msgid "05168"
msgstr "If you leave me behind{line_break}and then lose, I'll never{line_break}forgive you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05169"
msgstr "I just hope your aim{line_break}doesn't falter...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05170"
msgstr "Everybody deserves a little{line_break}credit for this victory!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05171"
msgstr "You can count on me,{line_break}through thick and thin!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05172"
msgstr "If I seemed nervous, it was{line_break}only because I wasn't sure{line_break}you were prepared for this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05173"
msgstr "I'm glad we won... But don't{line_break}you feel at all bad for your{line_break}opponents?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05174"
msgstr "?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05175"
msgstr "You know, you would never{line_break}have won without me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05176"
msgstr "Yeah... That didn't offer a{line_break}lot of challenge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05177"
msgstr "I gave it my best effort,{line_break}as you could see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05178"
msgstr "Everybody did great! I didn't{line_break}worry at all about you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05179"
msgstr "You won? Without me? Wow...{line_break}Way to make a guy feel{line_break}unneeded there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05180"
msgstr "You really stayed cool in{line_break}the heat of battle. Good work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05181"
msgstr "The most important thing is{line_break}that nobody got hurt. Except{line_break}your opponents.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05182"
msgstr "?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05183"
msgstr "Sure, you won, but...it would{line_break}have been a lot easier if I'd{line_break}been there, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05184"
msgstr "Oh, you won? Yeah, that's{line_break}great. But you still left me{line_break}behind!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05185"
msgstr "That was a stunning battle.{line_break}I was on the edge of my seat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05186"
msgstr "Don't blame yourself... It{line_break}was just a bad strategy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05187"
msgstr "Pull yourself together! We'll{line_break}do it next time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05188"
msgstr "You should have picked{line_break}someone else. It's all my{line_break}fault that we lost.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05189"
msgstr "I didn't help out very much,{line_break}did I? I'm sorry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05190"
msgstr "?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05191"
msgstr "Wow. That was a serious{line_break}beating... What happened to us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05192"
msgstr "I was doing my very best.{line_break}I certainly hope you were, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05193"
msgstr "Maybe it would have been{line_break}better if I just hadn't come...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05194"
msgstr "You win some, you lose some.{line_break}That's the nature of competition.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05195"
msgstr "What? You lost? That's what{line_break}you get for leaving me out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05196"
msgstr "It's not a problem, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}You'll do better next time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05197"
msgstr "I know I wasn't out there with{line_break}you, but...I still blame myself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05198"
msgstr "?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05199"
msgstr "Of course, you're going to{line_break}lose if you have such an{line_break}awful attitude about it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05200"
msgstr "If you'd taken me with you,{line_break}none of this would ever have{line_break}happened. Don't you forget it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05201"
msgstr "You should have asked for{line_break}my help. From the look of{line_break}things, you could have used it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05202"
msgstr "I'm just going to watch.{line_break}But you guys are going{line_break}to battle, aren't you?{page_break}Well, do your best.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05203"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}I don't have the guts to fight{line_break}in the battle arena. I'll just{line_break}be sitting here, if that's OK.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05204"
msgstr "You look a little scrawny,{line_break}but guys like you are often{line_break}surprisingly strong...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05205"
msgstr "Fighting a guy with a build{line_break}like that would really wear{line_break}me out! Whew!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05206"
msgstr "I'll be rooting for you!{line_break}Do your best!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05207"
msgstr "I like my men macho.{line_break}You...don't work out{line_break}much, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05208"
msgstr "Hm... It comes in like this...{line_break}Then you do this, and...{line_break}Whoa, that's not right...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05209"
msgstr "You could use Psynergy, Djinn,{line_break}even summons and items! There{line_break}are a lot of battle strategies...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05210"
msgstr "So you win against one guy,{line_break}and then you lose against{line_break}the next.{page_break}Depending on the foe,{line_break}you've got to change up{line_break}your tactics.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05211"
msgstr "I need to find a way to get{line_break}stronger, but I'm just out of{line_break}ideas. Maybe a nice smoothie?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05212"
msgstr "Sometimes, your class changes{line_break}when you unleash a Djinni.{page_break}You need to watch that, because{line_break}it can get you into some real{line_break}trouble if you're not careful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05213"
msgstr "Should I enter or not?{line_break}I'm so stressed about this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05214"
msgstr "It looks like this is{line_break}your first time here.{page_break}I will teach you{line_break}what it is like to{line_break}fight in a battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05215"
msgstr "You've won {argument_signed_number}{line_break}Linked Battle{plural_suffix}. Keep up{line_break}the good work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05216"
msgstr "It looks like this is{line_break}your first time here.{page_break}You can ask me about{line_break}the results of your{line_break}battle. Okay?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05217"
msgstr "You've won {argument_signed_number}{line_break}Linked Battle{plural_suffix}.{page_break}Check the board on{line_break}the wall for the best{line_break}records so far.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05218"
msgstr "Up to three allies{line_break}can fight in Linked{line_break}Battle finals.{page_break}The results vary greatly{line_break}depending on who you{line_break}set what Djinn to.{end_wait}"

