msgctxt "message"
msgid "05538"
msgstr "To light the elemental{line_break}lighthouses...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05539"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} and his friends{line_break}would prevent this from{line_break}happening.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05540"
msgstr "So that makes them enemies?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05541"
msgstr "But fear not...{line_break}They won't be able to defeat{line_break}Saturos and Menardi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05542"
msgstr "So... {actor_name:5} went back to{line_break}the top of the lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05543"
msgstr "Why do you seem so{line_break}pleased, Alex?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05544"
msgstr "Why shouldn't I be? After all,{line_break}the lighthouse will soon shine{line_break}brightly once again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05545"
msgstr "Alex, why do you want{line_break}to see the beacon lit{line_break}so badly?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05546"
msgstr "Oh, so it's my turn to answer{line_break}questions, is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05547"
msgstr "Once, Alchemy was commonplace{line_break}throughout this world...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05548"
msgstr "With its power, mankind worked{line_break}wonders across the land...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05549"
msgstr "The lost age of man...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05550"
msgstr "I want to see that world{line_break}restored once again, and...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05551"
msgstr "And what, Alex?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05552"
msgstr "We've spoken long enough{line_break}already. Let us continue{line_break}this another time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05553"
msgstr "We should leave the{line_break}lighthouse now, before{line_break}the beacon is fired...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05554"
msgstr "I concur... Let's meet at the{line_break}location we agreed on{line_break}and wait for {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05555"
msgstr "All right, Kraden,{line_break}let's go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05556"
msgstr "No, {actor_name:6}, not{line_break}that way.{page_break}We must get away from{line_break}the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05557"
msgstr "The chest was already open.{page_break}But it looks like there's{line_break}still {argument_item_name:2} inside!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05558"
msgstr "You found {argument_item_name:2}.{page_break}It looks like there's also{line_break}{argument_item_name:2} inside.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05559"
msgstr "There they are!{line_break}Get 'em!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05560"
msgstr "Iodem sent us to stand{line_break}guard here, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05561"
msgstr "I never thought we'd{line_break}actually run into them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05562"
msgstr "Scoundrels! What have you{line_break}done with {actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05563"
msgstr "Return her now, or you're{line_break}really going to regret it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05564"
msgstr "Um...{pause_20_skippable} Aren't there supposed{line_break}to be more of them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05565"
msgstr "Huh... Maybe they're just the{line_break}first ones to come out...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05566"
msgstr "Great! That means we've{line_break}got 'em outnumbered!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05567"
msgstr "We can probably take{line_break}'em, you think?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05568"
msgstr "Go fetch the other Tolbi{line_break}soldiers still stationed{line_break}in Lalivero...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05569"
msgstr "Yes, sir!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05570"
msgstr "And we'll go tell the guys{line_break}in the caves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05571"
msgstr "Got it, Boss!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05572"
msgstr "How unfortunate... It looks{line_break}like an ambush. What should{line_break}we do, {actor_name:6}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05573"
msgstr "What do you mean? Look{line_break}around... We'll have to{line_break}fight them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05574"
msgstr "Are you serious?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05575"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, are you really prepared{line_break}to fight these men?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05576"
msgstr "We don't have any other{line_break}choice. We have to...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05577"
msgstr "Well, then. Allow me to{line_break}shoulder some of your{line_break}burden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05578"
msgstr "...Burden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05579"
msgstr "We regroup along the road{line_break}leading away from Lalivero.{line_break}Do you understand?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05580"
msgstr "You don't need to remind us,{line_break}Alex. We know the place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05581"
msgstr "It's quite simple, {actor_name:6}.{line_break}The meeting place is in the{line_break}direction opposite Lalivero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05582"
msgstr "Follow this road west, and{line_break}take the path down through{line_break}the canyon to the cave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05583"
msgstr "On the other side of that{line_break}cave, you will find a small{line_break}peninsula called Idejima.{page_break}We meet there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05584"
msgstr "Thankfully, only those{line_break}workmen block your route.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05585"
msgstr "And fortunately...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05586"
msgstr "They don't look too tough...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05587"
msgstr "Hello! We can hear you!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05588"
msgstr "That's just plain rude!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05589"
msgstr "Why don't the two of you{line_break}escape and leave the Tolbi{line_break}soldiers to me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05590"
msgstr "The two of us? Alone?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05591"
msgstr "You can use Psynergy,{line_break}can't you, {actor_name:6}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05592"
msgstr "Um... Yes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05593"
msgstr "Then you'll be fine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05594"
msgstr "We shall reconvene{line_break}at the peninsula.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05595"
msgstr "You think you can take on{line_break}Tolbi's finest on your own,{line_break}little man?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05596"
msgstr "I do not wish to inflict{line_break}unnecessary bloodshed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05597"
msgstr "Don't wish to...{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}What's that supposed{line_break}to mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05598"
msgstr "If you lay a hand on these{line_break}two, I assure you that you{line_break}will be made to regret it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05599"
msgstr "By advancing, I assume you{line_break}mean to fight. Permit me{line_break}to strike the first blow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05600"
msgstr "What was {text_effect:4}that{reset_text_style}!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05601"
msgstr "I don't know, but whatever{line_break}he did, it's out of our{line_break}league!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05602"
msgstr "You guys deal with him{line_break}until backup arrives!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05603"
msgstr "Oh, so you're next?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05604"
msgstr "Hey, no need to{line_break}worry about us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05605"
msgstr "We're not soldiers...{line_break}We're not anybody!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05606"
msgstr "Seriously, there's no{line_break}way we're gonna face{line_break}off against you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05607"
msgstr "Let's get outta here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05608"
msgstr "How undignified...{line_break}and how shameful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05609"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, now is your{line_break}chance. Go to Idejima{line_break}and wait for me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05610"
msgstr "I'm not finished{line_break}with you yet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05611"
msgstr "You mentioned backup{line_break}from Lalivero?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05612"
msgstr "Let's go meet them{line_break}together, shall we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05613"
msgstr "Hey, pal! When they{line_break}get here, you'll really{line_break}be in for it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05614"
msgstr "Do you honestly believe{line_break}that even a hundred of{line_break}you could stop me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05615"
msgstr "How amusing...{line_break}This I must see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05616"
msgstr "They're gone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05617"
msgstr "Come on, {actor_name:6}...{line_break}Let's be going.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05618"
msgstr "There's nothing standing{line_break}in our way now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05619"
msgstr "But...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05620"
msgstr "What is it now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05621"
msgstr "Ah... You're worried about{line_break}hurting any innocents?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05622"
msgstr "Well, just try to hold back{line_break}when you're fighting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05623"
msgstr "Oh. You must be concerned{line_break}about {actor_name:5}. We can't do{line_break}anything to help him here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05624"
msgstr "Let's get going!{line_break}To the peninsula!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05625"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}... Are...{line_break}Are you all right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05626"
msgstr "Ah, {actor_name:6}...{line_break}You're awake.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05627"
msgstr "Can you stand?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05628"
msgstr "It's a good thing I came{line_break}back for you two...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05629"
msgstr "Perhaps you ought to{line_break}come with us this time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05630"
msgstr "No. Someone has to keep{line_break}Tolbi's soldiers at bay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05631"
msgstr "I'll have to go to Lalivero{line_break}and confront them there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05632"
msgstr "We'll meet at Idejima.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05633"
msgstr "He's gone again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05634"
msgstr "And we'd best be{line_break}going as well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05635"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, escape{line_break}to the boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05636"
msgstr "Why do I gotta be the{line_break}one to wait for backup!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05637"
msgstr "Yaaah! P-P-Please!{line_break}Just let me go, and...{line_break}Hey!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05638"
msgstr "That scary guy with the{line_break}blue hair's not with you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05639"
msgstr "Great! Now, you'll see{line_break}what I'm really made of!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05640"
msgstr "Ugggh. I can't believe I{line_break}got beaten by a girl...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05641"
msgstr "Waahhh! It's them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05642"
msgstr "Whoa there... Where'd the{line_break}blue-haired guy go?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05643"
msgstr "Who cares! I can handle{line_break}some girl and her grandpa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05644"
msgstr "Ooooog. Maybe I shouldn't{line_break}have underestimated her...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05645"
msgstr "Ha! That was a good idea,{line_break}waiting here for 'em!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05646"
msgstr "You two aren't going{line_break}anywhere!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05647"
msgstr "Except with us, back{line_break}to Master Iodem!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05648"
msgstr "Maybe I should have{line_break}eaten a bigger breakfast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05649"
msgstr "All right, so maybe you{line_break}are going somewhere{line_break}after all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05650"
msgstr "Oh, man... There goes{line_break}my big promotion...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05651"
msgstr "My! That was invigorating!{line_break}He wasn't too strong...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05652"
msgstr "I never knew fighting could{line_break}be so fun!{pause_20_skippable} Ah, but we'd better{line_break}get on to the peninsula...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05653"
msgstr "Not that way, {actor_name:6}!{line_break}The meeting spot{line_break}is west of here.{page_break}We must go down that{line_break}road and into the hills.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05654"
msgstr "Not that way, {actor_name:6}!{line_break}The meeting spot{line_break}is down this way.{page_break}We must climb down here{line_break}and go into that cave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05655"
msgstr "There are words carved{line_break}into the relief...{page_break}If ye seek to climb{line_break}Venus Lighthouse, first{line_break}seek the power within.{page_break}To obtain this power, see{line_break}with the eyes of truth.{line_break}Then the way shall open.{page_break}But the path I reveal is{line_break}not the beginning.{page_break}The true beginning lies{line_break}down ancient pathways{line_break}on distant soils.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05656"
msgstr "The true road can only{line_break}be known by he who bears{line_break}a true heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05657"
msgstr "This is the place,{line_break}isn't it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05658"
msgstr "The peninsula at the end{line_break}of the road to the west...{line_break}That's what he told us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05659"
msgstr "This must be Idejima!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05660"
msgstr "Hm... Menardi said a ship{line_break}would be here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05661"
msgstr "We ought to see if{line_break}we can find it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05662"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, it's over here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05663"
msgstr "At first glance, it seems{line_break}like a normal ship, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05664"
msgstr "There's something {pause_20_skippable}odd{line_break}about it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05665"
msgstr "Kraden, wait! Oh, I swear!{line_break}You're like a kid with a{line_break}new toy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05666"
msgstr "Hurry up in there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05667"
msgstr "What's wrong?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05668"
msgstr "It's missing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05669"
msgstr "Hm? What are you{line_break}talking about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05670"
msgstr "The thingie...{line_break}that makes it go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05671"
msgstr "What do you mean? What's so{line_break}important about this...thingie?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05672"
msgstr "The boat can't move without it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05673"
msgstr "That Menardi!{line_break}She tricked us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05674"
msgstr "Tricked us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05675"
msgstr "Yeah, by passing this{line_break}dud boat off on us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05676"
msgstr "There's no trick. If this{line_break}boat is a dud, how did it{line_break}get here in the first place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05677"
msgstr "Oh, right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05678"
msgstr "It must have been{line_break}the orb...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05679"
msgstr "What orb?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05680"
msgstr "Don't you remember that{line_break}crystal Saturos was{line_break}carrying?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05681"
msgstr "That big, black pearl thing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05682"
msgstr "I'm certain he said he{line_break}could move the ship{line_break}with it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05683"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, Kraden!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05684"
msgstr "There you are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05685"
msgstr "I see you've found{line_break}the boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05686"
msgstr "We set sail as soon as the{line_break}beacon has been fired,{line_break}correct?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05687"
msgstr "Strange...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05688"
msgstr "What is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05689"
msgstr "The beacon...{line_break}It hasn't been lit yet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05690"
msgstr "You're right...{line_break}Why is it taking so long?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05691"
msgstr "And why hasn't my{line_break}brother returned?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05692"
msgstr "They've done it, {actor_name:6}!{line_break}They've lit the beacon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05693"
msgstr "What's happening, Kraden!?{line_break}Why won't the ground stop{line_break}shaking?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05694"
msgstr "Strange... I think it might{line_break}actually be getting worse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05695"
msgstr "I think the lighthouse is{line_break}collapsing! Look! The ground{line_break}around it is crumbling!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05696"
msgstr "Mercury Lighthouse didn't{line_break}react this way... What{line_break}makes Venus different?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05697"
msgstr "That last tremor tore a{line_break}rift in the Suhalla Range!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05698"
msgstr "How are we going to get{line_break}back to Gondowan now!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05699"
msgstr "Idejima... It's drifting away{line_break}from the mainland!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05700"
msgstr "But...what will{line_break}happen to us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05701"
msgstr "Oh, Kraden... How long{line_break}will this island{line_break}continue to drift?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05702"
msgstr "I don't know...{line_break}I wish you could{line_break}tell me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05703"
msgstr "Sheesh... You're no help{line_break}in times like this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05704"
msgstr "Hey, I'm hungry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05705"
msgstr "How can you even{line_break}think about food?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05706"
msgstr "I wonder what happened{line_break}to my brother...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05707"
msgstr "I can't be certain,{pause_20_skippable} but{line_break}it looks like they lit{line_break}the Venus beacon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05708"
msgstr "Yeah, I know. You don't have to{line_break}tell me that. That's how we{line_break}wound up adrift at sea, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05709"
msgstr "My, aren't you cranky{line_break}today, {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05710"
msgstr "Well,{pause_20_skippable} I suppose you're{line_break}just worried about{line_break}{actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05711"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} and the others{line_break}must have been at the{line_break}lighthouse, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05712"
msgstr "I suspect you're right...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05713"
msgstr "I miss them...{line_break}{actor_name:1}... {actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05714"
msgstr "Come with me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05715"
msgstr "There is something I wish{line_break}to show you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05716"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}... {actor_name:7}..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05717"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}! {actor_name:5}!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05718"
msgstr "They... {pause_20_skippable}They're alive...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05719"
msgstr "They're really alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05720"
msgstr "What is this?{line_break}Alex, what happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05721"
msgstr "I thought {actor_name:5} and{line_break}{actor_name:7} were still{line_break}inside the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05722"
msgstr "It's miraculous...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05723"
msgstr "Miracle or no, I'm just{line_break}happy my brother's alive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05724"
msgstr "What happened back there?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05725"
msgstr "..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05726"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05727"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Oh...{reset_text_style}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05728"
msgstr "Thank the elements,{line_break}she's awake!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05729"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}, are you all right?{line_break}It's me, {actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05730"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05731"
msgstr "What...happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05732"
msgstr "It seems you drifted{line_break}here with {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05733"
