msgstr "Bleah! I fell in a puddle{line_break}and got my clothes dirty!{line_break}Mom's gonna have a fit!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05926"
msgstr "That wave turned this place{line_break}into a swamp! Everything{line_break}smells like brine!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05927"
msgstr "That must have been one{line_break}serious wave to make the{line_break}whole continent move...{page_break}I didn't even know{line_break}continents did that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05928"
msgstr "I thought I saw some lights{line_break}in the northwestern skies...{line_break}Maybe I just imagined them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05929"
msgstr "The sea god must have saved{line_break}us from the wave. It's good we{line_break}have a shrine honoring him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05930"
msgstr "My hip's killing me, and all{line_break}that woman cares about is{line_break}how muddy my clothes are!{page_break}She cares more about the{line_break}laundry than she does me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05931"
msgstr "I can't believe those{line_break}children play in the shrine!{page_break}It's dangerous, and it will{line_break}only bring them misfortune...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05932"
msgstr "The Shrine of the Sea God{line_break}stopped the wave, but I'm{line_break}worried...{page_break}Riki and Tavi were{line_break}playing in there, and I'm{line_break}too scared to tell anyone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05933"
msgstr "I can't believe those losers{line_break}were inside the shrine when{line_break}the wave hit!{page_break}If Riki and Tavi want{line_break}to be idiots, I say, let 'em!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05934"
msgstr "That wave was brutal!{line_break}It smashed my boat{line_break}to splinters!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05935"
msgstr "With all the boats gone,{line_break}we sailors are stuck here!{page_break}What are we supposed{line_break}to do on dry land? Knit!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05936"
msgstr "With all this salt water{line_break}on the ground, what will{line_break}happen to our crops?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05937"
msgstr "Yay! We never get puddles{line_break}like this, not even when{line_break}it rains!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05938"
msgstr "Bleccch!{line_break}This water's saaalty!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05939"
msgstr "Riki's really in for it{line_break}when he gets home!{page_break}He's been out playing{line_break}with his friend for days!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05940"
msgstr "That no-good kid of mine!{line_break}Taking his father's fishing{line_break}pole! I mean, really!{page_break}If he doesn't come home{line_break}soon, he's really going to{line_break}get it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05941"
msgstr "Riki, Tavi... Where are{line_break}you? What are you up to?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05942"
msgstr "That Tavi's a bad{line_break}influence on Riki...{page_break}Just because he lives{line_break}next door doesn't mean{line_break}they have to be friends!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05943"
msgstr "I wonder where our{line_break}little Tavi has gone.{line_break}I'm getting worried.{page_break}He was gone when the{line_break}wave hit, and he hasn't{line_break}been home since...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05944"
msgstr "Tavi never misses{line_break}three o'clock snacksies!{page_break}Where could he be?{line_break}His food's getting cold...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05945"
msgstr "I'll bet that, wherever{line_break}Tavi is, Riki is{line_break}with him...{page_break}The neighbors must be{line_break}pretty worried, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05946"
msgstr "If Tavi isn't home{line_break}soon, we're going to have{line_break}to go looking for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05947"
msgstr "If you're looking for a{line_break}boat, you might check{line_break}in Madra...{page_break}Head south, and then when{line_break}the road forks, follow{line_break}the path to the east.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05948"
msgstr "If you head south, you'll{line_break}find a fork in the road.{page_break}Take the road west, and{line_break}you'll hit the Kandorean{line_break}Temple in no time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05949"
msgstr "I wonder how the road{line_break}to Madra is holding up{line_break}after that flood...{page_break}The ground was always{line_break}pretty soft around there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05950"
msgstr "I wonder if the holy man{line_break}at the Kandorean Temple is{line_break}as powerful as they say...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05951"
msgstr "In all my years as mayor,{line_break}I've never seen a wave{line_break}like that before...{page_break}I'm grateful that nobody{line_break}was seriously injured.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05952"
msgstr "The wave was awful, but{line_break}the noise that followed{line_break}was even worse...{page_break}The shock alone could{line_break}probably have destroyed{line_break}the road to Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05953"
msgstr "A lot of folk said they{line_break}heard a terrible rumbling{line_break}from the southeast.{page_break}You ask me, it was the{line_break}road to Madra crumbling{line_break}to bits...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05954"
msgstr "Between the pirates and{line_break}the tidal waves, this{line_break}town has the worst luck!{page_break}Now that Briggs has been{line_break}arrested in Madra, maybe{line_break}our luck is changing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05955"
msgstr "At least, nobody seems to{line_break}have been injured too badly.{page_break}Maybe I should make{line_break}another inspection later.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05956"
msgstr "I still don't know what{line_break}that sound I heard was...{page_break}With everything that's been{line_break}going on lately, I'm still a{line_break}little bit edgy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05957"
msgstr "We should find a different{line_break}way to get to Madra. That{line_break}shoddy road's a mess...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05958"
msgstr "Now that Briggs is locked{line_break}away, we shouldn't have any{line_break}pirate trouble this year.{page_break}Of course, that tidal wave{line_break}did more damage than those{line_break}pirates ever managed...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05959"
msgstr "You folks ain't thinkin'{line_break}'bout goin' south, are ya?{page_break}The roads to the south{line_break}are a real mess from the{line_break}earthquake. Dangerous, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05960"
msgstr "I'm glad I'm not going to{line_break}Madra now... It had been{line_break}so parched for so long...{page_break}And now, after the quake,{line_break}I'm sure it's full of cracks{line_break}and fissures and gaps...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05961"
msgstr "You guys look new 'round{line_break}these parts! What brings{line_break}you to here?{page_break}There's nothing much to see{line_break}on this forsaken continent.{line_break}You must be odd folk indeed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05962"
msgstr "If those two scamps knew{line_break}there were travelers in town,{line_break}they'd have a field day.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05963"
msgstr "I haven't seen Tavi and{line_break}Riki around lately...{page_break}I like those little guys,{line_break}so I'm kind of worried{line_break}about 'em.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05964"
msgstr "I'm sure those two went to{line_break}the Shrine of the Sea God.{line_break}They never listen!{page_break}I told them they were{line_break}way too small to climb{line_break}those cliffs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05965"
msgstr "What should I cook for our{line_break}guests tonight? I just can't{line_break}decide.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05966"
msgstr "We run a very small inn, so{line_break}we make do with just the{line_break}two of us working here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05967"
msgstr "I don't know when I'll be{line_break}able to return to Madra. I{line_break}sure miss the food there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05968"
msgstr "I hear the seafood in{line_break}Madra is wonderful!{page_break}I wonder what kinds of{line_break}fish they catch in Madra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05969"
msgstr "We can't sail, and we can't{line_break}fish... Not with our ships in{line_break}this condition...{page_break}{text_effect:4}Oh...{reset_text_style} I'm not looking{line_break}forward to becoming{line_break}a vegetarian...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05970"
msgstr "Look at all these guests!{line_break}We need more help...but{line_break}how will we afford it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05971"
msgstr "After all that shaking, I{line_break}wouldn't be surprised if{line_break}the roads were unusable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05972"
msgstr "I'm so torn... Do I like{line_break}my fish grilled?{page_break}Or do I prefer poached?{line_break}It's hard to say... Why is{line_break}life so difficult?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05973"
msgstr "Travelers! Well, I'll be!{line_break}Do you have a lot of time{line_break}and nowhere to go?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05974"
msgstr "Then I suggest you visit{line_break}the Kandorean Temple to{line_break}see Master Poi.{page_break}He performs great feats,{line_break}but I'll warn you, he might{line_break}not let you in...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05975"
msgstr "Oh, going to Madra, are you?{page_break}It's a dangerous road,{line_break}but no one will stop you{line_break}from taking it, my children.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05976"
msgstr "Travelers with nowhere to{line_break}go... This is bad. I hope they{line_break}stay out of the shrine...{page_break}If they anger the sea god,{line_break}there's nowhere they could{line_break}hide, not anywhere in Indra!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05977"
msgstr "Have you come to{line_break}see Master Poi?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05978"
msgstr "The master will see no one.{line_break}Leave now, and do not{line_break}return.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05979"
msgstr "I'm sorry, but the temple{line_break}is closed to sightseers.{line_break}Go home now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05980"
msgstr "Once the period of meditation{line_break}has begun, none may enter{line_break}the temple grounds.{page_break}Master Poi's teachings{line_break}require absolute concentration.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05981"
msgstr "I do not understand Master{line_break}Poi. If I were him, I would{line_break}allow more people to enter.{page_break}Instead, I must turn away{line_break}the very people who would{line_break}benefit from his teachings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05982"
msgstr "I was hoping to hear Master{line_break}Poi speak. Instead, I got{line_break}guard duty. How boring...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05983"
msgstr "I hope to enter the temple{line_break}one day... I want to learn{line_break}from the master himself...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05984"
msgstr "Please don't break{line_break}my concentration!{page_break}I am...lighter than air...{line_break}floating, rising up...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05985"
msgstr "I am not just meditating.{line_break}I am guarding the entry{line_break}as well. It is important work.{page_break}But someday, I will be{line_break}permitted to enter{line_break}the temple...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05986"
msgstr "I still can't believe that{line_break}the older monks can{line_break}levitate through meditation.{page_break}If I work hard enough,{line_break}maybe I'll be able to do{line_break}it, too. Maybe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05987"
msgstr "My mind is empty;{line_break}my body is light...{line_break}Now...float...float...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05988"
msgstr "Empty the mind{line_break}to lighten the body...{page_break}I've been fasting for{line_break}days... I've got to be{line_break}light enough by now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05989"
msgstr "You there!{line_break}Focus your mind!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05990"
msgstr "Did you see that, Master?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05991"
msgstr "No, no, no!{line_break}You lack discipline!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05992"
msgstr "Now, you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05993"
msgstr "How was that, Master?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05994"
msgstr "Improving...slowly!{line_break}Continue your meditation!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05995"
msgstr "Your turn!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05996"
msgstr "Master, have I done it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05997"
msgstr "Not bad...{line_break}You might stand a{line_break}chance to succeed...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05998"
msgstr "I can do it, Master!{line_break}Please, just let me try!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05999"
msgstr "Your skills lack polish...{line_break}It may be dangerous. Do{line_break}you still wish to enter?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06000"
msgstr "Yes, I do! I do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06001"
msgstr "If you fail, you may{line_break}lose more than just{line_break}your pride...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06002"
msgstr "I do not fear death, Master!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06003"
msgstr "Ho ho! Is that so?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06004"
msgstr "Very well, then!{line_break}It is time for your{line_break}trial, my son!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06005"
msgstr "Enter the cave,{line_break}and ascend!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06006"
msgstr "HE went in before ME?{line_break}What nonsense!{page_break}Wait... I guess I ought{line_break}to be supportive and{line_break}hope for his success...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06007"
msgstr "Empty mind, empty body.{line_break}By clearing my thoughts,{line_break}I can ascend...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06008"
msgstr "There's no way I'm rooting{line_break}for that loser!{page_break}Choke! Choke! Fail the test!{line_break}Then, I'll get my chance!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06009"
msgstr "Arrgh! I was so close!{line_break}I can't believe I didn't{line_break}make it!{page_break}Gah... I'm so consumed{line_break}with frustration that I{line_break}can't clear my thoughts...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06010"
msgstr "It seems I may not have{line_break}been ready after all...{page_break}I should start my{line_break}meditations over again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06011"
msgstr "Is it really possible{line_break}for anyone to pass{line_break}this test?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06012"
msgstr "You have passed a very{line_break}difficult test. You have{line_break}pleased your teacher!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06013"
msgstr "Wait... You're not one of my{line_break}students! Who are you!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06014"
msgstr "How did you...{line_break}come this far?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06015"
msgstr "Ah, yes... How indeed?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06016"
msgstr "The rope is still{line_break}on the floor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06017"
msgstr "You must have come{line_break}through the cave...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06018"
msgstr "That means...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06019"
msgstr "I must give you...{line_break}the secret of Lash!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06020"
msgstr "Master Poi...{line_break}You seem perturbed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06021"
msgstr "Oh, no...{line_break}Not at all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06022"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, am I imagining it,{line_break}or does he seem perturbed?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06023"
msgstr "I am not perturbed.{line_break}Merely...surprised.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06024"
msgstr "No one from outside the{line_break}temple has ever passed{line_break}the test. It's amazing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06025"
msgstr "What is this \"Lash\" you{line_break}mentioned a moment ago?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06026"
msgstr "Lash is a sacred power,{line_break}passed down for years to{line_break}the followers of this temple.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06027"
msgstr "A sacred power? And{line_break}it's called Lash,{line_break}you say?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06028"
msgstr "And now, I must pass it{line_break}on to you. It is our way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06029"
msgstr "It is a gift given to all those{line_break}who pass the test, as it{line_break}has been for ages.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06030"
msgstr "What type of power{line_break}is this Lash?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06031"
msgstr "Allow me to show you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06032"
msgstr "Lash looks quite a bit{line_break}like Psynergy, doesn't it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06033"
msgstr "Psynergy, hm?{line_break}We call it spiritual strength,{line_break}but it seems the same.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06034"
msgstr "I do not know of your{line_break}Psynergy, but our power{line_break}comes from within.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06035"
msgstr "This technique uses{line_break}the spiritual to affect{line_break}the physical.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06036"
msgstr "One with a strong spirit{line_break}can lift and move heavy{line_break}objects farther.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06037"
msgstr "The distance changes with{line_break}your level of power?{line_break}Fascinating!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06038"
msgstr "Those who cannot pass{line_break}this cave's trials are not{line_break}worthy of the technique.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06039"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, do you think this{line_break}cave was designed to test{line_break}one's control of Psynergy?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06040"
msgstr "Yes, yes!{line_break}Well done, old man!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06041"
msgstr "Who are you calling an{line_break}old man!? You're no spring{line_break}chicken yourself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06042"
msgstr "You are quite mistaken...{line_break}You should listen to the{line_break}old man. He speaks wisely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06043"
msgstr "Tha°HEY! Who are you{line_break}calling an old man? You're{line_break}no schoolboy yourself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06044"
msgstr "I wondered if it would be{line_break}right to allow an outsider{line_break}to use this power...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06045"
msgstr "You're...not going{line_break}to teach us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06046"
msgstr "But I like you, so I will{line_break}let you learn our secret.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06047"
msgstr "Please, follow me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06048"
msgstr "Take the power of{line_break}Lash. It is yours now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06049"
msgstr "This is the power and the{line_break}secret of our temple!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06050"
msgstr "If you are worthy, you{line_break}will use it with ease!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06051"
msgstr "When you see a rope,{line_break}use Lash on it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06052"
msgstr "Perhaps you will find this{line_break}useful on your travels.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06053"
msgstr "Take this power with{line_break}you, and do good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06054"
msgstr "I hope that someday, my{line_break}students will be worthy{line_break}of this honor, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06055"
msgstr "If you wish to practice,{line_break}these caves may hold a{line_break}place of interest to you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06056"
msgstr "Ho ho! I feel the strength{line_break}of your spirit flowing{line_break}toward me! Splendid!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06057"
msgstr "You were the ones{line_break}who passed the test?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06058"
msgstr "Wow! I can't believe it!{line_break}Are you monks? Where{line_break}did you study!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06059"
msgstr "Well, if it wasn't you,{line_break}who was it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06060"
msgstr "I hear that someone{line_break}passed the test...{line_break}No matter, though...{page_break}I am here to improve{line_break}myself, to meditate...{line_break}Not to show off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06061"
msgstr "When I awoke, I learned{line_break}that someone else had passed{line_break}my test... How disgraceful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06062"
msgstr "The master seemed so{line_break}disappointed that someone{line_break}passed the test...{page_break}I think it was just that{line_break}none of his students{line_break}can do it yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06063"
msgstr "I knew it!{line_break}It should have been{line_break}me taking that test!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06064"
msgstr "Before I passed out,{line_break}I saw...something...{page_break}Some sort of...cute little{line_break}monster. Was I delirious?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06065"
msgstr "Hey, what's an outsider{line_break}doing on the temple{line_break}grounds?{page_break}Oh, meditation must be{line_break}over... That's why they{line_break}let you in...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06066"
msgstr "Looks like none of our{line_break}brothers passed this time,{line_break}either.{page_break}At this rate, maybe we'll{line_break}be able to surpass them{line_break}after all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06067"
msgstr "Someday, I'm going to{line_break}be a great monk, like{line_break}Master Poi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06068"
msgstr "Gah! I kept my eyes shut in{line_break}meditation so long that the{line_break}sun hurts when I open them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06069"
msgstr "I've been meditating all{line_break}day, but my body just{line_break}doesn't want to float...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06070"
msgstr "Whenever the master goes{line_break}to town, the villagers are{line_break}all in such awe of him...{page_break}Maybe someday, they'll{line_break}look at me the same way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06071"
msgstr "Extinguish your desire,{line_break}and the fire will cool.{page_break}Empty your mind,{line_break}and you will feel no pain!{line_break}                    -Poi-{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06072"
msgstr "{text_effect:2}Ouch!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06073"
msgstr "This wall looks rather{line_break}suspicious, wouldn't you{line_break}say, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06074"
msgstr "Fantastic work, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}Keep a watchful eye for{line_break}any strange-looking areas!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06075"
msgstr "All right! I'm gonna{line_break}throw the rope again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06076"
msgstr "Just don't miss{line_break}this time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06077"
msgstr "Aww, no!{line_break}You missed again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06078"
msgstr "Sorry, Tavi...{line_break}I can't do it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06079"
msgstr "I thought I got lucky{line_break}when that wave carried{line_break}me up here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06080"
msgstr "What are you, crazy? It{line_break}knocked you stupid{line_break}for a good ten minutes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06081"
msgstr "Yeah, yeah!{line_break}Just find some way to{line_break}get me down from here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06082"
msgstr "Fine! Just don't jump{line_break}down or do anything{line_break}dumb, OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06083"
msgstr "Wah! You scared me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06084"
msgstr "I thought you were one{line_break}of the grown-ups from{line_break}Daila... {pause_20_skippable}So, who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06085"
msgstr "Look, I'm kinda busy trying{line_break}to help my pal Tavi{line_break}right now, OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06086"
msgstr "I can't find anything{line_break}around here that'll help{line_break}get him down from there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06087"
msgstr "Excellent work, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06088"
msgstr "Hey, the rope!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06089"
msgstr "Awesome, Riki!{line_break}Way to go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06090"
msgstr "Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06091"
msgstr "We're just passing through.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06092"
msgstr "How come you threw{line_break}me the rope?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06093"
msgstr "We'd heard that you{line_break}needed some assistance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06094"
msgstr "Well, whatever.{line_break}Thanks anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06095"
msgstr "Hey, Tavi!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06096"
msgstr "How'd ya get{line_break}down from there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06097"
msgstr "These guys threw{line_break}me the rope...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06098"
msgstr "Really? These grown-ups?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06099"
msgstr "Well, whatever.{line_break}Now we can go nab{line_break}that critter we saw!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06100"
msgstr "What? What is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06101"
msgstr "That little guy's so fast,{line_break}I can't catch him!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06102"
msgstr "Do you think we could{line_break}catch him together?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06103"
msgstr "Well, yeah, except that{line_break}every time I'm about to{line_break}grab him, he flies off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06104"
msgstr "So I guess it wouldn't{line_break}matter if we worked{line_break}together or not.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06105"
msgstr "Yeah, I guess not.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06106"
msgstr "Well, that's too bad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06107"
msgstr "Hey, I'm really hungry!{line_break}I haven't eaten since{line_break}before I got stuck!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06108"
msgstr "Yeah, same here...{line_break}My stomach's growling{line_break}up a storm!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06109"
msgstr "Let's go home, Riki.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06110"
msgstr "Sounds good, Tavi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06111"
msgstr "They're gone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06112"
msgstr "Well, it was good of{line_break}you to help them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06113"
msgstr "We should be going, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06114"
msgstr "This statue looks a lot like{line_break}the one in Daila's Sanctum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06115"
msgstr "I took all the money that was{line_break}in here to pay for a boat.{page_break}Don't think badly of me.{line_break}-Alex.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06116"
msgstr "After that wave hit, I was{line_break}worried about Daila, but{line_break}we're pulling through...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06117"
msgstr "Sure are a lot of travelers{line_break}coming through here today.{page_break}That last one, though...{line_break}He was awful cute.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06118"
msgstr "Those puddles of sea-{line_break}water the wave left have{line_break}almost all evaporated now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06119"
msgstr "Ah, the sea is calm again,{line_break}and we can all get back{line_break}to our normal lives.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06120"
msgstr "I bet you thought it was{line_break}the wave that knocked me{line_break}over and hurt my hip, huh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06121"
msgstr "It'd take more than a little{line_break}water to knock this old-{line_break}timer down!{page_break}No, it was the earthquake{line_break}afterward that made me{line_break}fall on my tush...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06122"
msgstr "Nobody believes me when{line_break}I tell them the continent{line_break}moved...{page_break}Why do you think I fell?{line_break}The ground shifts, you fall{line_break}on your fanny! It's a fact!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06123"
msgstr "I've always heard that the{line_break}Shrine of the Sea God holds{line_break}an amazing treasure...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06124"
msgstr "The dread pirate Briggs{line_break}was captured in Madra...{page_break}If that guy were free, you{line_break}could bet he'd be coming{line_break}after our village...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06125"
msgstr "Those two losers are{line_break}back home now, eating{line_break}their snacks...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06126"
msgstr "I thought I saw something{line_break}when those puddles dried.{line_break}Maybe it was just my eyes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06127"
msgstr "So...I hear they caught{line_break}the pirate Briggs down{line_break}in Madra...{page_break}The seas should be safe{line_break}now. Makes me wish I still{line_break}had a boat...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06128"
msgstr "It was creepy°right before{line_break}the wave hit, the water{line_break}got all quiet and calm.{page_break}I don't know how to{line_break}explain it, but it was{line_break}really eerie.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06129"
msgstr "The puddles are gone,{line_break}and now I'm bored.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06130"
msgstr "I got hurt when I was{line_break}playing in the puddles,{line_break}so now I'm not.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06131"
msgstr "Thank our lucky stars{line_break}our little town survived{line_break}that ordeal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06132"
msgstr "Is that guy still meeting{line_break}with the mayor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06133"
msgstr "Those puddles stank!{line_break}I thought I'd get sick from{line_break}the smell of stagnant brine!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06134"
msgstr "I'm glad everything is back{line_break}to normal here in Daila...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06135"
msgstr "Nobody believes a wave{line_break}could be big enough to{line_break}move a continent...{page_break}I'm starting to think it's a{line_break}sign of things to come,{line_break}personally...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06136"
msgstr "I'd sure like to see what{line_break}that treasure is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06137"
msgstr "I wonder what happened{line_break}to Briggs when they{line_break}caught him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06138"
msgstr "Tavi and Riki must{line_break}have been starving. They{line_break}were gone for days...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06139"
msgstr "It's probably nothing but{line_break}junk and garbage, but it's{line_break}not my problem...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06140"
msgstr "The seas are peaceful and{line_break}free of pirates at last, and{line_break}I don't even have a boat.{page_break}Life's funny like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06141"
msgstr "Before the wave hit, the{line_break}tide went way out...{page_break}It was like the sea had{line_break}been drained away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06142"
msgstr "I hope some of the little{line_break}puddles stay, at least.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06143"
msgstr "I caught my foot on{line_break}something that was in one{line_break}of those dried-up puddles.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06144"
msgstr "Let me tell you, kids{line_break}are a lot of work...{page_break}If they're not out getting{line_break}in trouble, they're inside,{line_break}and they're eating!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06145"
msgstr "Who stays outside until{line_break}he's absolutely famished?{page_break}And would it have hurt{line_break}to let us know where{line_break}he was going!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06146"
msgstr "Mmm... Mmnph...{line_break}Dad was SO mad that{line_break}we were late...{page_break}He said, \"No dinner for{line_break}you!\" And I was like,{line_break}\"Whatever!\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06147"
msgstr "Darn that Riki!{line_break}Ah... I'm glad he's{line_break}home, though...{page_break}He's so cute when{line_break}he's stuffing his face.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06148"
msgstr "Hee hee. My Riki is{line_break}mommy's little monster!{line_break}Just look how he eats!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06149"
msgstr "I still want to{line_break}catch that monster.{page_break}We are SO going back{line_break}there tomorrow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06150"
msgstr "Our little one is{line_break}finally home.{page_break}I don't know where he{line_break}got to for all that time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06151"
msgstr "Tavi wolfed down{line_break}his snack and just{line_break}asked for more!{page_break}He must think we're here{line_break}to feed him, I swear!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06152"
msgstr "Mmmph... Mmmm.{line_break}Don't tell anyone we were in{line_break}the Shrine of the Sea God.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06153"
msgstr "I guess Riki next door{line_break}made it home, too...{page_break}Those two are just{line_break}inseparable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06154"
msgstr "Once Tavi finishes{line_break}eating, I'm putting him{line_break}right outside again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06155"
msgstr "I'm sure glad I made it{line_break}down from that cliff...{page_break}I could have starved{line_break}up there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06156"
msgstr "Are you going to Madra?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06157"
msgstr "You'll have to cross the{line_break}Dehkan Plateau...{page_break}It's a dangerous place.{line_break}You'll want to be very,{line_break}very careful out there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06158"
msgstr "Walking into trouble just{line_break}for a boat ain't exactly{line_break}smart...{page_break}But sometimes, you have to{line_break}face danger to move forward.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06159"
msgstr "I think Madra is east of{line_break}the crossroads... I think...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06160"
msgstr "Daila got hit pretty hard.{line_break}I wonder how Madra is{line_break}doing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06161"
msgstr "Someone should see{line_break}how the road to Madra{line_break}held up in the quake...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06162"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06163"
msgstr "Well, well... Our happy{line_break}little family is back{line_break}together again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06164"
msgstr "Alex...{line_break}Where did you go?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06165"
msgstr "To look for a ship,{line_break}of course.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06166"
msgstr "That's what Kraden said...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06167"
msgstr "And did you find one?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06168"
msgstr "Unfortunately, there are{line_break}none to be had.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06169"
msgstr "I spoke to the mayor, and{line_break}he suggested that we try{line_break}the large town south of us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06170"
msgstr "Is that where you're going?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06171"
msgstr "Yes. Madra may have boats{line_break}available. That would be{line_break}the most logical move.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06172"
msgstr "So what do yout think?{line_break}Should we go to Madra{line_break}with Alex?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06173"
msgstr "Ah... You...want to{line_break}travel with me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06174"
msgstr "What, you don't like{line_break}that idea?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06175"
msgstr "Ah. {actor_name:5} doesn't{line_break}think it's a good idea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06176"
msgstr "You seem awfully{line_break}pleased about that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06177"
msgstr "No, that's not it. I'm{line_break}just...preoccupied.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06178"
msgstr "Self-absorbed is more{line_break}like it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06179"
msgstr "I simply prefer{line_break}to work alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06180"
msgstr "If that's the case,{line_break}we'll let you be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06181"
msgstr "Perhaps you will see{line_break}me in Madra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06182"
msgstr "Gah! The nerve of that guy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06183"
msgstr "Yeah, I know... Now, I just{line_break}want to find a boat before{line_break}he does!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06184"
msgstr "Let's be on our way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06185"
msgstr "Don't tell me you're all{line_break}looking for a boat, too!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06186"
msgstr "Look, there aren't any{line_break}boats here, not for you{line_break}or anyone!{page_break}Try Madra, down south!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06187"
msgstr "If I had one, I'd let you{line_break}use it, but I don't.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06188"
msgstr "It's too dangerous to{line_break}go to Madra now.{page_break}I wonder if that man who{line_break}wanted the boat will survive{line_break}on the Dehkan Plateau.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06189"
msgstr "Who was that guy?{line_break}I wonder why he needed{line_break}a boat so badly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06190"
msgstr "Why did the pirate{line_break}Briggs plague us{line_break}for so long?{page_break}If I were going to Madra,{line_break}I'd go look him in the{line_break}eyes and ask him!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06191"
msgstr "He said he'd pay me{line_break}a fortune for a boat.{page_break}I'm not sure he'd pay{line_break}me even if I'd had one,{line_break}though...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06192"
msgstr "The road to Madra goes{line_break}through the Dehkan Plateau.{page_break}It's nearly impossible to{line_break}cross over that soft,{line_break}crumbly soil right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06193"
msgstr "Maybe that guy washed{line_break}up on shore when the{line_break}wave hit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06194"
msgstr "Briggs probably has{line_break}lots of men under him...{page_break}If I lived in Madra, I'd be{line_break}more worried about them{line_break}coming to rescue him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06195"
msgstr "Way back when, Daila used{line_break}to be a hideout for a band{line_break}of pirates...{page_break}They were all captured,{line_break}but no one ever found{line_break}their stolen treasure.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06196"
msgstr "This town may be dirt-{line_break}poor, but we still get a{line_break}good variety of travelers.{page_break}They're searching for{line_break}treasure, I'll bet. I hear{line_break}even Briggs was after it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06197"
msgstr "We don't have a lot of{line_break}people in Daila, but it's{line_break}a very spacious town...{page_break}The layout confuses{line_break}me sometimes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06198"
msgstr "Maybe they hid treasure{line_break}here because this town{line_break}is so mazelike...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06199"
msgstr "Tavi and Riki{line_break}are back home, safe{line_break}and sound...{page_break}They stopped by{line_break}to say hello on their{line_break}way... What nice kids.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06200"
msgstr "I hope their parents{line_break}didn't punish them too{line_break}severely...{page_break}They must have{line_break}worried their parents{line_break}half to death!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06201"
msgstr "Our fishermen still can't{line_break}head out to sea...{page_break}When will they start{line_break}fixing all those boats!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06202"
msgstr "Oh, I was just practicing.{line_break}It's part of our dinner{line_break}show for guests...{page_break}You know, because we{line_break}don't actually have any{line_break}good food for dinner...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06203"
msgstr "Er... Aheh heh... You...{line_break}weren't watching, were you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06204"
msgstr "I was just practicing{line_break}for the show we're putting{line_break}on tonight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06205"
msgstr "When do we get to{line_break}sample some of Daila's{line_break}famous seafood?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06206"
msgstr "I'm sick of eating nothing{line_break}but vegetables... And the{line_break}service stinks!{page_break}At least there's a show.{line_break}I wonder what we'll see{line_break}tonight...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06207"
msgstr "Until we get our seafood{line_break}back, we have to put on{line_break}these shows for guests...{page_break}My feet hurt... I wonder{line_break}if they'll let me skip{line_break}tonight's performance...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06208"
msgstr "Shoot... What was my first{line_break}line? \"Welcome to the Palace{line_break}of the Dragon King\"?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06209"
msgstr "Putting on shows instead of{line_break}serving good food is fine,{line_break}I guess...{page_break}But won't stories about sea{line_break}dragons make people{line_break}think about seafood?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06210"
msgstr "I just hope they don't make{line_break}us watch another one of{line_break}those awful shows!{page_break}I'd rather eat a pile of{line_break}steamed cabbage than{line_break}watch them again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06211"
msgstr "Maybe I'll just get up{line_break}on stage and do a little{line_break}dance of my own tonight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06212"
msgstr "There is nothing left for{line_break}you in Daila...{page_break}Please be careful on{line_break}your journey to Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06213"
msgstr "Daila's probably pretty{line_break}boring for travelers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06214"
msgstr "Look...{line_break}It's Menardi's ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06215"
msgstr "It doesn't look like{line_break}they sailed here, though...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06216"
msgstr "Of course not...{line_break}They were killed at the{line_break}lighthouse, weren't they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06217"
msgstr "Do you think it could{line_break}have drifted here?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06218"
msgstr "Yes, {actor_name:5},{line_break}That would be logical...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06219"
msgstr "How else could it have{line_break}come to be here, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06220"
msgstr "If we had that thingie{line_break}Saturos had, we could{line_break}just take their boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06221"
msgstr "For all we know, the orb{line_break}is at the bottom of the{line_break}sea...with them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06222"
msgstr "Well, there's no point{line_break}in hanging around here{line_break}all day.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06223"
msgstr "Let's go see about{line_break}finding ourselves a{line_break}ship we can use.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06224"
msgstr "We've been found!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06225"
msgstr "You wanna fight, punk?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06226"
msgstr "No one said anything{line_break}about fighting yet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06227"
msgstr "We haven't done{line_break}anything to you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06228"
msgstr "And if you think we{line_break}did, then prove it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06229"
msgstr "I'm, uh, from Kibombo...{line_break}It's, er...nice to meet you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06230"
msgstr "Hey, we're just here to{line_break}finish what you guys{line_break}started, OK?{page_break}You guys are the ones who{line_break}rammed into our continent,{line_break}and don't you forget it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06231"
msgstr "Hey, we're just out here, uh...{line_break}camping... Yup. If you want{line_break}good camping, go to Indra.{page_break}We're just here to, you know,{line_break}see the sights and stuff.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06232"
msgstr "Our friends from Kibombo{line_break}are coming soon.{page_break}When they get here,{line_break}we'll all come say hello.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06233"
msgstr "Oh, tense... We're busted!{line_break}They're on to us, I know it!{page_break}We never should have{line_break}launched that raid on{line_break}Madra without the others!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06234"
msgstr "My family lost its entire{line_break}store of food°months'{line_break}worth, gone in a flash!{page_break}Well, we'll show those{line_break}foreigners what happens{line_break}when they mess with us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06235"
msgstr "And once our Kibombo warriors{line_break}swarm over your town, we'll{line_break}all be real good friends...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06236"
msgstr "It was a good raid, but{line_break}after all that work, we{line_break}didn't find a thing...{page_break}I wonder what happened{line_break}to those people who fled{line_break}from the jail we broke into.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06237"
msgstr "The door is held closed{line_break}by a powerful force.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06238"
msgstr "Well, there's no point{line_break}in hanging around here{line_break}all day.{page_break}Let's go see about{line_break}finding ourselves a{line_break}ship we can use.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06239"
msgstr "You there!{line_break}Hold your ground!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06240"
msgstr "What seems to be{line_break}the trouble?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06241"
msgstr "Just wait there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06242"
msgstr "They don't look like{line_break}they're Champa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06243"
msgstr "I agree...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06244"
msgstr "Sorry for the delay.{line_break}You may pass.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06245"
msgstr "What were you{line_break}checking us for?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06246"
msgstr "Our town was sacked{line_break}by pirates...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06247"
msgstr "They'd come to free{line_break}their leader, Briggs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06248"
msgstr "They came from the east,{line_break}a small party, and we{line_break}repelled them with ease...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06249"
msgstr "But then, foreigners struck{line_break}from the west, exploiting a{line_break}weak point near our prison.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06250"
msgstr "That's over now, though...{line_break}Feel free to relax and{line_break}enjoy your time here safely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06251"
msgstr "There's no way those{line_break}pirates are coming back...{page_break}Not after Indra slammed{line_break}into Osenia. I hear you can{line_break}even walk there if you want.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06252"
msgstr "All of Indra shifted and{line_break}collided with Osenia...{line_break}Everyone's talking about it.{page_break}As if dealing with{line_break}invading pirate soldiers{line_break}wasn't enough!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06253"
msgstr "It's so weird that we can{line_break}just walk to Osenia now.{line_break}Crazy, crazy world...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06254"
msgstr "These are rough times...{line_break}We don't have nearly{line_break}enough people to help us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06255"
msgstr "You comin' through here?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06256"
msgstr "Yeah, well...{pause_20_skippable} We're workin'{line_break}in the hole right now, so...{page_break}Until we're done here,{line_break}you're gonna have to enter{line_break}Madra through the gates.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06257"
msgstr "That's good, 'cause we can't{line_break}let anyone through right now.{page_break}If you're goin' to Madra, you're{line_break}gonna have to go through{line_break}the front gates.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06258"
msgstr "The Champa dug this hole{line_break}when they raided our town,{line_break}but there's more to it...{page_break}The hole they dug uncovered{line_break}a cave that runs all the way{line_break}under our town!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06259"
msgstr "I can't believe the Champa{line_break}just stumbled onto this{line_break}cave accidentally...{page_break}That's like winning the{line_break}lottery or something!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06260"
msgstr "Who dug this cave?{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}And why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06261"
msgstr "The town elder took off{line_break}to deal with Briggs...{line_break}I wonder where he is now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06262"
msgstr "You picked the wrong{line_break}time to come to Madra...{page_break}We've had disasters, pirate{line_break}attacks, all sorts of{line_break}nonsense...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06263"
msgstr "That big wave moved the{line_break}whole continent of Indra{line_break}to the south.{page_break}Now, we're sandwiched{line_break}between the two continents{line_break}of Gondowan and Osenia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06264"
msgstr "Let me guess... You want{line_break}a boat, right?{page_break}Look, like I told that last{line_break}guy, the tidal wave went{line_break}and ruined all our boats!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06265"
msgstr "Maybe we'll learn Briggs's{line_break}whereabouts from that{line_break}captured Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06266"
msgstr "If I could walk to Osenia,{line_break}I'd like to see Air's Rock,{line_break}out near Garoh.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06267"
msgstr "Did you come here over{line_break}the Dehkan Plateau?{page_break}Yeah? You must have{line_break}seen that boat grounded{line_break}near the cave, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06268"
msgstr "I hear it was a Champa{line_break}boat! And on it, they found{line_break}an unconscious Champa!{page_break}So they nabbed him, of{line_break}course, and they tossed{line_break}him in our jail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06269"
msgstr "You didn't? Weird...{page_break}I wonder if it{line_break}drifted away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06270"
msgstr "It's like all three{line_break}continents got together to{line_break}form a supercontinent!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06271"
msgstr "The Champa were swarming{line_break}over the village...{page_break}But I screamed like the{line_break}dickens and scared 'em{line_break}off! It's true! Heh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06272"
msgstr "Those Champa curs dug a{line_break}hole here to sneak into{line_break}Madra...{page_break}And to think, it was just a{line_break}decoy so they could break into{line_break}the prison... What a crazy plan!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06273"
msgstr "I doubt the Champa could{line_break}have come up with that{line_break}plan on their own...{page_break}I'm not even sure that{line_break}strange boat we found up{line_break}north is even theirs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06274"
msgstr "I got someone to show{line_break}me around inside... It's{line_break}just a really big hole.{page_break}Nobody could dig that much{line_break}in such a short time without{line_break}us noticing, you'd think...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06275"
msgstr "I don't care what the elder{line_break}says... That prisoner is{line_break}filthy Champa scum!{page_break}Until someone proves{line_break}otherwise, I say, let{line_break}him rot!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06276"
msgstr "We took that unconscious{line_break}guy from the boat and{line_break}tossed him in jail.{page_break}He keeps saying that{line_break}he's not Champa, though.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06277"
msgstr "My friend was on guard{line_break}duty when Briggs's{line_break}men attacked...{page_break}Who would let a menace{line_break}like Briggs go free?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06278"
msgstr "My partner was guarding{line_break}the prison...{page_break}When the Champa attacked,{line_break}he was so scared, he ran{line_break}off. Disgraceful!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06279"
msgstr "Everyone thinks Briggs{line_break}fled to the east after the{line_break}breakout...{page_break}I think that must be{line_break}where the elder went{line_break}with the others.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06280"
msgstr "The town elder is getting{line_break}pretty elderly. I hope he's{line_break}OK, traveling out there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06281"
msgstr "If a big wave can move{line_break}the whole continent of{line_break}Indra...{page_break}Does that mean that all{line_break}of Indra is just floating{line_break}on the water?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06282"
msgstr "It's a bit of a problem that{line_break}the tidal wave destroyed{line_break}our boats...{page_break}But the tidal wave sort of{line_break}solved the problem, too...{page_break}Now, all three continents{line_break}are wedged together, and{line_break}we don't really need boats.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06283"
msgstr "That Champa in the cell{line_break}looks a bit pale for a{line_break}pirate...{page_break}I thought pirates were{line_break}supposed to be all tan{line_break}and leathery...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06284"
msgstr "I've always wanted to see{line_break}Air's Rock...but Garoh is{line_break}such a long way away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06285"
msgstr "Who was it who told me the{line_break}Champa boat was damaged?{page_break}Doesn't matter... But I bet{line_break}Briggs went to Osenia{line_break}to find himself a new boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06286"
msgstr "Now, Madra is pinned{line_break}between two continents!{page_break}People from Gondowan{line_break}can walk here to visit!{line_break}What fun!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06287"
msgstr "When I saw those Champa,{line_break}I was so surprised that{line_break}I let out a yelp...{page_break}It must have startled{line_break}them, because they all{line_break}ran away!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06288"
msgstr "The Champa must have{line_break}known exactly where{line_break}Briggs was...{page_break}But how did they know{line_break}the layout of our town?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06289"
msgstr "It's not like the Champa{line_break}to plan out elaborate{line_break}strategies...{page_break}I think the two raids were{line_break}entirely coincidental.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06290"
msgstr "I'm not sure the Champa{line_break}actually dug this hole...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06291"
msgstr "I'll never forgive those{line_break}dogs for what they've{line_break}done to our village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06292"
msgstr "I looked into that man's{line_break}eyes. He looked so serene,{line_break}so calm...{page_break}No one with such pretty{line_break}eyes could be a liar.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06293"
msgstr "I wonder how many{line_break}of the raiders were{line_break}actually Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06294"
msgstr "I miss my partner...{line_break}It's a shame he turned{line_break}tail and ran like that...{page_break}But who knows? Maybe I{line_break}would have done the same{line_break}thing in his place...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06295"
msgstr "In all this chaos, everyone{line_break}here has clean forgotten{line_break}about Alhafra...{page_break}Sure, it's all the way in{line_break}Osenia, but they're bound{line_break}to have a boat or two.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06296"
msgstr "Madra and Alhafra, off in{line_break}Osenia, have a long{line_break}history together...{page_break}Alhafra's a thriving{line_break}seaport, up on the{line_break}northern coast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06297"
msgstr "Wait a second... I'll bet{line_break}Briggs is heading to{line_break}Alhafra!{page_break}Of course! That'd be the{line_break}place to go if you were{line_break}looking for a boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06298"
msgstr "Alhafra has long been{line_break}a trade partner with Madra.{page_break}I should go there one day...{line_break}It's such an easy trip{line_break}from North Osenia...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06299"
msgstr "The lands to the south{line_break}of Gondowan are full of{line_break}barbarians, I'm told.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06300"
msgstr "Indra is in direct contact{line_break}with southern Gondowan...{line_break}Will we be safe?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06301"
msgstr "You're just trying to make{line_break}me feel better, but you{line_break}don't have a clue, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06302"
msgstr "Listen, we don't need you{line_break}running around getting{line_break}folks worked up! Buzz off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06303"
msgstr "The Kibombo are warlike,{line_break}but they live far off in the{line_break}center of Gondowan...{page_break}I can't imagine they'd{line_break}come all the way out{line_break}here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06304"
msgstr "They say there are people{line_break}who use a frightening kind of{line_break}magic in Gondowan...{page_break}I don't know if it's{line_break}true, but it's absolutely{line_break}terrifying!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06305"
msgstr "A wave big enough to{line_break}move a continent is{line_break}a terrible portent...{page_break}Could the legendary{line_break}beast of the deep{line_break}have awakened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06306"
msgstr "Everything happened so{line_break}suddenly... The earth moved,{line_break}and everything fell down...{page_break}It's going to take me{line_break}forever to clean up...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06307"
msgstr "If the mythical sea{line_break}creature has awakened,{line_break}we're all in trouble...{page_break}The legends say that only{line_break}one armed with an enchanted{line_break}trident can kill it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06308"
msgstr "Everything's on the floor,{line_break}and all my dishes are{line_break}broken. What a chore!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06309"
msgstr "They say that boat belongs{line_break}to the Champa...{page_break}But I keep telling them,{line_break}that boat looks like no{line_break}Champa ship I've seen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06310"
msgstr "The boat that ran aground{line_break}in the cove out east looks{line_break}like a normal ship, almost...{page_break}But I'm not sure a boat{line_break}like that can even sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06311"
msgstr "That boat's far sturdier{line_break}and far more sleek than{line_break}any Champa could build.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06312"
msgstr "It didn't even have{line_break}any oars! How does{line_break}it move? I don't get it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06313"
msgstr "Milady and I have been{line_break}told to guard that{line_break}jewel on the mantel.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06314"
msgstr "Don't touch that gem!{line_break}The elder gave us strict{line_break}orders to protect it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06315"
msgstr "My father was opposed to{line_break}arresting the man we{line_break}found on the boat...{page_break}But the townspeople were in{line_break}an uproar about the Champa,{line_break}and they locked him up...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06316"
msgstr "When the elder gets back,{line_break}I'm sure he will prove{line_break}that young man innocent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06317"
msgstr "Dad and Grandpa have{line_break}gone to Osenia to look{line_break}for Briggs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06318"
msgstr "Whenever Dad goes on{line_break}trips, he brings back{line_break}presents!{page_break}I wonder what he'll bring{line_break}back this time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06319"
msgstr "I wish I knew why{line_break}the elder wanted us{line_break}to protect this thing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06320"
msgstr "Until my father returns,{line_break}I'll protect this gem{line_break}with my life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06321"
msgstr "He intends to find Briggs{line_break}and prove that young man's{line_break}innocence.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06322"
msgstr "If Dad has to fight,{line_break}I wonder if he'll go...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06323"
msgstr "I hope he brings me a{line_break}nice doll. I want a{line_break}wooden one!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06324"
msgstr "Admit it! You're one of{line_break}the Champa, aren't you,{line_break}{actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06325"
msgstr "Speak! Or let your{line_break}silence condemn you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06326"
msgstr "I told you already...{line_break}I'm not a Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06327"
msgstr "Then where did you{line_break}come from?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06328"
msgstr "The heart of the Eastern{line_break}Sea... If I told you where,{line_break}you'd never believe me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06329"
msgstr "Look at me when I'm{line_break}talking to you! Are you{line_break}trying to mock me!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06330"
msgstr "I implore you, do not{line_break}anger me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06331"
msgstr "Oh, do you? So what's{line_break}going to happen if I{line_break}make you angry?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06332"
msgstr "Hey, Shin...{line_break}Maybe you should go{line_break}easy on him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06333"
msgstr "Hey, it wasn't your{line_break}girlfriend who got hurt!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06334"
msgstr "I'm sorry she was{line_break}injured, but I cannot°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06335"
msgstr "I don't want your sympathy,{line_break}freak! I want you to get{line_break}angry for me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06336"
msgstr "Stop, please...{line_break}Even my patience{line_break}has its limits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06337"
msgstr "Hey, don't you want{line_break}to see what he'll do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06338"
msgstr "I think we should{line_break}just stop...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06339"
msgstr "If my words will not{line_break}cool your temper, then...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06340"
msgstr "Oh! That was Psynergy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06341"
msgstr "Waaaaaaaaaahh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06342"
msgstr "Did you do that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06343"
msgstr "What did your friend{line_break}expect?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06344"
msgstr "You monster!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06345"
msgstr "I...{line_break}I am no monster.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06346"
msgstr "Help!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06347"
msgstr "This man... He must{line_break}be an Adept!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06348"
msgstr "Of course! That was{line_break}clearly Psynergy he{line_break}just used...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06349"
msgstr "You're right... We only{line_break}know what we just saw.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06350"
msgstr "Perhaps we should{line_break}try to learn a little{line_break}more about him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06351"
msgstr "Ah... When will that kindly{line_break}elder return and end my{line_break}imprisonment?{page_break}I have no time to wait,{line_break}but I don't want to have{line_break}to hurt anyone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06352"
msgstr "Why did I use my Psynergy{line_break}in anger? I must maintain{line_break}control...{page_break}My actions should{line_break}never cause regret°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06353"
msgstr "I...sense someone...{line_break}using Psynergy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06354"
msgstr "That person...{line_break}Could he be°no, he is{line_break}not of my people...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06355"
msgstr "When will I be freed?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06356"
msgstr "Even if we tried to{line_break}tell someone what{line_break}we saw...{page_break}Who would believe us!?{line_break}I think I'll just guard him{line_break}from out here, where it's safe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06357"
msgstr "Was I just dreaming{line_break}when that shaft of ice{line_break}appeared?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06358"
msgstr "Yeah! That's what it was...{line_break}It was all just a dream...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06359"
msgstr "What!?{pause_20_skippable} Oh! Oh... You're just...{line_break}You're joking with me,{line_break}right? Yeah...joking...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06360"
msgstr "My sore bottom tells{line_break}me it was all real...{page_break}But I'm not about to{line_break}say that out loud...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06361"
msgstr "It was all just a dream...{line_break}If I keep on saying it,{line_break}maybe I'll believe it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06362"
msgstr "After the Champa opened{line_break}the jail cells, they came{line_break}over here...{page_break}All of us merchants{line_break}grabbed our own swords{line_break}and started fighting...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06363"
msgstr "The item vendor got{line_break}wounded in the attack...{line_break}She's still recovering.{page_break}I don't think her boyfriend{line_break}will ever forgive that man{line_break}in the jail cell...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06364"
msgstr "Ow. Ow. Ow...{line_break}I think I got a bone{line_break}bruise. I hate those...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06365"
msgstr "Those lousy Champa...{page_break}Next time I see them,{line_break}they'll be the ones with{line_break}the bruises!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06366"
msgstr "My sister was hurt{line_break}when the Champa{line_break}attacked...{page_break}She's recovering, but I{line_break}sure hope Shin gets the{line_break}guy who did it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06367"
msgstr "Ohh... {text_effect:4}Ohhh...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06368"
msgstr "Briggs and his men{line_break}are horrid. Imagine,{line_break}hitting a woman...{page_break}When I think about it,{line_break}I just get so angry!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06369"
msgstr "Eyes... Shining in the{line_break}darkness... No! Go away!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06370"
msgstr "Surely this town is{line_break}enduring some sort{line_break}of test...{page_break}We must not fail...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06371"
msgstr "We must pass this{line_break}test. Now is the time{line_break}to be strong!{page_break}Come, join hands, and{line_break}let us give thanks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06372"
msgstr "A wave that moves the{line_break}very earth... This is no{line_break}act of man...{page_break}But certain forces do{line_break}move in mysterious ways...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06373"
msgstr "How could one explain{line_break}a continent moving?{page_break}Surely, it is the work{line_break}of a greater power...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06374"
msgstr "If this is a test,{line_break}please give us a sign.{page_break}We are your flock...{line_break}Do with us as you will...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06375"
msgstr "The raid was just another{line_break}part of the test. It must{line_break}have been.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06376"
msgstr "Has {actor_name:8} escaped!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06377"
msgstr "Oh, I'm so relieved...{line_break}So {actor_name:8} hasn't escaped?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06378"
msgstr "If he had escaped, the{line_break}elder would no longer{line_break}be able to protect him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06379"
msgstr "But...from the look of{line_break}things, it seems there{line_break}was a scuffle...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06380"
msgstr "The cell is in disarray...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06381"
msgstr "What happened in{line_break}there, I wonder?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06382"
msgstr "It seems {actor_name:8} is a man{line_break}of many mysteries.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06383"
msgstr "Not the least of which{line_break}being that boat he{line_break}arrived in...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06384"
msgstr "Oh, you there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06385"
msgstr "You look like travelers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06386"
msgstr "Milady, now is not the{line_break}time to be speaking{line_break}with strangers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06387"
msgstr "It's all right... This one{line_break}has such kind eyes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06388"
msgstr "When did you arrive?{line_break}And where are you going?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06389"
msgstr "My lady, please...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06390"
msgstr "Are you...going to Osenia?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06391"
msgstr "I knew it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06392"
msgstr "No need to be{line_break}shy, my friends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06393"
msgstr "One requires permission{line_break}to cross the bridge to{line_break}Osenia, correct?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06394"
msgstr "Then I hereby grant{line_break}my permission to these{line_break}four travelers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06395"
msgstr "Relay that message{line_break}at once!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06396"
msgstr "You may all continue{line_break}your journey and cross{line_break}into Osenia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06397"
msgstr "Father and the others set{line_break}out for Osenia to chase{line_break}Briggs... I hope he is well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06398"
msgstr "Earthquakes, pirate{line_break}attacks... What a week!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06399"
msgstr "Our inn is quite safe...{line_break}The Champa themselves{line_break}couldn't fight their way in!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06400"
msgstr "I hope those Champa{line_break}don't come back for{line_break}a rematch...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06401"
msgstr "I slept right through{line_break}the pirate raid!{page_break}It's too bad, too. I would{line_break}have given those pirates{line_break}the thumping of a lifetime!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06402"
msgstr "I'm glad my partner and{line_break}I weren't injured when{line_break}the Champa attacked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06403"
msgstr "The new land bridges{line_break}between the continents{line_break}should bring more business.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06404"
msgstr "Actually, I think it was{line_break}just that the Champa knew{line_break}we didn't have anything{page_break}worth stealing. I wonder{line_break}how they knew...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06405"
msgstr "No one was safe from{line_break}the Champa...not even{line_break}innocent women!{page_break}I should learn to{line_break}defend myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06406"
msgstr "I was hiding under my{line_break}bed the whole time...{page_break}But I'm not about to{line_break}tell him that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06407"
msgstr "We were fine because{line_break}our karma is good.{page_break}Only people with bad{line_break}karma got hurt, I'll bet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06408"
msgstr "If you wanna cross here,{line_break}you'll need permission{line_break}from the town elder!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06409"
msgstr "Without permission, ain't{line_break}no one's gonna cross this{line_break}bridge, no matter what!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06410"
msgstr "You goin' to Osenia?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06411"
msgstr "You'll have to head back to{line_break}town and get a permit!{page_break}Just go to the elder's house{line_break}and ask real nice-like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06412"
msgstr "Then get lost, pal.{line_break}These parts can be{line_break}dangerous...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06413"
msgstr "If you have permission,{line_break}you can cross anytime.{page_break}But try to cross illegally,{line_break}and we'll throw you in the{line_break}hoosegow with Mr. Bluehair!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06414"
msgstr "I wish I could tell 'em{line_break}it's nothing personal...{line_break}It's for their own good.{page_break}Who knows what's{line_break}waiting to gobble 'em{line_break}up in Osenia!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06415"
msgstr "I'm startin' to wonder when{line_break}the elder and the others'll{line_break}come back from Osenia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06416"
msgstr "Yeah, we heard about{line_break}you already.{page_break}If you're going to{line_break}Osenia, you'd better{line_break}get moving.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06417"
msgstr "Alhafra is up along the{line_break}northeast of Osenia...{line_break}You'll see it eventually.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06418"
msgstr "Head to Southeast{line_break}Osenia, and you'll{line_break}hit Mikasalla.{page_break}It's a small village, though.{line_break}Probably not much to{line_break}interest you there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06419"
msgstr "If you try heading straight{line_break}through Osenia to Alhafra,{line_break}you'll hit Yampi Desert.{page_break}You'd be better off avoiding{line_break}the desert and just following{line_break}the coast to Alhafra instead.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06420"
msgstr "Unless I had a boat, I{line_break}wouldn't go to Osenia,{line_break}with permission or without.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06421"
msgstr "These guys must be looking{line_break}for trouble. Me, I'd rather{line_break}stay home and relax.{page_break}It's so pleasant and{line_break}comfortable.{pause_20_skippable} And safe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06422"
msgstr "This is a Champa boat...{line_break}You can see their mark{line_break}on the flag there.{page_break}They must have been{line_break}run aground here by the{line_break}tidal wave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06423"
msgstr "Wait, if this is the Champa{line_break}ship, then that must mean{line_break}{actor_name:8} isn't a Champa!{page_break}So...why does the elder{line_break}still need Briggs to{line_break}clear his name?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06424"
msgstr "Look at all the damage...{line_break}That wave must have{line_break}been gigantic...{page_break}I wonder how many{line_break}Champa died in the{line_break}wreck...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06425"
msgstr "I guess even if they{line_break}did free Briggs...{page_break}They wouldn't have{line_break}been able to go back{line_break}out to sea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06426"
msgstr "Briggs must be trying{line_break}to get a new ship in{line_break}Alhafra.{page_break}I hope the elder finds{line_break}him first!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06427"
msgstr "They still had enough{line_break}men to dig that hole{line_break}and attack Madra.{page_break}And enough to form{line_break}two attack parties, too...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06428"
msgstr "Look upon me with eyes{line_break}of truth... Then the door{line_break}will open...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06429"
msgstr "The door won't budge.{line_break}...Must be locked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06430"
msgstr "It's been a long time{line_break}since we had any{line_break}visitors in Mikasalla.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06431"
msgstr "Are you looking{line_break}for someone?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06432"
msgstr "Well, if you're looking for{line_break}someone...{page_break}I'd say the best place{line_break}to start would be...{line_break}somewhere else.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06433"
msgstr "Didn't think so...{line_break}We don't get a lot of{line_break}strangers coming here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06434"
msgstr "I went out to investigate{line_break}after the earthquake...{page_break}It looks like a whole{line_break}different land collided{line_break}into our own...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06435"
msgstr "If you're going deeper{line_break}into Osenia, you'd better{line_break}be ready for trouble.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06436"
msgstr "In the heart of Osenia{line_break}lies a sacred place,{line_break}Air's Rock...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06437"
msgstr "If you want to go into{line_break}the heart of Osenia,{line_break}there are two ways...{page_break}You can approach from the{line_break}south, or you can come{line_break}down from the north...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06438"
msgstr "If you look across the{line_break}ocean to the south,{line_break}you can see Tundaria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06439"
msgstr "A town called Garoh{line_break}lies to the east of us...{page_break}But...its residents aren't{line_break}quite...human...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06440"
msgstr "Why would anyone travel{line_break}all this way just to come{line_break}to our backwater town?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06441"
msgstr "I like this time of year{line_break}best of all...{page_break}It's so much nicer and{line_break}more pleasant than the{line_break}harsh winter...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06442"
msgstr "Osenia was big already,{line_break}but now that we're{line_break}connected to Indra...{page_break}It's just huge!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06443"
msgstr "No way I'd leave town...{page_break}If I got lost on the roads{line_break}out there, I'd be a monster{line_break}snack in no time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06444"
msgstr "Air's Rock has stood there since{line_break}this world was first formed...{page_break}Nobody knows exactly{line_break}what that means, though...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06445"
msgstr "It's weird that you can't{line_break}go all the way around{line_break}Osenia from the south...{page_break}I mean, it's a piece of{line_break}cake if you go around{line_break}from the north...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06446"
msgstr "It's bitter cold in{line_break}Tundaria... It snows{line_break}there all year long.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06447"
msgstr "The people in Garoh{line_break}are pretty furry.{page_break}They look weird°and{line_break}kinda cuddly°but{line_break}they're nice enough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06448"
msgstr "I heard someone say{line_break}there's another continent{line_break}west of Gondowan.{page_break}...At least, that's what{line_break}my dad used to tell me,{line_break}rest his soul...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06449"
msgstr "My father-in-law was a{line_break}great explorer, long ago,{line_break}as was my husband.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06450"
msgstr "Hey, mister! Are you{line_break}an explorer?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06451"
msgstr "Awesome! Don't tell{line_break}anyone, but I want to be{line_break}an explorer too someday!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06452"
msgstr "My grandpa used to{line_break}travel all over the{line_break}whole world!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06453"
msgstr "It must be nice to get{line_break}out and see the world...{page_break}But staying in one place{line_break}is nice, too.{page_break}Maybe that's why my{line_break}dad founded this village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06454"
msgstr "That boy sure admires{line_break}his grandpa, but I get{line_break}really worried about him.{page_break}I'm afraid he'd get hurt{line_break}if he became an explorer{line_break}like his grandfather.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06455"
msgstr "I love exploring out{line_break}behind the house...{line_break}It's my secret place!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06456"
msgstr "Buk buk buk...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06457"
msgstr "Bah! {text_effect:4}Baaaaaaa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06458"
msgstr "The ground here is so{line_break}soft! I just want to{line_break}scratch and dig, buhKAWK!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06459"
msgstr "Oh, yeah! Mmm!{line_break}I just loves to eat{line_break}me some grass! Yum!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06460"
msgstr "Those who have climbed{line_break}Air's Rock claim that they{line_break}can see the unseeable...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06461"
msgstr "My husband has tried{line_break}to climb Air's Rock{line_break}many times...{page_break}I wish I knew what he{line_break}saw in that big hunk{line_break}of rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06462"
msgstr "What does the unseeable{line_break}even look like?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06463"
msgstr "I can't let him try to{line_break}climb it again. What{line_break}if he were injured?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06464"
msgstr "We only have a small{line_break}shop here. I used to{line_break}specialize in items...{page_break}But now, I sell armor{line_break}and weapons, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06465"
msgstr "I don't know much about{line_break}weapons and stuff...{page_break}I hope they don't ask me{line_break}any questions. Maybe{line_break}they only want items...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06466"
msgstr "There aren't any towns{line_break}between here and Garoh.{page_break}You should rest here and{line_break}maybe reequip yourselves{line_break}before heading out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06467"
msgstr "You've come a long way,{line_break}friends. Stay a while, and{line_break}rest your feet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06468"
msgstr "There's no reason to go{line_break}to Garoh unless you were{line_break}heading to Air's Rock...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06469"
msgstr "Why are travelers always{line_break}in such a hurry?{page_break}Like my mum used to{line_break}say, \"Fools rush in...\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06470"
msgstr "Have you been{line_break}to Garoh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06471"
msgstr "They're all werewolves{line_break}there... They hide away{line_break}from those who fear them.{page_break}But their cursed forms{line_break}come with great powers...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06472"
msgstr "Do not fear their outward{line_break}appearance...{page_break}Many revile them, but{line_break}they are gentle, and they{line_break}have kind hearts.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06473"
msgstr "I wonder if there are{line_break}werewolves beyond{line_break}those in Garoh...{page_break}I also wonder if they{line_break}might not be as gentle{line_break}as Garoh's folk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06474"
msgstr "Forgive my manners...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06475"
msgstr "No, please...{line_break}Do not fear me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06476"
msgstr "I am the warrior Galahad.{page_break}I am looking for someone,{line_break}and I need your help...{page_break}Do you know of a{line_break}knight called {actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06477"
msgstr "You do? I must warn Sir{line_break}{actor_name:1} that he is in{line_break}danger most grievous...{page_break}Even now, Satrage,{line_break}Navampa, and Azart{line_break}are looking for him...{page_break}They wish to avenge{line_break}the loss he gave them{line_break}at Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06478"
msgstr "A pity... The one I seek{line_break}won a battle at Colosso,{line_break}in Tolbi.{page_break}He won...and too easily,{line_break}perhaps. Now, his opponents{line_break}are eager for revenge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06479"
msgstr "I think {actor_name:1} must{line_break}be somewhere in the{line_break}Eastern Sea right now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06480"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}'s enemies are{line_break}gathering now, to destroy{line_break}him and erase their shame.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06481"
msgstr "I fear what might happen{line_break}if the three find {actor_name:1}{line_break}before I can warn him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06482"
msgstr "Gaaaroooooo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06483"
msgstr "Aow-aow-oooo!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06484"
msgstr "What was that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06485"
msgstr "Awoooooo!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06486"
msgstr "Ah-ah-awoooo!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06487"
msgstr "Eeek!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06488"
msgstr "I don't believe it!{line_break}Was that a°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06489"
msgstr "A what? Kraden, do you{line_break}know what that thing was?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06490"
msgstr "Well... Perhaps...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06491"
msgstr "So, what are you{line_break}waiting for!? Tell us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06492"
msgstr "I suspect it may have{line_break}been...a lycanthrope.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06493"
msgstr "A lycanthwhat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06494"
msgstr "Just think of them as{line_break}a race of people born with{line_break}special powers...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06495"
msgstr "Kind of like Adepts,{line_break}you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06496"
msgstr "Yes, that sounds right.{line_break}{actor_name:7}, you've put it{line_break}quite well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06497"
msgstr "Adepts borrow their{line_break}abilities from the power{line_break}of the elements...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06498"
msgstr "While lycanthropes borrow{line_break}theirs from the power{line_break}of beasts...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06499"
msgstr "This is why they{line_break}take the forms of{line_break}animals...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06500"
msgstr "They may look{line_break}frightening...{page_break}But we must try to{line_break}communicate with them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06501"
msgstr "Lycanthropes...{line_break}Werewolves... A whole{line_break}village in hiding...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06502"
msgstr "Is it just me...{page_break}Or does Kraden seem a{line_break}little TOO happy to have{line_break}found werewolves?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06503"
msgstr "What? Me? Happy to{line_break}find werewolves? You{line_break}must be joking!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06504"
msgstr "I would love to study{line_break}them, but still...they{line_break}do frighten me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06505"
msgstr "I guess I'm just curious{line_break}about all of the secrets{line_break}of these new lands...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06506"
msgstr "Any real scholar would be{line_break}thrilled to explore a new land{line_break}full of mystery, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06507"
msgstr "So, are there werewolves{line_break}only on Osenia?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06508"
msgstr "Ummm...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06509"
msgstr "If so, how could you{line_break}even have known about{line_break}them, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06510"
msgstr "Er... I, uh...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06511"
msgstr "Yeah... That is weird.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06512"
msgstr "All right, so I lied!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06513"
msgstr "I'm glad we found{line_break}werewolves! There!{line_break}Are you happy!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06514"
msgstr "And you know what!?{line_break}I even want to get a{line_break}closer look if I can!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06515"
msgstr "So let's go! Let's find{line_break}us some werewolves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06516"
msgstr "So, uh...you say you{line_break}saw a werewolf?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06517"
msgstr "Don't be ridiculous...{line_break}There's no such{line_break}thing as werewolves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06518"
msgstr "Of course not...{line_break}You should know there's{line_break}no such thing! Not here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06519"
msgstr "Good evening. Forgive{line_break}me for not taking my{line_break}hood off...{page_break}I just...don't care much{line_break}for the full moon's light.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06520"
msgstr "Gaaaroooooo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06521"
msgstr "Gah! Whoops...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06522"
msgstr "Heh heh hrrr...{line_break}I was just calling my{line_break}dog... Sounded good, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06523"
msgstr "You there...{line_break}Strangers should not{line_break}go about at night...{page_break}Guests are welcome in{line_break}Garoh, but they'd do{line_break}well to stay in at night.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06524"
msgstr "Don't you love the{line_break}sight of the full moon?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06525"
msgstr "Yes, I agree...{line_break}But it brings me grief.{page_break}We here cannot{line_break}enjoy the sight{line_break}of it directly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06526"
msgstr "Heh hrr hrrr... Don't feel{line_break}like you must watch your{line_break}words on my account.{page_break}The full moon's light gives{line_break}birth to many strange{line_break}sights on nights like this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06527"
msgstr "It's grim luck that brings{line_break}strangers here in the{line_break}gloom of the full moon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06528"
msgstr "Such gorgeous moonlight...{line_break}If only I could take{line_break}off this hood...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06529"
msgstr "Which one of us was it{line_break}who removed his hood in{line_break}front of these strangers?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06530"
msgstr "Foreigners only come{line_break}here en route to Air's Rock.{page_break}Only a chosen few{line_break}can reach the peak.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06531"
msgstr "The night of the full{line_break}moon is usually so{line_break}festive...{page_break}It's boring having to{line_break}wear these hoods{line_break}when strangers come...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06532"
msgstr "What!? Outsiders, here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06533"
msgstr "Good evening, wanderers!{line_break}Are you looking for{line_break}something?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06534"
msgstr "Just...staying up late,{line_break}eh? Can't say I blame{line_break}you, on a night like this.{page_break}We here know the glory{line_break}of night of the full moon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06535"
msgstr "Searching for{line_break}werewolves, eh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06536"
msgstr "You don't really{line_break}believe they exist,{line_break}do you?{page_break}If so, you'd best keep{line_break}it to yourself...{page_break}That is, if you don't{line_break}want to have folks here{line_break}howling with laughter...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06537"
msgstr "Hehrrr... Sorry.{line_break}Just thought I'd ask.{page_break}We get some crazy folk{line_break}coming through here,{line_break}and I had to ask...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06538"
msgstr "Our oldest son is always{line_break}scampering off late{line_break}at night... Where is he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06539"
msgstr "No fair! My brother{line_break}always gets to go{line_break}out late!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06540"
msgstr "Outsiders could never{line_break}understand the gift the{line_break}moon has given us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06541"
msgstr "That pup of mine just{line_break}won't listen. He went out{line_break}when he shouldn't have...{page_break}He just wanted to see the{line_break}moonlight, and now his{line_break}father blames me for it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06542"
msgstr "What made Master{line_break}Maha take my brother{line_break}into the rock?{page_break}I want to see{line_break}what's in there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06543"
msgstr "Garoh exists to{line_break}protect Air's Rock.{page_break}In exchange, we gain{line_break}its power ourselves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06544"
msgstr "So you've heard of Whirlwind?{line_break}Most people haven't...{page_break}Even in Garoh, only a{line_break}chosen few can use it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06545"
msgstr "I've heard about the{line_break}Wind Stone...{page_break}Using Whirlwind on it{line_break}makes...something happen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06546"
msgstr "We have other powers{line_break}than just Whirlwind...{page_break}I wonder which of us{line_break}will inherit the powers{line_break}of Master Maha?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06547"
msgstr "And different people use{line_break}Whirlwind different ways.{page_break}Master Maha's mastery{line_break}of Whirlwind would put{line_break}anyone to shame.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06548"
msgstr "I wish I knew what{line_break}would happen...{line_break}Something weird, I guess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06549"
msgstr "When our people grow{line_break}older, they generate{line_break}strange powers...{page_break}Of course, I'm just a{line_break}wee pup, in people years...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06550"
msgstr "My mate is close to{line_break}obtaining the power{line_break}he's been seeking...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06551"
msgstr "I cast Whirlwind on the{line_break}stone, like I was{line_break}supposed to...{page_break}So why didn't I gain the{line_break}power that Maha wields?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06552"
msgstr "If he succeeds and carries{line_break}on Master Maha's traditions,{line_break}I'll be so proud...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06553"
msgstr "I'm sorry, but on nights{line_break}of the full moon, we only{line_break}sell claws and fangs.{page_break}You...probably wouldn't{line_break}have any use for those,{line_break}would you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06554"
msgstr "I should be outside,{line_break}howling with the pack,{line_break}not stuck in here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06555"
msgstr "Unfortunate that you{line_break}should come on a night{line_break}of the full moon, sir...{page_break}Come during the day{line_break}to see our full range{line_break}of wares...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06556"
msgstr "These strangers seem{line_break}normal enough...{page_break}Except that they're{line_break}up late for outsiders...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06557"
msgstr "Did you come here{line_break}from Alhafra?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06558"
msgstr "Really? You must have{line_break}gone through the cave...{page_break}You can't go back that{line_break}way, you know... The{line_break}return trip is longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06559"
msgstr "Oh, so you must have{line_break}come by way of Mikasalla.{page_break}If you're going to Air's{line_break}Rock, take the crossroads{line_break}west of Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06560"
msgstr "I never change my stock,{line_break}unlike the weapons and{line_break}armor shopkeeps...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06561"
msgstr "A clear night around here{line_break}always means fair weather{line_break}on the morrow...{page_break}You've come all this{line_break}way, so you might as{line_break}well go to Air's Rock, too...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06562"
msgstr "Air's Rock can get quite{line_break}desolate. After all, it's in{line_break}the middle of a desert...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06563"
msgstr "Zzzz... Zzzz...{line_break}What a waste...{line_break}Just a big rock...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06564"
msgstr "Zzz... Whuzza? Whirlwind?{line_break}Wind Stone? Zzzzrrrgg...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06565"
msgstr "It only rains a few{line_break}times a year there...{page_break}Air's Rock is in a desert,{line_break}so what else would{line_break}you expect?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06566"
msgstr "Most people see nothing{line_break}of the true Air's Rock.{page_break}Our current guests{line_break}saw only the wind{line_break}and the dust...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06567"
msgstr "...Climbed all over{line_break}that stupid rock, and{line_break}for what? Nothing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06568"
msgstr "That rock was huge.{line_break}How was I supposed{line_break}to make it spin?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06569"
msgstr "The people here may{line_break}be different, but they{line_break}certainly are nice...{page_break}And those abilities of{line_break}theirs are amazing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06570"
msgstr "No matter what it takes,{line_break}I will save the souls of{line_break}those poor villagers...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06571"
msgstr "Haowooo!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06572"
msgstr "Aow-aow-oooo!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06573"
msgstr "Look! It's that werewolf!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06574"
msgstr "He was right there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06575"
msgstr "Let's go find him,{line_break}{actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06576"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, wait...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06577"
msgstr "Where could that{line_break}werewolf have gone?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06578"
msgstr "Do you think we lost{line_break}him somewhere?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06579"
msgstr "That would be a shame...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06580"
msgstr "I hope we didn't...{line_break}Or rather, I'd be quite{line_break}unhappy if we did...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06581"
msgstr "Grrrr...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06582"
msgstr "What was that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06583"
msgstr "It sounded like a wolf{line_break}growling, didn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06584"
msgstr "My hearing is not{line_break}so very good, but...{line_break}there was something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06585"
msgstr "Perhaps we should{line_break}search this area more{line_break}thoroughly...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06586"
msgstr "There is no need...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06587"
msgstr "Look... He's using Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06588"
msgstr "Garrrrooow...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06589"
msgstr "Fear not...{line_break}This child is harmless.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06590"
msgstr "He does look kind{line_break}of...small...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06591"
msgstr "Grrrrrrr...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06592"
msgstr "Tell me, who are you? How{line_break}did you come to be here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06593"
msgstr "I should like to ask you{line_break}the same question.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06594"
msgstr "Could it be? Do you{line_break}outsiders possess the{line_break}power to reveal the unseen?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06595"
msgstr "Impossible...{line_break}Without Reveal, you could{line_break}not have entered this cave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06596"
msgstr "Of course... I was certain{line_break}that you must.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06597"
msgstr "Grawooo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06598"
msgstr "Yes, you are correct. They{line_break}must have passed the{line_break}challenge of Air's Rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06599"
msgstr "Er... How come that kid{line_break}doesn't talk, like you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06600"
msgstr "When we become werewolves,{line_break}speaking the human tongue{line_break}becomes more difficult.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06601"
msgstr "But you can... You must{line_break}be someone special, then...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06602"
msgstr "Hurh hurr hrrr... \"Special\"?{line_break}Perhaps.{pause_20_skippable} Why don't you just{line_break}call me Maha...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06603"
msgstr "So... I assume you also{line_break}can use Whirlwind...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06604"
msgstr "If you learned Reveal on{line_break}Air's Rock, you must also{line_break}know Whirlwind.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06605"
msgstr "I don't think we need to hide{line_break}the fact that we're Adepts{line_break}from Maha...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06606"
msgstr "That's right...{line_break}I think we can tell Maha{line_break}that we're Adepts.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06607"
msgstr "Awooo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06608"
msgstr "What did he say?{line_break}I don't understand...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06609"
msgstr "He wanted to know what{line_break}an Adept is... A question I{line_break}would like answered as well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06610"
msgstr "Adepts tap the power of{line_break}elemental energies to generate{line_break}forces like Whirlwind...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06611"
msgstr "Elementals... You mean the{line_break}four elements, the powers of{line_break}earth and fire, water and wind?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06612"
msgstr "That is correct. These elements{line_break}together comprise everything{line_break}in our world...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06613"
msgstr "Interesting.{line_break}Very interesting...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06614"
msgstr "Awooo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06615"
msgstr "Um... What did he{line_break}say that time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06616"
msgstr "He asked if there were{line_break}no longer any need to hide{line_break}from you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06617"
msgstr "...Why did he have to{line_break}hide in here in the{line_break}first place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06618"
msgstr "Aaah-Ah-Awoooh!{line_break}Hawawoooh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06619"
msgstr "No doubt, most would find{line_break}the sight of a werewolf{line_break}rather unnerving...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06620"
msgstr "You are, sadly, correct.{line_break}Many consider ours an{line_break}accursed race.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06621"
msgstr "And if they found you{line_break}in your werewolf form?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06622"
msgstr "...Once, our people were{line_break}burned at the stake as{line_break}abominations...{page_break}They called this{line_break}\"purification.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06623"
msgstr "Horrible...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06624"
msgstr "But...this little one...{line_break}He won't get excited{line_break}and try to bite, will he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06625"
msgstr "Child, return to{line_break}your home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06626"
msgstr "Arrooo?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06627"
msgstr "Don't worry.{line_break}We can trust them...{line_break}Go back home now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06628"
msgstr "Aarrrooo?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06629"
msgstr "They are Adepts, not unlike{line_break}us werewolves... They guard{line_break}an ancient secret.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06630"
msgstr "We can trust them. They{line_break}will not betray us to{line_break}the world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06631"
msgstr "Woof.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06632"
msgstr "It has grown quite late.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06633"
msgstr "Why don't you go to{line_break}the inn and rest...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06634"
msgstr "But then...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06635"
msgstr "I will not leave{line_break}this place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06636"
msgstr "You aren't going home?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06637"
msgstr "When I learned Reveal,{line_break}I lost my human form. The{line_break}wild is my home now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06638"
msgstr "So, Master Maha, you{line_break}always look this way?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06639"
msgstr "And the little one?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06640"
msgstr "The child changed because{line_break}he looked directly at the{line_break}full moon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06641"
msgstr "So, by tomorrow morning,{line_break}he will have returned{line_break}to his human form again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06642"
msgstr "Correct.{line_break}Now, let us retire.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06643"
msgstr "I will tell the people of{line_break}Garoh that they need not{line_break}hide our secret from you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06644"
msgstr "One who can master Reveal{line_break}in human form... An Adept...{line_break}What a remarkable thing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06645"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} and party{line_break}stayed the night{line_break}at the inn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06646"
msgstr "You folks didn't sleep much{line_break}last night... You don't look{line_break}like you got any rest at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06647"
msgstr "Master Maha told us all{line_break}about you. Don't you worry{line_break}about the bill. It's on us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06648"
msgstr "Farewell, friends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06649"
msgstr "I hear tell from Master{line_break}Maha that you guys are{line_break}special, too...{page_break}We don't have to hide{line_break}our secret from you{line_break}any longer!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06650"
msgstr "Last night when you saw{line_break}me, I was wearing a hood.{page_break}I guess I won't have to{line_break}do that anymore!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06651"
msgstr "Awoooooh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06652"
msgstr "Heh heh... Sorry about that!{line_break}I'm so happy I don't have{line_break}to hide that I howled out loud!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06653"
msgstr "Maha said that you were the{line_break}only outsiders we could{line_break}share our secret with...{page_break}So...does it bother you that{line_break}we're all werewolves?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06654"
msgstr "Yeah, I thought so...{line_break}That's too bad.{page_break}I was so happy when Maha{line_break}told us. Now, I'm just{line_break}really disappointed. Arooo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06655"
msgstr "Wow! You guys really are{line_break}different from the others!{page_break}Most people run away{line_break}screaming or even grab{line_break}their weapons...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06656"
msgstr "I heard there were other{line_break}werecreatures in Osenia,{line_break}in a few places...{page_break}...People who can turn{line_break}into other things than{line_break}wolves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06657"
msgstr "Hey, it's you guys!{line_break}Thanks for last night!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06658"
msgstr "Oh, yeah... That's right...{line_break}You probably don't recognize{line_break}me in my human form!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06659"
msgstr "I was in the cave with Maha!{line_break}I was that little werewolf!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06660"
msgstr "I'm the reason you can{line_break}stay in our village and we{line_break}don't have to wear hoods!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06661"
msgstr "How could these outsiders{line_break}have learned Reveal?{page_break}These guys must be{line_break}pretty unusual.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06662"
msgstr "I thought we'd never be{line_break}able to talk to outsiders{line_break}about our secret...{page_break}I feel so free!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06663"
msgstr "I never thought I'd be{line_break}so happy to have our{line_break}secret out in the open!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06664"
msgstr "Maha said these travelers{line_break}were like us...{page_break}Does that mean they're{line_break}werewolves, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06665"
msgstr "I would love to meet{line_break}other werecreatures{line_break}someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06666"
msgstr "My dad told me I put the{line_break}whole village at risk...{line_break}He was really mad...{page_break}He said this whole thing{line_break}was just dumb luck... But{line_break}why would luck be dumb?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06667"
msgstr "Hey! It's you!{line_break}Thanks for looking out{line_break}for our son last night!{page_break}But I'm curious... Did you{line_break}believe in werewolves{line_break}before you came here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06668"
msgstr "Everyone is amazed that{line_break}you learned Reveal{line_break}at Air's Rock!{page_break}If you have some time,{line_break}could you teach it{line_break}to our children?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06669"
msgstr "My brother should have{line_break}gotten in trouble, but they{line_break}barely even got mad at him!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06670"
msgstr "The younger the werewolf,{line_break}the less control he has{line_break}over his wolf form...{page_break}These travelers must have{line_break}been very brave to follow him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06671"
msgstr "Oh, thank goodness!{line_break}Everything worked out,{line_break}and my husband's not mad...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06672"
msgstr "And dad said he was{line_break}really going to tan his hide{line_break}this time, too...{page_break}And now everyone's treating{line_break}him like he did some{line_break}amazingly good deed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06673"
msgstr "So you're something special?{line_break}An Adept, or something like{line_break}that?{page_break}Does that mean that you{line_break}can turn into a wolf or,{line_break}something, like us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06674"
msgstr "You learned Reveal at{line_break}Air's Rock and lived to{line_break}tell the tale...{page_break}So that must mean...{line_break}you can use Whirlwind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06675"
msgstr "I just can't believe that{line_break}someone outside the{line_break}village learned Reveal...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06676"
msgstr "Did Maha mean that they{line_break}could change forms, like{line_break}we can?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06677"
msgstr "So these people can use{line_break}both Reveal and Whirlwind...{page_break}They must be powerful,{line_break}like Master Maha is.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06678"
msgstr "Normally, outsiders never{line_break}get in to see Maha, but{line_break}these people...{page_break}They can see him{line_break}whenever they want...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06679"
msgstr "You... Is it true that{line_break}you learned Reveal?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06680"
msgstr "Hmm...I thought Air's{line_break}Rock belonged to my{line_break}people alone...{page_break}But you young outsiders{line_break}have mastered it so quickly...{line_break}I might as well quit trying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06681"
msgstr "No, I can tell it was you{line_break}they're talking about... I can{line_break}smell Air's Rock on you...{page_break}Ah, but you're so young!{line_break}And I am so very old...{line_break}I might as well quit trying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06682"
msgstr "To think I've wasted so much of{line_break}my life on something you{line_break}did in a single afternoon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06683"
msgstr "He's worked so hard...{line_break}But now, I don't know...{line_break}He seems so sad...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06684"
msgstr "I thought I could become a{line_break}leader if I learned Reveal.{line_break}How foolish of me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06685"
msgstr "So now, even outsiders{line_break}are learning Reveal...{page_break}How do we decide who{line_break}will lead Garoh now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06686"
msgstr "What do you think? I'll bet{line_break}these weapons suit you{line_break}better than any fangs would!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06687"
msgstr "I prefer the tooth and claw,{line_break}myself, but whatever...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06688"
msgstr "When we change form,{line_break}it's best to be unclothed.{page_break}But when you're human,{line_break}armor always comes in handy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06689"
msgstr "Maha says that when we're{line_break}wolves, we don't need to{line_break}wear armor...{page_break}He says our instincts{line_break}will protect us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06690"
msgstr "I've heard stories about{line_break}other mountains like our{line_break}own Air's Rock...{page_break}Like on this island that{line_break}lies across the Eastern{line_break}Sea, far from Osenia...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06691"
msgstr "I heard that one that's{line_break}across the Eastern Sea{line_break}is really pretty, too.{page_break}It's got water spilling down{line_break}the sides in huge torrents.{line_break}Sounds lovely...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06692"
msgstr "If you can pass the tests{line_break}of Air's Rock, you can do{line_break}anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06693"
msgstr "Maha came along{line_break}and said the nicest{line_break}things about you all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06694"
msgstr "Those wolves were{line_break}really noisy last{line_break}night, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06695"
msgstr "Maybe we should stay{line_break}and try climbing Air's Rock{line_break}one more time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06696"
msgstr "I've heard stories about{line_break}other places like Air's{line_break}Rock...{page_break}If they can handle Air's{line_break}Rock, they can probably{line_break}handle those too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06697"
msgstr "He said if they were{line_break}werewolves, he'd want them{line_break}to take his place...{page_break}They must have made{line_break}quite an impression on{line_break}Maha for him to say that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06698"
msgstr "I'm scared of wolves,{line_break}so I don't go out much{line_break}at night...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06699"
msgstr "If I used a lever, I{line_break}could probably make{line_break}that rock spin...{page_break}But I still don't get what{line_break}the point of it is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06700"
msgstr "I've heard about you.{line_break}They say you're special,{line_break}like the people in this town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06701"
msgstr "Am I the only one here{line_break}who isn't special!?{page_break}Please, won't somebody{line_break}answer my wishes and{line_break}make me special, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06702"
msgstr "Ah, you came...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06703"
msgstr "I've been waiting for you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06704"
msgstr "Would you mind telling me a{line_break}little more about werewolves?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06705"
msgstr "You want to know the reason{line_break}we possess the power to{line_break}transform into beasts?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06706"
msgstr "Ah... Well, {pause_20_skippable}I, er...{line_break}Actually, yes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06707"
msgstr "Do you find it strange{line_break}that we can change our{line_break}shapes?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06708"
msgstr "Well, ummm... Yes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06709"
msgstr "But surely changing one's{line_break}shape is not really all that{line_break}unusual.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06710"
msgstr "What are you getting at?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06711"
msgstr "Think about the caterpillar{line_break}for a moment.{page_break}When the time is right,{line_break}does it not transform into{line_break}a beautiful butterfly?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06712"
msgstr "Well, yes. It's only natural...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06713"
msgstr "And the pill bug and hedgehog?{line_break}Do they not change their{line_break}shapes to protect themselves?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06714"
msgstr "I have heard of these{line_break}creatures, yes...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06715"
msgstr "And many amphibians possess{line_break}the power to change color{line_break}at will, correct?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06716"
msgstr "In light of all this, do you{line_break}mean to tell me you find{line_break}werewolves so abnormal?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06717"
msgstr "Hrmm, well... To be honest,{line_break}I hadn't thought of it that{line_break}way before...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06718"
msgstr "Perhaps you simply did not{line_break}give it enough thought.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06719"
msgstr "How insulting! I, sir...{line_break}am a SCIENTIST!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06720"
msgstr "Indeed! A scientist?{line_break}That {text_effect:2}is{reset_text_style} impressive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06721"
msgstr "I have spent a great{line_break}deal of time thinking{line_break}about werewolves.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06722"
msgstr "For a time, I even felt{line_break}cursed to have been{line_break}born a werewolf...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06723"
msgstr "But after taking a more{line_break}objective look at nature...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06724"
msgstr "I realized that weaker{line_break}species have survived by{line_break}evolving...by transforming.{page_break}Don't you agree?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06725"
msgstr "Think about it for a moment.{line_break}Without changing their bodies{line_break}with weapons and armor...{page_break}Humans would be very{line_break}weak creatures indeed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06726"
msgstr "I believe that evolving into{line_break}werewolves is just one way{line_break}for humanity to survive...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06727"
msgstr "But that's...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06728"
msgstr "Of course, there's{line_break}no way I can prove{line_break}this theory.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06729"
msgstr "But I felt that our ability{line_break}to use Whirlwind was{line_break}evidence of this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06730"
msgstr "Whirlwind? Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06731"
msgstr "I had thought only the{line_break}people of Garoh could{line_break}use Whirlwind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06732"
msgstr "It was a gift known{line_break}only to werewolves, to{line_break}Garoh's pack...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06733"
msgstr "And that only a chosen few{line_break}could use Reveal...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06734"
msgstr "But now I find that you,{line_break}too, can use these... What{line_break}does it all mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06735"
msgstr "Why are you able to use{line_break}Whirlwind, and what is{line_break}an Adept?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06736"
msgstr "Master Maha, do you know of{line_break}a continent called Angara? It{line_break}lies far north of the Eastern Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06737"
msgstr "Angara?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06738"
msgstr "In the middle of Angara, there{line_break}is a peak called Mt. Aleph.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06739"
msgstr "Mt. Aleph? ...Then it's true!{line_break}Our legends say this peak has{line_break}stood since this world began!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06740"
msgstr "If Mt. Aleph does exist, then{line_break}perhaps our legends are true!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06741"
msgstr "It does exist...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06742"
msgstr "These two hail from the{line_break}village at the base of Mt. Aleph,{line_break}a village called Vale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06743"
msgstr "They come from Mt. Aleph!?{line_break}Incredible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06744"
msgstr "And they are both Adepts.{line_break}And while their powers{line_break}may vary...{page_break}Everyone from Vale is an{line_break}Adept to a certain degree.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06745"
msgstr "Then, does that not make{line_break}them like us in Garoh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06746"
msgstr "In Vale, the myths say that{line_break}Mt. Aleph itself gave birth{line_break}to the Adepts...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06747"
msgstr "This is not what the legends{line_break}of Garoh tell us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06748"
msgstr "As a people, they are{line_break}quite gifted...but it goes{line_break}far beyond that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06749"
msgstr "The mystical stones on{line_break}Mt. Aleph... The Psynergy{line_break}Stones...{page_break}They are closely linked to{line_break}the powers of the townsfolk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06750"
msgstr "\"Psynergy Stones,\" you say?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06751"
msgstr "If there were similar stones{line_break}in Garoh, it might explain{line_break}your powers as well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06752"
msgstr "And what manner of stones{line_break}are these Psynergy Stones?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06753"
msgstr "You've seen them, Maha!{line_break}The shining stone at the{line_break}heart of Air's Rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06754"
msgstr "I know the stone you{line_break}speak of, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06755"
msgstr "Air's Rock is quite far{line_break}from Garoh.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06756"
msgstr "I don't see how it could{line_break}affect the people here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06757"
msgstr "I wonder... Could it be{line_break}the wind?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06758"
msgstr "You probably figured{line_break}it out for yourself already,{line_break}{actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06759"
msgstr "I guess I couldn't have{line_break}expected you to understand,{line_break}{actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06760"
msgstr "There were strong winds blowing{line_break}within Air's Rock... Those winds{line_break}would carry far...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06761"
msgstr "Carry? Carry what?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06762"
msgstr "Ugh! You're so dense!{line_break}The power of the Psynergy{line_break}Stone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06763"
msgstr "How is that possible? How{line_break}could the stone's power{line_break}be carried on the wind?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06764"
msgstr "Do not belittle the{line_break}power of the wind!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06765"
msgstr "Given time, the wind can{line_break}grind great mountains down{line_break}to sand!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06766"
msgstr "I mean, the wind at Air's{line_break}Rock was strong enough{line_break}to blow us off the ground!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06767"
msgstr "So why couldn't the wind{line_break}carry particles of the stone{line_break}all the way to Garoh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06768"
msgstr "She's right!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06769"
msgstr "She's right!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06770"
msgstr "Those particles from the{line_break}Psynergy Stone must be{line_break}charged with its power!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06771"
msgstr "This explains why your{line_break}Psynergy is weaker than{line_break}that of Vale's people...{page_break}You've been exposed{line_break}to smaller particles.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06772"
msgstr "The wind patterns might{line_break}also affect who among us{line_break}in Garoh can use Whirlwind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06773"
msgstr "Of course, this is all mere{line_break}conjecture, but it does offer{line_break}us some clues...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06774"
msgstr "Thank you, umm...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06775"
msgstr "It's {actor_name:7}.{line_break}I'm pleased to meet you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06776"
msgstr "Oh! Haven't we given you{line_break}our names, Master Maha?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06777"
msgstr "I am Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06778"
msgstr "This is {actor_name:6}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06779"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06780"
msgstr "And {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06781"
msgstr "You must permit me to thank{line_break}you for all you've done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06782"
msgstr "No, no, please... We don't{line_break}need any thanks...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06783"
msgstr "That's too bad... I was{line_break}going to give you this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06784"
msgstr "It's a Djinni!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06785"
msgstr "A \"Djinni\"? Is that{line_break}what you call them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06786"
msgstr "When he is with you,{line_break}he adds to your power.{line_break}He is very helpful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06787"
msgstr "I suppose you'll be continuing{line_break}your journey now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06788"
msgstr "So you intend to travel by{line_break}sea? That is a long journey...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06789"
msgstr "So, you still can't tell just{line_break}what sort of journeys{line_break}await you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06790"
msgstr "In that case, I think you{line_break}will get more use out of{line_break}this \"Djinni\" than I will.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06791"
msgstr "{argument_actor_name:1} got the{line_break}Djinni ~.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06792"
msgstr "Another Djinni!{line_break}Talk about lucky!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06793"
msgstr "This is a great gift.{line_break}We are quite thankful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06794"
msgstr "You don't need to thank{line_break}me. Just take care on{line_break}your travels.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06795"
msgstr "Good luck with the...{line_break}werewolf thing, Maha...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06796"
msgstr "Well, {actor_name:5}, we must{line_break}be going now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06797"
msgstr "Take care in your{line_break}travels, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06798"
msgstr "I wish that I were free{line_break}to travel the world, like{line_break}{actor_name:5} and his friends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06799"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} checked the{line_break}tablet. It has strange{line_break}characters written on it.{page_break}Wielder of Wind's might...{line_break}Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}We bestow upon thee{line_break}the power to see the{line_break}truth unclouded...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06800"
msgstr "Do you think I ought{line_break}to touch it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06801"
msgstr "{actor_name:7} touched the tablet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06802"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} checked the{line_break}Psynergy Stone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06803"
msgstr "Everyone's PP{line_break}was replenished!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06804"
msgstr "Beware the Wind Stones.{page_break}The stones magnify the power{line_break}of the wind. Use caution when{line_break}approaching Air's Rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06805"
msgstr "There's something inside{line_break}the cracked ice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06806"
msgstr "We followed the pirates{line_break}here from Madra...{page_break}Are you going to{line_break}Alhafra, too?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06807"
msgstr "I don't think you can{line_break}get there through{line_break}the desert...{page_break}You probably should've{line_break}crossed the bridge you{line_break}passed on the way here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06808"
msgstr "You guys are lucky. We've{line_break}gotta find some way{line_break}through this desert.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06809"
msgstr "If that accursed pirate Briggs{line_break}hadn't smashed the bridge,{line_break}we wouldn't be here!{page_break}Maybe we won't find him,{line_break}but I promise you {actor_name:8}{line_break}will pay the price for him!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06810"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Ooooh...{reset_text_style} This desert...{line_break}It's so hot out here!{line_break}I feel dizzy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06811"
msgstr "Water... My throat is{line_break}so parched! *Gasp!*{line_break}...It's no use...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06812"
msgstr "Can't we just forget{line_break}about Briggs?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06813"
msgstr "No. I'm not about to{line_break}quit looking for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06814"
msgstr "There must be some{line_break}way through this desert!{line_break}We must press onward!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06815"
msgstr "As you can see, the{line_break}elder is quite insistent{line_break}on finding a way through.{page_break}He feels the only way{line_break}to Alhafra is through{line_break}this desert...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06816"
msgstr "This is where my son{line_break}must prove himself{line_break}as mayor...{page_break}So, Son. How are you{line_break}planning to get us{line_break}through this desert{page_break}and on to Alhafra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06817"
msgstr "Father, how am I supposed{line_break}to get us through the{line_break}desert?{page_break}I think you're over-{line_break}estimating my abilities.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06818"
msgstr "Briggs and the Champa{line_break}are nowhere to be seen.{end_wait}I wonder if they actually{line_break}made it to Alhafra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06819"
msgstr "That {actor_name:8} is SO one of{line_break}the Champa... We don't need{line_break}Briggs to prove it.{page_break}When we get back home,{line_break}he's gonna pay for{line_break}helping Briggs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06820"
msgstr "Sure, it's hot. But it's{line_break}a dry heat...{pause_20_skippable}and{line_break}I can't stand it!{page_break}I want to go somewhere{line_break}cool and just relax!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06821"
msgstr "There's a spring over{line_break}there, but we can't{line_break}reach it...{page_break}I can hear Fate{line_break}mocking us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06822"
msgstr "We've reached a{line_break}dead end...{page_break}I just want to go{line_break}home to Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06823"
msgstr "My son is in quite{line_break}a fix, but I'm not{line_break}going to help him.{page_break}Only by overcoming{line_break}adversity can he ever{line_break}become a strong leader.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06824"
msgstr "My father's always telling{line_break}me to overcome adversity,{line_break}but he never tells me how!{page_break}I don't understand why{line_break}we can't just go home and{line_break}forget about Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06825"
msgstr "Hey! Look! Up there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06826"
msgstr "How did those guys{line_break}get up there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06827"
msgstr "Maybe there's a path{line_break}up ahead that we{line_break}missed...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06828"
msgstr "Maybe... Maybe we can{line_break}get through the desert{line_break}after all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06829"
msgstr "We can find a way{line_break}through to Alhafra!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06830"
msgstr "I don't care where we{line_break}go, as long as it's cool.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06831"
msgstr "Hey! I found it!{line_break}I found a way through!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06832"
msgstr "At last, we can get{line_break}through this accursed{line_break}desert!{page_break}Except that the elder{line_break}and the others need{line_break}to rest before we go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06833"
msgstr "I was certain this was a{line_break}dead end. What's wrong{line_break}with this desert?{page_break}This is only delaying{line_break}{actor_name:8}'s punishment...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06834"
msgstr "I'm just glad we're{line_break}finally able to rest.{page_break}It doesn't feel like{line_break}my brain is on fire{line_break}anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06835"
msgstr "Oh, man! This is the{line_break}best water I've ever{line_break}tasted! Yowza!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06836"
msgstr "Osenia is so much{line_break}larger than I'd thought...{page_break}I wonder how much{line_break}farther it is to Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06837"
msgstr "My son...has passed his{line_break}first test as mayor.{page_break}I'll have to congratulate{line_break}him. Eventually. Now, to{line_break}see if his luck holds up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06838"
msgstr "If we remain here much{line_break}longer, Briggs will be{line_break}beyond our reach...{page_break}We have to press on{line_break}just a little farther...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06839"
msgstr "Oh, not again!{line_break}Don't tell me they{line_break}want to rest again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06840"
msgstr "My job is to find{line_break}evidence that {actor_name:8}{line_break}is a Champa.{page_break}The elder is with us,{line_break}so I wouldn't dream{line_break}of lying...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06841"
msgstr "Maybe we should have{line_break}the mayor go on ahead{line_break}while we rest here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06842"
msgstr "I don't want to leave!{line_break}At least let me fill up{line_break}on water before we go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06843"
msgstr "How much longer will{line_break}we be walking, anyway?{page_break}I feel like we've walked{line_break}off the edge of the{line_break}world as it is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06844"
msgstr "Regardless of what{line_break}happens next, know that{line_break}you have done well, my son.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06845"
msgstr "Hooo... I can't believe{line_break}we're going to all this{line_break}trouble for a stranger...{page_break}I'm still not convinced that{line_break}{actor_name:8} isn't one of{line_break}Briggs's henchmen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06846"
msgstr "North: Alhafra{line_break}South: Air's Rock{page_break}Warning: Beyond this{line_break}point, there is no{line_break}route back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06847"
msgstr "Welcome to Alhafra. This is{line_break}the largest town in western{line_break}Osenia...{page_break}You can find anything you{line_break}need here! ...Unless you{line_break}need a boat, that is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06848"
msgstr "A massive tidal wave{line_break}hit us and destroyed{line_break}every ship in Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06849"
msgstr "I hear the tidal wave{line_break}knocked Indra into Osenia.{line_break}Is that true?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06850"
msgstr "Really? It's just so hard{line_break}to believe, you know?{page_break}Still, that would explain the{line_break}massive jolt we felt right{line_break}after the tidal wave hit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06851"
msgstr "I was hoping a traveler like{line_break}you might have a better idea{line_break}of what happened... Oh well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06852"
msgstr "I guess what those men{line_break}told me was true...{page_break}I'd figured they were just{line_break}playing a joke on me, so I{line_break}ignored them all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06853"
msgstr "Right after my boat got crushed,{line_break}a group of men came by asking{line_break}if I had one for sale.{page_break}They were pretty swarthy,{line_break}like they might have been{line_break}sailors or something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06854"
msgstr "This guy's probably wondering{line_break}about that boat sitting down{line_break}at the pier...{page_break}It still floats, but I don't{line_break}think the thing can move...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06855"
msgstr "Losing our boats was awful...{page_break}But I feel so bad for all the{line_break}people whose houses were{line_break}destroyed by the tidal wave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06856"
msgstr "I just can't believe a single tidal{line_break}wave could cause an entire{line_break}continent to move like that.{page_break}But I used to be able to see{line_break}Indra to the north of us, and{line_break}it's definitely not there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06857"
msgstr "Those guys looking for a{line_break}boat sure were in a hurry.{line_break}I wonder why...{page_break}Hey, at least I was able{line_break}to unload that boat with{line_break}the busted mast on them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06858"
msgstr "Finally! We made it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06859"
msgstr "We-We're here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06860"
msgstr "Where's the Elder?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06861"
msgstr "He's coming now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06862"
msgstr "Haaa hoo hooo...{line_break}Are we...here? I feel like{line_break}I just walked 500 miles.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06863"
msgstr "I'm fine... I feel like I{line_break}could walk 500 more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06864"
msgstr "So...is this Alhafra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06865"
msgstr "Madra's a pretty big place,{line_break}but this town is huge!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06866"
msgstr "We didn't come to Alhafra{line_break}to shop, Mister Mayor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06867"
msgstr "We're here to bring in{line_break}Briggs the Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06868"
msgstr "I know that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06869"
msgstr "Then we should go{line_break}straight to speak with{line_break}Alhafra's mayor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06870"
msgstr "We're in no shape to go{line_break}present ourselves to{line_break}the mayor right now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06871"
msgstr "Look, Briggs is obviously{line_break}not here, and besides, we{line_break}already know {actor_name:8} is°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06872"
msgstr "Silence!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06873"
msgstr "It seems Alhafra has felt{line_break}the effects of the tidal{line_break}wave as well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06874"
msgstr "It looks like they suffered{line_break}a good deal of damage...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06875"
msgstr "That would explain why{line_break}Alhafra doesn't seem to have{line_break}any boats for sale, either!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06876"
msgstr "You know, just looking around,{line_break}I get the impression they only{line_break}had one boat to begin with!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06877"
msgstr "So if you really needed a{line_break}boat, the only way to get{line_break}one would be to steal it.{page_break}Hmmm... But wouldn't that{line_break}cause quite an uproar?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06878"
msgstr "...Which means the pirates{line_break}must still be here, trying{line_break}to get a boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06879"
msgstr "So, you think we've actually{line_break}caught up with Briggs?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06880"
msgstr "No doubt about it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06881"
msgstr "That's why I want to meet{line_break}the mayor of Alhafra before{line_break}the Champa steal a ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06882"
msgstr "Oh yeah... I get it now.{line_break}In that case, let's go see{line_break}Alhafra's mayor right away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06883"
msgstr "Um... Say, excuse me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06884"
msgstr "Where would we find the{line_break}mayor of Alhafra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06885"
msgstr "Uh... The mayor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06886"
msgstr "Just keep going down{line_break}this road. It's the last{line_break}house. You can't miss it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06887"
msgstr "Those men didn't look like{line_break}they were from Osenia...{page_break}I wonder what business{line_break}they have in Alhafra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06888"
msgstr "Those people that just{line_break}came through looked{line_break}totally exhausted.{page_break}You don't suppose they passed{line_break}through the Yampi Desert to get{line_break}here, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06889"
msgstr "We've had a lot of{line_break}strangers coming{line_break}through here lately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06890"
msgstr "Our port was ruined by the{line_break}tidal wave, so kids aren't{line_break}allowed there anymore...{page_break}But all I want to do is just{line_break}see what kind of wind is{line_break}blowing in off the sea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06891"
msgstr "The only boat spared by the{line_break}tidal wave is that newfangled{line_break}ship that catches wind in a sail.{page_break}The thing is...the mast that{line_break}holds up the sail got snapped{line_break}apart!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06892"
msgstr "Let me guess... You're here{line_break}because you want to buy{line_break}a canoe, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06893"
msgstr "Sorry, but I'm totally backlogged{line_break}with preorders. I'm gonna be up{line_break}late finishing these as it is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06894"
msgstr "That's good, because{line_break}I've got a ton of work{line_break}to do already...{page_break}And then I have to head{line_break}down to the wharf and{line_break}help clean up the wreck...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06895"
msgstr "That boat at the wharf uses{line_break}a sail, so it's more efficient{line_break}than any galley.{page_break}But since the mast is broken,{line_break}it's not going anywhere.{line_break}What a waste.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06896"
msgstr "Why would the mayor go and{line_break}sell our boat to a bunch of{line_break}foreigners?{page_break}I know it's got a broken{line_break}mast, but come on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06897"
msgstr "...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06898"
msgstr "If this guy's looking to buy{line_break}a boat, he's looking in the{line_break}wrong town...{page_break}I already sold the last boat in{line_break}town, and it had a broken mast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06899"
msgstr "Who would come to Alhafra{line_break}across the Yampi Desert? It's{line_break}way too dangerous!{page_break}Anyone with half a brain{line_break}would've just taken the{line_break}bridge to the northwest...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06900"
msgstr "This tidal wave's actually been{line_break}good for Alhafra. The town is{line_break}bustling with activity...{page_break}I think I'll steer clear of those{line_break}swarthy men at the wharf,{line_break}though... They're a scary lot!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06901"
msgstr "I don't know why they won't{line_break}let us kids go down to see{line_break}the dock...{page_break}I wanna see what kind of{line_break}damage the tidal wave did!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06902"
msgstr "I wonder if my partner has{line_break}finished up that canoe yet...{page_break}The sooner he finishes, the{line_break}sooner we can clean things{line_break}up down at the jetty.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06903"
msgstr "We can't raise the mast{line_break}until we get rid of the debris.{page_break}But I can't help get rid of{line_break}the debris until I finish at{line_break}least this one last canoe!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06904"
msgstr "I still can't believe those{line_break}guys wanted to buy my{line_break}busted boat! One man's junk...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06905"
msgstr "It may be newfangled, but{line_break}it's no good if it's broken.{page_break}Forget technology! I'm{line_break}sticking with boats with{line_break}oars! No masts for me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06906"
msgstr "Ooo... This ain't good!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06907"
msgstr "That guy looked like the{line_break}mayor of Madra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06908"
msgstr "He must have come here{line_break}looking for Briggs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06909"
msgstr "I'd better go tell the others!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06910"
msgstr "What's your problem?{line_break}What are you, some{line_break}kind of freak?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06911"
msgstr "Well? What!? You got{line_break}a problem with me?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06912"
msgstr "Ah, who cares what you{line_break}think? I've got stuff to do,{line_break}so scram, kid!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06913"
msgstr "So where do you get off{line_break}invading my personal space,{line_break}huh? Scram, stinkbreath!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06914"
msgstr "Where was I? Oh yeah,{line_break}I was going to tell them{line_break}about the mayor of Madra!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06915"
msgstr "I don't care if it WAS broken!{line_break}The mayor shouldn't have up{line_break}and sold the town's only boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06916"
msgstr "Those guys who bought the{line_break}boat looked kinda shabby...{page_break}But I hear they paid the{line_break}mayor a whole wad of cash{line_break}for it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06917"
msgstr "I wonder if the mayor{line_break}will use that money to{line_break}repair our poor town...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06918"
msgstr "Why would anyone pay so{line_break}much for a broken old boat?{page_break}I know I shouldn't be so{line_break}suspicious, but there's{line_break}something odd about them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06919"
msgstr "We're taking care of some{line_break}people whose house was{line_break}destroyed by the tidal wave.{page_break}But...they're just so demanding!{line_break}My wife feels so overwhelmed{line_break}that she can't take it anymore!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06920"
msgstr "Augh! With all these demanding{line_break}houseguests, I feel like I've{line_break}lost control of my own house!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06921"
msgstr "Aren't you thirsty,{line_break}my dear?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06922"
msgstr "Oh, you're right, dear.{line_break}I am!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06923"
msgstr "Sorry to bother you, but{line_break}we'd like some tea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06924"
msgstr "Are you talking to me?!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06925"
msgstr "If you want tea, you can go{line_break}right ahead and fix it yourself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06926"
msgstr "Well! I say! It seems the lady{line_break}of the house is no lady at all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06927"
msgstr "When we lost our house in the{line_break}tidal wave, the master of this{line_break}house offered his home to us.{page_break}But living with another family{line_break}isn't easy. Hahhh... They're{line_break}absolutely exhausting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06928"
msgstr "I just wish that old man{line_break}would stop pestering my{line_break}wife all the time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06929"
msgstr "I don't mind helping people{line_break}in need, but I won't be taken{line_break}advantage of...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06930"
msgstr "All I ask is for a little tea,{line_break}and that's the behavior I get!?{page_break}I just want to get out of this{line_break}inhospitable house and back{line_break}into my own sweet home...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06931"
msgstr "Is this how a young bride{line_break}treats her husband these{line_break}days?{page_break}Back in my day, we were{line_break}never like that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06932"
msgstr "We were hit by a wave so{line_break}strong that it swept homes{line_break}off their foundations!{page_break}What's worse is, all my best{line_break}weapons were washed out{line_break}to sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06933"
msgstr "Losing all my most expensive{line_break}items may well ruin my business{line_break}entirely...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06934"
msgstr "That tidal wave may well wash{line_break}out both my business and the{line_break}weapon shopkeeper's!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06935"
msgstr "It doesn't matter how well-{line_break}crafted a suit of armor is... If{line_break}you soak it in seawater, it's junk.{page_break}All my furs are ruined... All my{line_break}steel is rusted. It's nothing but{line_break}garbage now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06936"
msgstr "Don't mention the tidal wave{line_break}to the other merchants...{page_break}It did a lot of damage, and{line_break}we'd really just rather not{line_break}talk about it, you know?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06937"
msgstr "If all my goods were damaged{line_break}by seawater, they'd be useless.{line_break}I'd have to throw them all away...{page_break}I'm lucky the wave{line_break}missed my shop.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06938"
msgstr "Maybe you've noticed, but a lot{line_break}of folk here lost their homes in{line_break}the wave, but don't mind them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06939"
msgstr "You see how full our inn is?{line_break}You'd think we'd be making{line_break}money hand over fist...{page_break}But that's not true... We just{line_break}don't have the heart to charge{line_break}the people who lost their homes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06940"
msgstr "The town ought to give money{line_break}to all the people who suffered{line_break}from the tidal wave...{page_break}That way, maybe the innkeeper{line_break}could afford to make us{line_break}better food...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06941"
msgstr "I can't believe the innkeeper{line_break}is renting out more rooms{line_break}when we're as busy as this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06942"
msgstr "The innkeeper told me to use{line_break}only the cheapest ingredients{line_break}to help save money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06943"
msgstr "The innkeeper serves his{line_break}paying guests better meals{line_break}than we Alhafrans get.{page_break}That's so cheap! I want{line_break}gourmet meals, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06944"
msgstr "We're all guests in the same{line_break}inn, so why is my meal{line_break}so awful?{page_break}At the very least, they should{line_break}let us go back for seconds{line_break}of that stinking slop!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06945"
msgstr "Ohhh... I'm hungry...{line_break}My tummy hurts...{line_break}When's dinnertime?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06946"
msgstr "I don't think I've had a bite{line_break}of meat or fish ever since{line_break}setting foot in this inn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06947"
msgstr "I'll never forgive the mayor{line_break}for failing to come to our aid{line_break}when we were all suffering...{page_break}I wonder what I can do to{line_break}make him suffer...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06948"
msgstr "Our guests are very upset{line_break}with the mayor. I just hope{line_break}they don't do anything...rash...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06949"
msgstr "My pop's been lookin' around,{line_break}an' he says the mayor keeps{line_break}all his treasure underground.{page_break}He says it's south of the{line_break}palace, but that's all{line_break}I know about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06950"
msgstr "Why do we all have{line_break}to be cooped up in{line_break}such a small room?{page_break}How am I supposed to sleep{line_break}with Grandpa grinding his{line_break}teeth all night?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06951"
msgstr "We all have to bear the{line_break}discomfort of this place until{line_break}our homes are repaired.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06952"
msgstr "I heard there's only one person{line_break}staying in the room next door.{page_break}Can't they just move one more{line_break}person into that room? Like me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06953"
msgstr "So, you've finally come.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06954"
msgstr "I had suspected we might run{line_break}into each other again, since{line_break}we both are looking for boats.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06955"
msgstr "Unfortunately, the only boat{line_break}this town possesses has{line_break}already been sold.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06956"
msgstr "I will be resting here in Alhafra{line_break}a bit longer. I have traveled long{line_break}and hard, and I am weary.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06957"
msgstr "Perhaps we can get along{line_break}at least until we both depart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06958"
msgstr "The broken mast on the{line_break}ship they sold won't be{line_break}easily fixed.{page_break}That is, as long as we Adepts{line_break}don't do anything about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06959"
msgstr "I never imagined anyone from{line_break}Alhafra would ever stay at{line_break}my inn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06960"
msgstr "Perhaps the mayor will cover{line_break}the cost of lodging everyone so{line_break}we can feed them a decent meal.{page_break}We're just trying to be helpful,{line_break}but we're the ones who end up{line_break}looking cheap.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06961"
msgstr "I bet the master of the inn{line_break}could afford to give us better{line_break}food than he's been giving us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06962"
msgstr "I can't believe the innkeeper{line_break}is cramming all those poor{line_break}people into that tiny room.{page_break}He certainly can't badmouth{line_break}the mayor...they're both stingy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06963"
msgstr "I can't believe I'm only{line_break}supposed to feed the{line_break}villagers vegetable dishes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06964"
msgstr "Maybe it's 'cause all we've{line_break}been eating is vegetables, but{line_break}I just never seem to fill up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06965"
msgstr "I think I've lost weight from{line_break}all these vegetables!{page_break}Sure, I'm looking skinnier than{line_break}ever, but something tells me{line_break}this just isn't healthy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06966"
msgstr "Maybe I'm just hungry, but{line_break}everything they put in front{line_break}of me looks delicious.{page_break}I'm so hungry I could eat{line_break}my own hand...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06967"
msgstr "*Sniff sniff*{line_break}That smell! That's the smell{line_break}of fish... No! Now I'm drooling!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06968"
msgstr "I hope the mayor's treasure{line_break}room doesn't run too close{line_break}to the prison...{page_break}If those thieves found out{line_break}about it, they'd dig their way{line_break}out in no time flat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06969"
msgstr "I know our mayor's bad, but{line_break}he wouldn't stoop to stealing{line_break}from his own people, would he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06970"
msgstr "Everyone says the hill beneath{line_break}the mayor's mansion is full of{line_break}tunnels. I wonder if that's true.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06971"
msgstr "I think they put me next to{line_break}Grandpa so they wouldn't have{line_break}to listen to him grind his teeth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06972"
msgstr "When you're living packed in{line_break}together like this, you're bound{line_break}to get on each other's nerves.{page_break}I just hope everything goes{line_break}back to normal once we move{line_break}back into our own homes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06973"
msgstr "That warrior next door{line_break}is so suave and handsome,{line_break}just how I like 'em.{page_break}I hope we can be friends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06974"
msgstr "Really, I do wish you would{line_break}quit using your Mind Read{line_break}on me...{page_break}Trust me, my thoughts will{line_break}become all too clear in{line_break}due time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06975"
msgstr "!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06976"
msgstr "In the middle of Osenia, there's{line_break}a terrible village where they{line_break}worship a foul and vengeful god.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06977"
msgstr "The people of Garoh brought{line_break}the curse upon themselves for{line_break}worshipping their wicked god...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06978"
msgstr "Everything's so boring here...{line_break}Why doesn't anybody do{line_break}anything...criminal?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06979"
msgstr "I don't know why there are so{line_break}many outsiders in Alhafra now,{line_break}but it's bound to mean trouble.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06980"
msgstr "Did you want to see the mayor?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06981"
msgstr "Sorry, but he's meeting with{line_break}some visitors from Madra{line_break}right now...{page_break}Maybe you can see him once{line_break}he's finished with them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06982"
msgstr "The mayor is very open to{line_break}meeting visitors, but he's in{line_break}an important meeting now...{page_break}So it's probably good that{line_break}you're not here to see him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06983"
msgstr "Listen, you look like an OK{line_break}guy, and I'd love to let you{line_break}through, but I just can't...{page_break}I mean, if I let you in, then I'd{line_break}have to let everyone in, right?{line_break}I'm sorry, but it wouldn't be fair.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06984"
msgstr "I hate my job. I always{line_break}have to be so tough and{line_break}secretive around people.{page_break}Deep down inside, all I{line_break}really want to do is read{line_break}them some of my poetry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06985"
msgstr "My partner's always in such{line_break}a bad mood... Maybe I should{line_break}bake him a cake...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06986"
msgstr "No one is allowed beyond this point.{line_break}Don't even think about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06987"
msgstr "The mayor said no one goes{line_break}through, and I mean to make{line_break}sure no one goes through!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06988"
msgstr "It's... It's no use!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06989"
msgstr "The mast just won't budge,{line_break}no matter how many people{line_break}we get to help us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06990"
msgstr "We're going to have to get{line_break}all this junk off the mast{line_break}first.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06991"
msgstr "If we could just get some{line_break}decent footing, we could have{line_break}this thing clear in no time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06992"
msgstr "There's more to it than{line_break}that, though...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06993"
msgstr "We still have to do something{line_break}about that rope over there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06994"
msgstr "Untangling that'll be a piece{line_break}of cake, once we get a boat{line_break}we can use...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06995"
msgstr "Oh, yeah... A piece of cake...{line_break}Except for that huge{line_break}rock over there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06996"
msgstr "Oh yeah... The rock...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06997"
msgstr "How are we supposed to{line_break}get the mast out from{line_break}under that thing? It's huge!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06998"
msgstr "There's no way we're gonna{line_break}move it by ourselves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06999"
msgstr "Well, either way, we can't{line_break}do anything until Zack{line_break}finishes the canoe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07000"
msgstr "What's your problem?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07001"
msgstr "You're new in town,{line_break}aren't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07002"
msgstr "Well, I've never seen you{line_break}before, but whatever...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07003"
msgstr "You're probably curious{line_break}about this here ship, huh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07004"
msgstr "Masted ships like this were{line_break}originally built by the Champa...{line_break}Oh, forget it. It's lost on you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07005"
msgstr "They call this a \"sailing\"{line_break}ship... Wind is the only{line_break}thing that'll make it move...{page_break}Isn't that incredible?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07006"
msgstr "You kids today, with your{line_break}\"been there, done that\"{line_break}attitudes... It's a shame...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07007"
msgstr "Yeah, well, think how surprised{line_break}we were to find that Alhafra{line_break}had learned to build sailing ships!{page_break}I suppose the age when anyone{line_break}could sail the seas was{line_break}bound to come someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07008"
msgstr "We paid big money for this{line_break}ship. It's ours now, so don't{line_break}you go cryin' about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07009"
msgstr "We sent my pal into town{line_break}to get some supplies, but{line_break}he came back looking pale...{page_break}He went straight down{line_break}to talk to Briggs, and{line_break}I haven't seen him since...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07010"
msgstr "If we could just raise the{line_break}mast, we could head back{line_break}to Champa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07011"
msgstr "People call us Champa a{line_break}seafaring people because{line_break}we make sailboats...{page_break}And sure, maybe we{line_break}do a little pillaging on{line_break}the side...{page_break}But now that Alhafra can{line_break}build sailboats, Briggs's{line_break}pirating days may be ending.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07012"
msgstr "I thought it would be easy{line_break}to right the mast, but I think{line_break}I must have been crazy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07013"
msgstr "That lousy rat... If something{line_break}happened back there, he{line_break}should have told all of us!{page_break}Now I can't stop worrying...{line_break}What's taking him so long!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07014"
msgstr "When I think about how long it{line_break}will be until we go home,{line_break}I miss Champa all the more.{page_break}I'm just glad nobody in{line_break}Champa knows we're pirates.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07015"
msgstr "The mayor of Madra? Here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07016"
msgstr "You're certain?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07017"
msgstr "How did he know we{line_break}came to Alhafra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07018"
msgstr "He knew we needed a ship,{line_break}and he knew we went east.{line_break}It seems pretty easy to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07019"
msgstr "Arr... Well, yeah... When you put{line_break}it that way, it does make sense...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07020"
msgstr "He was looking to find{line_break}the mayor of Alhafra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07021"
msgstr "He must be hoping the mayor{line_break}will tell him where we are...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07022"
msgstr "He'll probably tell the Alhafrans{line_break}we're pirates, too, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07023"
msgstr "Pirates!? That seems a{line_break}little unfair!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07024"
msgstr "What do you mean? We{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.are{line_break}pirates, aren't we?{page_break}I mean, we've taken all sorts{line_break}of stuff that didn't belong to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07025"
msgstr "That's only because everyone in{line_break}Champa would starve otherwise!{line_break}We don't have any choice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07026"
msgstr "Ah...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07027"
msgstr "And even then, it's never a lot.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07028"
msgstr "Wha-What's not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07029"
msgstr "The stuff we take. We never{line_break}take too much from any one{line_break}town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07030"
msgstr "Yeah, I guess not...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07031"
msgstr "And why do you think that is?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07032"
msgstr "Er... Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07033"
msgstr "Because you never can tell{line_break}how these wealthy towns will{line_break}react. It's too risky, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07034"
msgstr "Hey, yeah! Which is why we{line_break}didn't steal anything from{line_break}Alhafra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07035"
msgstr "Right! That's why we avoid the{line_break}risky towns and just take what{line_break}we need from the others!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07036"
msgstr "See? That's why you're our{line_break}captain, Briggs! You've got{line_break}brains coming out your ears!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07037"
msgstr "Hmph! There's nothing{line_break}brainy about that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07038"
msgstr "Did you hear that? It sounded{line_break}like a girl! Who's out there!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07039"
msgstr "What do you think you're doing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07040"
msgstr "Don't you know that someone{line_break}has been falsely imprisoned{line_break}for your crimes?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07041"
msgstr "Er... What's your point?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07042"
msgstr "You have to come with{line_break}us and attest to that{line_break}man's innocence!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07043"
msgstr "And...why would I want to{line_break}do something like that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07044"
msgstr "Oh-ho! I was hoping we could{line_break}avoid any ugliness, but you{line_break}leave us no choice!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07045"
msgstr "We'll bring you in against your{line_break}will if we must, but either way,{line_break}you're coming with us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07046"
msgstr "Isn't that right, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07047"
msgstr "Good for you! Let's teach{line_break}these guys a lesson!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07048"
msgstr "After what they've done?{line_break}Come on, we need to{line_break}make them fess up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07049"
msgstr "You don't stand a chance! We're{line_break}hardened criminal types! We eat{line_break}punks like you for breakfast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07050"
msgstr "Watch yourselves, you self-{line_break}righteous little brats! You're{line_break}the ones with a lesson to learn!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07051"
msgstr "Well, that takes care of that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07052"
msgstr "And I'm willing to bet everyone{line_break}Briggs has been harassing{line_break}will be quite happy to hear it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07053"
msgstr "This should set everyone in{line_break}Indra at ease... They all seemed{line_break}to fear the pirate Briggs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07054"
msgstr "We lost...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07055"
msgstr "Even pirates have honor...{line_break}I'll go quietly. I won't make a{line_break}scene just because I lost...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07056"
msgstr "Go on... Hand us over to{line_break}Madra or Alhafra or whoever...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07057"
msgstr "Good... First off, you can tell{line_break}the Madrans that the man called{line_break}{actor_name:8} is innocent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07058"
msgstr "Fine. So, what, I just have to{line_break}say that {actor_name:8} isn't{line_break}one of my men?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07059"
msgstr "That's right. You tell the{line_break}Madrans that, and they can{line_break}release their prisoner.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07060"
msgstr "Saying {actor_name:8} is{line_break}innocent won't clear you{line_break}of your own crimes...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07061"
msgstr "We've secured Briggs's{line_break}vow... We should take him{line_break}to the Madrans...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07062"
msgstr "Wait!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07063"
msgstr "Can't you find it in your{line_break}hearts to forgive Briggs{line_break}and his men?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07064"
msgstr "And who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07065"
msgstr "My name is Chaucha.{line_break}I am Briggs's wife.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07066"
msgstr "So you're a pirate, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07067"
msgstr "No! Chaucha hasn't done{line_break}a thing! Let her be!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07068"
msgstr "I know Briggs and his men{line_break}have caused some great{line_break}trouble with their piracy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07069"
msgstr "And I know their crimes{line_break}cannot be ignored...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07070"
msgstr "If you know all that, then{line_break}how can you ask us just{line_break}to forgive him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07071"
msgstr "The only reason Briggs{line_break}became a pirate was to help{line_break}the people of Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07072"
msgstr "We Champa are a seafaring folk.{line_break}Our livelihood depends entirely{line_break}upon the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07073"
msgstr "But in recent years, the sea{line_break}has changed... We can't live{line_break}the life we once could.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07074"
msgstr "The oceans have warmed, and{line_break}the fish have vanished from{line_break}our waters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07075"
msgstr "The soil in Champa is rocky{line_break}and barren. No crops can{line_break}grow there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07076"
msgstr "No crops? So you have no{line_break}grains? And no meat? It sounds{line_break}like life in Champa is hard...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07077"
msgstr "It's not hard! It's unbearable!{line_break}Our children can't eat! Our{line_break}village is dying!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07078"
msgstr "These men promised to return{line_break}with food enough for all our{line_break}people, but they found none...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07079"
msgstr "So you became pirates...thieves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07080"
msgstr "We don't know where{line_break}Champa is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07081"
msgstr "It sits on the southeast{line_break}corner of Angara...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07082"
msgstr "Southeast Angara? Isn't that{line_break}near Xian and Lama Temple?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07083"
msgstr "You have a good memory! If{line_break}you were to head south through{line_break}the mountains, you'd find it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07084"
msgstr "That's so far away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07085"
msgstr "Well, yeah! You think we{line_break}could be successful pirates{line_break}so close to home?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07086"
msgstr "If they raided any towns near{line_break}Champa, it would be obvious{line_break}to all who the attackers were...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07087"
msgstr "And no one back home could{line_break}forgive me if they knew.{line_break}Not even my grandmother...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07088"
msgstr "But where does that leave us?{line_break}Are we simply to accept your{line_break}looting here on Indra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07089"
msgstr "I'm shocked, I tell you. Shocked!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07090"
msgstr "What's so shocking?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07091"
msgstr "It looks like they really{line_break}are pirates, just like you{line_break}said...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07092"
msgstr "Mister Mayor, I am appalled{line_break}that you could not take{line_break}our word for it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07093"
msgstr "He probably wouldn't even{line_break}have believed we were from{line_break}Madra if the mayor hadn't come!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07094"
msgstr "Am I supposed to believe{line_break}the accusations of a{line_break}complete stranger?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07095"
msgstr "Is this your position, Mayor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07096"
msgstr "How can I be expected to{line_break}believe a tidal wave could{line_break}wash Indra into Osenia?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07097"
msgstr "Or that a group of men{line_break}could walk°on foot!°from{line_break}Madra all the way to Alhafra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07098"
msgstr "It sounds to me like you had{line_break}forgotten about us altogether!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07099"
msgstr "I'm not sure you remember{line_break}the last time we met. Do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07100"
msgstr "We met when I was just a child...{line_break}It must have been more than{line_break}ten years ago now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07101"
msgstr "Twenty years! It's been twenty{line_break}years since I last saw you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07102"
msgstr "Has it really been so long?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07103"
msgstr "It's been a long time indeed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07104"
msgstr "I guess we can't blame you{line_break}for forgetting his face.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07105"
msgstr "Don't be silly! I didn't forget{line_break}his face! His face merely...{line_break}changed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07106"
msgstr "Ahem! Forgive my interrupting{line_break}your interruption, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07107"
msgstr "Would I be correct in assuming{line_break}that I am speaking to the leaders{line_break}of Madra and Alhafra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07108"
msgstr "You are correct!{line_break}I am the mayor of Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07109"
msgstr "And I..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07110"
msgstr "I am..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07111"
msgstr "I am the mayor of Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07112"
msgstr "I am Madra's town elder.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07113"
msgstr "And I am a close personal{line_break}friend of Shin, whose lover{line_break}was injured by the Champa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07114"
msgstr "I am the scholar Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07115"
msgstr "He is {actor_name:5}, the{line_break}leader of our group.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07116"
msgstr "I am {actor_name:6}, {actor_name:5}'s{line_break}sister.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07117"
msgstr "I am called {actor_name:7}.{line_break}I come from the town{line_break}of Lalivero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07118"
msgstr "Now, what errand has{line_break}brought you all here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07119"
msgstr "We came for Briggs..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07120"
msgstr "The mayor of Madra claims°"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07121"
msgstr "We followed Briggs here{line_break}from Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07122"
msgstr "Of course, we have good{line_break}reason to suspect them{line_break}of being pirates.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07123"
msgstr "Ahem! And I was honestly{line_break}taken aback to hear a{line_break}businessman being slandered!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07124"
msgstr "If they truly are pirates, then{line_break}why would they go to the trouble{line_break}of buying a ship from us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07125"
msgstr "Because the very funds they{line_break}used to purchase the ship{line_break}were pillaged from our homes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07126"
msgstr "If the ship was bought with{line_break}Madran gold, then it belongs{line_break}to the Madrans!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07127"
msgstr "What do you say? If you give{line_break}them the ship, will that fix{line_break}everything?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07128"
msgstr "Then where will you go?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07129"
msgstr "I won't run, and I won't hide.{line_break}...Actually, I don't feel up for{line_break}much of anything right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07130"
msgstr "Then you probably won't mind{line_break}being locked up, will you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07131"
msgstr "Briggs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07132"
msgstr "Don't worry, Chaucha!{line_break}I'll be back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07133"
msgstr "Take care of Eoleo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07134"
msgstr "Your strange powers surprised{line_break}me, but even without them, you{line_break}would have overwhelmed us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07135"
msgstr "We'll be taking that boat, then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07136"
msgstr "You're taking our ship!? You're{line_break}worse than we ever were!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07137"
msgstr "Aren't you at least going{line_break}to pay us for the boat!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07138"
msgstr "Quiet! All of you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07139"
msgstr "Do as you must, but I{line_break}have one request...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07140"
msgstr "You have to let Chaucha and{line_break}Eoleo stay in the boat{line_break}until it's repaired.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07141"
msgstr "You haven't done Alhafra any{line_break}harm, Briggs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07142"
msgstr "At least keep him locked up{line_break}until the boat is repaired...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07143"
msgstr "And our prisoner, {actor_name:8}...{line_break}Is he one of your men?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07144"
msgstr "I don't know any {actor_name:8}!{line_break}Sounds to me like you've{line_break}made a pretty big mistake!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07145"
msgstr "See! It's just as I said!{line_break}{actor_name:8} is innocent!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07146"
msgstr "You must return to Madra{line_break}and free him immediately!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07147"
msgstr "...Me? What, alone?!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07148"
msgstr "Only two of us will remain{line_break}here. You can return to{line_break}Madra with the others.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07149"
msgstr "Understood! We'll return{line_break}immediately!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07150"
msgstr "Can you come with us?{line_break}...Please?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07151"
msgstr "It looks like that wraps{line_break}this whole mess up...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07152"
msgstr "Let us return to my mansion{line_break}for a nice cup of tea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07153"
msgstr "You say your name{line_break}is Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07154"
msgstr "Thank you very much for{line_break}the help with Briggs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07155"
msgstr "If you have the time, please{line_break}come see me at my mansion{line_break}before you go...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07156"
msgstr "It's nothing special, but I{line_break}would like to thank you for{line_break}everything you've done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07157"
msgstr "Why do I get the feeling the{line_break}mayor of Alhafra prefers to{line_break}deal with my father over me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07158"
msgstr "Thank all of you{line_break}very much.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07159"
msgstr "Due to your efforts,{line_break}{actor_name:8} is going{line_break}to be released.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07160"
msgstr "And now, this fine ship{line_break}belongs to Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07161"
msgstr "None of this would have{line_break}come to pass were it not{line_break}for you. Thank you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07162"
msgstr "Unfortunately, I don't have any{line_break}reward I can offer you here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07163"
msgstr "Oh, pish posh! We don't need{line_break}any reward, do we,{line_break}{actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07164"
msgstr "Ha! Your honesty is{line_break}refreshing, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07165"
msgstr "That's as may be, but I still{line_break}feel quite indebted to you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07166"
msgstr "So, what shall we do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07167"
msgstr "I know... Come to Madra{line_break}after our boat has been{line_break}fixed and we've sailed home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07168"
msgstr "We are still recovering from{line_break}the effects of the tidal wave,{line_break}so it won't be much...{page_break}But we do want to give{line_break}you some kind of reward.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07169"
msgstr "Well, shall we be going?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07170"
msgstr "I see, so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07171"
msgstr "Oh! N-Nothing. Never mind...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07172"
msgstr "I do get to stay on the{line_break}boat, right? At least until{line_break}it's repaired?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07173"
msgstr "Yes. That's where I'll be if{line_break}you need me. ...With Eoleo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07174"
msgstr "I feel kind of bad for Chaucha.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07175"
msgstr "What can we do about it?{line_break}After all, she's the one{line_break}married to a pirate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07176"
msgstr "So, what should we do now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07177"
msgstr "I suggest that we try to{line_break}find {actor_name:8}. He could{line_break}prove enlightening!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07178"
msgstr "That's true... He seems to{line_break}be a Water Adept.{page_break}He might be able to tell us{line_break}a little about these lands...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07179"
msgstr "Do you think we should{line_break}help them fix the boat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07180"
msgstr "Say, if we help with the boat,{line_break}maybe they'll give us a ride{line_break}back to Madra! Good idea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07181"
msgstr "What do you say, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07182"
msgstr "All right! Let's go see{line_break}what we can do to get{line_break}this thing sailing again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07183"
msgstr "You're opposed to it? Well,{line_break}since you seem to have your{line_break}own ideas, let's get going!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07184"
msgstr "Goo goo ga ga!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07185"
msgstr "Eoleo's only just recently{line_break}started doing that... After that{line_break}gem fell from the sky and hit him.{page_break}He was overcome by a{line_break}terrible fever, and when he{line_break}recovered, he had this power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07186"
msgstr "Eoleo and I are going to{line_break}visit Briggs every day.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07187"
msgstr "I'm gonna use my magic{line_break}to free Papa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07188"
msgstr "If Eoleo gets the hang{line_break}of it, then maybe Briggs can...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07189"
msgstr "We're all going to work together{line_break}to rebuild the homes that were{line_break}destroyed by the tidal wave.{page_break}It may have hurt us, but if{line_break}we put our backs into it, we{line_break}can overcome this hardship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07190"
msgstr "Once things are back to{line_break}normal, we're all going to{line_break}build another sailboat.{page_break}If we all work together,{line_break}we'll have it done in no time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07191"
msgstr "So, the guys who bought the{line_break}boat are the pirates who{line_break}were terrorizing Madra?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07192"
msgstr "Everyone is talking about{line_break}how you captured the pirates{line_break}in the prison.{page_break}Wow! Taking care of that{line_break}salty bunch is something else!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07193"
msgstr "The mayor is the only one from{line_break}Madra who stayed in town.{page_break}They said something about{line_break}freeing an innocent man...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07194"
msgstr "The mayor of Madra apparently{line_break}seized the boat from the pirates{line_break}and plans to sail it back home.{page_break}I think he's got quite a{line_break}wait in store before that{line_break}mast gets fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07195"
msgstr "I never thought a fine house{line_break}could be crushed in the blink{line_break}of an eye by plain old water.{page_break}I guess that's what makes tidal{line_break}waves true natural disasters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07196"
msgstr "I can help build houses,{line_break}too. ...At least for a little{line_break}while, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07197"
msgstr "We've put off fixing the boat{line_break}for now so we can work{line_break}on repairing the town first.{page_break}Which is exactly the{line_break}opposite of what the mayor{line_break}of Alhafra said would happen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07198"
msgstr "Once repairs are done here,{line_break}we have to fix the bridge in{line_break}the northwest of Osenia.{page_break}I guess Briggs destroyed it.{line_break}If you're going that way, I'd{line_break}wait until the bridge is fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07199"
msgstr "They told me they'd help{line_break}get that mast fixed up.{page_break}Would someone please explain{line_break}to me why suddenly they all{line_break}decided to fix houses instead?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07200"
msgstr "What does a sailor like{line_break}me know about building{line_break}houses, anyway?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07201"
msgstr "Hey! You there! Sailor boy!{line_break}Get back to work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07202"
msgstr "Hey! Give me a break!{line_break}I'm on it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07203"
msgstr "It's so nice of everyone{line_break}to chip in and help rebuild{line_break}Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07204"
msgstr "Everyone in town is so much{line_break}happier now that we've started{line_break}rebuilding the town...{page_break}I hope things stay this nice{line_break}once all the work is done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07205"
msgstr "You know, pirates who pay{line_break}for stuff instead of stealing{line_break}must be pretty weird pirates.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07206"
msgstr "Those pirates have{line_break}the coolest outfits!{page_break}Someday, I wanna be a{line_break}pirate, so I can dress{line_break}up all fancy like that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07207"
msgstr "I can't believe they left{line_break}their mayor behind! Those{line_break}Madrans are so coldhearted.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07208"
msgstr "If our mayor thinks I'm going{line_break}to work on a boat for him,{line_break}he's got another think coming.{page_break}Madra's mayor can wait{line_break}here forever for all I care.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07209"
msgstr "You know, sitting here fixing{line_break}houses really makes you think{line_break}about how unsafe the sea is.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07210"
msgstr "Helping people out feels{line_break}really good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07211"
msgstr "The fact that Madra took{line_break}our boat from us can't be{line_break}sitting well with the mayor.{page_break}That's probably why he{line_break}put off fixing their mast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07212"
msgstr "I wonder if the crew from{line_break}Madra went back through{line_break}Yampi Desert...{page_break}If they weren't in such a{line_break}rush, they could just wait{line_break}for the bridge to be fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07213"
msgstr "It's strange... The quarters{line_break}down in the belly of that{line_break}ship feel pretty cramped...{page_break}It seems like there should{line_break}be a lot more space down{line_break}there somewhere...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07214"
msgstr "Working on deck with the{line_break}cool ocean breeze on your{line_break}face feels great.{page_break}Working on land doesn't.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07215"
msgstr "I'm amazed those guys who{line_break}bought the ship were pirates...{page_break}But then again, they didn't{line_break}much look like your average,{line_break}run-of-the-mill merchants...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07216"
msgstr "I thought it was weird that{line_break}someone would pay that{line_break}much for a broken ship...{page_break}They probably had some{line_break}secret plan to steal from us...{line_break}That's why they were so quiet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07217"
msgstr "Pirates? Here in Alhafra?{line_break}That's a scary thought. I'm{line_break}so glad they were caught!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07218"
msgstr "Those guys were just trying{line_break}to win our trust so they could{line_break}take advantage of us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07219"
msgstr "We've all started working{line_break}together to repair the houses!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07220"
msgstr "Oooh... Not much longer, and{line_break}then I can kick these folks{line_break}out of my house!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07221"
msgstr "Once my old neighbors' house{line_break}is repaired, my life can finally{line_break}get back to normal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07222"
msgstr "Once everyone started working{line_break}to rebuild the town, our hostess{line_break}started being much nicer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07223"
msgstr "I wonder what happened{line_break}that's making the lady of the{line_break}house smile so much...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07224"
msgstr "Ahh... It's so relieving to see{line_break}my wife smiling again.{page_break}I don't think there will be{line_break}any more arguments with{line_break}our elderly guests...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07225"
msgstr "It won't be long until our{line_break}guests go back home...{page_break}It's a lot of work to help{line_break}a friend in need, but it does{line_break}feel good to be nice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07226"
msgstr "The lady of this house is so{line_break}temperamental. She gets angry{line_break}at the smallest things...{page_break}It was just a little tomato{line_break}juice. How was I to know{line_break}that was her wedding gown?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07227"
msgstr "The lady of the house is{line_break}so adorable when she's{line_break}in a good mood.{page_break}It would be nice if she{line_break}were always in a good mood...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07228"
msgstr "Once they fix the old folks'{line_break}home, it'll be our turn to get{line_break}some repairs done.{page_break}We're all doing our part{line_break}to get things fixed, even if{line_break}it's just a little cleaning up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07229"
msgstr "I was afraid my house{line_break}would never get repaired,{line_break}but everything's fine now.{page_break}With everyone working{line_break}together, maybe our new{line_break}houses will be a little sturdier.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07230"
msgstr "I'm so hungry I can't{line_break}even move...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07231"
msgstr "If we don't get out of{line_break}this inn soon, I'll die of{line_break}starvation!{page_break}The sooner Dad gets the{line_break}house fixed, the sooner I{line_break}get a good meal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07232"
msgstr "You know, since we're rebuilding{line_break}the house, maybe I'll ask for{line_break}my own room!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07233"
msgstr "I wish someone would{line_break}just bring me some food...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07234"
msgstr "Thanks, mister.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07235"
msgstr "The kid ate the bread.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07236"
msgstr "Oh, wow, I feel so much better!{line_break}Look at how much energy{line_break}I've got now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07237"
msgstr "Geez, mister, I don't know{line_break}how I can repay you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07238"
msgstr "Wait, I've got it! Do you{line_break}like...adventures?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07239"
msgstr "Then you totally have to go{line_break}check out the caves under{line_break}the mayor's mansion!{page_break}Go find my dad... He's up{line_break}along the path near there.{line_break}The entrance is just past him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07240"
msgstr "Really? Wow... You're so boring.{line_break}Well, if you change your{line_break}mind, just let me know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07241"
msgstr "I'm feeling a lot better now{line_break}thanks to you, mister.{page_break}If you get any more food,{line_break}could you bring it to me, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07242"
msgstr "I wonder if I should have{line_break}shared some with my sister.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07243"
msgstr "All my neighbors are going{line_break}to work together to help{line_break}rebuild my house.{page_break}A friend in need really{line_break}is a friend indeed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07244"
msgstr "Why, look at this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07245"
msgstr "Wow, honey! You found{line_break}some gold coins!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07246"
msgstr "Way to go, Mom! So...{line_break}How much did you find?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07247"
msgstr "Oh! Well, it's not too much...{line_break}It's only 5 coins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07248"
msgstr "That's great, though! We can{line_break}use it to buy some food!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07249"
msgstr "I'm going to start looking, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07250"
msgstr "What a stroke of luck! Right{line_break}when we really needed it, too!{page_break}There might be more, so{line_break}let's keep looking!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07251"
msgstr "I wonder if there's any more{line_break}money hidden around here...{page_break}Oh, and I'll help with{line_break}the cleaning up, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07252"
msgstr "My dad lost the draw, so{line_break}our house is going to be{line_break}the last one to get fixed...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07253"
msgstr "Losing the lottery and being{line_break}the last house to get fixed{line_break}takes some pretty bad luck.{page_break}At least no one is{line_break}complaining about how{line_break}bad our luck is...except me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07254"
msgstr "I thought the hard part of{line_break}cleaning up would be fixing{line_break}the houses...{page_break}But that's a piece of cake{line_break}next to having to pick up{line_break}all these pots and jars...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07255"
msgstr "I really shouldn't be peeking{line_break}into other people's pots,{line_break}should I?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07256"
msgstr "All because of my dad's{line_break}stupid luck, our house is{line_break}the very last one fixed.{page_break}Maybe he can make up{line_break}for it by finding some cash.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07257"
msgstr "What? Briggs was the{line_break}leader of a crew of pirates?{line_break}Aw, but he was so nice!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07258"
msgstr "Briggs was very generous.{line_break}He bought plenty of weapons.{line_break}Wait a minute...{page_break}I wonder what he was{line_break}going to DO with all{line_break}those weapons...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07259"
msgstr "That group from Madra{line_break}was incredibly lucky!{page_break}They didn't do a thing, but{line_break}they get a great boat because{line_break}someone else caught Briggs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07260"
msgstr "Getting a boat for nothing{line_break}seems like a pretty good{line_break}deal to me...{page_break}If you ignore the fact that{line_break}that boat isn't going{line_break}anywhere for a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07261"
msgstr "The Madrans dropped in{line_break}and stocked up on items.{page_break}I guess they're traveling by{line_break}way of Yampi, or they wouldn't{line_break}have needed so many supplies.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07262"
msgstr "The Madrans must have been{line_break}in quite a hurry...{page_break}They knew we were going{line_break}to fix the bridge pretty soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07263"
msgstr "As soon as I'm done{line_break}fixing up the inn, I'm going{line_break}to give a hand in town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07264"
msgstr "We're all taking turns helping{line_break}out with the repairs in town.{page_break}The lady hasn't ever had to{line_break}work this hard before. I hope{line_break}she's going to be all right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07265"
msgstr "Everyone's working so hard{line_break}to restore this town to its{line_break}previous splendor!{page_break}I've been working all{line_break}day, and I'm beat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07266"
msgstr "There's still plenty of work{line_break}to do once all the construction{line_break}is finished...{page_break}It's going to be a long time{line_break}before these houses feel{line_break}livable again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07267"
msgstr "Tonight's meal is chock-full{line_break}of ingredients to restore{line_break}strength and vitality.{page_break}Manual labor requires a lot{line_break}of energy, so you have to{line_break}rejuvinate with a good meal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07268"
msgstr "Mom said we're gonna have{line_break}a bigger house than before.{line_break}I hope I get my own room.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07269"
msgstr "My son has terrible luck...{line_break}I think I passed my bad-luck{line_break}genes on to him...{page_break}At the very least, I hope{line_break}my grandchildren end up{line_break}with better luck than we had.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07270"
msgstr "The guy next to us is{line_break}awfully handsome. He's{line_break}just my type...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07271"
msgstr "So, I hear you{line_break}caught Briggs...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07272"
msgstr "{actor_name:4}, a young girl{line_break}from my clan, was very kind,{line_break}much like you are...{page_break}Perhaps you should consider{line_break}lending a hand to the mayor{line_break}of Madra. He could use it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07273"
msgstr "You have no need to hide{line_break}such fine exploits from me.{page_break}Working hard for the benefit{line_break}of others is quite noble. That's{line_break}what {actor_name:4} always said...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07274"
msgstr "Why do I have to work so{line_break}hard? I'm tired, and I'm in{line_break}terrible shape for my age.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07275"
msgstr "I may not look very strong,{line_break}but I know I can help out.{line_break}I want to lend a hand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07276"
msgstr "We heard a loud popping{line_break}sound when we tried to{line_break}hoist the mast...{page_break}We thought we'd broken{line_break}the mast, but it turns out{line_break}it was just my spine...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07277"
msgstr "I wonder what our new{line_break}houses will look like...{line_break}I can't wait to see them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07278"
msgstr "I was told to use only the{line_break}cheapest ingredients, but{line_break}I actually bought only the best.{page_break}I don't think I'll be{line_break}telling the master of{line_break}the inn about this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07279"
msgstr "Oh! If we get a bigger{line_break}house, we can get all{line_break}kinds of pets!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07280"
msgstr "I guess I just don't have{line_break}any faith in myself...{page_break}I should go with my instincts,{line_break}but I always change my{line_break}mind at the last second.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07281"
msgstr "Our neighbor is so mellow.{line_break}He never stresses out. Maybe{line_break}that's why he's so lucky.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07282"
msgstr "Feel free to help whomever{line_break}you like if it truly makes{line_break}you happy.{page_break}Perhaps capturing Briggs{line_break}marks the beginning of your{line_break}dreams coming to fruition.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07283"
msgstr "That cute boy next door{line_break}left already. What a shame.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07284"
msgstr "The fellow next door was so{line_break}handsome. He was just my type.{line_break}This one's not so bad either!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07285"
msgstr "Capturing the dreaded{line_break}Briggs was a great deed.{page_break}Allow me to thank you{line_break}on behalf of my townsfolk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07286"
msgstr "I think this man might{line_break}even be able to defeat{line_break}the horrible werewolves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07287"
msgstr "You here to see Briggs?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07288"
msgstr "Chaucha... It's good to see you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07289"
msgstr "And you, too, Eoleo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07290"
msgstr "Goo. Goo goo ga.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07291"
msgstr "How...is your cell? Is there{line_break}anything I can do to make{line_break}this easier on you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07292"
msgstr "I'm fine, Chaucha.{line_break}My only complaint is that{line_break}the food here is terrible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07293"
msgstr "What!? Are they forcing you{line_break}to eat this disgusting gruel?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07294"
msgstr "Now, wait a second...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07295"
msgstr "First of all, it's not disgusting.{line_break}It's nutritious! And besides...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07296"
msgstr "You're IN JAIL! What did{line_break}you expect, gourmet cuisine?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07297"
msgstr "Eoleo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07298"
msgstr "Eoleo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07299"
msgstr "Hooo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07300"
msgstr "Ahhh waaah...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07301"
msgstr "{text_effect:2}WAHHH!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07302"
msgstr "I don't know why he's crying!{line_break}You're his mother! Can't you{line_break}do something?!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07303"
msgstr "There there, Eoleo...{line_break}What's the matter?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07304"
msgstr "Waa waa waa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07305"
msgstr "Did the mean old guard{line_break}frighten you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07306"
msgstr "Waa waa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07307"
msgstr "Don't let him bother you...{line_break}He's just a big bully! Come{line_break}on! Let's get you home!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07308"
msgstr "Waa waa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07309"
msgstr "We'll be back again later.{line_break}Will that be all right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07310"
msgstr "Yeah, yeah. That's fine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07311"
msgstr "We'll come back soon, dear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07312"
msgstr "WAHHH!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07313"
msgstr "I've been WAY too busy ever{line_break}since you captured Briggs{line_break}and his pirate crew.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07314"
msgstr "Oh, stopped by for a{line_break}visit, did you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07315"
msgstr "I wish that I'd met you under{line_break}different circumstances...{page_break}If we had met out on the{line_break}open seas, you would have{line_break}seen a different man.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07316"
msgstr "Ah, so you just came here{line_break}to check up on us?{page_break}Hah! Well, as you can see,{line_break}we're not causing any trouble!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07317"
msgstr "I hate prison. The food is terrible...{page_break}My bed is hard and lumpy...{line_break}It's even worse than being{line_break}a pirate was.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07318"
msgstr "It sounds like the mayor of{line_break}Alhafra lost interest in fixing{line_break}that boat.{page_break}I guess that means it will{line_break}be a while before the mast{line_break}gets raised again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07319"
msgstr "Everything would have been{line_break}fine if it hadn't been for{line_break}you meddling kids!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07320"
msgstr "I saw you staring at{line_break}Eoleo... But you couldn't{line_break}have figured out...{page_break}N-No! Of course not!{line_break}Nobody could see that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07321"
msgstr "It's so boring here when{line_break}there's no one to guard. I'm{line_break}glad I've got some company.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07322"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} has strange{line_break}powers of his own, so we can't{line_break}let him see what Eoleo can do.{page_break}If he does, he might ruin our{line_break}only chance to escape...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07323"
msgstr "I'm not staying in this stupid{line_break}cell forever. I'll get outta{line_break}here one way or another!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07324"
msgstr "If they don't fix that{line_break}boat, then it's not going{line_break}anywhere.{page_break}I bet Alhafra's greedy mayor{line_break}doesn't like seeing Madra{line_break}profit from all of this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07325"
msgstr "Oh, what's that punk {actor_name:5}{line_break}doing again? I wish that{line_break}troublemaker'd just scram!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07326"
msgstr "I hear some people can see{line_break}Eoleo's power... I want to see{line_break}for myself! How does he do it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07327"
msgstr "Ah! {actor_name:5}! Welcome,{line_break}welcome...{page_break}Listen, sorry about all that{line_break}\"not letting you in\" business{line_break}before... Don't take it personally.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07328"
msgstr "Oh, {actor_name:5}! Go on in!{line_break}The mayor's been looking{line_break}forward to meeting with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07329"
msgstr "If I'd known Briggs was{line_break}a pirate, I would have{line_break}fought him myself.{page_break}I never get to have any fun.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07330"
msgstr "The mayor was really impressed{line_break}with these guys... He'll probably{line_break}want them to stay in Alhafra...{page_break}I hope he doesn't try to give{line_break}{actor_name:5} my job.{line_break}I hate when he does that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07331"
msgstr "No one is allowed beyond this point.{line_break}Don't even think about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07332"
msgstr "The mayor said no one goes{line_break}through, and I mean to make{line_break}sure no one goes through!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07333"
msgstr "You're the one who gave my{line_break}son some food, aren't you?{page_break}Did you want to go{line_break}see the cave?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07334"
msgstr "If you were up for a little{line_break}spelunking, I'd be glad to{line_break}let you pass. Oh well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07335"
msgstr "I'm only letting you pass{line_break}because you did good{line_break}by my son...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07336"
msgstr "I'm only letting you by so{line_break}you can explore a little.{page_break}Make sure you don't{line_break}lay a hand on any of{line_break}the mayor's treasure.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07337"
msgstr "I've heard that the deeper{line_break}you go into the cave, the more{line_break}dangerous it gets, so be wary.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07338"
msgstr "Not that it matters. The door to{line_break}the mayor's treasure room is{line_break}locked, so they're not getting in.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07339"
msgstr "You should go to the{line_break}watchtower and gaze{line_break}southward.{page_break}On a clear day you can see{line_break}the most amazing view of{line_break}Air's Rock from there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07340"
msgstr "What do you think of Alhafra?{line_break}Have you taken a fancy to it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07341"
msgstr "Then you are welcome to{line_break}stay here and relax for{line_break}as long as you please.{page_break}I am sure our mayor will{line_break}be happy to hear it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07342"
msgstr "Then why don't you follow{line_break}your feet to the south?{page_break}There are plenty of delights{line_break}for warriors such as you in{line_break}the middle of Osenia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07343"
msgstr "Our town was rife with{line_break}pirates until just recently.{page_break}Your efforts have removed{line_break}a scourge from our town. We{line_break}truly owe you our gratitude.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07344"
msgstr "The mountains to the east{line_break}of Alhafra are the Balloo{line_break}Range. They divide Osenia in two.{page_break}And we call the area on the{line_break}other side of the Balloo Range{line_break}East Osenia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07345"
msgstr "There are numerous tales{line_break}about that rocky peak we{line_break}call Air's Rock.{page_break}Air's Rock looks so odd that{line_break}many people think there must{line_break}be something in hiding there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07346"
msgstr "Why do they always tell me{line_break}to send adventure-seekers{line_break}to South Osenia?{page_break}All you do is go to the{line_break}desert and head south. Where's{line_break}the adventure in that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07347"
msgstr "Those pirates never did us{line_break}any harm, but that's because{line_break}they were up to something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07348"
msgstr "There's no way to cross the{line_break}Balloo Range from here.{page_break}I've heard western Osenia{line_break}is nothing compared to the{page_break}frightful things found{line_break}in the east.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07349"
msgstr "Lookee here!{line_break}Can't you see Air's{line_break}Rock out there?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07350"
msgstr "From here, it just looks like{line_break}a regular old rock, but from{line_break}up close, it's something else!{page_break}The first thing you think{line_break}when you see it is \"Now{line_break}that's one serious rock!\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07351"
msgstr "Oh... I guess today is a bit{line_break}cloudier than usual.{page_break}Air's Rock has another name.{line_break}They call it the Windy Peak. You{line_break}almost never see clouds near it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07352"
msgstr "The longer I sit here gazing{line_break}at Air's Rock, the more I grow{line_break}to love it.{page_break}All it takes is one glance,{line_break}and you're convinced it holds{line_break}some mystery deep within.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07353"
msgstr "I'd been saying Indra wasn't{line_break}in the right place for some{line_break}time now.{page_break}Nobody would believe me{line_break}until the mayor of Madra{line_break}actually walked here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07354"
msgstr "I sat and gazed at that{line_break}continent every day.{page_break}I ought to know where that{line_break}continent should and{line_break}shouldn't be, I tell you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07355"
msgstr "Are you the brave hero{line_break}who defeated the pirates?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07356"
msgstr "Well, I wonder if even{line_break}a hero like you can stand{line_break}up against a creature...{page_break}With the brains of man{line_break}and the strength and{line_break}cunning of a beast.{page_break}If you don't think any such{line_break}creatures exist, then head{line_break}south and see for yourself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07357"
msgstr "I know you're the one who{line_break}beat the pirates... Don't try{line_break}to act humble...{page_break}You should have a little{line_break}more faith in your deeds.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07358"
msgstr "I heard the pirates talking{line_break}about the warriors who beat{line_break}them. They sounded tough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07359"
msgstr "I wish someone would go do{line_break}something about that cursed{line_break}village south of us. It's evil...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07360"
msgstr "I hope the warriors who{line_break}defeated the pirates aren't{line_break}from Garoh, the cursed village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07361"
msgstr "Darn that mayor...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07362"
msgstr "I thought he'd get that mast{line_break}fixed up for us right away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07363"
msgstr "I'm starting to think the mayor{line_break}of Alhafra never planned on{line_break}repairing that boat at all!{page_break}I was a fool to believe{line_break}he would help us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07364"
msgstr "He's already been paid to fix{line_break}the boat, but he says that was{line_break}only while it was Briggs's.{page_break}He probably expects us to{line_break}pay for the repairs a second{line_break}time... The greedy pig...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07365"
msgstr "If we leave the boat here and{line_break}go home, the mayor of Alhafra{line_break}keeps the boat AND the money.{page_break}There must be a way to fix{line_break}that boat without relying on{line_break}Alhafra's help...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07366"
msgstr "The money Briggs used to{line_break}pay for that boat was stolen{line_break}from our people...{page_break}I don't think it's wrong for us{line_break}to expect the mayor of Alhafra{line_break}to honor his promise.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07367"
msgstr "I'm sure the mayor has his{line_break}reasons for halting repairs{line_break}on the sailboat...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07368"
msgstr "The mayor feels that Madra{line_break}should only get back what was{line_break}stolen from them. Nothing more...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07369"
msgstr "But now, it seems the Madrans{line_break}are getting the better end of{line_break}the deal...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07370"
msgstr "The mayor thinks it unfair{line_break}that Madra should benefit{line_break}while Alhafra suffers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07371"
msgstr "That's why he's keeping the{line_break}pirates' money and using it{line_break}to repair Alhafra, not the boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07372"
msgstr "If Madra wants their boat{line_break}fixed, then they can just{line_break}pay us to have it fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07373"
msgstr "Briggs tells me there are{line_break}huge towns on a continent{line_break}that lies across the Eastern Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07374"
msgstr "He tells me that, by trading{line_break}with one another, all of these{line_break}towns prosper and grow...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07375"
msgstr "I've made a decision... If Alhafra{line_break}is to prosper, then we must{line_break}trade, too! Trade and grow!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07376"
msgstr "I'm going to build an entire{line_break}trade fleet and make lots{line_break}of money!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07377"
msgstr "Still...there must be other{line_break}pirates and freebooters{line_break}still roaming the high seas.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07378"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, Briggs told{line_break}me you and your friends{line_break}fought with great strength.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07379"
msgstr "If you could lend me that{line_break}strength, we would need{line_break}not fear any pirates.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07380"
msgstr "So if you'd just be willing{line_break}to help us out, our town could{line_break}begin trading...and prospering...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07381"
msgstr "What do you say?{line_break}Do we have a deal?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07382"
msgstr "Great! Why don't you just{line_break}stay here in Alhafra until we're{line_break}ready for our first trade run?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07383"
msgstr "Ah, such a pity that you{line_break}don't see the potential of{line_break}this partnership...{page_break}I certainly hope you will{line_break}reconsider... We stand to{line_break}make a lot of money...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07384"
msgstr "I am planning a glorious new{line_break}sailing ship so that we can{line_break}begin trading immediately...{page_break}I'm certain this will go well,{line_break}and we will both become{line_break}very, very wealthy indeed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07385"
msgstr "The mayor won't help fix the{line_break}boat until he feels he's getting{line_break}a fair payment in exchange.{page_break}If Madra's mayor wants the{line_break}boat fixed, he's going to have{line_break}to shell out more cash.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07386"
msgstr "This is such a fantastic{line_break}idea, and I'm the one who{line_break}thought of it...{page_break}So, naturally, it need only be{line_break}me alone who profits from it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07387"
msgstr "The mayor hates seeing anyone{line_break}else make money, so I'm sure{line_break}he'll make this tough on Madra.{page_break}Heh heh heh... The mayor{line_break}doesn't play fair.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07388"
msgstr "You do plan to help with{line_break}the mast, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07389"
msgstr "Not even Briggs and his{line_break}pirates could fix that mast.{line_break}How are we supposed to?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07390"
msgstr "They need our help... We{line_break}at least have to try...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07391"
msgstr "Isn't that right, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07392"
msgstr "Well then, we'd better get{line_break}right to it, hadn't we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07393"
msgstr "Are you finished here,{line_break}{actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07394"
msgstr "Wait, you wanted to do this,{line_break}and now you're telling me{line_break}we should just give up?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07395"
msgstr "I just don't see how{line_break}much more help we{line_break}can be here, {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07396"
msgstr "Oh, don't be ridiculous! We've{line_break}already done so much.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07397"
msgstr "I know how you feel, but{line_break}there's nothing else we{line_break}can do right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07398"
msgstr "So... Maybe we should{line_break}start searching for{line_break}another ship then...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07399"
msgstr "...Not that I was planning on{line_break}\"borrowing\" the Madran's ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07400"
msgstr "Although...I did plan on asking{line_break}them if we could use it once{line_break}we got back to Madra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07401"
msgstr "But it doesn't look like{line_break}the ship will be leaving{line_break}anytime soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07402"
msgstr "So I think maybe we should{line_break}just forget about that and start{line_break}on our way again, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07403"
msgstr "It looks like the mayor of{line_break}Madra went home to fetch{line_break}some workers for the boat...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07404"
msgstr "I guess our mayor didn't even{line_break}offer Madra any help at all...{line_break}What a crummy thing to do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07405"
msgstr "I hear the mayor of Madra{line_break}went back through the desert{line_break}and home to Madra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07406"
msgstr "He seems like an honest,{line_break}hardworking young man...{line_break}nothing at all like our mayor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07407"
msgstr "I don't know what we're{line_break}going to do about this{line_break}rock...{page_break}I think we've done all we can{line_break}do here... Let's get going...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07408"
msgstr "Hey! You lot! Hold{line_break}it right there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07409"
msgstr "Hang on, there's no need to{line_break}stop them. They couldn't be{line_break}involved in this mess...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07410"
msgstr "If you're talking about the pirate{line_break}incident, I believe we resolved{line_break}that to everyone's satisfaction.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07411"
msgstr "This has nothing to do with the{line_break}Champa this time, old man! This{line_break}time, the Kibombo attacked us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07412"
msgstr "\"Old man\"?!? Hmph!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07413"
msgstr "Wait... Did you say you were{line_break}attacked again? By the Kibombo?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07414"
msgstr "Do you know about{line_break}the Kibombo?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07415"
msgstr "You must be pretty worldly,{line_break}considering that they rarely{line_break}leave the heart of Gondowan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07416"
msgstr "Not many people do... They're{line_break}a barbaric tribe from central{line_break}Gondowan! Watch out for them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07417"
msgstr "When did all this happen?!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07418"
msgstr "Not too long ago...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07419"
msgstr "Right after the mayor{line_break}left, actually...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07420"
msgstr "It was them, wasn't{line_break}it, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07421"
msgstr "Of course! They did seem to be{line_break}acting awfully strange when we{line_break}saw them in that cave...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07422"
msgstr "Surely you remember, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}The cave? Those strange men{line_break}we saw in there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07423"
msgstr "Was anything stolen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07424"
msgstr "Only a single black orb...{line_break}Everything else was untouched.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07425"
msgstr "A black orb...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07426"
msgstr "I'm afraid we don't have much{line_break}more information than that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07427"
msgstr "You helped us with the Champa,{line_break}so, I'll tell you what...{page_break}Maybe you could look around{line_break}at the mayor's house. It's the{line_break}only one that was robbed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07428"
msgstr "First, pirates raid our town,{line_break}then the Kibombo come{line_break}storming in...{page_break}Things have been going{line_break}horribly for Madra lately...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07429"
msgstr "My guess is the Kibombo{line_break}have long since fled the{line_break}area.{page_break}Still, considering the way things{line_break}have been going, we still want{line_break}to have guards at the gates.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07430"
msgstr "The way things have been{line_break}going, I'm so scared I can{line_break}hardly sleep at night...{page_break}Is there no way to appease{line_break}the gods? Is our town cursed?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07431"
msgstr "I've been standing for so{line_break}long, I wish they would give us{line_break}little stools we could sit on.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07432"
msgstr "Oh, uh... You coming through?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07433"
msgstr "Yeah, uh... We're sealing the{line_break}hole up right now, so you, uh,{line_break}can't get through this way.{page_break}If you're trying to get into{line_break}Madra, why don't you head{line_break}around to the main entrance?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07434"
msgstr "Yeah, well, that's good, 'cause{line_break}we wouldn't let you down here{line_break}anyway...{page_break}Besides, anyone who's going{line_break}to Madra can just go through{line_break}the main gates, like normal folk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07435"
msgstr "We sealed up the hole, but{line_break}nobody seems to feel any{line_break}better...{page_break}Maybe we should just fill up{line_break}the catacombs completely...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07436"
msgstr "We think the Kibombo came{line_break}into Indra across the new{line_break}land bridge...{page_break}But just because they {text_effect:2}could{reset_text_style}{line_break}attack Madra doesn't mean{line_break}they had to...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07437"
msgstr "So... The Kibombo got into{line_break}Madra from Gondowan, right?{page_break}Well, doesn't that mean that{line_break}we can cross into Gondowan{line_break}from Madra, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07438"
msgstr "The Kibombo came in through{line_break}the broken wall to the west.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07439"
msgstr "I heard that the elder got{line_break}us a boat in Alhafra...{line_break}I wonder if that's true...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07440"
msgstr "I guess that guy we had{line_break}in prison wasn't one of{line_break}Briggs's cronies after all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07441"
msgstr "Gondowan sounds like a{line_break}frightening place. I don't{line_break}think I'll ever go there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07442"
msgstr "Hey, mister! Are you the guy{line_break}who beat up Briggs?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07443"
msgstr "So does that mean you'll{line_break}go thump the Kibombo, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07444"
msgstr "You're not? Someone told{line_break}me it was a young warrior...{line_break}That sounded a bit like you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07445"
msgstr "I can't believe someone{line_break}stomped on those pirates...{line_break}That's incredible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07446"
msgstr "Now that we're sealing off the{line_break}other end of this hole, maybe we{line_break}won't have any more surprises!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07447"
msgstr "There are still plenty of{line_break}things I want to investigate{line_break}in this cave.{page_break}And until I do, there's no way I'm{line_break}going to seal the entire thing off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07448"
msgstr "Briggs didn't have nearly{line_break}as many pirates under him{line_break}as we thought he did.{page_break}He did an amazing job of{line_break}flanking the town, considering{line_break}how few men he had.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07449"
msgstr "These caves were my{line_break}secret hiding place.{page_break}I wish they weren't going{line_break}to seal it all up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07450"
msgstr "That guy {actor_name:8} wasn't{line_break}one of Briggs's men{line_break}after all.{page_break}I can't believe we locked him{line_break}up without any evidence...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07451"
msgstr "Oh, {actor_name:8}? We released{line_break}him as soon as we heard.{page_break}He stopped by the mayor's{line_break}house and then left town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07452"
msgstr "Everyone yelled at me for{line_break}running away this last time,{line_break}so next time, I'm gonna fight!{page_break}But the thing is, last time,{line_break}I took such a beating I got{line_break}lumps on my head. Ouch!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07453"
msgstr "You shoulda seen my partner{line_break}in that fight!{page_break}He was in the mix right up{line_break}until they took him down...{line_break}Man... That takes courage!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07454"
msgstr "If it weren't for that tidal{line_break}wave, none of this awful stuff{line_break}would have happened...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07455"
msgstr "If Gondowan is really that{line_break}much bigger than Indra,{line_break}then I should go check it out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07456"
msgstr "It's strange... It's almost as{line_break}though the Kibombo knew that{line_break}the wall was broken...{page_break}But there's no way they{line_break}could have known...unless{line_break}the pirates told them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07457"
msgstr "The mayor is supposed to be{line_break}coming back with that boat...{line_break}I wonder when that will be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07458"
msgstr "He told us he was innocent,{line_break}but we jailed him anyway. Is{line_break}that justice? Is that right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07459"
msgstr "In Gondowan, they have{line_break}evil magic curses they can{line_break}put on you in an instant!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07460"
msgstr "I heard the guys who captured{line_break}Briggs were just a bunch of{line_break}feeble-looking kids...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07461"
msgstr "If they were strong enough{line_break}to beat Briggs, they must{line_break}be huge!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07462"
msgstr "It was so convenient, being{line_break}able to sneak out through{line_break}the cave to the other side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07463"
msgstr "I wonder who dug those{line_break}underground passages{line_break}and why they're there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07464"
msgstr "Wait, if Briggs only has four{line_break}crew members, then they{line_break}couldn't have outflanked us...{page_break}They must have had help{line_break}from someone else...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07465"
msgstr "I've never seen any{line_break}monsters around the{line_break}cave entrance...{page_break}I want to go inside and see{line_break}if there are any monsters{line_break}inside, but I can't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07466"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} didn't seem like{line_break}he was in a very good{line_break}mood when he left town.{page_break}I guess he was still angry about{line_break}having been imprisoned like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07467"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} was so happy{line_break}to get out of jail...{page_break}But after he spoke to the{line_break}mayor's wife, he looked unhappy.{line_break}I wonder what she told him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07468"
msgstr "I didn't have a chance to{line_break}run away during the fight. The{line_break}Kibombo were everywhere!{page_break}That's the only reason I stayed{line_break}to fight them. But I'm not about{line_break}to tell anyone that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07469"
msgstr "I can't believe nobody seems{line_break}impressed that my partner{line_break}fought the Kibombo so bravely.{page_break}Don't tell me they don't think{line_break}it takes guts to stand up{line_break}against them, because it does!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07470"
msgstr "So Briggs and his pirates{line_break}must have gone to Alhafra{line_break}looking for a boat.{page_break}I'm impressed that they{line_break}were captured before{line_break}they could escape.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07471"
msgstr "It was sure sneaky of Briggs{line_break}to destroy the bridge to{line_break}Osenia after they crossed.{page_break}It made it really hard for{line_break}the mayor to reach Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07472"
msgstr "Now that Briggs has{line_break}been captured, I have{line_break}nothing to fear!{page_break}Yes! That means I can head{line_break}to Osenia for some business!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07473"
msgstr "It sounds like Osenia is a{line_break}huge place. They took forever{line_break}to catch up with Briggs!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07474"
msgstr "The Kibombo are a very{line_break}warlike tribe.{page_break}That last attack was enough{line_break}to warn me to stay away{line_break}from central Gondowan!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07475"
msgstr "I'm glad the Kibombo's attack{line_break}wasn't too terrible this time,{line_break}but what if they come back?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07476"
msgstr "Our best guess is that the{line_break}Kibombo come from the{line_break}central part of Gondowan...{page_break}Why would they turn around{line_break}so quickly after coming all{line_break}this way?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07477"
msgstr "What can we do to stop the{line_break}Kibombo from attacking us{line_break}again?{page_break}Maybe we have to find a way{line_break}to separate our continents,{line_break}like before the tidal wave...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07478"
msgstr "The Kibombo apparently used{line_break}ropes to climb down the cliffs.{page_break}But we can't climb back up{line_break}the cliffs from this side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07479"
msgstr "My husband pursued the{line_break}Kibombo after the attack,{line_break}but he had to turn back...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07480"
msgstr "If I were just a little bit younger,{line_break}I think I might have been able{line_break}to catch those Kibombo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07481"
msgstr "In his youth, my husband was{line_break}a very fast runner. They called{line_break}him \"The Cheetah.\"{page_break}I guess he's learned that he{line_break}can't race against old age.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07482"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} left that boat{line_break}of his behind when he took off...{page_break}That thing wasn't going{line_break}anywhere, so I guess he had{line_break}no choice but to give up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07483"
msgstr "I can't stop thinking about{line_break}that ship {actor_name:8} left{line_break}by the eastern shore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07484"
msgstr "Some people in town saw{line_break}{actor_name:8} heading toward{line_break}the Gondowan cliffs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07485"
msgstr "I wonder if that ship grounded{line_break}by the eastern shore is still{line_break}broken.{page_break}It seems like a well-built{line_break}ship. It'd be a shame to{line_break}just leave it there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07486"
msgstr "All the Kibombo wanted when{line_break}they attacked was the black orb{line_break}that sat above the fireplace.{page_break}We're just lucky{line_break}no one was hurt.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07487"
msgstr "My father was holding on to{line_break}that orb for {actor_name:8}, and{line_break}the Kibombo stole it...{page_break}No matter how much he{line_break}apologizes for losing it,{line_break}it won't make things right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07488"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} went to Kibombo{line_break}to get his orb back.{page_break}We told him that central{line_break}Gondowan is very dangerous,{line_break}but he wouldn't listen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07489"
msgstr "If my father'd been in town,{line_break}I wouldn't have been scared{line_break}when the Kibombo attacked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07490"
msgstr "My father hasn't come home yet,{line_break}even though Briggs has{line_break}been captured.{page_break}I'm scared that something{line_break}happened to him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07491"
msgstr "When my husband hears that{line_break}the orb he was keeping was{line_break}stolen, he'll be quite angry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07492"
msgstr "I won't ever forget the look{line_break}on {actor_name:8}'s face when he{line_break}heard his orb was stolen.{page_break}He was so sad... It was like{line_break}he'd lost a part of himself...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07493"
msgstr "When {actor_name:8} left, he said{line_break}he was going to pursue the{line_break}Kibombo, but I wonder...{page_break}What if he reached the cliffs{line_break}and then couldn't climb them.{line_break}I hope he's not stuck...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07494"
msgstr "Dad always knows what to{line_break}do... He'd never have let those{line_break}Kibombo barge in here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07495"
msgstr "I hope he's just late because{line_break}he's looking for a good{line_break}souvenir to bring me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07496"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} wasn't one of{line_break}the Champa... That's{line_break}why they let him go.{page_break}You shouldn't just keep an{line_break}innocent man in prison for{line_break}no reason.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07497"
msgstr "So, that {actor_name:8} guy{line_break}wasn't a pirate after all, huh?{page_break}That still doesn't answer{line_break}where that ice came from...{line_break}That freaked me out...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07498"
msgstr "There was something really{line_break}frightening about {actor_name:8}...{line_break}I'm glad to be rid of him...{page_break}He went after the Kibombo,{line_break}but I doubt he'll make it{line_break}back from Gondowan alive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07499"
msgstr "That {actor_name:8} was a{line_break}strange fellow.{page_break}Shin was terrified of him.{line_break}He let him go as soon as we{line_break}learned he was innocent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07500"
msgstr "The armorer and I are busy{line_break}researching the equipment{line_break}the Kibombo left behind.{page_break}They dropped a lot of strange{line_break}weapons that might reveal{line_break}more about the attacks...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07501"
msgstr "The Champa weapons we found{line_break}before are identical to the{line_break}Kibombo weapons we just found.{page_break}It can't be a coincidence...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07502"
msgstr "I knew there was something{line_break}strange about the pirates{line_break}attacking us like that...{page_break}I think those weapons we{line_break}found are going to be the{line_break}key to the mystery...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07503"
msgstr "The group that attacked from{line_break}the east used different weapons{line_break}from the group to the west.{page_break}If they really were from the{line_break}same crew, then why would{line_break}they use different weapons?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07504"
msgstr "All my injuries have healed{line_break}up pretty nicely...{page_break}It made for a nice vacation,{line_break}but now, it's time to get back{line_break}to work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07505"
msgstr "I'm so happy that my sister's{line_break}all better now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07506"
msgstr "That Shin is always bugging{line_break}me just to relax and take{line_break}a break. He's a real pain.{page_break}I like working more than{line_break}I like sleeping.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07507"
msgstr "I was so scared that my{line_break}sister wouldn't get better...{line_break}What would I do without her?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07508"
msgstr "The Kibombo are a tribe from{line_break}Gondowan... They're searching{line_break}for some great and evil power.{page_break}Do not allow yourselves to{line_break}be corrupted by them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07509"
msgstr "If that tidal wave hadn't hit{line_break}us, the Kibombo would never{line_break}have been able to attack.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07510"
msgstr "Them Kibombo possess{line_break}{text_effect:4}evil powers.{reset_text_style} They sure{line_break}are a weird bunch.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07511"
msgstr "I hope the power of our faith{line_break}will prevent the Kibombo{line_break}from attacking us again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07512"
msgstr "Everyone says them Kibombo{line_break}were mostly nekkid...{line_break}They sound so...savage!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07513"
msgstr "We're lucky the Kibombo didn't{line_break}use their evil powers... There{line_break}were enough injuries as it was.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07514"
msgstr "I've heard that the Kibombo{line_break}wield an evil, wicked magic...{page_break}But...why didn't they use any{line_break}of it when they attacked us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07515"
msgstr "Things have been busy here...{line_break}First, the pirates, then the{line_break}Kibombo... What a week!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07516"
msgstr "I hid under my bed on{line_break}the night of the attack.{line_break}I was really scared!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07517"
msgstr "I watched the entire attack of{line_break}the Kibombo with my own eyes.{page_break}I'll never forget it... I was{line_break}paralyzed with fear...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07518"
msgstr "If you want to know about{line_break}the attack, talk to my partner.{line_break}He saw the whole thing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07519"
msgstr "There's nothing worse than{line_break}wicked, evil magic. I don't want{line_break}to see it, much less use it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07520"
msgstr "If it were me, I would have{line_break}attacked a wealthier town.{line_break}...If it were me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07521"
msgstr "After I crawled under the{line_break}bed, I fell asleep, so I was{line_break}pretty achy the next morning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07522"
msgstr "I had to go to the bathroom in{line_break}the middle of the night, but{line_break}when I went...{page_break}I saw all these eyes in the{line_break}darkness. I got so scared...{line_break}I didn't have to go anymore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07523"
msgstr "The Kibombo attacked in the{line_break}wee hours of the morning...{page_break}Why weren't they asleep, like{line_break}all us respectable people?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07524"
msgstr "Is the way clear?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07525"
msgstr "This area is clear! The strange{line_break}one has not been seen!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07526"
msgstr "And there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07527"
msgstr "We have not seen the{line_break}stranger near the village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07528"
msgstr "Do you believe he was truly{line_break}headed toward Kibombo?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07529"
msgstr "The guards here were only{line_break}recently knocked unconscious.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07530"
msgstr "Correct. We were under orders{line_break}to maintain a strict watch{line_break}over the mountain pass.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07531"
msgstr "No one must be permitted into{line_break}Kibombo until Akafubu has{line_break}completed his ceremony.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07532"
msgstr "Then we had better hurry to{line_break}find the one who attacked{line_break}our guards.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07533"
msgstr "Keep a good watch. Do not{line_break}permit anyone to pass.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07534"
msgstr "If anyone interrupts Akafubu's{line_break}ceremony, he will hold you{line_break}responsible...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07535"
msgstr "Guards! An intruder!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07536"
msgstr "Someone is trying to{line_break}pass! To arms, Kibombo{line_break}warriors! To arms!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07537"
msgstr "Here! The intruder is here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07538"
msgstr "Kibombo does not{line_break}permit visitors!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07539"
msgstr "You just follow this road right{line_break}back to where you came from!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07540"
msgstr "Guard! Get him out of here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07541"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Grrrrr...{reset_text_style} Rrrruff!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07542"
msgstr "Ah-roooo! Ah-roooo!{line_break}HAWOOOO!!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07543"
msgstr "Outsiders are not allowed{line_break}to enter Kibombo. Begone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07544"
msgstr "Grrrrr!{line_break}Rrrruff! Rrufff!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07545"
msgstr "An intruder! Repel the intruder{line_break}immediately!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07546"
msgstr "Hey! Who's there!? Get{line_break}me out of this crate!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07547"
msgstr "Sniff sniff...{line_break}Lick lick lick!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07548"
msgstr "It's dark! It's cramped!{line_break}Somebody get me out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07549"
msgstr "A bone! That's my favruff!{line_break}Lick lick... It's deruffcious!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07550"
msgstr "This rock is in my way.{line_break}I want to get to the other side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07551"
msgstr "Rrruff! Rrruff!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07552"
msgstr "Dig here, you dig? Rrruff!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07553"
msgstr "I knew it! I knew there was{line_break}something there, and he{line_break}dug it up! Look at that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07554"
msgstr "I tried to go to Gondowan to{line_break}find my fellow tribesmen, but{line_break}the ropes were taken down.{page_break}I can't go back to Kibombo{line_break}until someone realizes that{line_break}I'm missing and comes for me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07555"
msgstr "I wonder who removed the{line_break}rope from the other side...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07556"
msgstr "If the other warriors knew we{line_break}could not return to Kibombo,{line_break}they would be distraught.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07557"
msgstr "I long to see my homeland{line_break}again. This Indra lacks the{line_break}savage beauty of Gondowan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07558"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! Where do you{line_break}intend to go?{page_break}We should try to help{line_break}{actor_name:8} recover his{line_break}black orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07559"
msgstr "Kraden's right. I think we should{line_break}try to help {actor_name:8}, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07560"
msgstr "I completely agree{line_break}with Kraden and {actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07561"
msgstr "It looks like the majority wins!{line_break}Let's go back to Kibombo{line_break}and help {actor_name:8}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07562"
msgstr "Welcome to Naribwe.{line_break}It's really hot out...{line_break}You should relax a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07563"
msgstr "The Kibombo went on an{line_break}expedition to the east, but{line_break}they've already returned.{page_break}Do you know what kind of{line_break}expedition it was?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07564"
msgstr "What? They crossed over to{line_break}Indra and attacked a town!?{page_break}The Kibombo are a reckless{line_break}and dangerous people.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07565"
msgstr "Oh, you don't? The Kibombo{line_break}rarely journey far abroad.{line_break}It's very worrisome...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07566"
msgstr "The Kibombo never move in{line_break}such large numbers without{line_break}orders from Akafubu...{page_break}Without that witch doctor,{line_break}the Kibombo would be a{line_break}much more peaceful tribe...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07567"
msgstr "I would not venture far north{line_break}of here if I were you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07568"
msgstr "It's been dangerous out ever{line_break}since the day the gems fell{line_break}from the sky.{page_break}After that day, all local{line_break}creatures suddenly grew{line_break}more powerful and terrifying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07569"
msgstr "When Oeia was their witch{line_break}doctor, the Kibombo were much{line_break}more peaceful.{page_break}Akafubu took over when Oeia{line_break}passed on, and he is responsible{line_break}for their warlike ways.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07570"
msgstr "Can you tell me where you{line_break}have come from?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07571"
msgstr "Angara? That is a land far to{line_break}the north, is it not?{page_break}I've heard that when it is hot{line_break}here, it is cold in Angara.{line_break}The world is a strange place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07572"
msgstr "Why won't you tell me?{line_break}What are you trying to hide?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07573"
msgstr "It's always hot here in Naribwe.{line_break}It doesn't matter if it's summer,{line_break}winter, or spring. It's always hot.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07574"
msgstr "You don't plan on going to{line_break}Kibombo, do you, mister?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07575"
msgstr "Well, you'll have to find a path{line_break}through the Kibombo Mountains{line_break}to get there.{page_break}The Kibombo warriors keep{line_break}a close watch on the pass.{line_break}They won't let you through.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07576"
msgstr "That's a wise choice. Nothing{line_break}good would come to you in{line_break}a place like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07577"
msgstr "On the far side of the river{line_break}lies a huge mountain we call{line_break}Magma Rock.{page_break}It is a sacred place that{line_break}the gods created long ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07578"
msgstr "I can hardly stand the heat{line_break}in Naribwe, and I've lived here{line_break}my whole life!{page_break}I can't imagine what travelers{line_break}must think of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07579"
msgstr "Akafubu is almost certainly{line_break}looking for jewels.{page_break}I cannot understand{line_break}why a witch doctor{line_break}needs so many jewels.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07580"
msgstr "It is awful to the north of{line_break}Naribwe... It is hotter, and{line_break}the creatures are fierce...{page_break}And worst of all, that's{line_break}where the Kibombo are!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07581"
msgstr "That was the day the wind{line_break}blew so hard and the dark{line_break}clouds came from the north.{page_break}That's when those strange{line_break}gems fell from above.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07582"
msgstr "Kibombo magic was once{line_break}widely respected. Now, it{line_break}is merely feared.{page_break}That is the way of things{line_break}since Oeia appointed Akafubu{line_break}as his successor before dying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07583"
msgstr "The warrior who passed through{line_break}here earlier said he came from{line_break}an isle in the middle of the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07584"
msgstr "To get to Kibombo, you have{line_break}to cross over the Kibombo{line_break}Mountains.{page_break}I seem to recall my{line_break}grandfather telling me about{line_break}a way past the guards.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07585"
msgstr "Sometimes, you can hear{line_break}explosions from across the{line_break}river near Magma Rock.{page_break}I wonder what's going on{line_break}over there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07586"
msgstr "When I climbed the Kibombo{line_break}Mountains, I had to find a path{line_break}the Kibombo didn't know about...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07587"
msgstr "I remember when I found that{line_break}path above the pass... Not even{line_break}the Kibombo knew about it!{page_break}I'm not even sure I could{line_break}find the way to the higher{line_break}pass anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07588"
msgstr "The fortune-teller lives{line_break}at the highest house in{line_break}Naribwe...{page_break}He's the closest thing{line_break}we have to a mayor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07589"
msgstr "We're a small village, but if{line_break}we all cooperate, we can get{line_break}almost anything done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07590"
msgstr "The fortune-teller in Naribwe{line_break}has quite a reputation...{line_break}His predictions are so accurate!{page_break}He's always done them for us{line_break}alone, so I don't understand{line_break}how he got so famous.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07591"
msgstr "As long as we listen to the{line_break}words of the fortune-teller,{line_break}we won't have any worries...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07592"
msgstr "If you desire a reading,{line_break}stand before the table...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07593"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} placed {argument_item_name:2}{line_break}on the table.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07594"
msgstr "I am a teller of fortunes.{line_break}Would you have a reading?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07595"
msgstr "Then stand back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07596"
msgstr "It costs 20 coins to hear{line_break}what your future holds.{line_break}Will you pay?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07597"
msgstr "Then away with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07598"
msgstr "Many want things they cannot{line_break}afford. If you do not have the{line_break}money, you will have no reading.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07599"
msgstr "Very well. Show me one{line_break}of your items.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07600"
msgstr "Are you prepared?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07601"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} changed his mind{line_break}and took back the item.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07602"
msgstr "Shall I give you another{line_break}reading for a different item?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07603"
msgstr "Then away with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07604"
msgstr "I shall begin my reading...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07605"
msgstr "I see...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07606"
msgstr "Beyond the weapon you set{line_break}down lies a terrible foe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07607"
msgstr "Many enemies await you, far{line_break}beyond the mountains.{page_break}If you move to strike{line_break}them... you will meet{line_break}with great disaster.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07608"
msgstr "In a misty sea, a mighty foe...{line_break}A fiersome battle awaits you.{page_break}Gather the pieces of the{line_break}weapon to defeat him, or{line_break}drown in defeat yourself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07609"
msgstr "None in the eastern world{line_break}can stand against the power{line_break}you possess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07610"
msgstr "I feel a shining power glowing{line_break}beyond the item before me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07611"
msgstr "You are lost in your way...{line_break}Another continent needs{line_break}your attention, another land.{page_break}A towering rock amid a{line_break}sea of sand. Return there{line_break}and find your way again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07612"
msgstr "A distant isle lies far to{line_break}the northeast... Sail there.{page_break}High atop a rocky peak, a{line_break}power awaits you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07613"
msgstr "I see a paradise awaiting{line_break}you... An island in the east.{page_break}But even paradise must have{line_break}its trials... Scale the peak and{line_break}earn your power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07614"
msgstr "A tiny figure stands against{line_break}a wasteland wrought in snow...{line_break}The southern edge of the world.{page_break}It is you... In the icy plains,{line_break}you will find ancient ruins{line_break}and ancient power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07615"
msgstr "I see you lost in mists, lost{line_break}in time, lost in the seas...{page_break}And there, I see you gaining{line_break}an ancient, fearsome power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07616"
msgstr "The eastern lands hold{line_break}little for you now. You will{line_break}not remain here long...{page_break}I see you opening a channel{line_break}between the continents and{line_break}sailing the Western Sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07617"
msgstr "Beyond the item before me,{line_break}I see a path for you to follow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07618"
msgstr "I see you inside a sacred icon.{line_break}By listening to the voices,{line_break}you will earn a precious item.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07619"
msgstr "You must forge a weapon to{line_break}defeat a mortal enemy.{line_break}Seek out the pieces!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07620"
msgstr "You will raise a mighty column{line_break}and gain assistance where it{line_break}is least expected.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07621"
msgstr "You will gain tremendous help{line_break}from a village on the eastern{line_break}reaches of the northern lands.{page_break}Seek them out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07622"
msgstr "You have the weapon you{line_break}need to defeat the sea beast.{page_break}Go to the sea of mists{line_break}and face your foe!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07623"
msgstr "The object that you seek lies{line_break}somewhere in the west.{page_break}Why do you linger in the{line_break}eastern world? If your work is{line_break}done, the west beckons you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07624"
msgstr "The object you have placed{line_break}before me wields a mighty{line_break}power over a terrible foe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07625"
msgstr "Near the beach where you{line_break}washed ashore lie ancient{line_break}ruins. Seek them out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07626"
msgstr "In the northern reaches of{line_break}the Eastern Sea lie moss-{line_break}covered, overgrown ruins.{page_break}You should explore them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07627"
msgstr "In the distant south lies an icy{line_break}cape. Above the rocky shore{line_break}stands a tower. Climb it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07628"
msgstr "You have the weapon you{line_break}need in many fragments..{page_break}Bring them to the people at{line_break}the eastern edge of the{line_break}northern continent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07629"
msgstr "That object you have placed{line_break}before me... It is a fearsome{line_break}weapon to a particular beast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07630"
msgstr "If you wield this weapon, you{line_break}can defeat the legendary beast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07631"
msgstr "But there are no more beasts{line_break}for you to fear in this part{line_break}of the world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07632"
msgstr "From the garb you have{line_break}placed before me, I sense the{line_break}presence of the one you await.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07633"
msgstr "To the east lies a continent{line_break}moved from its foundation. The{line_break}one you seek waits in the wood.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07634"
msgstr "To the north...inside the sacred{line_break}icon, the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07635"
msgstr "To the north...beneath the{line_break}sacred icon...the one you{line_break}seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07636"
msgstr "Head east by southeast... In a{line_break}cave on the southernmost{line_break}continent in the Eastern Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07637"
msgstr "Head east by northeast... In a{line_break}cave on a tiny islet, the{line_break}one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07638"
msgstr "Head north by northwest... In a{line_break}forest on the northernmost{line_break}continent in the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07639"
msgstr "To the northwest...in the ruins{line_break}on the southern continent{line_break}in the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07640"
msgstr "Head west by northwest... In an{line_break}inlet on the southern continent{line_break}in the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07641"
msgstr "To the north...in the village{line_break}that knows no spring...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07642"
msgstr "Head east by southeast... In{line_break}the desert on the southern{line_break}land in the Eastern Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07643"
msgstr "Head east by northeast... In a{line_break}cave on the continent that{line_break}shifted from its foundations...{page_break}The one you seek awaits...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07644"
msgstr "To the southeast...in the{line_break}plains of the southern continent{line_break}in the Eastern Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07645"
msgstr "To the south...in the forest...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07646"
msgstr "To the east...beside the{line_break}boulder on the tiny islet...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07647"
msgstr "Head east by northeast...{line_break}...In the town envolped in mist...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07648"
msgstr "To the north...somewhere{line_break}on a small island...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07649"
msgstr "Head north by northwest...{line_break}In a cave on the northern{line_break}continent in the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07650"
msgstr "To the north... In ruins chilled{line_break}by icy winds...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07651"
msgstr "Head east by northeast... In a{line_break}cave on a tiny islet...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07652"
msgstr "To the east...in the mountain{line_break}paths on the continent that{line_break}shifted from its foundations...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07653"
msgstr "To the southeast...in a village{line_break}lulled by the bleating of sheep,{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07654"
msgstr "Head south by southeast... On{line_break}the cliffs of a continent that{line_break}shifted from its foundations...{page_break}The one you seek awaits...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07655"
msgstr "Head east by southeast... In{line_break}a town on a continent that{line_break}shifted from its foundation...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07656"
msgstr "Head east by northeast... On the{line_break}island where the sun rises...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07657"
msgstr "Head south by southeast... In the{line_break}ruins on the island of winter...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07658"
msgstr "To the northwest...in the{line_break}forest on the southern{line_break}island in the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07659"
msgstr "To the northwest...along the{line_break}coast of the northern{line_break}continent of the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07660"
msgstr "To the northwest...beside the{line_break}ruins on the southern continent{line_break}in the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07661"
msgstr "Head north by northwest...{line_break}At the great rock on this{line_break}continent...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07662"
msgstr "To the north...in the ruins{line_break}chilled by icy winds...{line_break}the one you seek awaits...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07663"
msgstr "Head east by northeast... In a{line_break}cave on the continent that{line_break}shifted from its foundations...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07664"
msgstr "Head east by southeast... In the{line_break}desert on the southern land...{line_break}the one you seek awaits...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07665"
msgstr "Head east by southeast... In a{line_break}cave on the southern continent{line_break}in the Eastern Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07666"
msgstr "To the north...in the mountain{line_break}paths of this continent...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07667"
msgstr "To the east... Somewhere{line_break}on a tiny islet...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07668"
msgstr "To the east... In the forest{line_break}on the isle of winter...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07669"
msgstr "Head north by northwest...{line_break}In a village on the northern{line_break}continent in the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07670"
msgstr "In the northwest...in the ruins{line_break}on the southern continent in{line_break}the Western Sea...{page_break}The one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07671"
msgstr "Head north by northwest... Near{line_break}the spring before the rugged{line_break}path...the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07672"
msgstr "To the north...in the ruins{line_break}lying in the village...{line_break}the one you seek awaits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07673"
msgstr "Head north by northeast... On{line_break}the island where the treasure{line_break}lies...the one you seek awaits...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07674"
msgstr "In the item you have placed{line_break}before me, I can see nothing{line_break}of the future...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07675"
msgstr "My father is a fortune-teller,{line_break}not a witch doctor.{page_break}There are a great many{line_break}differences between him{line_break}and Akafubu of Kibombo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07676"
msgstr "By painting our bodies, we{line_break}bring about good luck.{line_break}You should try it, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07677"
msgstr "The items that one carries are{line_break}filled with one's hopes and{line_break}desires.{page_break}I can sense these desires,{line_break}and I can see answers{line_break}hidden within them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07678"
msgstr "My father may not be a witch{line_break}doctor, but he could easily{line_break}defeat Akafubu.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07679"
msgstr "Body painting also protects{line_break}us from the magic of the{line_break}witch doctor, or so I'm told.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07680"
msgstr "If you are burdened with many{line_break}concerns, take a weapon{line_break}to the fortune-teller.{page_break}He can read your future{line_break}by studying the weapons{line_break}that you carry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07681"
msgstr "I can look at any weapon and{line_break}see the monsters it faced,{line_break}but I cannot read its future.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07682"
msgstr "You should visit the fortune-{line_break}teller while you are in our{line_break}village.{page_break}By looking at the items you{line_break}possess, he can see what it{line_break}is that troubles you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07683"
msgstr "Whenever I get my fortune{line_break}read, I offer up some armor.{page_break}I think this might be why{line_break}I find so many rare and{line_break}valuable artifacts.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07684"
msgstr "No one can see the future.{line_break}Absolutely no one. Except{line_break}for our fortune-teller.{page_break}Just by looking at your{line_break}items, he can see the path{line_break}you're meant to follow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07685"
msgstr "Even if I wanted my fortune{line_break}told, I don't have any armor{line_break}or weapons to show him.{page_break}If he were only willing to{line_break}look at other items, I'm sure{line_break}he'd get more business.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07686"
msgstr "If you like adventure, you{line_break}should head out west{line_break}across the river...{page_break}Oh, wait... With all the rain{line_break}we've had lately, the river is{line_break}probably too deep to cross.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07687"
msgstr "Our cooking is famous all{line_break}across Gondowan.{page_break}If you find you like it,{line_break}come back soon! We change{line_break}our menu every season.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07688"
msgstr "The river is probably very{line_break}dangerous right now.{page_break}It's filled with monsters{line_break}when the waters are{line_break}running high.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07689"
msgstr "Our spices are our secret.{line_break}Everyone loves spicy food,{line_break}even if they regret it later.{page_break}And I'll thump the first{line_break}person that tries to tell{line_break}me otherwise!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07690"
msgstr "!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07691"
msgstr "I am but a humble pilgrim,{line_break}serving the greater good{line_break}in the heart of Gondowan.{page_break}Travelers should know that{line_break}even in this wild land, aid{line_break}is not far off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07692"
msgstr "Anywhere I can do some{line_break}good, I will serve without{line_break}complaint.{page_break}Although...it would be nice if{line_break}it were a little cooler here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07693"
msgstr "Don't tell me you just came{line_break}back from Kibombo!{page_break}You must be really brave{line_break}to have made it there and{line_break}back again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07694"
msgstr "I didn't see any Kibombo{line_break}soldiers in the mountain{line_break}pass... Where did they go?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07695"
msgstr "I saw smoke rising from{line_break}Kibombo... Were they having{line_break}a bonfire or something?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07696"
msgstr "Some soldiers came through{line_break}here looking for a guy{line_break}named {actor_name:8}.{page_break}They looked unhappy that{line_break}I'd never heard of him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07697"
msgstr "The smoke coming from{line_break}the Kibombo Mountains is{line_break}coming from a signal fire.{page_break}The signals are hard to read,{line_break}though. Whoever's sending{line_break}them isn't terribly good at it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07698"
msgstr "The fortune-teller predicted{line_break}that the Kibombo will settle{line_break}down for a time...{page_break}I hope for all of our sakes{line_break}that he's right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07699"
msgstr "A man came through a while{line_break}ago. He said he was going{line_break}to Kibombo.{page_break}He hasn't come back yet.{line_break}I think the guards in the{line_break}mountains caught him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07700"
msgstr "I mentioned Magma Rock{line_break}to a traveler the other day,{line_break}and he was very intrigued.{page_break}I can't be sure, but I think{line_break}he might have headed in{line_break}that direction.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07701"
msgstr "Who would travel to{line_break}Kibombo right now? It's{line_break}not very safe right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07702"
msgstr "I'm so glad the Kibombo{line_break}aren't lurking over us in{line_break}the hills anymore...{page_break}They were here, they{line_break}were there, they were{line_break}everywhere!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07703"
msgstr "That smoke's been rising from{line_break}Kibombo for a while... I doubt{line_break}it's just a fire...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07704"
msgstr "What kind of a name is{line_break}{actor_name:8}. An odd one, certainly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07705"
msgstr "The signals say something{line_break}has...ended? Or maybe has{line_break}been chosen?{page_break}It's so hard to figure out...{line_break}I wish they were a little{line_break}better at smoke signals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07706"
msgstr "The fortune-teller has never{line_break}been wrong...{page_break}But I can't imagine that{line_break}the Kibombo would ever{line_break}really calm down.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07707"
msgstr "If the man they were looking{line_break}for has gone to Kibombo,{line_break}they're better off waiting.{page_break}Kibombo is a dangerous{line_break}place for outsiders right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07708"
msgstr "I don't think anyone can{line_break}reach Magma Rock now.{line_break}The river is too deep.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07709"
msgstr "Ouch... Some big brute came{line_break}through here looking for a{line_break}woman named Menardi.{page_break}I told him I'd never heard of{line_break}her, and he shoved me to the{line_break}ground and stormed off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07710"
msgstr "What has gone wrong with{line_break}the world? People have no{line_break}respect for their elders!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07711"
msgstr "I guess those warriors learned{line_break}much about their future from{line_break}the fortune-teller.{page_break}You should do the same.{line_break}Bring your items to him,{line_break}just as they did.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07712"
msgstr "Our fortune-teller has been{line_break}saying some horrible things{line_break}lately.{page_break}He's been telling everyone{line_break}that \"our peace shall soon{line_break}sleep.\" It's not very comforting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07713"
msgstr "The power of the fortune-teller{line_break}is great. Anyone who listens to{line_break}his advice benefits greatly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07714"
msgstr "The fortune-teller said that the{line_break}power of nature would rekindle{line_break}the advance of civilization.{page_break}But which is better, an{line_break}advanced civilization, or{line_break}a peaceful one?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07715"
msgstr "If trouble resides in your{line_break}heart, I suggest you speak{line_break}with my father.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07716"
msgstr "Reading fortunes in people's{line_break}items takes a lot of energy, so{line_break}he's not always willing to do it.{page_break}But if you have 20 coins on{line_break}you, he might be a little more{line_break}willing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07717"
msgstr "Items placed before me are filled{line_break}with the desires of those{line_break}who place them there.{page_break}If I can sense those desires, I{line_break}can answer that which they seek.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07718"
msgstr "Father should charge{line_break}more for his readings.{page_break}People profit from what he{line_break}tells them. Why shouldn't{line_break}he profit from telling them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07719"
msgstr "After Father's been reading{line_break}all day, he sleeps like a baby.{line_break}A really loud, snoring baby.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07720"
msgstr "Whenever I get customers{line_break}from out of town, I always{line_break}tell them the same thing...{page_break}\"The fortune-teller sees all.\"{line_break}Nobody can resist trying{line_break}it at least once.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07721"
msgstr "When I look at weapons, I{line_break}can instantly tell what{line_break}monsters they have fought.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07722"
msgstr "If you wish to know anything,{line_break}go to the fortune-teller. He's{line_break}fast, accurate, and affordable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07723"
msgstr "I like offering armor to the{line_break}fortune-teller. It usually{line_break}gets me good results.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07724"
msgstr "Strangers to our town{line_break}would do well to visit the{line_break}fortune-teller's hut.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07725"
msgstr "Those who become lost should{line_break}offer the fortune-teller one{line_break}of their hard-earned items.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07726"
msgstr "If {actor_name:8} is traveling{line_break}in your group, please give{line_break}him this message:{page_break}{actor_name:1} and his companions{line_break}would like to speak{line_break}with him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07727"
msgstr "I see so many travelers...{line_break}How am I supposed to{line_break}remember who {actor_name:8} is?{page_break}And why would anyone come{line_break}all the way to Gondowan to{line_break}find him? What does {actor_name:1} want?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07728"
msgstr "He paid me a lot of money{line_break}to pass this message on, but{line_break}how would he know if I didn't?{page_break}Ah, I'm too honest for my own{line_break}good. I'll keep passing {actor_name:1}'s{line_break}message on to my guests.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07729"
msgstr "Why would {actor_name:1} travel{line_break}all this way in search of a{line_break}man he has never met?{page_break}What could it be that drives{line_break}him to look for this{line_break}{actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07730"
msgstr "!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07731"
msgstr "It's strange. As hot as it is{line_break}here in Gondowan, if you head{line_break}south, it's bitter cold...{page_break}The land of Tundaria is{line_break}a frozen wasteland that{line_break}deserves its name.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07732"
msgstr "The cold of Tundaria stifles{line_break}virtually all living things.{page_break}Compared to that barren land,{line_break}Gondowan's heat is comforting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07733"
msgstr "Akafubu's ceremony is set to{line_break}begin soon. I wonder if he'll{line_break}succeed this time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07734"
msgstr "During the last ceremony,{line_break}Akafubu made the jewel{line_break}float in the air...{page_break}But the mouth of the Great{line_break}Gabomba did not open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07735"
msgstr "I'm afraid of what Akafubu{line_break}will do if he fails the{line_break}ceremony a second time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07736"
msgstr "During the last ceremony,{line_break}the Great Gabomba didn't{line_break}move. It just stared silently.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07737"
msgstr "It's strange that Akafubu{line_break}decided to try again tonight.{line_break}What bolstered his confidence?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07738"
msgstr "The Great Gabomba is{line_break}supposed to open his{line_break}mouth if Akafubu is worthy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07739"
msgstr "When he fails the ceremony,{line_break}Akafubu gets so angry...{page_break}I hope he doesn't turn his{line_break}anger on to me... I'm afraid{line_break}of his powerful magic.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07740"
msgstr "It would be great to see the{line_break}Gabomba open its mouth. Please,{line_break}Akafubu... Do it right this time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07741"
msgstr "I hope the Great Gabomba is{line_break}satisfied by Akafubu's jewel{line_break}and opens his mouth this time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07742"
msgstr "Is making the jewel float{line_break}with the power of his mind{line_break}all there is to it?{page_break}I would have thought a ceremony{line_break}like this would have required{line_break}a little more effort.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07743"
msgstr "Rumor has it that after failing the{line_break}last time, Akafubu sat alone in{line_break}the shadows, crying to himself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07744"
msgstr "When the Gabomba is angered,{line_break}his eyes glow with rage and{line_break}fire shoots out of his mouth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07745"
msgstr "If the Great Gabomba opens{line_break}his mouth, he will have{line_break}acknowledged Akafubu's power.{page_break}When the Great Gabomba{line_break}accepts the jewel,{line_break}the door will open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07746"
msgstr "He's failed so many times{line_break}already...{page_break}Won't the same thing happen{line_break}again if he tries it another time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07747"
msgstr "As Oeia's disciple, Akafubu{line_break}had a bad reputation for always{line_break}crying and complaining.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07748"
msgstr "I hope Akafubu hasn't angered{line_break}the Great Gabomba. I would be{line_break}sorry to see him die like that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07749"
msgstr "I think Akafubu will speak of the{line_break}great witch doctor Oeia's fate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07750"
msgstr "Akafubu was a good man{line_break}when he was training with{line_break}Oeia...{page_break}After Oeia died, Akafubu was{line_break}simply no longer the same.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07751"
msgstr "Akafubu looks really confident{line_break}tonight. I think he just might{line_break}succeed this time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07752"
msgstr "If the Great Gabomba likes{line_break}the jewel, his mouth will open{line_break}and his tongue will stick out.{page_break}It sounds weird, but it's a{line_break}sign that the Gabomba{line_break}accepts the offering.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07753"
msgstr "Akafubu is so different{line_break}from Oeia, so impatient.{page_break}Why did Oeia have to{line_break}leave us so suddenly?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07754"
msgstr "Akafubu has not yet attained{line_break}the magical skill that Oeia{line_break}possessed...{page_break}I worry for our future if{line_break}Akafubu's character is as{line_break}weak as his magic.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07755"
msgstr "He travels to Madra and returns{line_break}with a stolen gem, and now he{line_break}expects us to call him a hero?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07756"
msgstr "If the Great Gabomba actually{line_break}moves and sticks out his tongue...{line_break}I might just faint!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07757"
msgstr "Akafubu has tried this before,{line_break}but he has always failed.{page_break}Tonight is different, though. With{line_break}this new gem, he may succeed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07758"
msgstr "Hey, no pushing! You're not{line_break}going to get any closer, with{line_break}all these people packed in here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07759"
msgstr "The heat is terrible tonight...{line_break}Of course, it's not so much the{line_break}heat as it is the humidity...{page_break}At this point, I don't care if{line_break}Akafubu ever succeeds, just{line_break}so long as he's quick about it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07760"
msgstr "My grandfather spoke of a time{line_break}when the Gabomba was so{line_break}angry that its eyes popped out!{page_break}After that, he says, nothing good{line_break}ever happened in Kibombo.{line_break}Nothing. It was a bad omen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07761"
msgstr "As a child, Akafubu was every{line_break}bit as horrible. He always cried{line_break}when he had to share his toys.{page_break}When he was good, he was{line_break}very, very good...but when{line_break}he was bad, he was AWFUL.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07762"
msgstr "There are so many people here!{line_break}If I want to see the ceremony,{line_break}I'll have to climb the posts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07763"
msgstr "If Akafubu hopes to become{line_break}our witch doctor, he'll have{line_break}to enter the Great Gabomba.{page_break}He's a slow child... It'll take him{line_break}a while, I can tell.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07764"
msgstr "I wonder what Oeia did to{line_break}make the Great Gabomba's{line_break}eyes pop out...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07765"
msgstr "Akafubu is attempting the{line_break}ceremony again tonight.{page_break}Oeia performed the same{line_break}ceremony with no problems.{line_break}What's holding Akafubu back?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07766"
msgstr "Akafubu seems perturbed{line_break}lately. I think his failures are{line_break}weighing heavily on him.{page_break}He seems pompous, but it's{line_break}only his lack of confidence{line_break}showing through.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07767"
msgstr "He who is the witch doctor of{line_break}Kibombo holds the most revered{line_break}office in our whole town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07768"
msgstr "Oeia's sudden death brought{line_break}pressure and responsibility on{line_break}Akafubu, well before his time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07769"
msgstr "Oeia was a great witch doctor{line_break}and a compassionate leader.{page_break}Poor Akafubu... He may be a good{line_break}man, but he will never match Oeia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07770"
msgstr "Once, these ceremonies were{line_break}guided by both the witch doctor{line_break}and his apprentice.{page_break}Akafubu is little more than an{line_break}apprentice himself... It's no{line_break}surprise that he struggles so.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07771"
msgstr "If only Oeia had taught his{line_break}magic to someone else...{page_break}If he had another pupil, this{line_break}would go more easily on poor{line_break}Akafubu. He would not be alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07772"
msgstr "I wonder if Akafubu even wanted{line_break}to study magic or to become{line_break}Oeia's sucessor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07773"
msgstr "Akafubu blames his failures{line_break}on the jewel he originally used.{line_break}He claims it was no good.{page_break}That's why he led a team of{line_break}soldiers to find a new one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07774"
msgstr "Akafubu used his abilities to see{line_break}the future. That's how he knew{line_break}to find the jewel in Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07775"
msgstr "If the Great Gabomba's mouth{line_break}doesn't open, Akafubu must not{line_break}yet be a true witch doctor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07776"
msgstr "I wonder what will happen tonight.{line_break}I'm so anxious, I can't stand it.{line_break}When will everything start?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07777"
msgstr "They attacked some town{line_break}to get the jewel he needed.{line_break}I hope no one was injured.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07778"
msgstr "I wonder how accurate Akafubu's{line_break}predictions are...{page_break}I mean, if he were any good,{line_break}shouldn't he be able to predict{line_break}the outcome of this ceremony?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07779"
msgstr "I feel so much excitement...{line_break}At last, will the Great Gabomba{line_break}recognize Akafubu's strength?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07780"
msgstr "I can't explain it, but I have a{line_break}feeling that, tonight, Akafubu's{line_break}ceremony will be different.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07781"
msgstr "At last, the sacred night{line_break}has come!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07782"
msgstr "Tonight, Akafubu becomes the{line_break}Kibombo's new witch doctor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07783"
msgstr "All of you, pray in the{line_break}depths of your hearts{line_break}for my success!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07784"
msgstr "It looks like the initiation{line_break}ceremony is beginning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07785"
msgstr "I'm not sure what will happen,{line_break}but we'd better hurry, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07786"
msgstr "Wh-Who are you?!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07787"
msgstr "What... What are your intentions?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07788"
msgstr "It looks like {actor_name:8} has{line_break}already forgotten us, huh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07789"
msgstr "I know! We met {actor_name:8} when{line_break}he was in JAIL! And it's not like{line_break}he had lots of visitors, either!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07790"
msgstr "What, is he so obsessed with{line_break}his black orb that he can't{line_break}even remember us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07791"
msgstr "Wait a second... I know you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07792"
msgstr "You're the travelers who came{line_break}seeking me when I was in jail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07793"
msgstr "So, you {text_effect:2}do{reset_text_style} remember!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07794"
msgstr "What are you doing{line_break}in this place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07795"
msgstr "Actually, that's what we{line_break}wanted to ask you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07796"
msgstr "We were worried about you,{line_break}{actor_name:8}, so we followed{line_break}you here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07797"
msgstr "And that's what brings you{line_break}to this dangerous place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07798"
msgstr "What's that supposed to mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07799"
msgstr "We came here to help you,{line_break}{actor_name:8}. Why are you being{line_break}like that about it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07800"
msgstr "Tell me something...{line_break}Exactly when did I ask{line_break}you for your help?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07801"
msgstr "SILENCE!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07802"
msgstr "I shall now present our jewel{line_break}to the Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07803"
msgstr "!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07804"
msgstr "O Great Gabomba!{line_break}Please accept this,{line_break}our humble gift!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07805"
msgstr "Please, Great Gabomba!{line_break}Accept this jewel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07806"
msgstr "Look! The Great Gabomba has{line_break}noticed the light of the jewel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07807"
msgstr "Why, Great Gabomba?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07808"
msgstr "Your prayers were weak!{line_break}Open your hearts to the{line_break}Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07809"
msgstr "Sing your praises and dance for{line_break}the Great Gabomba until your{line_break}prayers reach his ears!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07810"
msgstr "Akafubu is no witch doctor!{line_break}He's an Adept!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07811"
msgstr "I may have to confront{line_break}him to get my orb back...{line_break}I may have to fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07812"
msgstr "I will do whatever it takes,{line_break}but I will have my black{line_break}orb back again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07813"
msgstr "It's no use. We can't get to{line_break}Akafubu from here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07814"
msgstr "This won't work, either...{line_break}What are we going to do?{line_break}We can't get over there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07815"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}'s in trouble.{line_break}Shouldn't we try to help him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07816"
msgstr "Maybe if we could do something{line_break}about that stump, we could reach{line_break}the backside of Gabomba.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07817"
msgstr "We've got to help {actor_name:8}.{line_break}Right, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07818"
msgstr "Then hop to it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07819"
msgstr "What's all this now, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Is it too much to ask that you{line_break}help {actor_name:8} in his time of need?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07820"
msgstr "He seems to believe{line_break}we are enemies...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07821"
msgstr "I hope he doesn't think{line_break}we're with the Kibombo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07822"
msgstr "I must admit, you don't{line_break}look much like Kibombo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07823"
msgstr "But that begs the question, if{line_break}you're not Kibombo, then who are{line_break}you, and why have you come here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07824"
msgstr "They are...warriors.{line_break}But how did you{line_break}get in here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07825"
msgstr "Why are these warriors{line_break}in a place like this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07826"
msgstr "I'm not sure how to answer that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07827"
msgstr "Actually, we've been looking for{line_break}a boat... We kinda need one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07828"
msgstr "You're looking for a boat...{line_break}in the middle of the continent?{line_break}That seems like a bad idea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07829"
msgstr "Hey, this wasn't exactly{line_break}our first choice, you know?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07830"
msgstr "A tidal wave destroyed all the{line_break}boats in the coastal towns.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07831"
msgstr "You're asking me to believe{line_break}rather a lot, don't you think?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07832"
msgstr "SILENCE!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07833"
msgstr "I shall now present our jewel{line_break}to the Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07834"
msgstr "!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07835"
msgstr "O Great Gabomba!{line_break}Please accept this,{line_break}our humble gift!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07836"
msgstr "Please, Great Gabomba!{line_break}Accept this jewel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07837"
msgstr "Look! The Great Gabomba has{line_break}noticed the light of the jewel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07838"
msgstr "Gabomba, why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07839"
msgstr "Your prayers were weak!{line_break}Open your hearts to the{line_break}Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07840"
msgstr "Sing your praises and dance for{line_break}the Great Gabomba until your{line_break}prayers reach his ears!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07841"
msgstr "Akafubu is no witch doctor!{line_break}He's an Adept!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07842"
msgstr "I may have to confront{line_break}him to get my orb back...{line_break}I may have to fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07843"
msgstr "I will do whatever it takes,{line_break}but I will have my black{line_break}orb back again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07844"
msgstr "It's no use. We can't get to{line_break}Akafubu from here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07845"
msgstr "This won't work, either...{line_break}What are we going to do?{line_break}We can't get over there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07846"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}'s in trouble.{line_break}Shouldn't we try to help him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07847"
msgstr "Maybe if we could do something{line_break}about that stump, we could reach{line_break}the backside of Gabomba.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07848"
msgstr "We've got to help {actor_name:8}.{line_break}Right, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07849"
msgstr "Then hop to it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07850"
msgstr "What's all this now, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Is it too much to ask that you{line_break}help {actor_name:8} in his time of need?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07851"
msgstr "Well, if you're going to help him,{line_break}you'd better do something about{line_break}the stump blocking the path...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07852"
msgstr "The orb is right before me,{line_break}and yet I cannot reach it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07853"
msgstr "I am certain I just sensed the{line_break}power of Psynergy, but that{line_break}can't possibly be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07854"
msgstr "?!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07855"
msgstr "That power... Was that{line_break}Psynergy?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07856"
msgstr "I knew it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07857"
msgstr "Please, don't try to complicate{line_break}things by lying... It must have{line_break}been Psynergy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07858"
msgstr "I should have spotted it at once!{line_break}You're Adepts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07859"
msgstr "Wait, so does that mean you're°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07860"
msgstr "Yes, my name is {actor_name:8},{line_break}and I too am an Adept.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07861"
msgstr "To be honest, everyone in{line_break}Lemuria is an Adept, and{line_break}not just me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07862"
msgstr "What's Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07863"
msgstr "Lemuria is an island that lies{line_break}in the center of the Eastern Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07864"
msgstr "Wait a second... You said Lemuria?{line_break}I've heard that name before...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07865"
msgstr "Of course! It was Lord Babi!{line_break}He often spoke to me of Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07866"
msgstr "He said it was so advanced that{line_break}we can scarcely begin to imagine{line_break}what it must have been like...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07867"
msgstr "You are correct. My home was and{line_break}is all that you say. Whoever told{line_break}you this knows much of Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07868"
msgstr "But wait, if it's so far away in{line_break}the middle of the ocean, how come{line_break}anyone knows so much about it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07869"
msgstr "It is not easily reached, and{line_break}we Lemurians seldom leave...{page_break}I cannot imagine how anyone{line_break}could have learned anything at{line_break}all about us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07870"
msgstr "Except... Hold on a moment...{line_break}Babi... I've heard that name{line_break}somewhere before...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07871"
msgstr "Well, yeah... Everyone knows{line_break}about Lord Babi... He's the ruler{line_break}of Tolbi...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07872"
msgstr "I've never heard of Tolbi. Until{line_break}recently, I had never left my{line_break}home of Lemuria...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07873"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, are you just{line_break}playing games with us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07874"
msgstr "Don't be foolish. What would{line_break}I gain from lying to you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07875"
msgstr "I'm being quite serious.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07876"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} is not playing{line_break}games, {actor_name:6}. You can{line_break}trust him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07877"
msgstr "Thank you for believing{line_break}me, master sage!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07878"
msgstr "Please, call me Kraden,{line_break}{actor_name:8} of Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07879"
msgstr "And I am the one who should{line_break}be thanking you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07880"
msgstr "You look puzzled, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}You are probably wondering{line_break}what I'm talking about...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07881"
msgstr "Oh, good! Then I probably{line_break}don't need to tell you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07882"
msgstr "Wait, just because my brother{line_break}knows what you're talking about{line_break}doesn't mean we do! Tell us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07883"
msgstr "I thought as much...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07884"
msgstr "If what Babi told me is true,{line_break}Lemuria is all that remains of{line_break}a once great civilization.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07885"
msgstr "Your friend is correct.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07886"
msgstr "In fact, the reason I was sent to{line_break}Vale was somewhat related to my{line_break}inability to find Lemuria itself...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07887"
msgstr "I don't understand... What was{line_break}in Vale that had anything to{line_break}do with Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07888"
msgstr "Babi believed that, in Lemuria{line_break}alone, the power of Alchemy{line_break}remains unbound.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07889"
msgstr "Lord Babi had need of Lemuria's{line_break}Alchemy, but despite our effort,{line_break}we could not find the lost city.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07890"
msgstr "Since we could not find Lemuria,{line_break}Lord Babi sent me to unlock the{line_break}secrets of Alchemy myself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07891"
msgstr "Ah, yes! Babi! If I recall correctly,{line_break}a man named Babi came to{line_break}Lemuria long ago...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07892"
msgstr "He stole one of our ships{line_break}and fled the isle...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07893"
msgstr "Yes! That must indeed be the{line_break}same Lord Babi who know{line_break}leads the people of Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07894"
msgstr "Now, I'm even more confused.{line_break}This is making my head hurt...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07895"
msgstr "I mean, if Babi really stole a ship{line_break}from your home, why would he be{line_break}trying so hard to find it again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07896"
msgstr "I can't expect you to understand,{line_break}my dear. Lord Babi's reasons for{line_break}finding Lemuria are...complex.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07897"
msgstr "But if he already found Lemuria{line_break}once, why doesn't he just go{line_break}back the same way?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07898"
msgstr "Once you have left Lemuria,{line_break}finding it again is quite difficult,{line_break}even if you know where to look.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07899"
msgstr "Well...why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07900"
msgstr "The waters around Lemuria are{line_break}wrapped in a perpetual fog...{line_break}It is very difficult to navigate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07901"
msgstr "I remember Lord Babi once{line_break}saying something to that effect.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07902"
msgstr "Even if one locates Lemuria,{line_break}getting through the fog itself{line_break}remains quite a challenge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07903"
msgstr "I don't get it... Why can't you{line_break}just sail straight through it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07904"
msgstr "The ocean currents around{line_break}Lemuria are swift and{line_break}treacherous...{page_break}Only one who can sail{line_break}a Lemurian ship can{line_break}complete the journey.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07905"
msgstr "But...Babi stole a Lemurian ship{line_break}from you, right? That means that{line_break}he can sail it...{page_break}You said yourself that he used{line_break}it to flee the island!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07906"
msgstr "Unfortunately, Babi was the only{line_break}one of us who could use the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07907"
msgstr "You see, Lemurian ships can only{line_break}be helmed by Adepts...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07908"
msgstr "Which is why I have to get my{line_break}black orb back! I must be able{line_break}to captain my ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07909"
msgstr "There may be something up{line_break}ahead on this path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07910"
msgstr "Then let's go...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07911"
msgstr "Wait a moment, {actor_name:8}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07912"
msgstr "We want to help you{line_break}get your orb back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07913"
msgstr "You intend to help{line_break}me, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07914"
msgstr "I am on this quest for many{line_break}reasons...one of them being{line_break}that I wish to see Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07915"
msgstr "If you would allow me, that is...{line_break}I'd like to visit Lemuria myself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07916"
msgstr "If this is something you would do{line_break}for Babi, then I cannot permit it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07917"
msgstr "What? Why not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07918"
msgstr "Babi is a thief. He is not{line_break}well loved in Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07919"
msgstr "It is partially on behalf of Babi...{line_break}...but there's more to it than that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07920"
msgstr "I want to go to Lemuria so{line_break}that I can see the full power{line_break}of Alchemy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07921"
msgstr "I want to aid {actor_name:8} so that{line_break}he will take us to Lemuria...{line_break}What do you say, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07922"
msgstr "You'll do it!?{line_break}Splendid!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07923"
msgstr "Why, {actor_name:5}? Why?{line_break}Please, we simply have to!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07924"
msgstr "What's the matter with you,{line_break}{actor_name:5}? I don't see why{line_break}we can't help {actor_name:8}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07925"
msgstr "Yeah. I'm with {actor_name:6}{line_break}on this one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07926"
msgstr "I appreciate your offer,{line_break}but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07927"
msgstr "I understand, {actor_name:8}...{line_break}You're not sure if you'll be able{line_break}to take us to Lemuria, is that it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07928"
msgstr "Can't we talk about this later?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07929"
msgstr "Yes, yes, of course! For now,{line_break}let's just get that orb back{line_break}for {actor_name:8}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07930"
msgstr "Now that I know the orb is here,{line_break}I won't leave this village without{line_break}it! I will go alone if I must!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07931"
msgstr "You've come to help me get my{line_break}orb back? Thank you, all of you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07932"
msgstr "Oh... Oh my... I've heard of{line_break}ceremonies like these... Foreign{line_break}deities are so frightening...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07933"
msgstr "Hmm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07934"
msgstr "So, the ceremony is finally{line_break}over. Well! Isn't that...nice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07935"
msgstr "I wonder if a man in my{line_break}position should really be{line_break}in a place like this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07936"
msgstr "It's a dead end...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07937"
msgstr "But this was the only path...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07938"
msgstr "Isn't it a little strange that{line_break}there would be a path that{line_break}just goes nowhere like this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07939"
msgstr "Hmm...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07940"
msgstr "I see...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07941"
msgstr "So that's how it works...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07942"
msgstr "Listen up, {actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07943"
msgstr "Dig there!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07944"
msgstr "Don't worry. Just use Scoop...{line_break}You'll see why in just a{line_break}few seconds...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07945"
msgstr "I see...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07946"
msgstr "What's this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07947"
msgstr "Someone has put something{line_break}in the ground here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07948"
msgstr "And this statue...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07949"
msgstr "Well, take a look...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07950"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! Try using Scoop{line_break}around there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07951"
msgstr "Ah... I thought so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07952"
msgstr "You thought what?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07953"
msgstr "These marks are here to{line_break}indicate an entrance there,{line_break}in the center of the design...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07954"
msgstr "You mean we can go{line_break}inside this statue?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07955"
msgstr "You could at one point...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07956"
msgstr "The entrance was probably{line_break}beneath that stone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07957"
msgstr "I wonder... Was this the only one?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07958"
msgstr "It seems that way...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07959"
msgstr "Man, if this was the only entrance,{line_break}then I feel bad for the people{line_break}who built this statue.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07960"
msgstr "Why is that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07961"
msgstr "Well, if this is the only hole,{line_break}then there's no way for air to{line_break}get in or out...{page_break}It must have been really{line_break}hot when they were working{line_break}in there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07962"
msgstr "I...hadn't even thought of that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07963"
msgstr "We must inspect this area{line_break}carefully, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07964"
msgstr "{actor_name:6} has raised{line_break}an interesting point...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07965"
msgstr "If people did indeed build this,{line_break}they would not have been able{line_break}to do it without an air supply.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07966"
msgstr "They might have opened a vent{line_break}somewhere nearby.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07967"
msgstr "And if so, then there may have{line_break}been a ladder to enter the vent.{line_break}We should try to find it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07968"
msgstr "Kraden, there doesn't seem{line_break}to be anything of the sort here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07969"
msgstr "What were we just looking at?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07970"
msgstr "If there is a vent shaft, it{line_break}would probably be quite old,{line_break}maybe even buried...{page_break}Exactly like those marks we{line_break}just uncovered!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07971"
msgstr "And if that's the case, we{line_break}should search more thoroughly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07972"
msgstr "OK, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07973"
msgstr "Focus your energies!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07974"
msgstr "Everyone! Look over here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07975"
msgstr "Let us now present our jewel{line_break}to the Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07976"
msgstr "O Great Gabomba!{line_break}Please accept this,{line_break}our humble gift!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07977"
msgstr "Please, Great Gabomba!{line_break}Accept this jewel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07978"
msgstr "Look! The Great Gabomba has{line_break}noticed the light of the jewel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07979"
msgstr "You are still not pleased?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07980"
msgstr "No! This time, he seemed{line_break}almost like he might...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07981"
msgstr "We must continue!{line_break}Drums! More drums!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07982"
msgstr "Ah! So that's how it works!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07983"
msgstr "He's been failing because{line_break}the conduit that channels{line_break}his Psynergy is broken.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07984"
msgstr "Should we reconnect the{line_break}conduit so he can complete{line_break}the ceremony?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07985"
msgstr "I won't help them, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}They're the ones who stole my{line_break}orb from the Madrans!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07986"
msgstr "I agree, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}Why should we help this{line_break}pack of thieves?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07987"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, I understand that{line_break}you're angry at them, but it really{line_break}is in our best interest to help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07988"
msgstr "Think about it, {actor_name:8}...{line_break}Akafubu stole the orb solely to{line_break}perform this ceremony...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07989"
msgstr "So, what do you think he{line_break}intends to do with the orb?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07990"
msgstr "He means to give it to{line_break}the Great Gabomba...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07991"
msgstr "Oh! So...if his ceremony succeeds,{line_break}the orb will be taken into the{line_break}statue...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07992"
msgstr "And we're INSIDE the statue!{line_break}If the ceremony succeeds,{line_break}we can go find the orb!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07993"
msgstr "I...don't want to help{line_break}that Akafubu, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07994"
msgstr "I don't like the idea of helping{line_break}him any more than you do, but{line_break}if we can end this without a fight...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07995"
msgstr "You're right, {actor_name:7}. Let's see{line_break}if we can't help him finish{line_break}his little ceremony.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07996"
msgstr "It looks like the energy charge{line_break}is supposed to run over these{line_break}blocks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07997"
msgstr "If we can just move these around{line_break}a little, that might be enough to{line_break}complete the circuit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07998"
msgstr "Ah! There we go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07999"
msgstr "These panels have arrows on{line_break}them... What do you think it{line_break}all means?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08000"
msgstr "Look at the directions they{line_break}point... I'll bet these will{line_break}rotate the blocks...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08001"
msgstr "But how do we set the{line_break}blocks back in place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08002"
msgstr "Just Pound them in!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08003"
msgstr "Won't that do the trick?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08004"
msgstr "We must watch the path his{line_break}Psynergy takes and move{line_break}the blocks accordingly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08005"
msgstr "Oh! The magic, the power of{line_break}the witch doctor fills my body!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08006"
msgstr "At the count of twenty, I{line_break}shall present our jewel to{line_break}the Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08007"
msgstr "Make your hearts as one,{line_break}and dance for the Great{line_break}Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08008"
msgstr "O Great Gabomba!{line_break}Please accept this,{line_break}our humble gift!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08009"
msgstr "You are still not pleased?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08010"
msgstr "No! This time, he seemed{line_break}almost like he might...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08011"
msgstr "We must continue!{line_break}Drums! More drums!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08012"
msgstr "Look! Look! The Great Gabomba{line_break}has seen our jewel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08013"
msgstr "Ahh! We have enraged{line_break}the Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08014"
msgstr "No! Great catastrophe shall{line_break}befall the Kibombo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08015"
msgstr "Silence! SILENCE!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08016"
msgstr "Do not be hasty! The Great{line_break}Gabomba has not opened{line_break}his eyes in anger!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08017"
msgstr "Your prayers...have not{line_break}appeased him... That is all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08018"
msgstr "Pray! You must pray more!{line_break}Let the Great Gabomba hear{line_break}our desires!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08019"
msgstr "Drums! More drums!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08020"
msgstr "Look! The Great Gabomba has{line_break}responded to our gift!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08021"
msgstr "Wahhh! The Great Gabomba{line_break}spews jets of flame!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08022"
msgstr "It is the end of Kibombo!{line_break}Our village is doomed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08023"
msgstr "Silence! SILENCE!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08024"
msgstr "Do not be hasty, my people!{line_break}The Great Gabomba is not{line_break}angered by our ceremony!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08025"
msgstr "He is angered by the presence{line_break}of wicked thoughts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08026"
msgstr "Cast away your wicked{line_break}thoughts! Dance! Dance{line_break}for the Great Gabomba!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08027"
msgstr "Drums! More drums!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08028"
msgstr "Look! The Great Gabomba has{line_break}responded to our gift!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08029"
msgstr "Did you see it, people?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08030"
msgstr "At last! The Great Gabomba{line_break}accepts me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08031"
msgstr "I shall answer his call! I shall{line_break}enter the Great Gabomba!{line_break}Wait for me, my people!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08032"
msgstr "The black orb... Where is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08033"
msgstr "I saw it roll in there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08034"
msgstr "It came in through there{line_break}and rolled along this{line_break}groove in the floor...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08035"
msgstr "It vanished into that hole!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08036"
msgstr "It looks pretty deep...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08037"
msgstr "Can you see it? Do you{line_break}think you can reach it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08038"
msgstr "Hm... No, I can't even see it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08039"
msgstr "It's no use... Now, I'll never{line_break}see Lemuria again... I am lost{line_break}forever from my homeland!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08040"
msgstr "Wait, hold on... I can see light{line_break}on the other side of this hole...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08041"
msgstr "A light?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08042"
msgstr "There must be a room{line_break}on the other side of{line_break}this statue...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08043"
msgstr "Who... Who are you!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08044"
msgstr "What are you doing here?{line_break}Are you Kibombo!?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08045"
msgstr "What? Do you take me for{line_break}a naive fool!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08046"
msgstr "Then what are you doing{line_break}inside the Great Gabomba!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08047"
msgstr "We've come to reclaim the{line_break}black orb you stole!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08048"
msgstr "Do you really believe{line_break}I would permit you to{line_break}take it!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08049"
msgstr "Hey, watch it! You wouldn't{line_break}even be in here if it weren't{line_break}for us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08050"
msgstr "What is that supposed to mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08051"
msgstr "Why should I believe you?{line_break}I am Akafubu, the chosen{line_break}witch doctor of Kibombo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08052"
msgstr "Yeah, we know... We saw your{line_break}magic energy flowing past us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08053"
msgstr "See how this channel runs{line_break}along the floor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08054"
msgstr "Here, look... It runs all the{line_break}way over there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08055"
msgstr "But the thing is, the circuit{line_break}was broken right there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08056"
msgstr "So we completed the circuit so{line_break}that your magic energy could{line_break}go where it needed to go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08057"
msgstr "But...if you truly did this,{line_break}then why? Why did you{line_break}help me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08058"
msgstr "We were sort of hoping that{line_break}we could take the orb if your{line_break}ceremony succeeded...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08059"
msgstr "Ah, so you have taken the orb?{line_break}Then begone! You have no{line_break}further business here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08060"
msgstr "But...we didn't get the orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08061"
msgstr "It rolled through this groove{line_break}and right through this hole.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08062"
msgstr "We saw a light through there,{line_break}so we suspect there must be{line_break}another room behind the wall...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08063"
msgstr "I might be able to{line_break}retrieve the orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08064"
msgstr "Do you think Akafubu will really{line_break}return the orb to us?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08065"
msgstr "Maybe we had him all wrong...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08066"
msgstr "I think {actor_name:6} is right.{line_break}It sounds like he's going to{line_break}return what he has stolen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08067"
msgstr "I thought Akafubu was an evil{line_break}man, but I guess we were wrong...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08068"
msgstr "You never can tell, {actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08069"
msgstr "We have little choice but to{line_break}trust that he will return it.{line_break}Come on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08070"
msgstr "Let's go, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08071"
msgstr "Ahh! Something is coming{line_break}from within the Great Gabomba!{line_break}Are you men, or are you...gods?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08072"
msgstr "You look human...but perhaps{line_break}you are the ones who created the{line_break}Great Gabomba, reborn before us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08073"
msgstr "Akafubu possesses the power{line_break}to enter the Great Gabomba! My{line_break}faith is restored!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08074"
msgstr "We must stand guard and{line_break}wait until Akafubu's return!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08075"
msgstr "Men or gods, we fear you not!{page_break}The Kibombo fear nothing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08076"
msgstr "It seems these beasts want{line_break}to pass through...{page_break}Can't you see we are in the{line_break}midst of our ceremony!?{page_break}None shall pass until{line_break}it is complete!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08077"
msgstr "This isn't a bad way to spend{line_break}an evening, when you get right{line_break}down to it.{page_break}I could dance all night{line_break}and all day tomorrow, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08078"
msgstr "It is proper for a warrior to{line_break}be a man of few words.{page_break}It is the fearful dog who{line_break}barks the loudest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08079"
msgstr "They look like people, but how{line_break}could they be here now? I cannot{line_break}believe it!{page_break}Why doesn't my magic{line_break}amulet have any effect{line_break}on them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08080"
msgstr "If no person other than Akafubu{line_break}can enter the Great Gabomba...{page_break}Then these people{line_break}aren't really people{line_break}at all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08081"
msgstr "I saw Akafubu's power open{line_break}the jaw of the Great Gabomba.{page_break}I saw it happen, but I still{line_break}don't believe it. But...{line_break}I SAW it happen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08082"
msgstr "I hope Akafubu completes{line_break}the ceremony soon... I'm so{line_break}sleepy... I want to go home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08083"
msgstr "What if the Great Gabomba only{line_break}opened its mouth to lure Akafubu{line_break}in and...crush him like a grape!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08084"
msgstr "Look at these guys. They think{line_break}they're so hot... I bet they think{line_break}they're gonna get past me...{page_break}They have no idea how long I{line_break}can stand here, saying the same{line_break}thing to them, over and over.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08085"
msgstr "Sure, this is fun, but my feet{line_break}hurt! I never want to hear an{line_break}irresistible dance beat again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08086"
msgstr "*Koff! Koff!* All this chanting is{line_break}making my throat hurt! No more{line_break}singing in the shower for me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08087"
msgstr "Akafubu has been inside the{line_break}Great Gabomba for a while now.{line_break}How long is he going to take?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08088"
msgstr "I think Akafubu's has finally{line_break}succeeded at his ceremony.{page_break}Maybe Kibombo will finally{line_break}be peaceful once again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08089"
msgstr "Tonight seems to have been{line_break}a good night... I was worried,{line_break}since Akafubu kept failing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08090"
msgstr "Once the ceremony is complete,{line_break}Kibombo will be like a village{line_break}reborn. Peace will come again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08091"
msgstr "What? Don't ask me what{line_break}Akafubu's doing in there. I{line_break}was just wondering myself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08092"
msgstr "They say the Great Gabomba's{line_break}great jaw finally opened.{page_break}I wish I could go up front{line_break}and get a better view.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08093"
msgstr "They told me I had to stay{line_break}awake until the ceremony's{line_break}over.{page_break}Usually, they tell me I have{line_break}to go to bed early! Make up{line_break}your minds already!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08094"
msgstr "Whew! Thank goodness those{line_break}drums have stopped. They{line_break}were rattling my brain!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08095"
msgstr "Last time Akafubu tried the{line_break}ceremony, he failed. I saw him{line_break}crying behind the statue after.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08096"
msgstr "Oeia's death was so sudden.{line_break}It's been hard on Akafubu.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08097"
msgstr "Akafubu sees the future...{line_break}That's how he knew to{line_break}find the jewel in Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08098"
msgstr "I believe in Akafubu. I believe{line_break}he will surpass Oeia and{line_break}become a great witch doctor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08099"
msgstr "What's taking so long? We{line_break}can't finish the ceremony until{line_break}Akafubu comes back out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08100"
msgstr "Akafubu is obsessed! He'll{line_break}keep trying this until he{line_break}gets it right.{page_break}Please, oh please, just{line_break}get it right tonight!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08101"
msgstr "Will the Great Gabomba finally{line_break}accept Akafubu and make him{line_break}our new witch doctor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08102"
msgstr "Kibombo was so much better{line_break}when Oeia was our leader.{page_break}I wish we could return to that{line_break}life once again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08103"
msgstr "I'm so far away from the action...{line_break}From back here, Akafubu looks{line_break}like a deranged mosquito!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08104"
msgstr "They're saying the Great Gabomba{line_break}opened his mouth, but I'll just{line_break}have to take their word for it.{page_break}I wish I were closer, so I could{line_break}see it and know for sure.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08105"
msgstr "As long as this ceremony's{line_break}going on, I get to stay up!{page_break}Normally, I get in trouble for{line_break}trying to stay up this late.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08106"
msgstr "Am I going to have to play{line_break}drums all night? Can't they{line_break}just...dance without them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08107"
msgstr "Akafubu's always been a{line_break}crybaby. Whenever he failed{line_break}his lessons, he cried and cried.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08108"
msgstr "I suspect Akafubu never really{line_break}wanted to become the Kibombo{line_break}witch doctor. Poor boy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08109"
msgstr "I really wonder how accurate{line_break}Akafubu's farsight is.{page_break}If his skills were stronger, he{line_break}should be able to prophesy the{line_break}outcome of this ceremony.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08110"
msgstr "Akafubu and Oeia are so{line_break}different... How can he ever{line_break}hope to replace Oeia?{page_break}Ah, why did Oeia have{line_break}to die? What are we to do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08111"
msgstr "I have followed Oeia's{line_break}instructions and entered{line_break}the final chamber!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08112"
msgstr "He told me that if I reached{line_break}this chamber, I would become{line_break}Kibombo's witch doctor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08113"
msgstr "But what must I do here to{line_break}become a witch doctor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08114"
msgstr "I do not know...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08115"
msgstr "Your black orb rests in the hands{line_break}of the statue before you. Go on,{line_break}take it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08116"
msgstr "Oeia... What am I to do now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08117"
msgstr "Oh, young witch doctor... You{line_break}have succeeded in your task.{line_break}You have found this chamber.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08118"
msgstr "Wh-Who speaks?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08119"
msgstr "It sounded like it was the{line_break}statue of the Great Gabomba.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08120"
msgstr "That's ridiculous...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08121"
msgstr "Akafubu! Your magic has grown{line_break}strong! At last, you are worthy{line_break}of the title witch doctor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08122"
msgstr "I give you the feathers and{line_break}gown that are the badges{line_break}of your office!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08123"
msgstr "Akafubu, from this day{line_break}forward, you shall be{line_break}Kibombo's witch doctor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08124"
msgstr "I've done it! I've finally earned{line_break}the right to be witch doctor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08125"
msgstr "At last!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08126"
msgstr "Yes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08127"
msgstr "And there is one thing that{line_break}remains for me to give you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08128"
msgstr "Akafubu... You hasty fool... I had{line_break}something else to give you, and{line_break}in your haste, you left too soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08129"
msgstr "Say, you there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08130"
msgstr "Yes! You! You, looking{line_break}around there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08131"
msgstr "I have magic for Akafubu,{line_break}magic that he will soon need,{line_break}...but he is not ready for it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08132"
msgstr "As a result, I have decided that{line_break}I shall not pass this magic on{line_break}to anyone just yet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08133"
msgstr "Tell this to Akafubu:{line_break}If he desires this new magic,{line_break}then he must earn it himself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08134"
msgstr "If Akafubu does not refine his{line_break}magical arts, then he will never{line_break}earn this new power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08135"
msgstr "This power shall not be realized{line_break}until he ceases living only for{line_break}himself...{page_break}And instead lives his{line_break}life to benefit others.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08136"
msgstr "Tell him so!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08137"
msgstr "I don't suppose you could{line_break}just...give that magic to us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08138"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08139"
msgstr "I'm just asking if maybe we{line_break}could earn that magic before{line_break}Akafubu.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08140"
msgstr "The power can be claimed by{line_break}another, but only if Akafubu{line_break}lacks the will to earn it himself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08141"
msgstr "Aha! So we CAN get it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08142"
msgstr "Perhaps if he must compete{line_break}for his power, he will focus{line_break}and take his office seriously.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08143"
msgstr "But before you do this thing,{line_break}you must convey to Akafubu{line_break}all that I have told you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08144"
msgstr "Oh, of course! We wouldn't{line_break}dream of cheating him... We will{line_break}tell him all you have told us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08145"
msgstr "Follow that path, and you{line_break}will find a cavern...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08146"
msgstr "But now, I shall sleep...until{line_break}the time comes when I must{line_break}anoint a new witch doctor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08147"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}... Go get {actor_name:8}'s{line_break}precious orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08148"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}... Do you have any{line_break}idea exactly what this \"Great{line_break}Gabomba\" really is?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08149"
msgstr "If you have unraveled that{line_break}which I cannot, then perhaps{line_break}you are the greater scholar.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08150"
msgstr "You do not understand either?{line_break}Then I do not feel quite so{line_break}foolish...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08151"
msgstr "But doesn't this witch doctor{line_break}magic seem not unlike some{line_break}kind of Psynergy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08152"
msgstr "Wouldn't it be quite fortunate{line_break}if we were to get our hands{line_break}on that power ourselves?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08153"
msgstr "Oh! You didn't need{line_break}much convincing at{line_break}all, did you, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08154"
msgstr "Hrmm... You would feel guilty{line_break}about taking it, eh, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08155"
msgstr "I needn't remind you, but...{page_break}We're going to need every{line_break}kind of Psynergy we can muster{line_break}to complete this quest...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08156"
msgstr "Either way, {actor_name:5}, we are,{line_break}at the very least, obligated to{line_break}deliver the Gabomba's message.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08157"
msgstr "We must fulfill our promise{line_break}to the Gabomba.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08158"
msgstr "Then, maybe we can come back{line_break}inside this Gabomba statue{line_break}some other time to get it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08159"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} carried the message{line_break}of the Gabomba to Akafubu.{page_break}By the time {actor_name:5} finished{line_break}his story, dawn had broken.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08160"
msgstr "It looks like just fixing the{line_break}channel should do the trick...{page_break}Maybe we need to look at{line_break}when the two magical charges{line_break}reach the statue in the middle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08161"
msgstr "By reaching this place, you{line_break}have proven your power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08162"
msgstr "By rights, Akafubu should bear{line_break}this power...{page_break}But I shall keep my promise{line_break}and bestow it upon the one{line_break}to reach this place first!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08163"
msgstr "I am grateful for your promise...{page_break}But I am worried that we have{line_break}done Akafubu and the Kibombo{line_break}a great wrong.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08164"
msgstr "Akafubu has not honed his own{line_break}powers, and the fault lies with{line_break}him alone...{page_break}And yet, there is a hint of{line_break}truth to what you say...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08165"
msgstr "Then what are we to do?{line_break}Does this mean we won't{line_break}receive your magic?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08166"
msgstr "As I have said, I will give{line_break}the power to you. Your{line_break}concern is misplaced.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08167"
msgstr "But I must add some small{line_break}conditions to our agreement...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08168"
msgstr "Wh-What kind of conditions?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08169"
msgstr "You must not...mention{line_break}this to Akafubu.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08170"
msgstr "Akafubu was plainly ill prepared{line_break}for this test. He will lose heart{line_break}if he hears what you have done.{page_break}And yet...the Kibombo have need{line_break}of this ill-prepared leader...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08171"
msgstr "If Akafubu ever reaches this{line_break}place, I shall teach him the{line_break}magic as well.{page_break}Promise me that you will not{line_break}tell Akafubu that you earned{line_break}this magic. Can you do this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08172"
msgstr "Of course!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08173"
msgstr "And now I shall sleep.{line_break}Farewell, successor to the{line_break}witch doctor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08174"
msgstr "Right... Well, I guess{line_break}that's that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08175"
msgstr "You are virtuous men,{line_break}coming here to deliver this{line_break}message. My son and I thank you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08176"
msgstr "What do we have{line_break}to be thankful of?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08177"
msgstr "If they had just stopped me{line_break}from leaving the Great Gabomba,{line_break}this wouldn't have happened!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08178"
msgstr "What!? If you had been more{line_break}interested in your duty, you{line_break}would not have left so quickly...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08179"
msgstr "But, Father! These people are{line_break}trying to steal the magic of our{line_break}people! It should be mine!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08180"
msgstr "Mine, I tell you! That power{line_break}belongs to me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08181"
msgstr "I'm going to be the one to{line_break}get the Great Gabomba's{line_break}magic! You'll see!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08182"
msgstr "My son, you have much to learn.{line_break}He may look like a man, but{line_break}before me, he acts like a child.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08183"
msgstr "See how he behaves when{line_break}he gets excited?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08184"
msgstr "No matter what I say, he won't{line_break}listen to me right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08185"
msgstr "I think that he has had{line_break}enough for today...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08186"
msgstr "I see your point.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08187"
msgstr "Well! I suppose we should{line_break}be leaving then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08188"
msgstr "After all, our journey has only{line_break}just begun. We cannot remain{line_break}idle much longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08189"
msgstr "Dang! Why did I leave that{line_break}stupid room so quickly?{line_break}Stupid, stupid, stupid Akafubu!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08190"
msgstr "After he became a witch{line_break}doctor, Akafubu had no more{line_break}reason to focus himself...{page_break}It is good that he now has a new{line_break}goal. He will have to work hard to{line_break}earn the Great Gabomba's magic.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08191"
msgstr "I just can't quite grasp the{line_break}Great Gabomba's magic.{page_break}Still, I'm trying really hard{line_break}to help everyone, just like{line_break}the Great Gabomba said...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08192"
msgstr "My son has been so kind{line_break}and compassionate since the{line_break}ceremony. He's a changed man.{page_break}He has focused on bettering{line_break}himself and earning the{line_break}Great Gabomba's magic.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08193"
msgstr "Akafubu has finally completed{line_break}his ceremony, and things are{line_break}starting to calm down.{page_break}Maybe now, our warriors can{line_break}set aside their spears and{line_break}return to their peaceful lives.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08194"
msgstr "It looks like there are fewer{line_break}warriors in Kibombo now, huh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08195"
msgstr "All of our warriors were just{line_break}local farm boys...{page_break}Now that he's the witch doctor,{line_break}Akafubu let them all return{line_break}to their farming work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08196"
msgstr "You couldn't tell? I thought{line_break}you might have been a little{line_break}more observant, but oh well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08197"
msgstr "The Great Gabomba's mouth will{line_break}remain open until Akafubu has{line_break}earned the gift of the Gabomba.{page_break}Maybe I ought to sneak in there{line_break}and get a look around while I{line_break}have the chance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08198"
msgstr "Now that the ceremony is over,{line_break}I feel a touch depressed.{page_break}I wish we could have more big{line_break}events like that soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08199"
msgstr "I couldn't for the life of me{line_break}figure out how our warriors{line_break}got to Indra without a boat.{page_break}But I just found out that{line_break}something has pushed Indra{line_break}into contact with Gondowan!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08200"
msgstr "Oh... I smell something{line_break}delectable. We'll be eating{line_break}some good meat soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08201"
msgstr "Good ol' meat... I love meat.{line_break}I can't wait until we get some.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08202"
msgstr "We get to eat normal animals{line_break}again! They taste so much better{line_break}than those monsters we've had!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08203"
msgstr "You didn't come to Kibombo{line_break}to get revenge on us for that{line_break}raid, did you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08204"
msgstr "How many of you are there?{line_break}We've got some pretty{line_break}fierce warriors, you know...{page_break}You don't really think you{line_break}can defeat all of us, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08205"
msgstr "Whew! That's good to hear.{line_break}We're supposed to protect the{line_break}village, but I feel bad for the raid.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08206"
msgstr "The other warriors are busy{line_break}hunting right now.{page_break}The food supply for the whole{line_break}village depends entirely on the{line_break}animals they catch.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08207"
msgstr "Now that Akafubu is our new{line_break}witch doctor, we shall embark{line_break}on a path to peace.{page_break}The neighboring villages have{line_break}no reason to fear our warriors{line_break}any longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08208"
msgstr "This is a signal fire. We use{line_break}these to send messages to{line_break}neighboring villages.{page_break}I hope these messages set{line_break}our neighbors' minds at ease.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08209"
msgstr "Everyone was terribly worried{line_break}about Akafubu's ceremony.{line_break}We're all relieved it's over now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08210"
msgstr "Covering our warriors in paint{line_break}makes them scarier, and it makes{line_break}them more intimidating.{page_break}Most of our warriors aren't{line_break}that strong, so they need{line_break}every trick they can use.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08211"
msgstr "I want to look inside the Great{line_break}Gabomba at least once.{page_break}You don't suppose just peeking{line_break}will get me cursed, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08212"
msgstr "Now that the witch doctor{line_break}ceremony is over, I've decided{line_break}that...it was kind of fun!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08213"
msgstr "Because Kibombo lies hidden{line_break}deep in the continent, we rarely{line_break}hear news of the Eastern Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08214"
msgstr "You don't think anyone will notice{line_break}if I sneak a little nibble while I'm{line_break}cooking, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08215"
msgstr "Gulp! The smell of that sauce over{line_break}the fire is making me so hungry...{line_break}How long until we can eat!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08216"
msgstr "Lately the monsters have been{line_break}increasing, and the animals are{line_break}becoming more and more scarce.{page_break}That's why everyone's so{line_break}excited that we get to have{line_break}nice, normal steaks tonight!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08217"
msgstr "No one in Kibombo really wants{line_break}war with our neighbors.{page_break}We want everyone who shares{line_break}this land to share peace as well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08218"
msgstr "With all our battles behind{line_break}us, we warriors spend our time{line_break}refilling the village food supply.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08219"
msgstr "I wonder if I can keep going until{line_break}another village sees our signal{line_break}and comes to meet with us...{page_break}I don't care which village it is,{line_break}just send a delegation! Fast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08220"
msgstr "I have heard that if you head{line_break}west from southern Gondowan,{line_break}you'll see the Eastern Sea.{page_break}There are two continents{line_break}in the middle of that ocean:{line_break}Hesperia and Atteka.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08221"
msgstr "Are you going to head{line_break}to western Gondowan?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08222"
msgstr "That's unfortunate. The recent{line_break}rains have swollen the rivers.{page_break}It is too dangerous for{line_break}us to allow anyone to pass.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08223"
msgstr "That's for the best. It is far{line_break}too dangerous for anyone{line_break}to be going out west.{page_break}Perhaps a boat would lessen{line_break}the danger to a degree...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08224"
msgstr "You can see Atteka from the{line_break}bridge in western Gondowan.{line_break}My grandfather told me so.{page_break}Someday, I'll be a warrior like my{line_break}grandfather, and I'll be able{line_break}to see it for myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08225"
msgstr "I know I could find more animals{line_break}and grain on the far side of the{line_break}river. If only I could go...{page_break}These seasonal monsoon rains{line_break}have swollen the river and made{line_break}it too dangerous to cross.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08226"
msgstr "Crossing the river by canoe{line_break}is much too dangerous.{line_break}I'd need a ship to get across.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08227"
msgstr "If I'm ever going to be a warrior,{line_break}I must build more muscle and{line_break}master the art of the spear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08228"
msgstr "If you are looking for treasure,{line_break}look west of the river.{page_break}The rocky peaks there are{line_break}called the belly of the continent.{line_break}Great treasure hides there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08229"
msgstr "Each year, when the rains stop,{line_break}our warriors look for treasure{line_break}in the belly of the continent.{page_break}Maybe the belly is hidden, or{line_break}the treasure is also. I don't know,{line_break}but they all return empty-handed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08230"
msgstr "Sure, our legends speak of much{line_break}treasure, but no one ever seems{line_break}to have found it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08231"
msgstr "I wonder what Oeia meant when{line_break}he said that our magic is deeply{line_break}tied to the belly of the continent...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08232"
msgstr "Oh, my back... It's been aching{line_break}ever since that ceremony.{page_break}I guess I really am too old{line_break}to dance the night away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08233"
msgstr "As soon as Akafubu became{line_break}our recognized witch doctor,{line_break}he became so much nicer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08234"
msgstr "I swear, that's the{line_break}last time I'll ever let{line_break}loose like that again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08235"
msgstr "Akafubu gets so grouchy.{line_break}I wonder if it's just his{line_break}frustration taking over...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08236"
msgstr "Many in Gondowan fear the{line_break}might of the Kibombo warriors.{line_break}But we don't want to be feared.{page_break}Now is the time for Kibombo{line_break}to change its image.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08237"
msgstr "We think it is time to inform{line_break}other villages that Akafubu{line_break}has completed the ceremony.{page_break}I think they'll be glad to know{line_break}that we no longer pose any{line_break}threat to them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08238"
msgstr "It won't be easy, convincing{line_break}them that we've turned over{line_break}a new leaf...but we'll try.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08239"
msgstr "I am a mighty warrior, trained{line_break}from birth to be fierce. If you{line_break}are feared, you are powerful!{page_break}I'm...supposed to start my{line_break}\"being nice to people\" training{line_break}on Monday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08240"
msgstr "The weapons I sell in this shop are{line_break}ones we do not use in Kibombo.{page_break}You find it strange that I{line_break}do not sell the weapons{line_break}we make here, don't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08241"
msgstr "Our warriors appear so strong{line_break}because of the deadly poison{line_break}on their spears.{page_break}In a war, Kibombo spears{line_break}would make a powerful ally.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08242"
msgstr "The only defenses we Kibombo{line_break}need are our shields and our{line_break}war paint.{page_break}Our warriors think armor{line_break}is for cowards.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08243"
msgstr "Because our paint is infused{line_break}with the witch doctor's magic,{line_break}we're safe from attacks.{page_break}I would opt for paint in any{line_break}battle...no matter how much{line_break}iron my enemy wore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08244"
msgstr "I'm sorry, but the Kibombo{line_break}spearhead poison is a tribal{line_break}secret, used for hunting only.{page_break}We can't let outsiders have{line_break}it, because they might try{line_break}to turn it toward evil uses.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08245"
msgstr "If I had a coin for every time{line_break}some stranger came up and{line_break}asked me to sell them poison...{page_break}If only they'd let me sell it,{line_break}I could make millions!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08246"
msgstr "Don't worry about the beds{line_break}here... We used to have insect{line_break}problems, but not anymore.{page_break}We use a special bug powder{line_break}on our beds. It's quite harmless{line_break}to humans, I'll bet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08247"
msgstr "I can't remember how long{line_break}it's been since we've had{line_break}any guests.{page_break}Tell you what... If you stay at{line_break}our inn, you can have all the{line_break}freshly grilled steak you want!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08248"
msgstr "That bed makes me itch{line_break}so badly! It feels like bugs{line_break}are crawling all over me!{page_break}Whenever I get itchy, I just{line_break}rub some of that bug powder{line_break}all over myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08249"
msgstr "I love Kibombo's famous{line_break}BBQ monster steak...with{line_break}extra-spicy Herb sauce!{page_break}It's a local treat that's fun{line_break}to eat! ...But it's not nearly{line_break}as fun catching the monsters...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08250"
msgstr "Kibombo's peace is restored{line_break}now that the ceremony has{line_break}reached its end...{page_break}Now, the fate of Kibombo's{line_break}people depends on how{line_break}Akafubu leads them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08251"
msgstr "I can't believe that Akafubu{line_break}would change simply because{line_break}he completed the ceremony.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08252"
msgstr "The mayor finally returned{line_break}from Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08253"
msgstr "Hey! It's you guys! It's good{line_break}to see you again!{page_break}You want to enter Madra?{line_break}Yeah, sure! Go ahead!{line_break}Feel free!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08254"
msgstr "He was gone so long, I was{line_break}starting to worry that the{line_break}mayor would never come back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08255"
msgstr "How much longer do we{line_break}have to stand guard here?{page_break}Seriously, there's nothing to{line_break}guard against! We've already{line_break}been attacked by everyone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08256"
msgstr "I don't think the mayor ever{line_break}got that boat of his fixed,{line_break}either... Got tired of waiting.{page_break}I guess he's going back out again{line_break}as soon as he finds enough people{line_break}to fix it himself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08257"
msgstr "We go to all that work getting{line_break}the ship from Briggs, and now{line_break}we can't get it to work?{page_break}I guess the mayor's holding{line_break}a council to see if they can{line_break}figure out what's wrong.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08258"
msgstr "I heard the boat the mayor got{line_break}is much better than the battered{line_break}raft we used to have!{page_break}I also heard that the new ship can{line_break}even sail far across the sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08259"
msgstr "Is there by any chance a girl{line_break}named {actor_name:6} with you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08260"
msgstr "Ah! Those people must have{line_break}been looking for you!{page_break}There were four of them, and{line_break}they looked weatherworn, but{line_break}they had an amazing ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08261"
msgstr "Oh... Well, if you run across anyone{line_break}named {actor_name:6}, let her know{line_break}{actor_name:1} is looking for her.{page_break}You look like you travel a lot.{line_break}Maybe you'll run across this{line_break}{actor_name:6} somewhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08262"
msgstr "Those travelers looked{line_break}worried about you.{page_break}You should find them, so that{line_break}they can know you are safe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08263"
msgstr "I wonder if the legends are{line_break}true... If there really is a great{line_break}society on a far-off island...{page_break}Because if they are true, I{line_break}want to see this island.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08264"
msgstr "I don't know what will happen{line_break}when they all head out to sea.{line_break}They know nothing about sailing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08265"
msgstr "A group of sharp-looking{line_break}travelers came through{line_break}here recently.{page_break}They said they were looking for{line_break}an island called Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08266"
msgstr "If you have a big enough ship,{line_break}you can sail anywhere in the{line_break}world! Isn't that amazing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08267"
msgstr "I was at the mayor's house,{line_break}watching them argue about{line_break}why the boat won't move.{page_break}What's so important about{line_break}a mast, and what does it have{line_break}to do with sailing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08268"
msgstr "It's not that I don't want to go to{line_break}Alhafra... But what's the point if{line_break}we can't fix the mast?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08269"
msgstr "The mayor asked me to go to{line_break}Alhafra with him, but I'm not{line_break}sure I should...{page_break}If that ship runs on the power{line_break}of the wind, how reliable could{line_break}it really be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08270"
msgstr "It seems no one is really happy{line_break}that the mayor got this grand,{line_break}new ship. The poor mayor...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08271"
msgstr "Say, {actor_name:8}, there was{line_break}another group of travelers with{line_break}powers similar to your own.{page_break}What are the odds that we{line_break}should meet two groups{line_break}with these amazing abilities?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08272"
msgstr "I thought Shin and the others{line_break}were lying, but after seeing{line_break}what I saw, I'd believe anything.{page_break}They called it Psynergy and said{line_break}it can change water into ice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08273"
msgstr "When {actor_name:1} and his party{line_break}heard about {actor_name:8}, they{line_break}seemed shocked.{page_break}They said they were going to{line_break}follow you to Gondowan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08274"
msgstr "Uhhhnnn... UHHHNNN!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08275"
msgstr "They told me that you make{line_break}Psynergy by focusing your{line_break}mind...{page_break}I've been focusing nonstop{line_break}for days, but do you see{line_break}any ice? No!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08276"
msgstr "How can anyone just create{line_break}ice by thinking about it?{page_break}I mean, imagine how much{line_break}power you'd have if you could{line_break}just think, and things happened!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08277"
msgstr "Why would anyone be happy{line_break}to have a broken boat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08278"
msgstr "They've been having so many{line_break}meetings lately! I guess that{line_break}boat must be in miserable shape!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08279"
msgstr "Everyone gets the urge to{line_break}explore, to go out into the{line_break}wild and see new lands...{page_break}I'd love to see the world. I'd{line_break}love to have an adventure{line_break}of my own!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08280"
msgstr "I wonder why those travelers{line_break}were in such a hurry...{page_break}They looked so severe... You'd{line_break}think they carried the fate of{line_break}the world on their shoulders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08281"
msgstr "What was that island again?{line_break}Come on, brain... Work with me...{line_break}Lemoria? Lemurland? Lulu?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08282"
msgstr "The people of Madra know our{line_break}own lands well...but we know{line_break}little of the world beyond.{page_break}What kind of fool would think{line_break}himself ready to sail into a{line_break}world he knew nothing about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08283"
msgstr "That island that group{line_break}was asking about sounded{line_break}familiar for some reason...{page_break}Grandpa used to tell me stories{line_break}about a treasure island when I{line_break}was young. Was that the place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08284"
msgstr "How big would a ship that{line_break}could go anywhere be?{line_break}Probably bigger than a whale!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08285"
msgstr "Everyone here in Madra is afraid{line_break}of the Kibombo now. Do they{line_break}scare you, too?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08286"
msgstr "I saw the fear in your eyes{line_break}the instant I said \"Kibombo.\"{line_break}Don't get worked up, though.{page_break}We caught sight of a Kibombo{line_break}smoke signal that said they had{line_break}given up their warlike ways.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08287"
msgstr "You must have heard{line_break}their proclamation...{page_break}We only just caught sight{line_break}of their smoke signals... They{line_break}have announced a truce!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08288"
msgstr "We're still recovering from{line_break}the Kibombo raid...{page_break}It's no small wonder people{line_break}are still afraid...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08289"
msgstr "These new boats apparently{line_break}use the power of wind to cross{line_break}the seas...{page_break}I just don't understand how{line_break}a big pole in the boat can{line_break}help to capture the wind...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08290"
msgstr "If a building has broken{line_break}columns, we tear it down...{page_break}Shouldn't a boat with a{line_break}broken column be torn{line_break}down as well?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08291"
msgstr "Sailors are supposed to{line_break}use oars and pull the boat{line_break}through the water...{page_break}So, what's a sailor supposed{line_break}to do on a boat that's{line_break}powered by wind?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08292"
msgstr "Our mayor's done so little for{line_break}us up until now... We should at{line_break}least thank him for the boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08293"
msgstr "Is turning water to ice really{line_break}such a special power?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08294"
msgstr "Madra is always so hot. If{line_break}there were some way to create{line_break}ice, it would be so...cool.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08295"
msgstr "So, this {actor_name:8} fellow must{line_break}be a friend of {actor_name:1}...{page_break}Why else would they go all the{line_break}way to Gondowan for him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08296"
msgstr "I knew I should have asked{line_break}them how to make ice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08297"
msgstr "There's talk of mighty travelers{line_break}who passed by here recently.{line_break}I wish I could have met them.{page_break}It seems they had powers no one{line_break}has ever seen before. I bet those{line_break}powers could be profitable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08298"
msgstr "Since things are finally calming{line_break}down in Madra, our people are{line_break}ready to get down to business.{page_break}They seem to have thought up{line_break}a business plan that makes use{line_break}of {actor_name:1}'s power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08299"
msgstr "What if we just traveled with{line_break}{actor_name:1} to show off his powers...{line_break}We could make loads of cash!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08300"
msgstr "The business plan our people{line_break}have come up with is supposed{line_break}to make us rich.{page_break}I guess it must be{line_break}a brilliant plan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08301"
msgstr "Our salesman said Kibombo's{line_break}ceremony is done, and he claims{line_break}that they're peaceful again.{page_break}I'll be so relieved if what he{line_break}said turns out to be true.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08302"
msgstr "I wonder if the Kibombo have{line_break}truly set aside their spears{line_break}and returned to peace...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08303"
msgstr "The continent shift makes it feel{line_break}like we're sharing backyards{line_break}with the Kibombo...{page_break}We'd be so happy if we could{line_break}live in peace without having to{line_break}fear their spears.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08304"
msgstr "The salesman that just came back{line_break}from Gondowan claims the{line_break}Kibombo are peaceful now...{page_break}But if we relax, we won't be{line_break}ready for their next attack.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08305"
msgstr "How are we to climb the cliffs{line_break}between here and Gondowan?{page_break}If someone would just drop{line_break}some ropes down from the{line_break}top, it wouldn't be a problem.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08306"
msgstr "My husband relishes those rare{line_break}mushrooms growing in the{line_break}Gondowan cliffs.{page_break}I wish someone would{line_break}bring some back for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08307"
msgstr "I'm dying for some of those{line_break}Gondowan mushrooms, but I{line_break}can't ever reach them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08308"
msgstr "My poor husband's getting old...{line_break}Those cliffs scare him now.{page_break}In his prime, he'd have{line_break}scrambled up those cliffs{line_break}in no time for a mushroom.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08309"
msgstr "Oh, my... Is... Is that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08310"
msgstr "Is that one of his most{line_break}favorite mushrooms!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08311"
msgstr "Did you climb all the way up{line_break}those cliffs just to get that{line_break}mushroom for us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08312"
msgstr "That's the nicest thing anyone{line_break}has ever done for me. I have{line_break}to thank you for this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08313"
msgstr "But what could I have that a{line_break}warrior like you would want?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08314"
msgstr "That's a tricky one...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08315"
msgstr "I don't know if you want{line_break}a pet, but this is all we{line_break}can offer. Take care of it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08316"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} got{line_break}{argument_actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08317"
msgstr "I can't wait for dinner tonight.{line_break}Batter-fried mushrooms! Mmm!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08318"
msgstr "This here's enough of a{line_break}mushroom that we'll be{line_break}eating it for days!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08319"
msgstr "The more I think about dinner{line_break}tonight, the more I drool...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08320"
msgstr "These mushrooms will make{line_break}any meal taste amazing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08321"
msgstr "No, dear... They look similar,{line_break}but these aren't quite right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08322"
msgstr "Thanks for bringing this by,{line_break}but it's just not the type of{line_break}mushroom we like...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08323"
msgstr "Please... Won't you please{line_break}try to find the mushrooms{line_break}my husband loves so much?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08324"
msgstr "That mushroom was great,{line_break}but I ate way too much. I{line_break}don't ever want to see it again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08325"
msgstr "Actually, I didn't cook the{line_break}mushrooms properly that night.{page_break}But, uh...please don't tell{line_break}my husband that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08326"
msgstr "I don't remember mushrooms{line_break}like that ever tasting bad...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08327"
msgstr "If my husband finds out I{line_break}messed up the recipe, he'll{line_break}be so sad...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08328"
msgstr "Same sailors came through{line_break}recently with a ship similar{line_break}to {actor_name:8}'s.{page_break}I'd never seen one before,{line_break}but now they're everywhere.{line_break}Are they new?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08329"
msgstr "One of the sailors, {actor_name:1}, was{line_break}very curious about {actor_name:8}'s{line_break}ship. A little {text_effect:2}too{reset_text_style} curious.{page_break}It looked like he had a{line_break}similar boat, almost identical{line_break}to {actor_name:8}'s.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08330"
msgstr "Oars, I understand. Hey,{line_break}I'll even give a sailboat{line_break}a try...{page_break}But there's no way I'm setting{line_break}foot on a ship powered by{line_break}some fool magic thingie.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08331"
msgstr "We've had a lot of strange{line_break}visitors ever since{line_break}{actor_name:8} showed up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08332"
msgstr "Have you by chance seen{line_break}a girl named Menardi?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08333"
msgstr "You have? And... And you're telling{line_break}me that my sister is...dead?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08334"
msgstr "If you continue these lies, I{line_break}might take it upon myself to{line_break}shut you up. Get out of my sight!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08335"
msgstr "If you don't know my sister,{line_break}then I have nothing to say{line_break}to you. Get out of my sight!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08336"
msgstr "Using Psynergy on me?{line_break}Are you so dense that you{line_break}don't know when to be afraid?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08337"
msgstr "I don't have time to play{line_break}games with you. Now, leave{line_break}me to my thoughts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08338"
msgstr "Where could Menardi have{line_break}gone? Where are you, my{line_break}sister?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08339"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! You're back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08340"
msgstr "And you've brought{line_break}{actor_name:8} with you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08341"
msgstr "Oh! {actor_name:8}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08342"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, I must apologize for{line_break}the trouble we've caused you.{line_break}I'm sorry we lost your jewel...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08343"
msgstr "Don't be. Everything worked{line_break}out for the best.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08344"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, you said you were{line_break}going to go to Gondowan.{line_break}Did you make it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08345"
msgstr "Yes. In fact, we have{line_break}just returned.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08346"
msgstr "And your jewel...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08347"
msgstr "You actually got it back from{line_break}the Kibombo? Incredible...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08348"
msgstr "I was able to recover it{line_break}with the help of {actor_name:5}{line_break}and his friends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08349"
msgstr "That's wonderful! I'm so relieved!{line_break}I was worried that you might{line_break}never get it back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08350"
msgstr "You didn't recover it{line_break}from the Kibombo?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08351"
msgstr "That's not true, sir. {actor_name:5}{line_break}and his companions helped{line_break}me recover it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08352"
msgstr "Please! Don't startle me like{line_break}that! I was afraid you might{line_break}never get it back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08353"
msgstr "That's why we came back...{line_break}To let you know that we've{line_break}recovered it. Worry no more.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08354"
msgstr "Ah, so you'll be leaving{line_break}again, will you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08355"
msgstr "Are you sure you must leave{line_break}so soon, {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08356"
msgstr "I may yet return here again, but{line_break}I'm afraid I must be going soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08357"
msgstr "You seem to be quite busy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08358"
msgstr "It is their youth that allows{line_break}them to be so busy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08359"
msgstr "But we'll be back, I promise.{line_break}Maybe we'll be able to visit{line_break}at a more leisurely pace...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08360"
msgstr "I'd like that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08361"
msgstr "So would I!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08362"
msgstr "If you've already recovered{line_break}your jewel, why don't you{line_break}stay here for a bit longer?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08363"
msgstr "Unfortunately, we can't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08364"
msgstr "Hey, have you seen{line_break}the girl out front?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08365"
msgstr "We must go...to the island{line_break}that is my home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08366"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, are you...{line_break}Are you sure?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08367"
msgstr "After what we've been{line_break}through, I feel I've learned{line_break}a few things.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08368"
msgstr "Like what!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08369"
msgstr "Like...the fact that you{line_break}truly are good people.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08370"
msgstr "And that you have gone to{line_break}great lengths for no other{line_break}reason than to help those in need.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08371"
msgstr "I have come to realize that{line_break}I, too, must do something{line_break}to help where I can.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08372"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08373"
msgstr "I have made my decision.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08374"
msgstr "And the sooner we depart,{line_break}the better, right, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08375"
msgstr "We shall set sail, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}To my ship! To the Eastern Sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08376"
msgstr "Do you truly mean to leave{line_break}so soon, {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08377"
msgstr "I may yet again have reason{line_break}to visit your town, but...{line_break}yes, I must go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08378"
msgstr "You seem quite busy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08379"
msgstr "It is their youth that allows{line_break}them to be so busy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08380"
msgstr "But we'll be back, I promise.{line_break}Maybe we'll be able to visit{line_break}at a more leisurely pace...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08381"
msgstr "I'd like that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08382"
msgstr "So would I!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08383"
msgstr "I know you went to a lot of trouble{line_break}to get us that boat, but we just{line_break}had to give up on it.{page_break}We couldn't just sit and wait in{line_break}Alhafra until the thing got fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08384"
msgstr "We just have to finish repairs{line_break}on that boat we left in Alhafra...{page_break}We've had several meetings{line_break}already, discussing our next{line_break}course of action.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08385"
msgstr "I'm so relieved {actor_name:8}{line_break}got his jewel back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08386"
msgstr "I can't believe {actor_name:8}{line_break}actually went all the way to{line_break}Kibombo to get his jewel back.{page_break}That's so...dashing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08387"
msgstr "Gondowan is such an{line_break}awful, dangerous place...{page_break}I never imagined for a second{line_break}that {actor_name:8} would make{line_break}it back here safely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08388"
msgstr "I like you guys a lot. I'm{line_break}sad that you're leaving.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08389"
msgstr "My daddy went to Gondowan,{line_break}and all I got was nothing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08390"
msgstr "All of this could have been avoided{line_break}if the people of Alhafra's offer to{line_break}repair the boat was genuine.{page_break}Now, I refuse to let that boat{line_break}fall into the hands of Alhafra{line_break}and its mayor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08391"
msgstr "Why won't the mayor of{line_break}Alhafra repair our boat?{page_break}If we could get that ship,{line_break}Madra would embark on a{line_break}voyage to prosperity...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08392"
msgstr "I can't believe it... Despite all{line_break}my worrying, they got that{line_break}jewel back like it was nothing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08393"
msgstr "I felt a little responsible for{line_break}{actor_name:8} losing his jewel.{line_break}I'm so happy he got it back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08394"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} said he was going{line_break}to Gondowan alone, but now he{line_break}has some friends with him.{page_break}That's nice. If he'd been all{line_break}alone, I'm sure he would have{line_break}been eaten by monsters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08395"
msgstr "I wish they'd tell me all{line_break}about their adventures!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08396"
msgstr "I'm so glad Daddy{line_break}got home safely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08397"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, wait!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08398"
msgstr "I believe I promised you{line_break}a reward for helping with{line_break}the boat, didn't I?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08399"
msgstr "Imagine! You came all this way{line_break}to put us at ease, and I totally{line_break}forget to give this to you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08400"
msgstr "Well, you may have forgotten,{line_break}{actor_name:5}, but I have not.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08401"
msgstr "Regardless, I told you that I{line_break}would reward you when the{line_break}boat was fixed...{page_break}That may take quite a{line_break}while now, it seems...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08402"
msgstr "That being the case, I'd like{line_break}to give you that reward now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08403"
msgstr "We can't accept it now,{line_break}though, could we, {actor_name:6}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08404"
msgstr "Madra is still in shambles{line_break}from the disaster... We couldn't{line_break}possibly accept any gifts...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08405"
msgstr "Nonsense! Misfortune or no,{line_break}a promise is a promise!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08406"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} got{line_break}{argument_item_name:2}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08407"
msgstr "I am glad that I was able to{line_break}give it to you before you left.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08408"
msgstr "Your travels seem to take you{line_break}from danger into greater{line_break}danger. Please be careful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08409"
msgstr "Thank you, Mr. Mayor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08410"
msgstr "...{actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08411"
msgstr "You... He just called you{line_break}{actor_name:5}, didn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08412"
msgstr "Why didn't I see it before?{line_break}You are {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08413"
msgstr "Then Menardi should be{line_break}somewhere around here,{line_break}too... And yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08414"
msgstr "You won't see Menardi or{line_break}Saturos ever again.{line_break}{actor_name:1} killed them.{page_break}They're probably at the bottom{line_break}of the sea by now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08415"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}! Quiet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08416"
msgstr "Hmph! I heard that, you{line_break}wretched little thing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08417"
msgstr "Can it be true? Is my{line_break}sister dead?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08418"
msgstr "No? Then where is she!?{line_break}Show me my sister!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08419"
msgstr "What is the matter? Is it so{line_break}very hard? You were traveling{line_break}with her°bring her to me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08420"
msgstr "She would never have left{line_break}you behind...and yet you are{line_break}alone...{pause_20_skippable} So it's true? She's...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08421"
msgstr "I can't believe it... No one has{line_break}the power to defeat Saturos{line_break}and my sister...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08422"
msgstr "Yet you all avoid my gaze...{line_break}And that look on your faces...{line_break}It...is true...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08423"
msgstr "Who is this {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08424"
msgstr "What? You feign ignorance?{line_break}Why? Would you protect him{line_break}from my fury!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08425"
msgstr "Never mind. I believe I've heard{line_break}some rumors of a traveler{line_break}named {actor_name:1} lately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08426"
msgstr "Is this {actor_name:1} the same{line_break}one they've been speaking of?{line_break}Is he pursuing you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08427"
msgstr "If that is the case, then this{line_break}{actor_name:1} should show up{line_break}here sooner or later.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08428"
msgstr "How do you know it wasn't{line_break}{actor_name:5} who defeated{line_break}your sister?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08429"
msgstr "What do you take me for?{line_break}I'm a warrior, like my sister...{page_break}I can gauge a man's strength{line_break}at a single glance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08430"
msgstr "Even if you doubled {actor_name:5}'s{line_break}power, he would still be no{line_break}match for my sister.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08431"
msgstr "And besides, I doubt {actor_name:5}{line_break}could find it in himself to{line_break}betray my sister.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08432"
msgstr "He knows that the lives of{line_break}those he holds dear would{line_break}hang in the balance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08433"
msgstr "But I must congratulate you on{line_break}your successes at both the{line_break}Mercury and Venus Lighthouses.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08434"
msgstr "Although your success there{line_break}now prevents us from{line_break}returning to the Western Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08435"
msgstr "You would have failed, of course,{line_break}had we not researched how to{line_break}climb those lighthouses...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08436"
msgstr "Oh, didn't Menardi tell you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08437"
msgstr "Regardless, {actor_name:1} won't be{line_break}getting in my way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08438"
msgstr "You will have to find your own{line_break}way to the Western Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08439"
msgstr "And if you make the journey,{line_break}you'll have to light Jupiter on{line_break}your own as well!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08440"
msgstr "We have our own work to do,{line_break}and number one on the list is{line_break}taking care of {actor_name:1}!{page_break}Are we clear on this, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08441"
msgstr "Aren't you an obedient boy...{line_break}If you're worried you can't get{line_break}it done, we could help you a bit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08442"
msgstr "What's the matter? Afraid{line_break}you can't perform your duties?{line_break}We could help you a bit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08443"
msgstr "No, thank you. I believe we'll{line_break}just find Jupiter Lighthouse on{line_break}our own, if it's all the same.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08444"
msgstr "I see. Just don't let{line_break}us down.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08445"
msgstr "We're going to find{line_break}that {actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08446"
msgstr "I'm going to find this{line_break}{actor_name:1}...{page_break}And I swear that the last thing{line_break}he sees will be Karst avenging{line_break}the death of her dear sister!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08447"
msgstr "Wow. And I thought Saturos{line_break}and Menardi had issues.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08448"
msgstr "We shouldn't take Karst{line_break}too lightly...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08449"
msgstr "Wait a moment... Karst did say{line_break}\"we,\" didn't she?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08450"
msgstr "Yes. Saturos and Menardi{line_break}traveled as a pair. Perhaps{line_break}she has a partner as well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08451"
msgstr "We ought to warn {actor_name:1}{line_break}that Karst is after him. Maybe{line_break}we should try to find him first.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08452"
msgstr "Believe me, I'd love to see{line_break}{actor_name:1} again, but we just don't{line_break}have time to look for him. Plus...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08453"
msgstr "Even if we did find them, I{line_break}think there is a good chance{line_break}we'd end up fighting them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08454"
msgstr "Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08455"
msgstr "What we are trying to achieve,{line_break}they are trying to prevent...{line_break}And they will fight to stop us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08456"
msgstr "But, {actor_name:6}... Aren't you and{line_break}{actor_name:1} an item? Couldn't{line_break}you, you know, do something?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08457"
msgstr "A... An item? No! I mean...{line_break}It's not like that! Not...really...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08458"
msgstr "...Stupid {actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08459"
msgstr "Ah! Well! Er, yes. For now, we{line_break}should press onward to Jupiter{line_break}Lighthouse, like we'd planned.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08460"
msgstr "But...what about {actor_name:2}{line_break}and the others?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08461"
msgstr "Don't you mean...{actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08462"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}! Be quiet! Sheesh...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08463"
msgstr "*Ahem!* Are you ready{line_break}to listen yet?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08464"
msgstr "They were strong enough to{line_break}defeat Saturos and Menardi.{line_break}They won't be beaten easily.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08465"
msgstr "We should continue on ahead,{line_break}just as Saturos and Menardi{line_break}would have, OK, {actor_name:6}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08466"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}? {actor_name:8}?{line_break}Are you ready?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08467"
msgstr "Then we should be going,{line_break}right, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08468"
msgstr "Oh! {actor_name:8}! After the way{line_break}we treated you, I thought you'd{line_break}never come to Madra again!{page_break}I know we were not very nice{line_break}to you before... I hope you can{line_break}forgive us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08469"
msgstr "Shin's developed a terrible{line_break}fear of the cold. He's afraid of{line_break}being turned into a block of ice.{page_break}Tell {actor_name:8} to cool it{line_break}with the ice routine, OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08470"
msgstr "Even the sound of the name{line_break}\"{actor_name:8}\" sends a chill{line_break}down my spine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08471"
msgstr "I understand why Shin's scared{line_break}of {actor_name:8}, but I think{line_break}he might be overdoing it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08472"
msgstr "It looks like the Kibombo must{line_break}have been involved in the raids{line_break}on our town...{page_break}Kibombo weapons are too{line_break}distinct... We found a bunch{line_break}of them after the attacks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08473"
msgstr "The pirates and the Kibombo{line_break}must have been working together.{line_break}What an astounding discovery!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08474"
msgstr "People are saying the Champa{line_break}and the Kibombo formed an{line_break}alliance... I don't buy it, myself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08475"
msgstr "That night, the Champa came from{line_break}the east, and the Kibombo, from{line_break}the west. That's not an alliance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08476"
msgstr "My boyfriend, Shin, seems so{line_break}downtrodden lately...{line_break}I hope he's all right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08477"
msgstr "I've told my sister not to{line_break}worry about Shin. He's tough.{line_break}At least...he usually is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08478"
msgstr "Shin seems terrified of{line_break}{actor_name:8}. I wonder what{line_break}happened between them.{page_break}Still, I guess that explains{line_break}why he's been so on edge{line_break}lately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08479"
msgstr "Shin's normally so kind and{line_break}gentle. I hope he gets over{line_break}whatever's bothering him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08480"
msgstr "I've noticed lately that the{line_break}temperature of the ocean has{line_break}been slowly rising.{page_break}It is a bad omen, I say.{line_break}Be wary if you plan to{line_break}set sail soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08481"
msgstr "The ocean's been warming up{line_break}a lot, and we're seeing lots of{line_break}dead fish washing up on shore.{page_break}At this rate, there aren't going{line_break}to be any fish left for us to{line_break}catch for food.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08482"
msgstr "When the ocean warms, the{line_break}Eastern Sea beckons... Seek for{line_break}the center, the legends say.{page_break}These legends are known to{line_break}nearly every sailor. It would be{line_break}wise for you to remember it, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08483"
msgstr "I knew the temperatures were{line_break}rising slowly over time...{page_break}But now, it's plain to see that{line_break}the temperatures are rising at{line_break}a dramatically higher rate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08484"
msgstr "Our new ship is spectacular, but{line_break}if we can't find some new fishing{line_break}spots, it does us no good at all.{page_break}Tidal waves, raids on our town,{line_break}and now the warming ocean{line_break}waters... What's going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08485"
msgstr "Seafaring towns know many{line_break}more legends of the sea...{page_break}But a few of the sailors passing{line_break}through here have told their{line_break}share of stories of the salty sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08486"
msgstr "Are you worried about all the{line_break}fish that have been washing{line_break}up dead on the shore?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08487"
msgstr "No need to worry. Those fish{line_break}all died farther out in the bay.{page_break}The fish we cook here at{line_break}the inn are caught fresh{line_break}from our pier.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08488"
msgstr "No?! I suppose you'd be happy{line_break}if the fish up and vanished, huh?{page_break}They're dying because the ocean{line_break}temperatures are rising, but no{line_break}one is doing anything about it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08489"
msgstr "Has someone been telling you{line_break}that we've been serving up the{line_break}dead fish found on the beaches?{page_break}Outrageous! We go to great pains{line_break}to serve only the finest fresh{line_break}fish to our customers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08490"
msgstr "One of our guests kept asking{line_break}for a weapon that he could use{line_break}to slay a great sea monster...{page_break}He kept mentioning this trident{line_break}thing, but we couldn't help him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08491"
msgstr "I guess that a lot of dead{line_break}fish have been washing ashore{line_break}all over the eastern seacoast.{page_break}It's kind of sad... Imagine how{line_break}much money we could have{line_break}made if we'd caught them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08492"
msgstr "I've heard that rising ocean{line_break}temperatures mean that a{line_break}volcano is forming under the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08493"
msgstr "I've never seen a single customer{line_break}get sick from our fish! Not a{line_break}single one...{page_break}I've never served rotten old fish{line_break}in my life! I only use the finest,{line_break}freshest ingredients in my cuisine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08494"
msgstr "Someone must have seen me{line_break}burying the dead fish. I'll bet{line_break}that's where the rumor started.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08495"
msgstr "It must be a very strange{line_break}monster if one needs such{line_break}a unique weapon to fight it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08496"
msgstr "If I had a boat we could{line_break}use, now would be a great{line_break}time to make some money.{page_break}We'd just need to take our{line_break}nets and scoop up whatever{line_break}we find...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08497"
msgstr "Hm... I wonder if the tidal{line_break}wave might have been caused{line_break}by an undersea eruption...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08498"
msgstr "My ship! At long last...{line_break}I have returned to my ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08499"
msgstr "Well, {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08500"
msgstr "I'm thrilled... I'm just happy{line_break}to be back with my ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08501"
msgstr "Uh, that's not what{line_break}Kraden's asking...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08502"
msgstr "You forgot, didn't you, {actor_name:8}?{line_break}When we talked in Kibombo?{line_break}Remember what Kraden asked?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08503"
msgstr "He wanted you to take us{line_break}to your home... To Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08504"
msgstr "Remember how we said we'd{line_break}talk about it later?{line_break}Well, it's later now, {actor_name:8}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08505"
msgstr "Oh... Is it? I suppose we have{line_break}to talk about it sooner or later.{line_break}You shall have your answer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08506"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}...if you do not{line_break}wish to take us, you do not have{line_break}to. Just tell me honestly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08507"
msgstr "And if not, well, we'll just have{line_break}to get ourselves a boat and find{line_break}our own way to Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08508"
msgstr "Right, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08509"
msgstr "What's with the guilt trip?{line_break}{actor_name:8} hasn't even given{line_break}us his answer yet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08510"
msgstr "Kraden! {actor_name:5}! Stop trying{line_break}to pressure {actor_name:8}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08511"
msgstr "{actor_name:7} is right! You guys{line_break}just let {actor_name:8} give{line_break}us his answer!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08512"
msgstr "I agree with {actor_name:5}. We{line_break}shouldn't try to pressure{line_break}{actor_name:8}, Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08513"
msgstr "But that's not what I was°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08514"
msgstr "Don't worry, {actor_name:7}...{line_break}I've actually been thinking{line_break}about this quite a bit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08515"
msgstr "I just never got the opportunity{line_break}to mention it before.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08516"
msgstr "Well? Well!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08517"
msgstr "It's not nice to test the{line_break}patience of an old man.{line_break}Will you take us or not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08518"
msgstr "We will go to Lemuria, Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08519"
msgstr "I figured it was too much to...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08520"
msgstr "What did you just say!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08521"
msgstr "I will take you to Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08522"
msgstr "Kraden? Are you OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08523"
msgstr "Is he OK!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08524"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}! Are you...{line_break}Are you serious?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08525"
msgstr "After what we've been through,{line_break}it would be wrong to deny you.{line_break}That's what made up my mind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08526"
msgstr "What's what made up your mind?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08527"
msgstr "The fact that you are{line_break}truly good people.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08528"
msgstr "You have gone to great trouble{line_break}to help one whose problems{line_break}needn't have concerned you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08529"
msgstr "Witnessing that kindness...{line_break}It made me want to help, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08530"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08531"
msgstr "No, {actor_name:6}. Please, don't say{line_break}a word. I've made up my mind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08532"
msgstr "I shall be leaving immediately,{line_break}but I want you to come, Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08533"
msgstr "Let us set sail, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}To my ship! And the Eastern Sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08534"
msgstr "So at long last, I will finally{line_break}reach Lemuria...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08535"
msgstr "I wonder what kind of advanced{line_break}civilization we'll find in Lemuria...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08536"
msgstr "I'm actually excited to find out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08537"
msgstr "What's wrong, {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08538"
msgstr "It just occurred to me... The{line_break}mayor of Madra and his wife{line_break}must be worried about me.{page_break}I'd feel bad if I didn't let{line_break}them know I was all right{line_break}before leaving Indra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08539"
msgstr "We should go tell them that{line_break}I've retrieved my orb. Then{line_break}they wouldn't have to worry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08540"
msgstr "Is that acceptable, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Can we stop by Madra briefly{line_break}before we leave for Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08541"
msgstr "What do you say, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Shall we go see the mayor?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08542"
msgstr "Don't worry about me. I've waited{line_break}this long. I can wait a little longer.{line_break}Let's go see the mayor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08543"
msgstr "I have no objection, so why{line_break}not? Let's go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08544"
msgstr "But we must depart as soon{line_break}as we're done at the mayor's{line_break}house, {actor_name:8}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08545"
msgstr "Oh, thank you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08546"
msgstr "Then let's waste no time!{line_break}We should set out for{line_break}Madra at once!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08547"
msgstr "At last, I'm back on my ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08548"
msgstr "Finally, I can return to{line_break}my beloved Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08549"
msgstr "Wait there a moment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08550"
msgstr "To set sail, we must{line_break}go down to the power{line_break}chamber belowdecks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08551"
msgstr "Let's head down.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08552"
msgstr "How did all these monsters{line_break}get on board? I could swear I{line_break}locked the door when I left...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08553"
msgstr "It doesn't matter. Once we get{line_break}this ship moving, I'm sure they'll{line_break}all jump ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08554"
msgstr "OK, now, I must set the{line_break}black orb in this pedestal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08555"
msgstr "Take the tiller, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08556"
msgstr "?!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08557"
msgstr "If you hope to reach Lemuria,{line_break}you'll have to learn a few{line_break}things about handling a ship.{page_break}I think we ought to sail{line_break}the Eastern Sea until you{line_break}get the hang of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08558"
msgstr "Kraden, shouldn't we be heading{line_break}straight for Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08559"
msgstr "Well, I suppose if we have to{line_break}learn to sail, it's better to do{line_break}it sooner than later...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08560"
msgstr "Then I want to go to Lalivero!{line_break}And Tolbi!{pause_20_skippable} Oh! And Vale!{line_break}Can we go to Vale?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08561"
msgstr "I'd love to see your hometown,{line_break}{actor_name:6}! Shall we? Let's{line_break}do it! To Vale we go!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08562"
msgstr "I don't think that's a good idea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08563"
msgstr "I'm with {actor_name:5}.{line_break}I don't think that would be{line_break}a wise course of action.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08564"
msgstr "Come, now! Why not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08565"
msgstr "Think about the roads we have{line_break}traveled to get where we are...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08566"
msgstr "I can't... I was never any{line_break}good at geography.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08567"
msgstr "Then allow me to explain...{page_break}The coastline of Angara, the{line_break}continent in which Vale lies,{line_break}is surrounded by rocky cliffs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08568"
msgstr "Oh... You don't think {actor_name:8}'s{line_break}boat could land there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08569"
msgstr "And as for Gondowan, I would{line_break}guess the people from Lalivero{line_break}are...looking for us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08570"
msgstr "He's right. Saturos and Menardi{line_break}went a little wild in Lalivero,{line_break}and you were all with them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08571"
msgstr "Oh... But {actor_name:7} can explain{line_break}the situation for us.{page_break}Faran and the Laliverans{line_break}would understand, I'm sure.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08572"
msgstr "And then they'd make me stay{line_break}in Lalivero! Would you just leave{line_break}me there, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08573"
msgstr "Oh yeah... Maybe that wouldn't be{line_break}such a good idea after all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08574"
msgstr "Then it's decided!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08575"
msgstr "What's decided?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08576"
msgstr "The sea is vast... We can go{line_break}wherever we please! So, let's{line_break}explore a bit, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08577"
msgstr "That's a great idea! We've{line_break}already met werewolves and{line_break}discovered new Psynergy.{page_break}I'm sure there's even more{line_break}out there waiting for us{line_break}to find it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08578"
msgstr "Wow! This is going to be great!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08579"
msgstr "Hmm... The seas can be quite{line_break}dangerous. It won't be my fault{line_break}if something happens, Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08580"
msgstr "To the open sea, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08581"
msgstr "There's no reaction...{line_break}It doesn't seem to be running.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08582"
msgstr "The mayor tried to give {actor_name:5}{line_break}{argument_item_name:2}, but {actor_name:5} can't{line_break}carry any more items.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08583"
msgstr "I couldn't possibly allow you to{line_break}leave with out giving you the{line_break}reward I promised.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08584"
msgstr "The mayor put the {argument_item_name:1}{line_break}in a pot.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08585"
msgstr "I'll put it in here. You can{line_break}come pick it up anytime.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08586"
msgstr "Rocks are poking out above{line_break}the waves. Pass them with care...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08587"
msgstr "These shoals would not make{line_break}a good place to land.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08588"
msgstr "Ever since the tidal wave moved{line_break}Indra, we haven't been able to go{line_break}to Gondowan's western shores.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08589"
msgstr "Did you know Indra moved?{line_break}It was quite a shock to all{line_break}of us here...{page_break}We haven't been able to use{line_break}the waterways to the south{line_break}ever since.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08590"
msgstr "My pop's the best sailor in{line_break}all the Eastern Sea!{page_break}That's why he can go anywhere,{line_break}even in that tiny boat of his!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08591"
msgstr "You're lucky, mister. You get to{line_break}ride your boat out on the open{line_break}sea all you want...{page_break}My dad'll be done with his boat{line_break}soon, and together, we'll be able{line_break}to sail anywhere we want...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08592"
msgstr "The waterways north of Tundaria{line_break}would have been the perfect{line_break}place to teach my sons to sail...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08593"
msgstr "I'm so grateful our little island{line_break}wasn't damaged in the tidal{line_break}wave... It was a miracle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08594"
msgstr "I can't wait until Dad teaches{line_break}me how to sail...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08595"
msgstr "I can't wait until the day{line_break}I can sail far away with{line_break}Dad and Kirt...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08596"
msgstr "Used to be, you could sail to{line_break}the other side of Gondowan by{line_break}skirting the coast of Tundaria.{page_break}Now, the whole area's got these{line_break}rocky spires... You just can't{line_break}work a boat around 'em.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08597"
msgstr "You must be cold, dressed in{line_break}those thin clothes... Come warm{line_break}yourselves by the fire...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08598"
msgstr "My mom says there's this{line_break}strange tower on the northern{line_break}cape of Tundaria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08599"
msgstr "Tundaria is the southernmost{line_break}continent in Weyard. I hear that{line_break}if you head east far enough...{page_break}There's an incredible waterfall{line_break}at the edge of the Easten Sea.{line_break}It sounds like hokum to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08600"
msgstr "Around here, it doesn't matter{line_break}what season it is...{line_break}It's always the cold season.{page_break}I can't even go outside without{line_break}first covering myself in fur.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08601"
msgstr "Who in Weyard would have{line_break}built a tower in the middle{line_break}of that frozen nowhere?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08602"
msgstr "I just want to know what's on{line_break}the other side of that sea{line_break}of fog...{page_break}No one has ever crossed{line_break}through it, but one day, I just{line_break}know I'll do it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08603"
msgstr "The Sea of Time... A massive bank{line_break}of fog that lies over the sea... All{line_break}sailors fear it, and rightly so!{page_break}I don't know if I'll ever make it{line_break}through, but I'm certain my son{line_break}will do it someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08604"
msgstr "Sailors tell of terrible currents{line_break}and vortexes that can tear a{line_break}boat to shreds in the Sea of Time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08605"
msgstr "When you enter the sea of fog...{line_break}enter the currents from the{line_break}direction of the red rocks.{page_break}Then, your ship won't be{line_break}destroyed.{pause_20_skippable} But that's all I know.{line_break}And it might not even be right!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08606"
msgstr "Ours is sad lineage...{page_break}Three generations of sons{line_break}have sworn their lives to trying{line_break}to pass through the sea of fog.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08607"
msgstr "Dad and Grandpa haven't been{line_break}able to cross the Sea of Time.{line_break}They're so old now...{page_break}I will be the one to make{line_break}their dreams come true.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08608"
msgstr "I remember once, an entire fleet{line_break}of ships entered the Sea of Time.{line_break}They vanished into the mists.{page_break}Every last one of the vessels{line_break}was destroyed by the currents.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08609"
msgstr "Once, long ago, my husband{line_break}entered the Sea of Time{line_break}without being destroyed.{page_break}The whirlpools spun him around,{line_break}and he got so dizzy he couldn't{line_break}stand. I wonder if he remembers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08610"
msgstr "I didn't really discover the{line_break}secret of the red rocks...{page_break}It was Yepp, the great explorer{line_break}from Yallam, who told me.{line_break}I should fess up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08611"
msgstr "And just what will happen once{line_break}they get through the sea of fog?{line_break}I wish they would just give up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08612"
msgstr "We like this island. A lot...{line_break}That's why we're here...{line_break}Because we like it.{page_break}We sure aren't looking{line_break}for Treasure Isle! Nope!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08613"
msgstr "What are you saying!? Idiot!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08614"
msgstr "Don't listen to that guy. He{line_break}didn't say anything about{line_break}Treasure Isle. Nothing at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08615"
msgstr "Look, we're busy...{line_break}We can't talk now...{line_break}Catch us some other time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08616"
msgstr "...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08617"
msgstr "The Eastern Sea is huge, even{line_break}if you don't add the Sea of Time,{line_break}which I guess you've got to do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08618"
msgstr "You don't look like much of a{line_break}sailor. You're not a treasure{line_break}hunter, are you?{page_break}Because you won't find any{line_break}in the waters around here, let{line_break}me tell you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08619"
msgstr "If we're supposed to be partners{line_break}in this crazy treasure hunt, why{line_break}am I the one doing all the cooking?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08620"
msgstr "Sure, there are legends about{line_break}how there's treasure hidden{line_break}north of the Sea of Time.{page_break}But have WE found any?{line_break}I just hope it's not on the sea-{line_break}floor! What would we do then?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08621"
msgstr "You used to be able to dive{line_break}into the ocean and find all{line_break}sorts of treasure in the reefs.{page_break}I liked to think all that stuff{line_break}was a gift from the deep...{line_break}A gift for me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08622"
msgstr "The temperature of the ocean{line_break}has been rising. The waters{line_break}are hottest at the Sea of Time.{page_break}I sure hope Poseidon hasn't{line_break}surfaced again! He was once a{line_break}king, but now, he's a monster!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08623"
msgstr "I remember how we used to{line_break}dredge up treasure by looking{line_break}for shadows in the reefs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08624"
msgstr "Long ago, Poseidon ruled{line_break}over all the oceans as the{line_break}one true king of the sea.{page_break}Legends say the only way to{line_break}defeat him is to stab him{line_break}with a trident...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08625"
msgstr "Pen pen!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08626"
msgstr "Pen pen pehnnn!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08627"
msgstr "My darling Pengulina hurt{line_break}her leg on the far shore and{line_break}can't swim back.{page_break}Somebody, please... Help her!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08628"
msgstr "Ohh... My leg... I can't get{line_break}back to my dearest Pengus...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08629"
msgstr "Thank you so much for saving{line_break}my sweet Pengulina.{page_break}Allow me to give you this{line_break}in return for your help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08630"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} got a beautiful stone{line_break}from Pengus as a reward for{line_break}saving dear little Pengulina.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08631"
msgstr "Pen pen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08632"
msgstr "Pen pen pehnnn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08633"
msgstr "I'm so happy my lovely{line_break}little Pengulina is all right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08634"
msgstr "I'm so glad to be back on{line_break}this side again, with my{line_break}precious Pengus.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08635"
msgstr "Pen pen pen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08636"
msgstr "Pen pen pehnnnn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08637"
msgstr "There is nothing better than{line_break}spending a day playing in the{line_break}snow with my pretty Pengulina.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08638"
msgstr "Pengus is pretty pleasant, and{line_break}I like that he likes me...{page_break}But he's always chasing me{line_break}around! I feel like I'm being{line_break}smothered...and I don't like it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08639"
msgstr "Chirp chirp!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08640"
msgstr "I love feeling fancy! I want{line_break}a really fancy accessory{line_break}to make me feel extra fancy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08641"
msgstr "Oh my! That stone you have!{line_break}It's divine! Simply divine!{page_break}I must have it! MUST! I'll give{line_break}you my very fancy neckerchief{line_break}for that fancy stone of yours!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08642"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} traded his stone{line_break}for the very fancy neckerchief.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08643"
msgstr "Chirp chirp!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08644"
msgstr "What do you think? Don't I{line_break}look fancy? I sure feel fancy!{line_break}And that's all that matters!{page_break}But I think this looks{line_break}fabulous on me! I love{line_break}fancy accessories!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08645"
msgstr "Moo! Moo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08646"
msgstr "I've been feeling so low{line_break}lately... I long to feel the{line_break}utter joy of...something.{page_break}I just don't know what.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08647"
msgstr "Oh! That red neckerchief{line_break}is quite nice indeed.{line_break}That would lift my spirits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08648"
msgstr "This really brightens{line_break}my mooood!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08649"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} tied the neckerchief{line_break}to the tree.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08650"
msgstr "Are you giving that lovely{line_break}thing to moooooi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08651"
msgstr "That's so kind of you! I should{line_break}repay you! Have some milk!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08652"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} traded the red neckerchief{line_break}for some fresh milk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08653"
msgstr "Yup. A nice, red neckerchief{line_break}will never steer you wrong!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08654"
msgstr "I'm sorry to hear that.{line_break}Come see me if you{line_break}don't want it anymore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08655"
msgstr "Are you giving that red{line_break}neckerchief to moooooi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08656"
msgstr "Arff! Arff!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08657"
msgstr "The water here is so salty!{line_break}I wish someone would bring{line_break}me something tasty to drink.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08658"
msgstr "Sniff! Sniff! I smell fresh milk!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08659"
msgstr "Hah hah hah! Are you going{line_break}to give me that milk? Are{line_break}you? Huh? Huh!?{page_break}I'll trade you this for it!{line_break}I caught it myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08660"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} traded his milk{line_break}for the dog's turtle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08661"
msgstr "I don't like to waste. I'll{line_break}just take little tiny laps.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08662"
msgstr "I don't want to waste, so{line_break}I'm just taking little laps.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08663"
msgstr "...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08664"
msgstr "I'm so very...very lonely.{line_break}I could sure use a friend.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08665"
msgstr "I'm so very sad and lonely.{line_break}I wish I had a friend to{line_break}call my own...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08666"
msgstr "Hey! You've got an itty-{line_break}bitty turtle tot, don't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08667"
msgstr "Why don't you set that{line_break}li'l guy free with me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08668"
msgstr "No? Oh... Then lonely I shall stay.{line_break}But if you change your mind,{line_break}you know where to find me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08669"
msgstr "Oh! You're really going to let{line_break}me take care of your li'l turtle?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08670"
msgstr "At long last, I have a friend!{line_break}Lonesome George I am no more!{line_break}I'm so happy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08671"
msgstr "I don't have much to offer in{line_break}return, but I can show you...{line_break}my secret spot.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08672"
msgstr "Hop on my back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08673"
msgstr "And we're off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08674"
msgstr "Well, here we are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08675"
msgstr "When you want to go back to{line_break}the island, just let me know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08676"
msgstr "Yup!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08677"
msgstr "You all set to go back{line_break}to the island?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08678"
msgstr "Then back we go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08679"
msgstr "Here we are!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08680"
msgstr "If you want to go to my secret{line_break}spot again, just let me know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08681"
msgstr "Take your time! I don't{line_break}like to rush...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08682"
msgstr "Yup!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08683"
msgstr "Want to go to my{line_break}secret spot again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08684"
msgstr "Anytime you want me to{line_break}take you to my secret spot,{line_break}just say the word.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08685"
msgstr "Then hop on my back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08686"
msgstr "And we're off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08687"
msgstr "Well, here we are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08688"
msgstr "When you want to go back to{line_break}the island, just let me know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08689"
msgstr "Yup!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08690"
msgstr "You all set to go back{line_break}to the island?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08691"
msgstr "Then back we go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08692"
msgstr "Here we are!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08693"
msgstr "If you want to go to my secret{line_break}spot again, just let me know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08694"
msgstr "Take your time! I don't{line_break}like to rush...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08695"
msgstr "I am here to tend to any travelers{line_break}who come to this place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08696"
msgstr "May these travelers' journey{line_break}end in peace and safety...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08697"
msgstr "Yallam doesn't get many{line_break}visitors. Hasn't for a long time.{page_break}I'd love to know a little about{line_break}what's going on in the outside{line_break}world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08698"
msgstr "Our master boatsman, Yepp, died.{line_break}Now, all we have to remember{line_break}him are the songs he wrote.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08699"
msgstr "If Yepp were alive today, our{line_break}village would be thriving. He{line_break}brought us lots of work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08700"
msgstr "Yepp found this huge bed of pearls{line_break}and sold them in another town.{page_break}Then, he bought all kinds of{line_break}things we needed in Yallam.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08701"
msgstr "There used to be a lot of{line_break}pearl divers here in Yallam. I{line_break}used to do some diving myself!{page_break}Yup... They were all younger{line_break}than me, but I still gave 'em{line_break}a good run for the money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08702"
msgstr "When we lost Yepp, all of{line_break}Yallam practically fell to pieces.{page_break}Our blacksmith, Sunshine, is our{line_break}only claim to fame now... He's{line_break}the best in all the lands...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08703"
msgstr "Yepp was the one who taught{line_break}me how to handle a boat.{line_break}That was right before he died...{page_break}He'd promised to teach me{line_break}how to dive for pearls...{line_break}Poor Yepp. I really miss him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08704"
msgstr "Yepp told me the only thing{line_break}he could teach me was how{line_break}to sail and how to sing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08705"
msgstr "Yepp was the one who{line_break}visited the lands beyond{line_break}eastern Osenia.{page_break}Since he died, we've had{line_break}no news from the outside{line_break}world at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08706"
msgstr "Singing with Yepp and all the{line_break}children in the village helped{line_break}us remember the songs.{page_break}It's funny how we all{line_break}memorized every one{line_break}of Yepp's songs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08707"
msgstr "Those pearls Yepp brought back{line_break}from the sea were the most{line_break}marvelous things I've ever seen.{page_break}If he were still with us,{line_break}Yallam wouldn't be in this{line_break}terrible fix.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08708"
msgstr "Yepp never told any of{line_break}us where he found his{line_break}bed of pearls, but...{page_break}I suspect it's somewhere{line_break}near the center of the Eastern{line_break}Sea. He knew that area well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08709"
msgstr "Yepp was amazing. He could{line_break}cut clean through the Sea of{line_break}Time with utter ease.{page_break}He read those waves like no{line_break}other sailor on Weyard. He{line_break}was a true man of the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08710"
msgstr "Sunshine is a famous{line_break}blacksmith... The most{line_break}famous in Osenia...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08711"
msgstr "I've searched the seas from{line_break}north to south, and I just can't{line_break}find those pearls...{page_break}I wonder if the pearls from his{line_break}secret place are all gone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08712"
msgstr "Yepp always sang such{line_break}wonderful children's songs{line_break}whenever he played with them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08713"
msgstr "Yepp had three different songs{line_break}he used to sing. Each song{line_break}was about a different situation.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08714"
msgstr "Do you like children's songs?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08715"
msgstr "Hmmm... Well, I don't care for{line_break}them so much, myself.{page_break}I mean, the lyrics make no{line_break}sense! ...And that stupid dance{line_break}we have to do when we sing!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08716"
msgstr "Yeah, you're totally right.{line_break}I just hate those songs.{page_break}One of these days, I'll{line_break}write one, and it'll be so{line_break}much better than this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08717"
msgstr "The songs are supposed to mean{line_break}something, but none of the other{line_break}kids knows what...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08718"
msgstr "I wonder why Yepp wanted{line_break}the children to learn those{line_break}songs he used to sing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08719"
msgstr "It's been really dry the past{line_break}few months. Even Taopo{line_break}Swamp has dried up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08720"
msgstr "We're supposed to be right in{line_break}the middle of the rainy season,{line_break}but I don't see any rain...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08721"
msgstr "When Taopo Swamp dries up,{line_break}we're in for some serious{line_break}drought problems this year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08722"
msgstr "I can't stand this drought!{line_break}How long is the weather{line_break}going to be like this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08723"
msgstr "Sunshine has started complaining{line_break}that he can't work lately. He{line_break}blames it on the lack of rain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08724"
msgstr "Our blacksmith, Sunshine, makes{line_break}the kinds of items you can't{line_break}find anywhere else.{page_break}You wouldn't know it to look{line_break}at him...or to talk to him...but{line_break}he's an amazing worker...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08725"
msgstr "What kind of person only wants{line_break}to work when it's raining?{page_break}I know Sunshine likes to enjoy{line_break}his days off, but he needs to{line_break}find a better excuse not to work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08726"
msgstr "Sunshine's a little eccentric. He{line_break}disappears into Taopo Swamp{line_break}for days at a time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08727"
msgstr "If the blacksmith isn't willing to{line_break}work, then how am I supposed{line_break}to get fine weapons to sell?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08728"
msgstr "If Sunshine set his mind to it,{line_break}he could make a lot of money!{line_break}What a waste of talent...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08729"
msgstr "If you want plain old, boring{line_break}armor, have a look around.{page_break}If you're looking for some{line_break}of Sunshine's work, you'll{line_break}have to come back later.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08730"
msgstr "I shouldn't tell him how boring{line_break}all this stuff is. I wish Sunshine{line_break}would get back to work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08731"
msgstr "If you're looking for Taopo{line_break}Swamp, head west around{line_break}the northern mountain range.{page_break}Sunshine sometimes goes{line_break}up there by himself on long{line_break}trips. It's a dangerous place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08732"
msgstr "What does Sunshine want{line_break}in Taopo Swamp?{page_break}There's nothing up there{line_break}but bugs and some odd{line_break}mountain fish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08733"
msgstr "It's a bit strange trying to{line_break}run an inn in a city that{line_break}never gets tourists, isn't it?{page_break}Well, sometimes, the locals{line_break}like to stay here. It's like a{line_break}little vacation for them, I guess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08734"
msgstr "Taopo Swamp has dried up, and{line_break}now it's inaccessible.{page_break}What's worse, with no water,{line_break}we can no longer get any more{line_break}delicious Yallam mountain fish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08735"
msgstr "Yallam was always such a{line_break}poor town. We had to work{line_break}hard just to break even.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08736"
msgstr "There weren't a lot of mountain{line_break}fish after the swamp dried up.{line_break}We probably won't catch many.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08737"
msgstr "Even out in these far-off{line_break}shores, people need the{line_break}services and hope I bring.{page_break}I am grateful merely to have{line_break}the chance to bring them{line_break}some small relief.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08738"
msgstr "Once, this was a thriving village.{line_break}Now, I look around, and I only{line_break}see abject poverty and despair.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08739"
msgstr "Ah, so you want me to make{line_break}you a little something special?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08740"
msgstr "Listen, when the sun's shining,{line_break}that's \"me time.\" I only work{line_break}when it's raining, you get me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08741"
msgstr "Oh, that's good. It's a bright,{line_break}sunshiny day, so I'm not doing{line_break}any work. Not till it rains.{page_break}But listen, I'm not just slacking{line_break}off because it's a nice day. I can{line_break}only work in the rain! Really!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08742"
msgstr "This is Sunshine's house. He's the{line_break}local blacksmith.{page_break}I'm afraid he's not taking on{line_break}any jobs right now, though.{line_break}He's just not...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08743"
msgstr "Dad's not doing any work right{line_break}now, but I'm making some basic{line_break}things for the villagers.{page_break}Maybe someday, I'll be able to{line_break}smith unique weapons, like my{line_break}dad. That's why I keep practicing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08744"
msgstr "If it's not raining, I can't get{line_break}into Taopo Swamp.{page_break}And if I can't get to Taopo, then{line_break}I can't get the stuff I need to{line_break}work, so there's no point!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08745"
msgstr "Sunshine's a pretty stubborn guy.{line_break}If he says he isn't going to{line_break}work, then he's not gonna work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08746"
msgstr "Everyone thinks Dad is stubborn,{line_break}but he's not...{page_break}He's a true artist, and so what{line_break}if he gets a little temperamental{line_break}from time to time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08747"
msgstr "Hey, where did you get your{line_break}hands on those materials?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08748"
msgstr "Well, it doesn't really{line_break}matter, now does it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08749"
msgstr "Looking at those raw materials{line_break}you've got there gives me a{line_break}mean hunger to do some smithing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08750"
msgstr "I handed him the {argument_item_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08751"
msgstr "Wait until you see what I'm{line_break}going to make for you!{line_break}You'll be amazed. Seriously.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08752"
msgstr "I can't wait to see what I'm{line_break}going to wind up making with{line_break}this...{page_break}It's funny, but I never know{line_break}until I actually start working! I'm{line_break}sure you'll be happy with it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08753"
msgstr "It takes our Sunshine a long{line_break}time to finish the items he{line_break}works on.{page_break}Maybe you could just...wait{line_break}a little while before coming{line_break}to pick it up...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08754"
msgstr "It's so weird, but something{line_break}really inspired my father to{line_break}work! He's beaming with joy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08755"
msgstr "It's been a long time since{line_break}I've been able to work. I'm so{line_break}excited! What should I make?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08756"
msgstr "What happened to Sunshine?{line_break}He's so happy, and he just{line_break}talks about work all the time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08757"
msgstr "Now that my dad's working again,{line_break}I have to watch his every move{line_break}to see what I can learn from him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08758"
msgstr "You want the item I made{line_break}with your raw materials?{line_break}Sure, sure...{page_break}My wife has it. She can{line_break}give it to you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08759"
msgstr "I've got the item you ordered.{page_break}Now, about the payment... We{line_break}only take cash. I hope that's not{line_break}a problem. Do you have enough?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08760"
msgstr "Hey, we're not a charity! If{line_break}you don't have the money,{line_break}you don't get the item!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08761"
msgstr "Right. Your {argument_item_name:1} will{line_break}come to {argument_actor_name:1} coin{plural_suffix}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08762"
msgstr "Hey, you don't enough money!{line_break}What are you trying to pull!?{line_break}I can't give you this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08763"
msgstr "OK, here you go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08764"
msgstr "You got the {argument_item_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08765"
msgstr "Man, if Sunshine worked more,{line_break}we'd be wealthy! What a{line_break}waste of a great talent...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08766"
msgstr "My dad's work is just insane!{line_break}It'll take me years to be{line_break}that good!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08767"
msgstr "Do you want to hear one of{line_break}the songs Yepp wrote?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08768"
msgstr "This is where all the kids{line_break}in Yallam come to play...{page_break}Nobody complains when we{line_break}play around out here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08769"
msgstr "Running around in circles{line_break}here while singing one of{line_break}Yepp's songs is pretty tough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08770"
msgstr "There's a game that goes along{line_break}with the song, but it's tough. I{line_break}want to play something else.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08771"
msgstr "Yepp wrote all of his children's{line_break}songs while he was out here{line_break}in his own private space.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08772"
msgstr "Yepp's songs are a lot of fun,{line_break}because he made this game{line_break}that goes along with them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08773"
msgstr "There's a lot of stuff to remember{line_break}for each song. It's tough to play{line_break}without making any mistakes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08774"
msgstr "I once heard that children's{line_break}songs and stories have{line_break}hidden meanings.{page_break}I wonder if Yepp has hidden{line_break}anything in his songs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08775"
msgstr "The story is that all these objects{line_break}around here were brought here{line_break}by Yepp long, long ago.{page_break}If you look around, you'll see{line_break}that everything was arranged{line_break}in accordance with his songs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08776"
msgstr "Here, let me show you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08777"
msgstr "Try turning the wooden pole{line_break}sticking out of that stone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08778"
msgstr "I thought I saw something{line_break}sparkling in the ground!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08779"
msgstr "Hey, why don't you play with{line_break}us while we sing Yepp's song!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08780"
msgstr "This is where all the kids{line_break}in Yallam come to play...{page_break}Nobody complains when we{line_break}play around out here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08781"
msgstr "Running in circles and singing{line_break}that song makes me feel all{line_break}dizzy in the head.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08782"
msgstr "There's a game that goes along{line_break}with the song, but it's tough. I{line_break}want to play something else.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08783"
msgstr "Yepp wrote all of his children's{line_break}songs while he was out here{line_break}in his own private space.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08784"
msgstr "Yepp's songs are a lot of fun,{line_break}because he made this game{line_break}that goes along with them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08785"
msgstr "There's a lot of stuff to remember{line_break}for each song. It's tough to play{line_break}without making any mistakes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08786"
msgstr "I once heard that children's{line_break}songs and stories have{line_break}hidden meanings.{page_break}I wonder if Yepp has hidden{line_break}anything in his songs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08787"
msgstr "The story is that all these objects{line_break}around here were brought here{line_break}by Yepp long, long ago.{page_break}If you look around, you'll see{line_break}that everything was arranged{line_break}in accordance with his songs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08788"
msgstr "Here, let me show you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08789"
msgstr "If you want to go to the stars,{line_break}if you want to go to the stars.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08790"
msgstr "Go north past the twins,{line_break}passing two swirls, run{line_break}deasil twice 'round the trunk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08791"
msgstr "Haste without waste, and head to{line_break}the east, past three to the north.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08792"
msgstr "There, run 'round thrice and wait{line_break}for the waves. When they stop,{line_break}run north and go to the stars.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08793"
msgstr "If you race full of folly and{line_break}take the wrong way, you'll{line_break}find yourself a watery grave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08794"
msgstr "Do you wanna hear the second{line_break}children's song Yepp wrote?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08795"
msgstr "Well, that's just fine then. Give{line_break}me a holler if you ever do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08796"
msgstr "If you want to go to the moon,{line_break}if you want to go to the moon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08797"
msgstr "Face west from the stars and{line_break}run straight past three swirls,{line_break}then circle 'round twice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08798"
msgstr "Haste without waste, and head to{line_break}the south, then one swirl west.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08799"
msgstr "There, run 'round thrice and wait{line_break}for the waves. When they stop,{line_break}run south and go for the moon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08800"
msgstr "If you race full of folly and{line_break}take the wrong way, you'll{line_break}find yourself a watery grave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08801"
msgstr "OK, so, now do you want to{line_break}hear the third children's song?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08802"
msgstr "Well, that's just fine then. Give{line_break}me a holler if you ever do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08803"
msgstr "If you want to go to the sun,{line_break}if you want to go to the sun.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08804"
msgstr "Face south from the moon{line_break}and run straight through two{line_break}swirls, then circle 'round twice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08805"
msgstr "Haste without waste, and head to{line_break}the west, then six to the north.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08806"
msgstr "There, run 'round thrice and wait{line_break}for the waves. When they stop,{line_break}run north and go for the sun.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08807"
msgstr "If you race full of folly and{line_break}take the wrong way, you'll{line_break}find yourself a watery grave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08808"
msgstr "That's it. That's all the games{line_break}we have for the songs...{page_break}If you want to play some{line_break}more, just give me a holler.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08809"
msgstr "This is Apojii, the easternmost{line_break}island in the Eastern Sea!{page_break}Wherever you're from, you've{line_break}come a long way. You must{line_break}be here to see Gaia Falls!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08810"
msgstr "Whatever you do, don't sail{line_break}out to the eastern edge{line_break}of the sea...{page_break}That's where the world ends.{line_break}No one knows where the falls{line_break}go, but you won't come back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08811"
msgstr "The huge waterfall at the{line_break}edge of the world is known{line_break}as Gaia Falls.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08812"
msgstr "On Aqua Island, you can see{line_break}the guardian moai.{page_break}Because of the moai, no one{line_break}can climb the craggy mountain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08813"
msgstr "Have you any idea what it's like{line_break}living on the edge of the world?{line_break}One wrong step, and down you go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08814"
msgstr "I don't know what brings you{line_break}to Apojii, but you'd better not{line_break}be planning anything stupid.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08815"
msgstr "When they come of age,{line_break}all the men of Apojii go{line_break}to Aqua Island. Will I, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08816"
msgstr "Do you think if you fall off{line_break}of Gaia Falls that you keep{line_break}on falling forever and ever?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08817"
msgstr "If there's nothing on Aqua{line_break}Island, then what are those{line_break}moai guarding, anyway?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08818"
msgstr "Looking over Gaia Falls{line_break}really makes you feel{line_break}small and insignificant.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08819"
msgstr "The currents near Apojii run{line_break}swiftly because we're so near{line_break}to Gaia Falls.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08820"
msgstr "All of the ocean's water is{line_break}spilling over Gaia Falls... Where{line_break}does it all go?{page_break}And more importantly, what{line_break}happens when all the water's{line_break}gone over the edge?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08821"
msgstr "Why would anyone build{line_break}a guardian statue out on{line_break}Aqua Island? What's to guard?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08822"
msgstr "Well, at least Gaia Falls will{line_break}put an end to a few silly{line_break}arguments.{page_break}After all, if it's got an edge{line_break}and you can fall off it, the{line_break}world is clearly FLAT!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08823"
msgstr "Apojii has so many nice{line_break}sights... Gaia Falls to the east,{line_break}and Aqua Island to the south.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08824"
msgstr "Aqua Island is supposed to{line_break}be dangerous, but that's why{line_break}I want to go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08825"
msgstr "I wonder where I'd be if I{line_break}fell off Gaia Falls...{page_break}I'd like to know, but I don't{line_break}want to find out firsthand!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08826"
msgstr "Aqua Rock must be the secret{line_break}hidden on Aqua Island. One day,{line_break}I'll have to scale its peak.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08827"
msgstr "What...{line_break}What just happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08828"
msgstr "That rock couldn't have heard{line_break}my wishes... That's impossible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08829"
msgstr "It's got to be.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08830"
msgstr "Well, OK then... Maybe we should{line_break}try putting some more of our{line_break}wishes into the rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08831"
msgstr "There's this guy in town who{line_break}spends his time at the spring,{line_break}staring at the Aqua Stone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08832"
msgstr "Why does my father keep{line_break}staring at that rock every day?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08833"
msgstr "I just wish he'd spend{line_break}some time at home. I'm{line_break}fed up with his nonsense!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08834"
msgstr "I can't ever tell what kind{line_break}of mood Mom and Dad are{line_break}in. At least they're not fighting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08835"
msgstr "I absolutely refuse to let{line_break}my son swim in the ocean{line_break}until he is an adult.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08836"
msgstr "The currents around Apojii{line_break}are just too strong to let{line_break}children swim on their own.{page_break}They're too strong for a lot{line_break}of the adults, too... They can{line_break}just wash a person away!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08837"
msgstr "I'm not allowed to go{line_break}into the ocean.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08838"
msgstr "Hey, mister! Did you know{line_break}that all the kids are calling{line_break}you their hero?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08839"
msgstr "I sink like a rock. It always{line_break}embarrasses my son to see{line_break}me try to swim.{page_break}I'm afraid he's no better than{line_break}I am, but he still wants to{line_break}practice and get better!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08840"
msgstr "Poor boy... His father sinks like{line_break}a rock, and I know it's genetic.{line_break}So he's not allowed to swim!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08841"
msgstr "It's stupid that I'm not{line_break}allowed to swim just because{line_break}Dad doesn't know how...{page_break}Someday, I'll show him...{line_break}I'll show them all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08842"
msgstr "Wow! He swam in the ocean{line_break}and survived the currents!{line_break}And he's looking at me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08843"
msgstr "That old Aqua Stone is{line_break}supposed to be the key to{line_break}getting onto Aqua Island.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08844"
msgstr "He's too old to try now,{line_break}but my husband used to{line_break}dream of scaling Aqua Rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08845"
msgstr "You unlock the Aqua Stone by{line_break}making it damp, but splashing{line_break}springwater on it won't work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08846"
msgstr "He always wanted to climb{line_break}to the peak of the mountain{line_break}on Aqua Island.{page_break}But he spent all his time{line_break}studying that Aqua Stone{line_break}instead. I always wondered why.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08847"
msgstr "It'd be nice if we could{line_break}import some items that{line_break}our visitors would like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08848"
msgstr "No one ships to Garapas so{line_break}I wonder if wares are scarce.{page_break}On the other hand, I suppose some{line_break}wares are unique to Garapas.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08849"
msgstr "Wow! You look just like the guy{line_break}who showed up in the fancy boat.{page_break}He slept for a long time... He{line_break}must've had a really long trip.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08850"
msgstr "You guys aren't the warriors{line_break}who came in that boat, are you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08851"
msgstr "Hmm... A while ago, some{line_break}others came in a boat much{line_break}like yours...{page_break}I'm sure back on the mainland{line_break}that those boats are all very{line_break}popular, aren't they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08852"
msgstr "It's not nice to tease an old{line_break}lady! If that's not your boat,{line_break}then how did you get here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08853"
msgstr "I'm sure that boat is{line_break}quite comfortable...{page_break}But no matter how nice your{line_break}boat is, you can't beat sleeping{line_break}in a nice, dry bed on land.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08854"
msgstr "Those guys on the other{line_break}boat must have been pretty{line_break}well off...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08855"
msgstr "This little island must seem{line_break}quite boring to you{line_break}sophisticated mainlander types.{page_break}But we have our share of{line_break}hardships and trials.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08856"
msgstr "I'm sick of living on this{line_break}boring island paradise!{page_break}Ah! Does thinking that{line_break}make me a bad person?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08857"
msgstr "I'd love to go to the mainland.{line_break}I want to go somewhere{line_break}without any ocean!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08858"
msgstr "Whenever visitors come{line_break}out, the islanders start to{line_break}complain about their lives.{page_break}But they don't realize that{line_break}they live better here than{line_break}they ever could in Osenia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08859"
msgstr "Maybe they'll take me with{line_break}them if I ask for a job! I can{line_break}swab a mean deck!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08860"
msgstr "I wonder what it's like,{line_break}standing in the middle of a{line_break}vast ocean of grass or sand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08861"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} checked the tablet.{line_break}It looks like there are strange{line_break}characters carved on it.{page_break}Wielder of Water's strength...{line_break}Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}If th'art worthy, the power{line_break}to drain away the standing{line_break}water shall be yours.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08862"
msgstr "Water's strength, huh? That sounds{line_break}like my sort of thing, doesn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08863"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} tried to touch{line_break}the stone slate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08864"
msgstr "What went wrong? What are{line_break}we going to do, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08865"
msgstr "Maybe our power{line_break}is being tested.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08866"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} checked the column.{page_break}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08867"
msgstr "It's a column with a spot where{line_break}you can place something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08868"
msgstr "You placed the {argument_item_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08869"
msgstr "We've had a lot of trouble{line_break}here in Izumo lately.{page_break}I don't want to scare you,{line_break}but...you should leave, and fast.{line_break}Right now. Seriously. Run.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08870"
msgstr "My name's Okuni. I'm a great{line_break}dancer... Except I don't feel{line_break}much like dancing these days.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08871"
msgstr "Lady Uzume doesn't want{line_break}to sacrifice Kushinada.{page_break}But that's the only way{line_break}to appease the serpent...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08872"
msgstr "Susa's going to try to kill the{line_break}serpent and save his beloved{line_break}Kushinada. He's so fearless!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08873"
msgstr "As a child, Susa was as wild as{line_break}could be and brought his elder{line_break}sibling, Lady Uzume, much strife.{page_break}Kushinada is the one who tamed{line_break}his wild ways. Of course, no one{line_break}wants to see her sacrificed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08874"
msgstr "Choosing the next sacrifice{line_break}by lottery seems such a{line_break}harsh method.{page_break}I am far too old to understand{line_break}the ideas of these modern times.{line_break}They seem far too extreme.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08875"
msgstr "The daughters of the family in{line_break}that home requested that we use{line_break}a lottery to choose the victims.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08876"
msgstr "A brave warrior will appear to{line_break}defeat the serpent by the next{line_break}full moon...{page_break}It's just a legend, though. No one{line_break}believes that. No one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08877"
msgstr "See this ring of giant stones?{line_break}They've been here for ages.{line_break}No one knows who put them here.{page_break}See how they make{line_break}this beautiful circle?{line_break}Except for that one, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08878"
msgstr "Susa moved it... He didn't even{line_break}use his hands. He surely holds{line_break}the secrets to a great power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08879"
msgstr "You're...not terribly{line_break}observant, are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08880"
msgstr "The misaligned stone! It's{line_break}back in its original position!{line_break}How did this happen!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08881"
msgstr "Hmmm... Either Susa or Kushinada{line_break}must have moved it when{line_break}I wasn't looking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08882"
msgstr "Can you imagine what it must{line_break}be like to have the power to move{line_break}stones without touching them?{page_break}That anyone should possess{line_break}that power is truly amazing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08883"
msgstr "The Great Serpent of Mikage{line_break}has awakened... What does it all{line_break}mean?{page_break}That dragon is the guardian of{line_break}the island, so why is it treating{line_break}us so cruelly?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08884"
msgstr "I'm not going to be sacrificed,{line_break}but that doesn't mean I'm happy.{page_break}My dear friend Kushinada{line_break}doesn't deserve this, either...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08885"
msgstr "I'm sure that kindhearted{line_break}Lady Uzume doesn't want{line_break}to sacrifice anyone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08886"
msgstr "What if losing Kushinada makes{line_break}Susa return to his wild ways?{line_break}I hope he fights the serpent...{page_break}If he loses, at least he won't{line_break}have to bear living without{line_break}Kushinada.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08887"
msgstr "Lady Uzume loves her brother{line_break}dearly... I'm sure she'd take{line_break}Kushinada's place if she could.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08888"
msgstr "Sacrifices as great as this{line_break}should not be determined by{line_break}chance alone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08889"
msgstr "Kushinada's always had bad{line_break}luck at games of chance. I'll bet{line_break}those girls were counting on it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08890"
msgstr "Why won't anybody listen{line_break}to Lady Uzume?{page_break}They've always trusted her,{line_break}at least up until now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08891"
msgstr "Why does Lady Uzume have{line_break}me guarding these ruins?{line_break}What a waste of time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08892"
msgstr "Okuni, Kushinada, and Lady Uzume{line_break}all drew in the lottery to choose{line_break}the next sacrifice with us...{page_break}I can't believe we drew{line_break}Kushinada. Is that chance? Fate?{line_break}I guess you never know...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08893"
msgstr "If Lady Uzume's name had been{line_break}drawn in the lottery, would she{line_break}have been the next sacrifice?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08894"
msgstr "I'm so relieved that I'm not{line_break}this year's sacrifice, but what{line_break}happens next year?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08895"
msgstr "Susa's been so sad all the{line_break}time, ever since Kushinada{line_break}was named the next sacrifice.{page_break}I never liked the old, wild Susa,{line_break}but he's so different now. Maybe{line_break}I can be his new girlfriend.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08896"
msgstr "Lady Uzume's been able to focus{line_break}on governing Izumo lately. I think{line_break}it's because Susa's calmed down.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08897"
msgstr "I only suggested this lottery{line_break}idea because I didn't want to{line_break}be sacrificed.{page_break}It looks like Kushinada really{line_break}does have bad luck, like{line_break}everyone says...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08898"
msgstr "What I want to know is, what{line_break}caused our legendary guardian{line_break}to awaken?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08899"
msgstr "A while back, a volcano erupted{line_break}on the mainland. We saw brilliant{line_break}flashes of light to the west.{page_break}The great dragon awoke shortly{line_break}afterward. It caused a terrible{line_break}panic through the island.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08900"
msgstr "That Dragonsbane seems to{line_break}have put the serpent under...{line_break}but for how long?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08901"
msgstr "I can't find my dagger...{line_break}I had it earlier... Where did it°{line_break}I wonder if Susa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08902"
msgstr "I am old, and I've had enough of{line_break}this world. Why wouldn't I make{line_break}a good sacrifice for the dragon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08903"
msgstr "The serpent can't stand sunlight,{line_break}so it only shows up in the village{line_break}at night. Just as the legend says.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08904"
msgstr "The serpent is only supposed{line_break}to awaken if the island is in{line_break}grave danger.{page_break}I wonder what calamity{line_break}is going to befall us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08905"
msgstr "I wonder if all the recent{line_break}disasters aroused the dragon{line_break}from his slumber on the mountain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08906"
msgstr "The serpent will drink as much{line_break}Dragonsbane as it can find,{line_break}right down to the last drop.{page_break}Nobody knows why they like{line_break}it so much, considering how{line_break}much it weakens them...{page_break}It must be like catnip to them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08907"
msgstr "According to legend, that's the{line_break}only thing that can put the{line_break}serpent back to sleep.{page_break}As for the dagger...{line_break}I'll bet Susa's planning on{line_break}using it to save Kushinada.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08908"
msgstr "Our guardian serpent is really{line_break}just a dragon. Why do dragons{line_break}always want maiden sacrifices?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08909"
msgstr "There's no way to get sunlight{line_break}into the serpent's cave on{line_break}Mt. Mikage. Just no way...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08910"
msgstr "Yeah, Susa came through{line_break}here on his way to save{line_break}Kushinada.{page_break}The jerk knocked me flat{line_break}and just kept on going...{line_break}He was totally wild...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08911"
msgstr "Even if Susa tried to rescue{line_break}Kushinada, she wouldn't just{line_break}run away with him.{page_break}I think she still believes that{line_break}a hero will appear and defeat{line_break}the serpent. That must be it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08912"
msgstr "You know, I can't stand Susa,{line_break}but I understand how he feels.{line_break}Kushinada's a really sweet girl.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08913"
msgstr "Lady Uzume says that a hero{line_break}would appear, but I don't know...{line_break}There's no hero coming...{page_break}If Susa came running past{line_break}me with Kushinada, I wouldn't{line_break}stop them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08914"
msgstr "*Sniff*{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08915"
msgstr "Susa, don't come{line_break}for me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08916"
msgstr "If I see you, I'll surely lose{line_break}the courage to sacrifice{line_break}myself for Izumo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08917"
msgstr "If I run, Lady Uzume and all{line_break}of Izumo will suffer greatly...{line_break}Please... Don't come for me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08918"
msgstr "Lady Uzume has foretold{line_break}the coming of a hero,{line_break}and I believe her...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08919"
msgstr "And so I shall remain here,{line_break}until the coming of the next{line_break}full moon...{pause_20_skippable}and the hero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08920"
msgstr "Susa, please...{line_break}Don't try to save me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08921"
msgstr "Susa's not here. I believe{line_break}he went to Mt. Mikage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08922"
msgstr "He believes he can save{line_break}Kushinada, and so he has{line_break}gone to fight the serpent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08923"
msgstr "He truly believes he can{line_break}defeat the Great Serpent{line_break}of Mikage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08924"
msgstr "It's all for naught, though, as{line_break}a hero will certainly appear and{line_break}destroy the great serpent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08925"
msgstr "If the serpent defeats Susa,{line_break}I'll...be alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08926"
msgstr "There's no point dancing{line_break}if Okuni's not here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08927"
msgstr "The serpent attacked the{line_break}town one night during a{line_break}festival.{page_break}It didn't leave until it had{line_break}eaten all of the food we'd{line_break}prepared for our feast...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08928"
msgstr "The serpent ate all our food{line_break}and vanished into the darkness.{line_break}It ruined the festival.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08929"
msgstr "The serpent lives on Mt. Mikage.{line_break}In our tongue, its original name{line_break}meant \"the undying mountain.\"{page_break}As long as the serpent{line_break}lives on its peak, I doubt the{line_break}serpent will ever die, either.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08930"
msgstr "I pray that our guardian's{line_break}anger is not aroused and{line_break}that Susa will be protected...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08931"
msgstr "Okuni's such a great dancer.{line_break}It's just so much more fun when{line_break}she's here to dance with us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08932"
msgstr "The serpent would eat up{line_break}anything we put in front of{line_break}it! Its hunger knows no bounds.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08933"
msgstr "Before the serpent ate all{line_break}our food, it was a terror{line_break}to behold...{page_break}But afterwards?{line_break}He wasn't so bad.{page_break}No doubt about it, that{line_break}serpent sure knows good{line_break}food when he eats it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08934"
msgstr "Legend has it that Mt. Mikage{line_break}is enshrouded by a mysterious{line_break}power.{page_break}I wonder if that's the source{line_break}of the serpent's eternal life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08935"
msgstr "Izumo's leaders have always{line_break}possessed certain special{line_break}powers. Always.{page_break}And let me tell you, the{line_break}combined power of Susa and{line_break}Lady Uzume is stunning to see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08936"
msgstr "One day, Kushinada put on{line_break}a display of power so great{line_break}that it almost rivaled Susa's!{page_break}It's such a shame...{line_break}I really wanted to see how{line_break}strong she might have become.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08937"
msgstr "The power that Lady Uzume{line_break}and Susa possess comes{line_break}from their ancestors.{page_break}It cannot be learned, and it{line_break}cannot be imitated.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08938"
msgstr "It was the day those bright rocks{line_break}fell from the sky... That's when{line_break}Kushinada gained her powers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08939"
msgstr "Of course, I knew the legend of{line_break}the great serpent... Everyone{line_break}does! But I didn't believe it!{page_break}Sacrificing a young girl to the{line_break}serpent year after year?{line_break}It's too cruel to be true!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08940"
msgstr "If I were younger, I might{line_break}have been the sacrifice...{line_break}Ahh... It's so horrible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08941"
msgstr "Things like this are really{line_break}going to hurt the inn... We get{line_break}few enough travelers as it is!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08942"
msgstr "What does that serpent plan{line_break}on doing with those young{line_break}women?{page_break}Surely, it doesn't intend{line_break}to marry all of them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08943"
msgstr "Why would our guardian{line_break}spirit demand a sacrifice?{line_break}It's inexcusable!{page_break}A true guardian would never{line_break}require such a cruel tribute.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08944"
msgstr "*Sniff* How could we{line_break}sacrifice our beloved{line_break}Kushinada? It's not fair!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08945"
msgstr "When I get older, I might{line_break}have to be a sacrifice, too...{line_break}...What's a sacrifice?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08946"
msgstr "If only I possessed the power{line_break}to prevent this from happening.{line_break}Please grant me strength...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08947"
msgstr "I don't want the serpent of{line_break}Mt. Mikage to eat Kushinada.{line_break}Oh, won't somebody help her?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08948"
msgstr "Nobody wants to be a sacrifice,{line_break}so a sacrifice must be something{line_break}pretty scary.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08949"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} checked the altar.{page_break}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08950"
msgstr "There wasn't anything special.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08951"
msgstr "It looks like something{line_break}can be placed here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08952"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} placed a doll{line_break}on the altar.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08953"
msgstr "However, nothing happened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08954"
msgstr "Who are you?{line_break}How did you get here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08955"
msgstr "Only Uzume, Kushinada, and I{line_break}possess the ability to come here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08956"
msgstr "Never mind. I don't have time{line_break}to talk. I have my hands full{line_break}getting the serpent to drink this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08957"
msgstr "Once it's groggy,{line_break}that's when I'll strike...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08958"
msgstr "If you understand, then get{line_break}out of my way.{line_break}Stand over there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08959"
msgstr "How many casks does it take{line_break}to weaken this stupid serpent?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08960"
msgstr "Move out of the way there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08961"
msgstr "The cups are overflowing{line_break}with a river of Dragonsbane.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08962"
msgstr "You! You cannot fight the{line_break}serpent! Not while it's still in{line_break}full possession of its senses!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08963"
msgstr "At last... The serpent has{line_break}finally had its fill. This is{line_break}the chance I'd hoped for.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08964"
msgstr "I will defeat you before the{line_break}next full moon and rescue{line_break}Kushinada myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08965"
msgstr "All right, you so-called guardian!{line_break}Let's see what you've got!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08966"
msgstr "That's weird... It didn't{line_break}even react...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08967"
msgstr "Feeding the serpent Dragonsbane{line_break}isn't weakening it enough for{line_break}me to beat it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08968"
msgstr "The serpent is still too strong.{page_break}If only there were a way to{line_break}weaken it further...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08969"
msgstr "The cups are overflowing{line_break}with a river of Dragonsbane.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08970"
msgstr "Who do they think they are?{line_break}I'm the only one who{line_break}can save Kushinada.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08971"
msgstr "Like I said, the serpent{line_break}can't be defeated by just{line_break}weakening it with Dragonsbane.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08972"
msgstr "It looks like the dragon is{line_break}in bad shape, but it doesn't{line_break}seem like it's close to dying...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08973"
msgstr "Even though the serpent's{line_break}been defeated, I can't rest!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08974"
msgstr "Be still, serpent, and I{line_break}will grant you peace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08975"
msgstr "And with this, Kushinada's{line_break}life has been spared.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08976"
msgstr "You have my sincerest thanks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08977"
msgstr "Where are you going?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08978"
msgstr "To Kushinada, of course.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08979"
msgstr "The serpent, with its eyes closed,{line_break}looks almost alive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08980"
msgstr "I'm not dying...{line_break}I'm just so tired... I'm going{line_break}to lie down for a bit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08981"
msgstr "If you're going to Izumo,{line_break}tell my sister that I'm{line_break}still alive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08982"
msgstr "You're going to tell Kushinada{line_break}that you defeated the serpent,{line_break}aren't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08983"
msgstr "Ha ha ha! Of course! That's{line_break}exactly what happened!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08984"
msgstr "Please, you were the ones to{line_break}defeat it, so you should be{line_break}honest and accept credit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08985"
msgstr "I really got worked over,{line_break}but as long as Kushinada's{line_break}safe, it was worth it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08986"
msgstr "Kushinada's safe...{line_break}She's safe!{line_break}Nothing else matters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08987"
msgstr "Those screams from{line_break}Mt. Mikage... They must{line_break}have come from the serpent.{page_break}That means Susa must{line_break}have saved Kushinada!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08988"
msgstr "We're planning a festival{line_break}to celebrate the end of the{line_break}serpent's reign of terror!{page_break}Lady Uzume is paying{line_break}for the whole thing, so{line_break}bring your dancin' feet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08989"
msgstr "Susa has changed so much{line_break}from the wild youth we once{line_break}feared. He's saved our village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08990"
msgstr "Kushinada has been spared?{line_break}I'm thrilled beyond words! She{line_break}did not deserve such a fate...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08991"
msgstr "I've heard people saying that{line_break}Susa had the help of other{line_break}heroes... Are you they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08992"
msgstr "Susa has grown so much{line_break}to fight for his beloved{line_break}Kushinada so gallantly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08993"
msgstr "Susa has put the serpent{line_break}back to rest, but not everyone{line_break}seems happy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08994"
msgstr "Lady Uzume predicted that{line_break}a great hero would appear{line_break}to save Kushinada.{page_break}Nobody thought that hero{line_break}would be Susa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08995"
msgstr "See this ring of giant stones?{line_break}They've been here for ages.{line_break}No one knows who put them here.{page_break}See how they make{line_break}this beautiful circle?{line_break}Except for that one, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08996"
msgstr "Susa moved it... He didn't even{line_break}use his hands. He surely holds{line_break}the secrets to a great power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08997"
msgstr "You're...not terribly{line_break}observant, are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08998"
msgstr "The misaligned stone! It's{line_break}back in its original position!{line_break}How did this happen!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08999"
msgstr "Hmmm... Either Susa or Kushinada{line_break}must have moved it when{line_break}I wasn't looking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09000"
msgstr "But it's a festival!{line_break}Why do I have to keep{line_break}guarding the stone circle?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09001"
msgstr "I had always thought Susa was{line_break}nothing but a troublemaker, but{line_break}he's proven himself a hero now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09002"
msgstr "This celebration will rival the{line_break}one that woke the serpent in{line_break}the first place!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09003"
msgstr "It's odd to think that so{line_break}many in the village once{line_break}despised Susa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09004"
msgstr "Kushinada is such a sweet{line_break}girl. She should never have{line_break}been chosen in the lottery.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09005"
msgstr "What would make anyone{line_break}want to race up Mt. Mikage{line_break}and into the serpent's lair?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09006"
msgstr "All the girls must be so relieved{line_break}now that that awful lottery{line_break}has been ended forever.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09007"
msgstr "Everyone's been wondering{line_break}why the serpent wanted{line_break}a sacrifice... Was he lonely?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09008"
msgstr "So...Susa really was as much{line_break}of a hero as Lady Uzume{line_break}claimed... How disappointing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09009"
msgstr "Susa did a momentous thing,{line_break}battling the serpent. So why do{line_break}I not want to congratulate him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09010"
msgstr "I wonder if there's someone out{line_break}there who would sacrifice his{line_break}life for me. Will I ever find him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09011"
msgstr "Dancing like this{line_break}is pure bliss.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09012"
msgstr "Everyone says that Susa is{line_break}the one to thank for returning{line_break}peace to our small village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09013"
msgstr "We may never know what{line_break}was responsible for waking{line_break}the serpent from its slumber...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09014"
msgstr "Our island is safe at last!{line_break}It's time for us to celebrate{line_break}and enjoy ourselves again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09015"
msgstr "The serpent taught us one{line_break}thing: Celebrate while you{line_break}can, but keep your eyes open!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09016"
msgstr "Lady Uzume and the others{line_break}aren't really blood relatives.{line_break}Does that surprise you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09017"
msgstr "Well, they do possess a power no{line_break}one else has... Maybe that means{line_break}they are siblings after all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09018"
msgstr "I'm just glad that Lady{line_break}Uzume used her powers{line_break}for the good of us all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09019"
msgstr "All anyone talks about is how Susa{line_break}risked his life to save Kushinada.{line_break}I'm so jealous...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09020"
msgstr "A dragon, a hero, a damsel{line_break}in distress... That's got all the{line_break}makings for a fairy tale...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09021"
msgstr "Susa said the serpent wasn't{line_break}all that tough... He makes quite{line_break}a dashing hero!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09022"
msgstr "We need to figure out what woke{line_break}the serpent...{line_break}After the festival, maybe...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09023"
msgstr "Dancing is good for the soul!{page_break}Oooog... But too much{line_break}dancing...makes...me...{line_break}dizzy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09024"
msgstr "That Susa used my dagger to{line_break}defeat the serpent.{page_break}He would never have won{line_break}if not for my dagger! And{line_break}he gets all the credit!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09025"
msgstr "As long as we have Lady{line_break}Uzume, Kushinada, and Susa{line_break}here, Izumo will be safe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09026"
msgstr "If you're looking for Kushinada,{line_break}Lady Uzume escorted her to{line_break}the mansion.{page_break}Now that Susa has defeated{line_break}the serpent, Kushinada is no{line_break}longer being held as a sacrifice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09027"
msgstr "Did you hear how Susa{line_break}defeated the serpent and{line_break}rescued Kushinada?{page_break}How come she doesn't{line_break}seem any happier now{line_break}that she's free?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09028"
msgstr "Lady Uzume and Kushinada{line_break}are as close as sisters.{line_break}It must be nice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09029"
msgstr "Kushinada must be upset that{line_break}Susa defied his sister and{line_break}risked his life for her.{page_break}She worries about him{line_break}so much.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09030"
msgstr "Warriors appeared from within{line_break}Mt. Mikage?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09031"
msgstr "Yes... After the serpent's roar,{line_break}these warriors appeared.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09032"
msgstr "So, it wasn't Susa who defeated{line_break}the serpent, but those heroes...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09033"
msgstr "It might have been...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09034"
msgstr "Lady Kushinada, please{line_break}forgive me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09035"
msgstr "I don't care who defeated{line_break}the serpent... I'm more worried{line_break}about what happened to Susa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09036"
msgstr "So, Susa never came down{line_break}from Mt. Mikage?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09037"
msgstr "He returned to the village after{line_break}the heroes appeared, and he{line_break}knew the serpent was defeated.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09038"
msgstr "Oh, Susa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09039"
msgstr "Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09040"
msgstr "This is my home, and I am{line_break}having a private conversation.{line_break}Leave at once!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09041"
msgstr "What is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09042"
msgstr "There can be no doubt...{line_break}These are the heroes who{line_break}appeared on Mt. Mikage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09043"
msgstr "Are you the ones who{line_break}defeated the serpent?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09044"
msgstr "So it was you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09045"
msgstr "My apologies...{line_break}You are welcome here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09046"
msgstr "Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09047"
msgstr "I'm Kraden, and this{line_break}is {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09048"
msgstr "Behind him is {actor_name:8}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09049"
msgstr "Pleased to meet you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09050"
msgstr "I'm {actor_name:6}, and{line_break}this is {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09051"
msgstr "We're on a quest. Our travels{line_break}across the Great Eastern{line_break}Sea brought us here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09052"
msgstr "You were seen coming down{line_break}from Mt. Mikage. What brought{line_break}you to such a dangerous place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09053"
msgstr "To complete our quest, we{line_break}need many types of Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09054"
msgstr "Psynergy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09055"
msgstr "What is Psynergy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09056"
msgstr "Psynergy is many things... The{line_break}power to move things with{line_break}one's mind, to heal, to create.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09057"
msgstr "All with one's mind?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09058"
msgstr "Tell me, is it something{line_break}like...this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09059"
msgstr "Is that the power you're{line_break}talking about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09060"
msgstr "That power?{line_break}Lady Uzume?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09061"
msgstr "It's not mine alone.{line_break}Kushinada and Susa{line_break}possess it as well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09062"
msgstr "This is the power we possess.{line_break}I assume you have something{line_break}like it yourselves?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09063"
msgstr "I thought so. Only those who{line_break}can wield the power can see{line_break}it. And you did see it, didn't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09064"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, there's no need{line_break}to hide our abilities from them,{line_break}is there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09065"
msgstr "So, you call what we do{line_break}\"Psynergy,\" and you can{line_break}do it, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09066"
msgstr "If you already have Psynergy,{line_break}why do you need more of{line_break}this power?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09067"
msgstr "Their powers are different{line_break}from our own. There seem to{line_break}be many forms of Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09068"
msgstr "Susa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09069"
msgstr "Susa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09070"
msgstr "So, you lived after all, Susa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09071"
msgstr "Yes, I've survived, and I've{line_break}made it home to you both.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09072"
msgstr "Thanks to them, actually...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09073"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, our gratitude to{line_break}you and your friends grows{line_break}deeper each passing moment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09074"
msgstr "Susa, you spoke of different{line_break}types of power. Tell me, what{line_break}did you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09075"
msgstr "I can only describe what{line_break}I saw, my sister. Ask{line_break}{actor_name:5} here about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09076"
msgstr "Ah, yes. Psynergy... I have{line_break}dedicated most of my life{line_break}to its study...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09077"
msgstr "The power of Psynergy comes{line_break}from the four basic forces of{line_break}earth, fire, water, and wind.{page_break}These energies, the foundations{line_break}of Alchemy, are called{line_break}\"Elementals.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09078"
msgstr "You don't know Alchemy?{line_break}The four elements?{page_break}Why, they're the very{line_break}building blocks of all{line_break}matter on Weyard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09079"
msgstr "All existing matter comes from{line_break}Alchemy and this Psynergy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09080"
msgstr "Yes, that's right. Everything{line_break}you see around you is some{line_break}combination of these elements.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09081"
msgstr "Does this mean that there{line_break}are as many types of Psynergy{line_break}as there are types of elements?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09082"
msgstr "That's right, Kushinada.{line_break}You're a smart lass.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09083"
msgstr "Mt. Mikage was a place of{line_break}great earth powers. I'd imagine{line_break}your powers are earth based.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09084"
msgstr "That's right, but how did{line_break}you know this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09085"
msgstr "Kraden... Mt. Mikage is{line_break}Gaia Rock, isn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09086"
msgstr "...Gaia Rock? Mt. Mikage is{line_break}the sacred mount of our people!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09087"
msgstr "Yes, but there are many mountains{line_break}like your Mt. Mikage all across{line_break}the Eastern Sea.{page_break}Mt. Mikage is a source of earth{line_break}power, and therefore, it must{line_break}be Gaia Rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09088"
msgstr "You have seen other mountains{line_break}like our Mt. Mikage?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09089"
msgstr "Yes! In fact, it seems that{line_break}each of these rocks contains{line_break}a different elemental power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09090"
msgstr "And now, you are questing to{line_break}gather the power of these{line_break}elements, yes?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09091"
msgstr "And you only defeated the{line_break}Great Serpent of Mikage to{line_break}accomplish this goal?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09092"
msgstr "Regardless of your motives,{line_break}you have saved us all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09093"
msgstr "You took pity on Kushinada?{line_break}You are very kind to help{line_break}Susa, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09094"
msgstr "You're...not implying that we{line_break}defeated the serpent, are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09095"
msgstr "It's true that we did fight{line_break}the creature...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09096"
msgstr "But without Susa's power,{line_break}the battle might not have{line_break}ended so happily.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09097"
msgstr "What... What are you°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09098"
msgstr "Susa had given the beast a{line_break}lot of Dragonsbane in order{line_break}to weaken it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09099"
msgstr "We could never have beaten{line_break}the beast if it had not been in{line_break}a...weakened state.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09100"
msgstr "We were victorious only{line_break}because Susa risked everything{line_break}to weaken the dragon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09101"
msgstr "Susa, perhaps, after all, you are...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09102"
msgstr "No, I didn't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09103"
msgstr "Don't forget, Susa dealt the{line_break}finishing blow, didn't he?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09104"
msgstr "Finishing blow? All I{line_break}did was stab it with{line_break}the Cloud Brand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09105"
msgstr "That's right. Piercing it{line_break}with the Cloud Brand was{line_break}hardly a finishing blow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09106"
msgstr "I disagree...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09107"
msgstr "You weakened the serpent.{line_break}You dealt the final blow.{line_break}I'd say you were essential.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09108"
msgstr "So, Lady Uzume, wouldn't you{line_break}say that Susa deserves{line_break}the reward for this feat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09109"
msgstr "Even {actor_name:5} agrees,{line_break}don't you, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09110"
msgstr "I do, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09111"
msgstr "We weren't fighting in hopes{line_break}of getting a reward, were we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09112"
msgstr "We'll be satisfied just learning{line_break}your Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09113"
msgstr "Are you asking for a reward?{line_break}That's just plain greedy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09114"
msgstr "We couldn't possibly take{line_break}any sort of reward.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09115"
msgstr "Learning new Psynergy{line_break}will be reward enough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09116"
msgstr "As you can see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09117"
msgstr "Now, it's about time for us{line_break}to leave Izumo Village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09118"
msgstr "Yes, indeed! We're on{line_break}our way to Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09119"
msgstr "You're leaving so soon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09120"
msgstr "We are in a great hurry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09121"
msgstr "Then you must return to{line_break}Izumo someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09122"
msgstr "I'm sure we'll be back{line_break}once our mission{line_break}is completed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09123"
msgstr "Excellent! I shall accept{line_break}that as your oath!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09124"
msgstr "...Oath?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09125"
msgstr "Oh, by promising to return, we'll{line_break}be ensuring that our quest will{line_break}end successfully...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09126"
msgstr "I understand... We must{line_break}vow to return, everyone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09127"
msgstr "We'll be waiting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09128"
msgstr "If you have time, won't{line_break}you enjoy a little of our{line_break}celebratory festival?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09129"
msgstr "Someday, Susa and I will have{line_break}a son, and we will name him{line_break}Takeru.{page_break}When he goes to sleep at night,{line_break}I will tell him the story of your{line_break}great deeds and your quest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09130"
msgstr "I'm sure you know the villagers{line_break}believe I beat the serpent.{line_break}Don't let me take all the glory!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09131"
msgstr "If {actor_name:5}'s descendants{line_break}are ever in trouble, our{line_break}Takeru will rush to their aid.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09132"
msgstr "I'm no hero, but that shouldn't{line_break}stop anyone from treating me{line_break}like one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09133"
msgstr "And what were you planning{line_break}to do, once you'd read my{line_break}mind, hm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09134"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, you read my{line_break}mind earlier, too, didn't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09135"
msgstr "You can't read my mind,{line_break}but if there is something you{line_break}want to know, I shall tell you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09136"
msgstr "Trying again, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}What a pest.{page_break}You can see my mind, but{line_break}you are incapable of{line_break}peering into my heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09137"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, wait!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09138"
msgstr "It troubled me to let you{line_break}leave like this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09139"
msgstr "I owe you much for your help,{line_break}but I didn't have any way to{line_break}thank you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09140"
msgstr "And then I thought of something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09141"
msgstr "You're a warrior, and{line_break}warriors need weapons.{line_break}Wouldn't you agree?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09142"
msgstr "Are you sure about that?{line_break}I was only hoping to show{line_break}you my appreciation.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09143"
msgstr "Would you be willing{line_break}to accept a token{line_break}of my gratitude?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09144"
msgstr "This token isn't something{line_break}I possess. It's a legend, one{line_break}that might be of use to you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09145"
msgstr "Long ago, the Great Serpent of{line_break}Mikage would sleep with its body{line_break}crossing the river...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09146"
msgstr "Where its tail fell, the{line_break}Cloud Brand lay hidden.{line_break}That's the legend, anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09147"
msgstr "The serpent was once the{line_break}sword's protector, but it lost{line_break}the sword many ages past.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09148"
msgstr "Anyway, maybe you want{line_break}to go check out the dragon{line_break}again...{page_break}I left something there{line_break}for you...just as a way{line_break}of saying thank you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09149"
msgstr "Well, I've said what I came to{line_break}say. I'm going back to Kushinada.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09150"
msgstr "I hope you are successful{line_break}in your quest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09151"
msgstr "The legend says that the Cloud{line_break}Brand is a powerful weapon{line_break}for fighting dragons.{page_break}I trust you'll test the legend,{line_break}should the time come.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09152"
msgstr "Times of peace are so dull.{line_break}It makes me want to do something{line_break}outrageous to shake things up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09153"
msgstr "They've been saying that you{line_break}went into Mt. Mikage, too...{line_break}Is that true?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09154"
msgstr "There's a legend about a doll{line_break}of mysterious power hidden{line_break}somewhere in the mountain.{page_break}I'm sure Lady Uzume would{line_break}by very pleased if you{line_break}were to find it for her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09155"
msgstr "Oh... There's an old legend about{line_break}a dancing doll that has strange{line_break}powers hidden up there.{page_break}Lady Uzume really wants that{line_break}doll. Maybe Susa will find it{line_break}and bring it back for her...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09156"
msgstr "Supposedly, the doll has the{line_break}power to move the statues that{line_break}block light inside the mountain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09157"
msgstr "Lady Uzume has grown quite{line_break}fond of this odd creature she{line_break}found... She's taken it as a pet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09158"
msgstr "Lady Uzume's new pet affects{line_break}her powers in weird ways. It{line_break}doesn't do anything to us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09159"
msgstr "Why does Lady Uzume want{line_break}that dancing doll so badly?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09160"
msgstr "I wonder what sort of dance{line_break}the doll does.{page_break}I'd love to see what it{line_break}looked like someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09161"
msgstr "I heard that Lady Uzume's pet{line_break}sometimesi disappears into{line_break}thin air...{page_break}Sound a little bit like that{line_break}cat I had when I was little.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09162"
msgstr "I don't know what it means{line_break}that Lady Uzume's pet{line_break}increases her power...{page_break}But these kids have seen a{line_break}lot of things I've never seen.{line_break}Maybe they understand...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09163"
msgstr "Ah... Could it be?{line_break}Is this the dancing doll{line_break}of Mt. Mikage?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09164"
msgstr "You found this at the peak{line_break}of Mt. Mikage?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09165"
msgstr "Don't lie to me. The style,{line_break}the craftsmanship... You must{line_break}have found this on Mt. Mikage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09166"
msgstr "Again, you have done more{line_break}for me than I can properly{line_break}reward you for doing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09167"
msgstr "I think I may have something{line_break}that might please you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09168"
msgstr "This is my pet. It's very{line_break}dear to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09169"
msgstr "I am unsure how it works,{line_break}but this fellow seems{line_break}to magnify our power...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09170"
msgstr "Though it saddens me to part{line_break}with it, I would have you take{line_break}him, as he might help you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09171"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} and his friends have{line_break}agreed to care for you{line_break}from now on.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09172"
msgstr "Please, accept this gift.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09173"
msgstr "With this dancing doll, I can{line_break}explore Mt. Mikage on my own.{line_break}Take care, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09174"
msgstr "I'm grateful for the dancing{line_break}doll, but I do wish you'd stop{line_break}trying to read my mind.{page_break}If there is something you wish{line_break}to know, simply open your mouth{line_break}and ask.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09175"
msgstr "You must see many wonderful{line_break}things traveling across the{line_break}Eastern Sea.{page_break}How I'd love to travel like you{line_break}and see such wonders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09176"
msgstr "My goods are among the{line_break}best on the island.{page_break}I'm sure there are things{line_break}the people on the mainland{line_break}would love to have.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09177"
msgstr "I'd love to travel the Great{line_break}Eastern Sea and get things{line_break}I can't find here on the island.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09178"
msgstr "This may be a small island, but{line_break}our craftsmanship is as good{line_break}as anything on the mainland.{page_break}It may seem impossible now,{line_break}but one day I'll be trading with{line_break}the shops in all the big cities.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09179"
msgstr "Briggs, from Champa, hasn't{line_break}been by selling much fish lately,{line_break}so our menu's suffered.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09180"
msgstr "As Lady Uzume foretold, the{line_break}serpent was defeated without{line_break}returning to our village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09181"
msgstr "If Briggs's ship doesn't come{line_break}soon, we won't be able to{line_break}get any seafood.{page_break}Until then, all we'll have to{line_break}eat is freshwater fish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09182"
msgstr "I understand now!{line_break}I had no idea why we were{line_break}preparing all those barrels.{page_break}If not for those barrels, the{line_break}serpent just might have{line_break}destroyed all of Izumo Village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09183"
msgstr "Now that peace has been{line_break}restored, our island is{line_break}flourishing once more.{page_break}And I am most pleased{line_break}that we had no need of{line_break}any sacrifices!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09184"
msgstr "Now that the serpent's been{line_break}defeated, we don't have to{line_break}sacrifice anyone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09185"
msgstr "If you're a sacrifice, that{line_break}means you have to marry{line_break}the dragon, right?{page_break}I'd hate to think what it{line_break}must be like, cooking for{line_break}a creature that big.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09186"
msgstr "I thank the powers that be{line_break}that I was not chosen as{line_break}a sacrifice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09187"
msgstr "Maybe now, Kushinada{line_break}can come out and play.{line_break}What should we do, though?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09188"
msgstr "That dragon wanted a new{line_break}wife each and every year!{line_break}He must really like girls.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09189"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} searched the slate.{line_break}There is an inscription.{page_break}Wielder of Earth's might,{line_break}Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}I shall grant thee the power{line_break}to melt into the earth, the{line_break}power of Sand!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09190"
msgstr "Wielder of Earth's might...{line_break}That'd be you, {protagonist_name}.{line_break}Touch it. Go on, don't worry!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09191"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} touched the rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09192"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} received{line_break}the power of Sand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09193"
msgstr "I'm...sensing something...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09194"
msgstr "I can't feel anything...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09195"
msgstr "I'm done for... That dragon{line_break}has finished me off...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09196"
msgstr "Oh, I'm so hungry...{line_break}And there won't be anything{line_break}to eat until Briggs returns.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09197"
msgstr "When is Briggs going to return{line_break}with food for the village?{line_break}We can't wait much longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09198"
msgstr "How did you find your way{line_break}here, to the edge of Angara?{line_break}Champa is hidden by mountains.{page_break}No one ever climbs over to{line_break}see us, except for the monks{line_break}of the Fuchin Temple.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09199"
msgstr "Champa is impoverished, but{line_break}soon, we will prosper again.{page_break}All our hopes rest on Briggs{line_break}returning with a ship filled{line_break}with treasures!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09200"
msgstr "You've the look of a traveler{line_break}about you... Have you been to{line_break}Ankohl Ruins?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09201"
msgstr "Only those who have mastered{line_break}the powers of the earth can{line_break}enter the ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09202"
msgstr "My mistake... These old eyes{line_break}aren't what they used to be.{page_break}Anyway, the ruins are just a{line_break}little ways northeast of here.{line_break}You should go see them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09203"
msgstr "The ruins at Ankohl are all{line_break}that remains of a great{line_break}sanctum our ancestors built.{page_break}They must have been quite{line_break}wealthy to build such a{line_break}massive building.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09204"
msgstr "Eoleo, Briggs's son, has a{line_break}really strange ability...{page_break}I'll bet if I keep practicing,{line_break}I'll be able to do it, too, so I'm{line_break}giving it my all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09205"
msgstr "Once Briggs comes back,{line_break}I can play with Eoleo again...{line_break}I hope they come back soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09206"
msgstr "The cliff caves are a lot{line_break}quieter with Briggs gone... It's{line_break}a little lonely without him here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09207"
msgstr "Our matriarch is the last{line_break}successor of the Ankohl.{page_break}She's a master of the forge.{line_break}It was the ancient gift of{line_break}the Ankohl... {page_break}There's nothing{line_break}broken that they couldn't fix.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09208"
msgstr "The Champa sailors aren't...well{line_break}liked outside of here, are we?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09209"
msgstr "Hey, that hurts... You could{line_break}at least lie to me, just to{line_break}be polite...{page_break}If you keep spreading rumors{line_break}like that, you'll have a rough{line_break}time around here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09210"
msgstr "Really? That's nice to hear.{line_break}But if you do hear anything,{line_break}don't believe a word of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09211"
msgstr "Where could Briggs be{line_break}wasting his time now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09212"
msgstr "Briggs promised to bring{line_break}enough food for the whole{line_break}village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09213"
msgstr "Champa is all alone on the{line_break}eastern edge of Angara. That's{line_break}why we took to the sea.{page_break}We had to learn to fend for{line_break}ourselves... That's why we{line_break}are seafaring people today.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09214"
msgstr "I bet Briggs has already{line_break}dug up the treasure and is{line_break}on his way back home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09215"
msgstr "I want someone to solve{line_break}the riddle of Ankohl Ruins{line_break}before I die... It's my one wish!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09216"
msgstr "They say the chamber at the{line_break}top of the ruins is decorated{line_break}in the purest gold.{page_break}Our ancestors must have{line_break}been wealthy to afford{line_break}such extravagent decor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09217"
msgstr "If I could pick up things{line_break}without using my hands,{line_break}life would be so much easier.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09218"
msgstr "Eoleo's so much younger than{line_break}I am, but I can't stop thinking{line_break}about him... Is that...love?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09219"
msgstr "Why haven't Briggs and{line_break}his men returned yet?{page_break}Obaba said not to go looking{line_break}for them, but what if they're{line_break}in trouble?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09220"
msgstr "Obaba's locked herself in her{line_break}room until her grandson, Briggs,{line_break}returns from sea.{page_break}She's so worried... She hasn't{line_break}even been eating. I hope{line_break}she's all right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09221"
msgstr "If Briggs would just bring the{line_break}treasure he found back to{line_break}Champa, we could all prosper.{page_break}Then we could put this pirate{line_break}business behind us for good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09222"
msgstr "There's not much space in the{line_break}cliff caves. That's why we have{line_break}to live out here on the boats.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09223"
msgstr "Everyone in Champa is poor,{line_break}but the poorest of us all live{line_break}on rafts... I want to live on land.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09224"
msgstr "When my father heads out{line_break}to sea, he takes our home{line_break}with him and leaves us cold.{page_break}But when he comes home{line_break}with an empty net, that{line_break}leaves us cold AND hungry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09225"
msgstr "My dad went out to fish, but there{line_break}were no fish to be caught, so he{line_break}had to come back empty-handed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09226"
msgstr "These rafts are all we have!{line_break}There's no place left for us{line_break}on dry land!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09227"
msgstr "If Dad hadn't been opposed to{line_break}Briggs becoming a pirate, we'd{line_break}still be living on land...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09228"
msgstr "I hope Dad makes it back before{line_break}dark... I don't want to have to{line_break}sleep on shore with no shelter.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09229"
msgstr "Father worries so much{line_break}about the lack of fish...{page_break}He used to come back with fish{line_break}jumping out of his nets. Why{line_break}can't he catch fish anymore?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09230"
msgstr "The tidal wave was terrible...{line_break}It... It nearly swallowed me{line_break}whole!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09231"
msgstr "It looked to me like the wave{line_break}came from the Sea of Time.{line_break}What's in there? What caused it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09232"
msgstr "Most of the sailors here live in{line_break}the cliff dwellings, but I don't{line_break}like those caves. They're dank!{page_break}And what's worse, the people{line_break}living in the harbor really{line_break}resent the cliff-dwellers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09233"
msgstr "The fish are vanishing. I'm{line_break}sailing farther and farther{line_break}for fewer and fewer fish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09234"
msgstr "Something must have blown up{line_break}in the Sea of Time. That would{line_break}explain the tidal wave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09235"
msgstr "You have to be one of the{line_break}pirates to live in the cliffs...{line_break}I just can't do it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09236"
msgstr "We've seen a lot of traveling{line_break}warriors in Champa of late.{page_break}We never used to... I wonder{line_break}if it's just a coincidence that{line_break}we've seen so many lately...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09237"
msgstr "A group of travelers came here{line_break}looking for a {actor_name:5}.{page_break}He seems to be a fairly{line_break}popular guy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09238"
msgstr "More visitors means more{line_break}money for our village... Maybe{line_break}we'll even get tourists soon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09239"
msgstr "Now that I think about it,{line_break}someone else was looking{line_break}for a {actor_name:5}, too.{page_break}I'll bet that guy is probably{line_break}still somewhere in town...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09240"
msgstr "The ocean has been a lot{line_break}warmer lately, and the fish{line_break}population is decreasing.{page_break}It's not natural for the{line_break}ocean to be so warm.{line_break}What's causing it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09241"
msgstr "I've heard rumors of a terrible{line_break}tidal wave striking the lands{line_break}south of us.{page_break}I sure hope Briggs and his{line_break}men weren't engulfed by it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09242"
msgstr "We Champa rely entirely on the{line_break}ocean for our survival. It's all{line_break}we've ever known...{page_break}I wish the Eastern Sea would{line_break}return to its bountiful days of{line_break}overflowing nets and smooth seas.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09243"
msgstr "All the sailors are saying{line_break}the tidal wave down south{line_break}was unbelievably huge.{page_break}If Briggs were caught up in{line_break}it, I don't think he could{line_break}have survived.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09244"
msgstr "Obaba's not seeing anyone{line_break}right now.{page_break}She's concerned about her{line_break}grandson, and she doesn't{line_break}want to be bothered.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09245"
msgstr "Has my grandson returned?{line_break}Has my Briggs come home?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09246"
msgstr "You lie! If Briggs had truly{line_break}returned, he would have come{line_break}to see me first!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09247"
msgstr "I asked not to be disturbed{line_break}until my grandson has returned{line_break}home! Now, let me be!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09248"
msgstr "That pit is Obaba's forge. She{line_break}uses it when she's working metal{line_break}into weapons and equipment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09249"
msgstr "Before he left, Briggs ordered{line_break}me to keep watch in his absence.{page_break}If Obaba is so worried about{line_break}Briggs, she ought to send{line_break}someone out to look for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09250"
msgstr "All of our men went to sea with{line_break}Briggs°even my sweetheart!{line_break}I hope they return soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09251"
msgstr "I bet you're wondering why only{line_break}sailors and their families get to{line_break}live in the cliff dwellings.{page_break}Well, from up here on the cliffs,{line_break}families can look out to sea and{line_break}await the return of their sailors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09252"
msgstr "The Champa sailors who don't{line_break}live in the cliffs are no better{line_break}than cowards.{page_break}The ones living in the caves will{line_break}protect Briggs and Obaba{line_break}without a second thought.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09253"
msgstr "My husband wants our children{line_break}to be sailors like him, but I{line_break}simply won't have it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09254"
msgstr "Someday, I want to be a sailor,{line_break}like my father before me. My{line_break}mother hates the idea, though.{page_break}She'd rather have me study and{line_break}become a scholar or something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09255"
msgstr "Mom's had it pretty rough. I hope{line_break}I meet a sailor with a future, so I{line_break}don't have to work so hard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09256"
msgstr "I've never seen Obaba like{line_break}this before.{page_break}She must be really worried{line_break}about Briggs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09257"
msgstr "I wonder how deep this forge{line_break}goes. It's supposed to reach{line_break}right into the mountain's heart.{page_break}Obaba must be a master of the{line_break}forge if she's the only one{line_break}who can call up its flames.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09258"
msgstr "Briggs may be our captain, but{line_break}at least he's not all full of{line_break}himself. I hate people like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09259"
msgstr "Briggs is the greatest{line_break}among all our sailors.{page_break}As long as he is leading our{line_break}men, they'll make it back to{line_break}Champa just fine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09260"
msgstr "Standing here, staring across the{line_break}sea from these cliffs, makes me{line_break}feel like I'm helping our sailors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09261"
msgstr "If you live up in the cliffs, that{line_break}means you've proven that you{line_break}can travel far across the seas.{page_break}If you call yourself a sailor{line_break}without ever going anywhere,{line_break}you're not worthy of the title.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09262"
msgstr "When I married a sailor, I knew{line_break}how cruel the sea could be.{page_break}I can't stop my husband from{line_break}sailing, but I don't want our{line_break}children to follow that path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09263"
msgstr "Has Mom forgotten that{line_break}I am my father's son?{page_break}If she knew anything about{line_break}me, she'd never ask me to{line_break}give up the sailor's life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09264"
msgstr "Eoleo is the only boy in town{line_break}who will amount to anything...{line_break}He will be mine!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09265"
msgstr "I have some lovely artifacts,{line_break}but it's only because I've been{line_break}to the Ankohl Ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09266"
msgstr "If you go to the Ankohl Ruins,{line_break}you might find some nice{line_break}artifacts for yourself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09267"
msgstr "Our products cost what they cost{line_break}for a reason: they're all rare and{line_break}valuable treasures from Ankohl.{page_break}If I risk my life to get something{line_break}nice, of course I'm going to ask{line_break}a higher price for it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09268"
msgstr "The stuff in the ruins just sits{line_break}there waiting for someone to{line_break}come along and take it.{page_break}But if it's broken, I'm the only{line_break}guy in town who can fix it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09269"
msgstr "Listen, if you came to Champa{line_break}looking for good seafood, you{line_break}came to the wrong place.{page_break}We haven't had a decent{line_break}catch in months. It's like{line_break}all the fish are just...gone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09270"
msgstr "We used to do good trade{line_break}with an island east of us. They{line_break}bought all our surplus fish.{page_break}We don't have any surplus{line_break}anymore. We don't even have{line_break}enough for ourselves.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09271"
msgstr "It's a shame that we can't{line_break}offer any fish to our customers.{page_break}Ah, how I long for the days{line_break}when we had fish enough{line_break}for everyone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09272"
msgstr "Watching our catches dwindle{line_break}with every day... It's a nightmare!{line_break}Where have all the fish gone?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09273"
msgstr "Briggs bears the weight{line_break}of hope for our struggling,{line_break}impoverished village.{page_break}He must return home soon,{line_break}before all the villagers lose hope{line_break}and fall into despair.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09274"
msgstr "I hope Briggs brings something{line_break}home for us... If not, it might{line_break}be the end of Champa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09275"
msgstr "I see you've caught up with{line_break}me again, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09276"
msgstr "Alex!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09277"
msgstr "Alex? Who is Alex?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09278"
msgstr "Alex is a Water Adept. We had{line_break}been traveling together, but he{line_break}left us when we landed on Indra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09279"
msgstr "A Water Adept?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09280"
msgstr "Ah, and I see you've made{line_break}a new friend! You have been{line_break}busy, haven't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09281"
msgstr "And you've found yourself a{line_break}new Water Adept! Do you mean{line_break}to cast me away, like old trash?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09282"
msgstr "Please... It's quite obvious that{line_break}you decided to replace me with{line_break}a new Water Adept.{page_break}I expect you thought you'd{line_break}never see me again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09283"
msgstr "What do you want with us now,{line_break}Alex? Or did you forget you were{line_break}the one who abandoned US?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09284"
msgstr "My dear {actor_name:6}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09285"
msgstr "Have you come to despise me{line_break}so, after all we've been through?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09286"
msgstr "That's right, {actor_name:5}! Why should{line_break}we care about someone who{line_break}just left us behind like that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09287"
msgstr "Duh! You're the one who left{line_break}us. It's pretty clear who{line_break}despises whom here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09288"
msgstr "My, aren't we a bitter bunch?{line_break}And I was just trying to help{line_break}you with your little task.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09289"
msgstr "We have no need of your help.{line_break}We can light the lighthouses{line_break}without you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09290"
msgstr "Oh... Can you really?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09291"
msgstr "Karst!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09292"
msgstr "That's right, Karst! I'm{line_break}flattered that you remember!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09293"
msgstr "What is this, Alex?{line_break}What's going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09294"
msgstr "Ah, how can I explain this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09295"
msgstr "What's going on is Alex is{line_break}demonstrating his remarkable{line_break}foresight once again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09296"
msgstr "Oh, have you not had the{line_break}pleasure of an introduction?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09297"
msgstr "He stayed back at the ship{line_break}when I saw them in Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09298"
msgstr "I am Agatio.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09299"
msgstr "Let's see... That guy's {actor_name:5},{line_break}and the girls are {actor_name:6} and {actor_name:7},{line_break}which makes him...Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09300"
msgstr "They look like an unreliable{line_break}bunch of ragamuffins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09301"
msgstr "Yes, they are rather useless,{line_break}aren't they? That's why I finally{line_break}had to abandon them, of course.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09302"
msgstr "But now, I believe I may have{line_break}been...hasty in my judgment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09303"
msgstr "You are {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09304"
msgstr "H-How do you know my name?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09305"
msgstr "How soon they forget!{line_break}We met you before, when you{line_break}were being...detained.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09306"
msgstr "Who could forget the amateur{line_break}Adept changing water to ice{line_break}in that strange little town?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09307"
msgstr "Ah! You saw that! That must{line_break}be how you knew {actor_name:8}{line_break}was a Water Adept.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09308"
msgstr "In fact, I was even thinking of{line_break}borrowing his ship at one point.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09309"
msgstr "You would steal someone's{line_break}boat? That's so typical, Alex!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09310"
msgstr "You wound me, {actor_name:6}...{line_break}I only meant to borrow it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09311"
msgstr "Whatever you might have{line_break}meant, that doesn't make it right!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09312"
msgstr "And just when I was about{line_break}to seize the opportunity,{line_break}you had to come back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09313"
msgstr "You mean from Kibombo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09314"
msgstr "I was mere moments too late.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09315"
msgstr "Isn't that a shame.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09316"
msgstr "Still, because of that, I did{line_break}meet Karst and Agatio, so{line_break}perhaps it was my fate...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09317"
msgstr "Can't you just stop talking about{line_break}yourself for one second, Alex?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09318"
msgstr "Enough of your childish gibes!{line_break}Alex, I want to know what{line_break}makes these punks useful!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09319"
msgstr "Because they brought us the orb{line_break}that Akafubu had taken. That{line_break}shows some resourcefulness.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09320"
msgstr "How so?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09321"
msgstr "The Kibombo are quite warlike...{line_break}or were, at any rate. Recovering{line_break}the orb was most likely not easy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09322"
msgstr "They were just typical villagers,{line_break}easily frightened with a small{line_break}display of Psynergy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09323"
msgstr "No... They would have used less{line_break}abrupt methods than those you{line_break}favor...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09324"
msgstr "Oh? What methods would{line_break}those be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09325"
msgstr "Alex said it clearly enough.{line_break}We wouldn't terrorize people{line_break}into doing what we wanted.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09326"
msgstr "Enough of this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09327"
msgstr "Stop changing the subject!{line_break}When are you going to light{line_break}the remaining lighthouses?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09328"
msgstr "Yes! Our patience is beginning{line_break}to wear thin!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09329"
msgstr "If you waste much more of our{line_break}time, we'll take those Elemental{line_break}Stars and do it ourselves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09330"
msgstr "If we had a Wind Adept like{line_break}{actor_name:7} and the Elemental{line_break}Stars, we wouldn't need you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09331"
msgstr "Excuse me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09332"
msgstr "I am, of course, opposed{line_break}to their line of thinking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09333"
msgstr "My experience with Saturos{line_break}and Menardi suggests that,{line_break}while they were fierce warriors...{page_break}They are somewhat lacking{line_break}when it comes to solving the{line_break}mysteries of the lighthouses...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09334"
msgstr "You mean to say that they{line_break}failed to solve the riddles?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09335"
msgstr "Miserably...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09336"
msgstr "Are you suggesting they were{line_break}simple brutes, incapable of{line_break}logic and intelligence?{page_break}And are you saying the{line_break}same of us!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09337"
msgstr "I'm afraid so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09338"
msgstr "Alex... Whose side{line_break}are you on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09339"
msgstr "I am on no one's side. My only{line_break}concern is to see the lighthouse{line_break}beacons lit once again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09340"
msgstr "So you mean to leave the{line_break}task to {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09341"
msgstr "Then why have we come all this{line_break}way looking for {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09342"
msgstr "I merely wanted to confirm{line_break}that he and his companions{line_break}had not forgotten their quest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09343"
msgstr "Is that truly all?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09344"
msgstr "I also wanted to introduce{line_break}{actor_name:5} to the two of you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09345"
msgstr "Why would you want to do that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09346"
msgstr "With Saturos and Menardi gone,{line_break}you probably felt very little{line_break}pressure to complete your task.{page_break}I cannot have that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09347"
msgstr "What do you mean by that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09348"
msgstr "With Saturos and Menardi gone,{line_break}I felt another pair might...{line_break}How shall I put this...{page_break}Provide you with the proper{line_break}incentive to complete your task.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09349"
msgstr "Is that some kind of threat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09350"
msgstr "Take it as you wish. I just{line_break}wanted to provide you with{line_break}the proper encouragement.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09351"
msgstr "So, what? You've used us to{line_break}your satisfaction, and now,{line_break}our role is done?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09352"
msgstr "You only wanted us around to{line_break}flex a little muscle and scare{line_break}them into action? Fine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09353"
msgstr "I suppose we will let you{line_break}go today...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09354"
msgstr "But we will always be nearby...{line_break}pushing you to make your way{line_break}to Jupiter Lighthouse swiftly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09355"
msgstr "I look forward to seeing you{line_break}soon, {actor_name:5}, somewhere{line_break}very near Jupiter Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09356"
msgstr "Kraden, am I right in recalling{line_break}that you pursue this quest on{line_break}the behalf of Tolbi's ruler, Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09357"
msgstr "This is true. I'm studying{line_break}Alchemy because Lord Babi{line_break}has ordered it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09358"
msgstr "What about it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09359"
msgstr "Ah, what a pity. It would{line_break}seem all your studies...{line_break}have been for naught.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09360"
msgstr "What are you getting at, Alex?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09361"
msgstr "Only that it seems your Lord{line_break}Babi has at last succumbed{line_break}to the ravages of time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09362"
msgstr "Lord Babi is dead?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09363"
msgstr "Oh, so you didn't know?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09364"
msgstr "Lord Babi? Dead? Could{line_break}that really be true?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09365"
msgstr "Alex! How would you know{line_break}such a thing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09366"
msgstr "Do not mistake me! We had no{line_break}hand in Babi's passing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09367"
msgstr "However, the people of Tolbi{line_break}may be under the impression that{line_break}our presence led to his death.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09368"
msgstr "Alex! Cut the melodrama{line_break}and get to the point for a{line_break}change!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09369"
msgstr "Simply put, I would recommend{line_break}against traveling to north{line_break}Gondowan for a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09370"
msgstr "I just thought it might be better{line_break}if you focused on your quest,{line_break}instead of exploration, for now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09371"
msgstr "How kind of you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09372"
msgstr "Take it as you will...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09373"
msgstr "Very well. May we meet again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09374"
msgstr "So the only reason Alex came{line_break}here was to threaten us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09375"
msgstr "And to bring us news of Babi's{line_break}death, despite the fact that we{line_break}asked for no such news!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09376"
msgstr "Perhaps he had his own reasons{line_break}for telling Kraden...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09377"
msgstr "What do you mean, {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09378"
msgstr "If Kraden undertook this quest{line_break}on behalf of Babi, then he no{line_break}longer has any need°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09379"
msgstr "Oh. Of course! I hadn't thought{line_break}of that. Your orders were to find{line_break}Lemuria, right, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09380"
msgstr "That's right. But if Babi really{line_break}has died, you're free to go{line_break}where you will, Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09381"
msgstr "That's not true, {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09382"
msgstr "Certainly, my original reason{line_break}for researching Alchemy was{line_break}for Lord Babi...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09383"
msgstr "\"Was for Lord Babi\"? That's{line_break}the past tense! What are your{line_break}reasons now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09384"
msgstr "This is no longer solely for{line_break}research... I do this because of{line_break}what I've learned on this quest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09385"
msgstr "Your research?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09386"
msgstr "What you learned on this quest?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09387"
msgstr "I'm not following you at all!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09388"
msgstr "I don't understand a word of this.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09389"
msgstr "Of course you don't! {actor_name:5}{line_break}is the only one I've spoken{line_break}to about any of this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09390"
msgstr "What!? You knew!?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09391"
msgstr "That's not fair! Tell us!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09392"
msgstr "Please, {actor_name:5}... Let's not{line_break}say too much about it just yet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09393"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} is right. Now is{line_break}not the time to tell you{line_break}about it all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09394"
msgstr "It's...far too complicated.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09395"
msgstr "Well, when WILL you tell us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09396"
msgstr "I am sure we will tell you once{line_break}we get to Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09397"
msgstr "Do you promise?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09398"
msgstr "I promise...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09399"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}? You don't{line_break}mind waiting?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09400"
msgstr "I cannot read minds, like{line_break}{actor_name:7}, but I have a guess{line_break}at what you're thinking...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09401"
msgstr "A guess? What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09402"
msgstr "You are a great scholar,{line_break}Kraden, are you not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09403"
msgstr "I believe your theory is correct.{line_break}And to prove it, I want to return{line_break}to Lemuria as soon as possible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09404"
msgstr "Getting Trident (TEMP){end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09405"
msgstr "It's the middle of three tines.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09406"
msgstr "It reads: Search by the water's{line_break}edge where the letter had fallen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09407"
msgstr "It reads: Two Steps north of the{line_break}middle grave where the{line_break}letter had fallen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09408"
msgstr "Champa ahead!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09409"
msgstr "Hey! That block on the{line_break}mast has disappeared!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09410"
msgstr "Hey! Now, we can raise the mast{line_break}and use the sail again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09411"
msgstr "Hey, mate, let's go tell the{line_break}mayor the good news!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09412"
msgstr "Yeah, let's do that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09413"
msgstr "Baba babubu!! {end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09414"
msgstr "What is it, Eoleo? What{line_break}are you so excited about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09415"
msgstr "Baba babubu!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09416"
msgstr "It's true! The block that was{line_break}pinning the mast down is gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09417"
msgstr "You were the ones who{line_break}did it, weren't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09418"
msgstr "I knew you would{line_break}do it someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09419"
msgstr "But, of course, I also know that{line_break}you didn't do it for our benefit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09420"
msgstr "Still, Briggs will be pleased{line_break}when he hears about this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09421"
msgstr "Well then, let's go tell him!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09422"
msgstr "I still just can't quite believe{line_break}that the stone block on top of{line_break}the mast has totally vanished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09423"
msgstr "I'm telling you, Mayor, I saw{line_break}it with my own eyes! ...I mean,{line_break}I didn't see it! It's gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09424"
msgstr "If you don't believe us, you{line_break}can go see for yourself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09425"
msgstr "Huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09426"
msgstr "What?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09427"
msgstr "Whoa, hey!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09428"
msgstr "It's gone! That huge block{line_break}is really gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09429"
msgstr "Excellent news, Mayor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09430"
msgstr "Unfortunately, the mayor of{line_break}Madra will probably try to{line_break}take it from us now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09431"
msgstr "But that can wait. Who was{line_break}able to move the block?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09432"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09433"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, did you do this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09434"
msgstr "Surprised to see us, Mayor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09435"
msgstr "Did you do this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09436"
msgstr "We left Alhafra some time ago,{line_break}but we just returned and{line_break}destroyed the stone block.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09437"
msgstr "Exploring? What brought you{line_break}back to Alhafra right now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09438"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} had a hunch that{line_break}we might be needed here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09439"
msgstr "Mayor, not to interrupt, but{line_break}shouldn't we begin repairs{line_break}on your ship now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09440"
msgstr "Yes, yes... You're right, of course.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09441"
msgstr "Gather the townspeople and{line_break}get them to work on the mast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09442"
msgstr "Yes, sir! We're on our way!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09443"
msgstr "We shouldn't need too many{line_break}people to raise the mast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09444"
msgstr "All right. I'm counting on you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09445"
msgstr "Destroying that stone must{line_break}have been quite a challenge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09446"
msgstr "Why don't you come back to{line_break}my manor to get some rest?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09447"
msgstr "We could use the rest,{line_break}{actor_name:5}. We should accept{line_break}the mayor's offer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09448"
msgstr "You're too kind, Mayor. We'd{line_break}be happy to...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09449"
msgstr "Thank you again, Mayor.{line_break}You keep a fine house.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09450"
msgstr "Don't be silly. You've done{line_break}us a great deed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09451"
msgstr "It was the least{line_break}I could do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09452"
msgstr "Even if he gets the boat fixed,{line_break}I don't think he's going to hand{line_break}it over to Madra...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09453"
msgstr "I agree... He's being way too{line_break}nice for me not to be a little{line_break}suspicious of him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09454"
msgstr "I'm sorry, did you girls{line_break}have something you'd{line_break}like to share with us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09455"
msgstr "I see!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09456"
msgstr "Jiya, how are the repairs coming{line_break}along? Things seem to be moving{line_break}slowly down there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09457"
msgstr "Milord, these things take time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09458"
msgstr "Sir, there's a problem!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09459"
msgstr "Calm down, man! You're a{line_break}soldier! What are you so{line_break}flustered about!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09460"
msgstr "Briggs destroyed the prison{line_break}and escaped with his pirates!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09461"
msgstr "What, were you asleep while{line_break}this was going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09462"
msgstr "Don't... Don't be silly!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09463"
msgstr "How could Briggs possibly{line_break}break out of our prison? It's{line_break}one of the strongest in Osenia!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09464"
msgstr "I don't know what happened,{line_break}but before I knew it, they'd{line_break}smashed a hole in the wall!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09465"
msgstr "Mayor! The mast has been{line_break}raised!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09466"
msgstr "Hey, what's up?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09467"
msgstr "Wait, you're supposed to{line_break}be guarding the prisoners...{line_break}What happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09468"
msgstr "It appears that Briggs{line_break}has escaped.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09469"
msgstr "That's no good...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09470"
msgstr "What are you standing around{line_break}for!? Search the area! Find{line_break}Briggs at once!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09471"
msgstr "It...might not be quite{line_break}that easy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09472"
msgstr "He is a pirate, after all...{line_break}A famous one!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09473"
msgstr "Enough of that! Move it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09474"
msgstr "Regardless, I'm going to go{line_break}inspect my boat...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09475"
msgstr "Oh, and {actor_name:5} and his crew{line_break}were there, too, weren't they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09476"
msgstr "I treated you like an honored{line_break}guest in my home...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09477"
msgstr "Usually, one feels a certain{line_break}obligation to those who do them{line_break}such a kind service, am I right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09478"
msgstr "So, don't just stand there!{line_break}Return the favor and find{line_break}me Briggs!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09479"
msgstr "Come on! Hurry up!{line_break}Let's go! Move it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09480"
msgstr "Let's go see the boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09481"
msgstr "The mayor of Alhafra certainly{line_break}does know how to look out for{line_break}his own interest, doesn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09482"
msgstr "That's one way of putting it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09483"
msgstr "Well, so what do we do? Do{line_break}we go after Briggs?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09484"
msgstr "Don't feel like you have to{line_break}do them any favors!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09485"
msgstr "That's right! Why should we{line_break}help the mayor, after the way{line_break}he treated you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09486"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} can decide for{line_break}himself what to do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09487"
msgstr "At the very least, I want to{line_break}go see the sailing ship{line_break}now that it's fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09488"
msgstr "Let's just go outside and{line_break}take a quick look.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09489"
msgstr "Everyone in town is talking{line_break}about how the boat's finally{line_break}been fixed! You should see it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09490"
msgstr "The whole town is grateful to{line_break}you... Without your help, we{line_break}couldn't have fixed the mast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09491"
msgstr "I'm just standing guard, in{line_break}case Briggs decides to{line_break}attack the mayor's manor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09492"
msgstr "Our sailboat looks fabulous{line_break}with its mast repaired! You{line_break}really must go check it out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09493"
msgstr "I wonder where Briggs and{line_break}his crew went... There's no sign{line_break}of them around here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09494"
msgstr "I heard you made it so we{line_break}could fix our sailboat! Is there{line_break}anything you CAN'T do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09495"
msgstr "Ever since we heard Briggs{line_break}broke out of jail, we've all{line_break}been a little nervous...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09496"
msgstr "I don't know why everyone's so{line_break}excited about fixing the ship. We{line_break}promised it to Madra, didn't we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09497"
msgstr "Oh! It's you! Where have you{line_break}been? We haven't seen you{line_break}around Alhafra lately...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09498"
msgstr "With that ship, Alhafra's going{line_break}to become a big, important{line_break}trading town... We'll all be rich!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09499"
msgstr "Once that stone was taken{line_break}care of, it was really quite{line_break}easy to raise the mast again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09500"
msgstr "If Briggs is smart, he's{line_break}probably long gone from{line_break}Alhafra, if you ask me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09501"
msgstr "I've been waiting for this day{line_break}for years! I can't wait to set{line_break}sail across the Eastern Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09502"
msgstr "The secret to harnessing the{line_break}wind's power is building a small{line_break}ship. Large ones can't do it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09503"
msgstr "I'm sure it's just a coincidence,{line_break}but whenever you show up,{line_break}trouble happens.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09504"
msgstr "The mayor was actually singing{line_break}and skipping when he went to{line_break}the dock. He seemed so pleased.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09505"
msgstr "Weird... Have you ever had the{line_break}feeling that someone just{line_break}passed by? Maybe it's just me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09506"
msgstr "Huge boats carry more, but{line_break}we need smaller ships to{line_break}catch the wind.{page_break}The mayor just doesn't{line_break}understand this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09507"
msgstr "I don't know what the big{line_break}rush is. We can see the boat{line_break}whenever we want. It's ours!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09508"
msgstr "Now that the boat is fixed,{line_break}who gets to keep it? Us? Or{line_break}the Madrans?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09509"
msgstr "I'm supposed to be guarding{line_break}in case Briggs shows up. But{line_break}if he does, I'll probably just cry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09510"
msgstr "Who cares if the boat is fixed?{line_break}It's not like we'll be allowed on{line_break}board. The mayor's too selfish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09511"
msgstr "Why do I have to look for{line_break}Briggs? It's not my fault{line_break}he escaped...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09512"
msgstr "I hate to tell {actor_name:5}, but{line_break}even though our mayor seems{line_break}nice, he's really a selfish jerk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09513"
msgstr "I'd bet that Briggs fled the{line_break}city at the first chance. I really{line_break}wonder if he'd still be here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09514"
msgstr "Briggs paid a lot for a broken{line_break}boat, but now that it's fixed, it's{line_break}practically priceless!{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09515"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} must have found himself{line_break}a boat... Isn't that what brought{line_break}him to Alhafra in the first place?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09516"
msgstr "I'm certain the only person to{line_break}prosper from the boat will be{line_break}that oaf of a mayor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09517"
msgstr "Now that all the debris{line_break}has been cleared away,{line_break}our harbor looks so nice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09518"
msgstr "The mayor said I had to look{line_break}for pirates... Where am I{line_break}supposed to be looking?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09519"
msgstr "I'm probably too old for the{line_break}mayor to let me on the ship,{line_break}but I can still have my dreams.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09520"
msgstr "Smaller ships use their sails{line_break}to steer a lot, but it must be{line_break}harder when your ship's so big.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09521"
msgstr "It's been so busy around here...{line_break}Pirates, warriors, sailing ships,{line_break}natural disasters. What a week!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09522"
msgstr "The mayor only had one thing{line_break}on his mind on his way to the{line_break}dock... Money, and lots of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09523"
msgstr "What if the pirates were{line_break}nearby... Maybe that was{line_break}them behind the building...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09524"
msgstr "Without smaller ships, how{line_break}can we catch the fish we{line_break}need to eat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09525"
msgstr "Oooog... Ow...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09526"
msgstr "Why do these things{line_break}always happen to me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09527"
msgstr "Stupid Briggs...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09528"
msgstr "Briggs's pirates... They{line_break}attacked us and...{line_break}The ship... The ship...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09529"
msgstr "I just came down to see the{line_break}repaired mast, and they jumped{line_break}on me from out of nowhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09530"
msgstr "Briggs said the boat was{line_break}his... And, to be honest, they{line_break}had paid us for it, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09531"
msgstr "Briggs!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09532"
msgstr "Briggs, where are you{line_break}taking my boat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09533"
msgstr "He's attempting to steal it!{line_break}Thief! Thief!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09534"
msgstr "Did you call me a thief?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09535"
msgstr "I paid for this boat, fair{line_break}and square. I'm no thief.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09536"
msgstr "You're the thieves! You tried{line_break}to take our boat away, after{line_break}we paid you so much for it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09537"
msgstr "... ...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09538"
msgstr "You're the one who{line_break}stole OUR boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09539"
msgstr "Ahoy, Briggs!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09540"
msgstr "Uh-oh... It's {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09541"
msgstr "You're not afraid of{line_break}them, are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09542"
msgstr "Look how far away they are...{line_break}There's no way they can{line_break}catch us now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09543"
msgstr "You're right... They're stuck on{line_break}the land, and we've got this boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09544"
msgstr "They can't catch us...{line_break}What would they do, swim?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09545"
msgstr "Hah! You're right! They can't{line_break}board us from way over there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09546"
msgstr "Wasn't there something you{line_break}wanted to do the next time{line_break}you saw {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09547"
msgstr "Don't tell me you forgot...{line_break}It's all you ever talked about{line_break}when you were in jail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09548"
msgstr "Oh yeah... I almost forgot.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09549"
msgstr "So now's your chance!{line_break}Do what you swore to do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09550"
msgstr "Bleah!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09551"
msgstr "Is that the best you could{line_break}come up with?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09552"
msgstr "But, Chaucha, they're an{line_break}awfully tough bunch...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09553"
msgstr "See? It's that attitude right{line_break}there! That's why you'll{line_break}never amount to anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09554"
msgstr "You know what? You're right!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09555"
msgstr "Hey! {actor_name:5}!{line_break}You guys take care!{page_break}And keep Alhafra safe{line_break}from thieves and pirates!{line_break}And politicians, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09556"
msgstr "What!?!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09557"
msgstr "I doubt we'll ever meet{line_break}again, but if we do,{line_break}remember this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09558"
msgstr "Neener neener neener!{line_break}Neener neener neener!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09559"
msgstr "Neener neener bleah!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09560"
msgstr "That may have been a bit much.{line_break}If you make him mad, he might{line_break}chase us right back to Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09561"
msgstr "What!!! You let Briggs{line_break}get away!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09562"
msgstr "You and your friends talk a{line_break}good game, but when trouble{line_break}happens, where are you!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09563"
msgstr "Well, isn't this a fine mess!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09564"
msgstr "My prize ship, stolen by a{line_break}bunch of filthy pirate scum!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09565"
msgstr "Get up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09566"
msgstr "They're gone, and you let{line_break}them escape!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09567"
msgstr "You guys have royally botched{line_break}this one. This ruins everything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09568"
msgstr "You all ought to be ashamed! All{line_break}of you were cowering, while I was{line_break}the only one to stand up to them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09569"
msgstr "All of you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09570"
msgstr "I'm going back to my manor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09571"
msgstr "And you, {actor_name:5}. I am{line_break}extremely disappointed in you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09572"
msgstr "There will be no reward for{line_break}you, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09573"
msgstr "You let that Briggs steal MY{line_break}ship! You're lucky I don't lock{line_break}you up in his stead!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09574"
msgstr "Bah! I've had enough of this!{line_break}Don't just stand there with your{line_break}mouths gaping! Get out of here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09575"
msgstr "We don't have a boat, so there's{line_break}no reason for anyone to be{line_break}here at the port. Return to town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09576"
msgstr "What an awful person.{line_break}Do you suppose he's always{line_break}this self-centered?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09577"
msgstr "Yes, he's terribly irritating.{line_break}You're quite right, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09578"
msgstr "You can stay calm after{line_break}listening to that windbag?{line_break}That's quite mature of you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09579"
msgstr "I'll wager Briggs is returning{line_break}to Champa, personally.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09580"
msgstr "Well, it doesn't matter. I think{line_break}I've had enough of this town.{line_break}Shall we be leaving?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09581"
msgstr "Ah, yes, well... If you still have{line_break}business to attend to here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09582"
msgstr "All right. But the sooner we leave,{line_break}the better. Lead on, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09583"
msgstr "Great! Let's leave as soon{line_break}as possible, shall we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09584"
msgstr "Alhafra lost its ship. Now, we're{line_break}nothing but a big, boring town{line_break}in the middle of Osenia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09585"
msgstr "Even though we lost the big boat,{line_break}I'm not particularly upset.{page_break}We'll be just fine if everyone{line_break}can work together and build{line_break}a fleet of smaller boats.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09586"
msgstr "After we did all that work to{line_break}fix the mast, someone goes and{line_break}steals our boat.{page_break}We never should have fixed{line_break}it in the first place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09587"
msgstr "It was great to see everyone{line_break}in town working to raise the{line_break}mast. Too bad the boat got stolen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09588"
msgstr "When they find that their boat was{line_break}stolen, I'm sure Madra's not going{line_break}to be too happy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09589"
msgstr "It's not like the boat could{line_break}even move when the mast{line_break}was still broken...{page_break}When you think of it that{line_break}way, it doesn't feel like we{line_break}really lost anything at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09590"
msgstr "The repairs are coming along{line_break}pretty slowly, aren't they?{page_break}Well, you wouldn't feel much{line_break}like working either if your last{line_break}major project was stolen!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09591"
msgstr "When is this house going to be{line_break}finished once and for all!? The{line_break}repairs are taking forever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09592"
msgstr "It felt so great when the whole{line_break}town joined together to get{line_break}those boat repairs done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09593"
msgstr "Back before Briggs destroyed{line_break}the bridge to the west, it was{line_break}a lot easier to trade with Madra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09594"
msgstr "We fixed the mast so we{line_break}could use that boat.{page_break}Now, Briggs has taken the boat{line_break}and sailed off to Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09595"
msgstr "If they caught a good breeze,{line_break}they're probably way off to the{line_break}north of us by now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09596"
msgstr "If only we had that ship, Alhafra{line_break}could have been a powerful{line_break}trading town...and wealthy, too...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09597"
msgstr "I hope trade doesn't make{line_break}Alhafra get all big. I like how{line_break}quiet things are around here...{page_break}We should stay a small town,{line_break}with our small little boats.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09598"
msgstr "It was Madra's boat. It{line_break}should have been Madra's{line_break}problem...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09599"
msgstr "The mayor seemed so happy to{line_break}see us working on the boat...{line_break}That's kind of strange.{page_break}After all, we were only fixing{line_break}it so we could give it to{line_break}Madra, weren't we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09600"
msgstr "The mayor of Madra seems like{line_break}a reasonable person. It's too{line_break}bad this had to happen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09601"
msgstr "We're all pulling together to fix{line_break}this house. At least everyone{line_break}is helping with the work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09602"
msgstr "If Mom would stop making all{line_break}these trifling little requests,{line_break}we'd be done a lot faster...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09603"
msgstr "I know it's time to forget about{line_break}that boat and get back to work...{line_break}But I just can't let it go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09604"
msgstr "First, he steals a ship...then he{line_break}ruins a very important bridge...{line_break}Briggs is a real jerk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09605"
msgstr "Why worry about Briggs? It's{line_break}not as though we've got a boat{line_break}to chase him with...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09606"
msgstr "If Briggs hadn't stolen that{line_break}boat, I'd be out on the open{line_break}sea right now, wind in my hair.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09607"
msgstr "There's no point in worrying{line_break}about losing something we{line_break}never had to begin with.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09608"
msgstr "I don't want to say this{line_break}out loud or anything, but...{page_break}Briggs paid for that boat{line_break}fair and square. He didn't{line_break}steal it at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09609"
msgstr "Briggs didn't commit any{line_break}crimes in Alhafra, did he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09610"
msgstr "Briggs paid for the boat and{line_break}then left in it. Why is everyone{line_break}treating him like a crook?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09611"
msgstr "I don't believe for one second{line_break}that Briggs was a pirate,{line_break}raiding the towns of Indra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09612"
msgstr "Fixing that old guy's house is{line_break}starting to drive us all crazy.{page_break}I, for one, will be ready for a{line_break}celebration once it's done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09613"
msgstr "The repairs on our neighbors'{line_break}house are moving slowly.{page_break}The longer it takes, the longer{line_break}they live with us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09614"
msgstr "My house is damaged more than{line_break}I thought. Looks like I'm still{line_break}stuck here with my neighbors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09615"
msgstr "My husband and I don't get{line_break}out much, and it's nice to{line_break}meet the neighbors...{page_break}But we've been here for so{line_break}long, I don't think we'll be{line_break}going out for quite a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09616"
msgstr "Will they ever get out of my{line_break}house? It's starting to worry{line_break}me a bit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09617"
msgstr "I don't have anything to say{line_break}to them, and I'm tired of being{line_break}the good hostess all the time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09618"
msgstr "I don't mind not being at{line_break}home, but my wife wants{line_break}her privacy back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09619"
msgstr "I hated this place at first, but it's{line_break}grown on me. I feel so much more{line_break}sociable now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09620"
msgstr "That guy's house isn't fixed,{line_break}and he won't help out on our{line_break}house until his is done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09621"
msgstr "The mayor's been handing out{line_break}free food to help us all through{line_break}these difficult times.{page_break}The way things have been{line_break}going, though, I bet everyone{line_break}just hoards it all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09622"
msgstr "We have to store what food we get{line_break}from the mayor and only eat a{line_break}little bit of it at a time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09623"
msgstr "We could use some help with{line_break}the house, but it looks like{line_break}we're on our own for now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09624"
msgstr "I don't know what will happen{line_break}if the repairs aren't done before{line_break}winter hits...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09625"
msgstr "I've seen Father trying to do some{line_break}repairs, but it's too much work{line_break}for him to do on his own.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09626"
msgstr "Even if we fix it, the columns{line_break}and the walls will collapse...{line_break}They always do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09627"
msgstr "With everyone's help, we were{line_break}somehow able to avoid the wind{line_break}and rain at least.{page_break}You know, after all this, I now{line_break}understand how difficult it{line_break}is to be a carpenter.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09628"
msgstr "Mom was happy to hear that{line_break}the repairs were coming along{line_break}nicely. The thing is, they're not.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09629"
msgstr "There are a lot of houses in{line_break}need of repair. Until the others{line_break}are finished, I'll wait quietly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09630"
msgstr "This is just too much work{line_break}for one man to get done.{page_break}I need to stop and get some{line_break}rest, but I promised I'd finish...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09631"
msgstr "He's never going to get{line_break}finished with that terrible{line_break}attitude of his.{page_break}Until he feels like working,{line_break}nothing much is going to{line_break}get done around here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09632"
msgstr "There's no way Dad can fix{line_break}this house up all by himself.{line_break}It's a mess!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09633"
msgstr "Carrying these things all over has{line_break}gotten my hands all torn up.{line_break}I feel so...rugged!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09634"
msgstr "Everyone's saying that Briggs{line_break}probably escaped by tunneling{line_break}through the mayor's manor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09635"
msgstr "Supposedly, the cave under the{line_break}mayor's manor is treacherous.{page_break}You'd have to be pretty tough{line_break}to make it out of there alive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09636"
msgstr "So, Briggs stole Madra's ship{line_break}right out from under our{line_break}own greedy mayor?{page_break}Ah, 'tis an ill wind that...{line_break}that...um... Oh, I forget how it{line_break}goes. But it's bad, trust me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09637"
msgstr "I don't know... I never really{line_break}thought the mayor would give{line_break}that boat to Madra anyway.{page_break}Our mayor's far too greedy to{line_break}pass up an opportunity like{line_break}this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09638"
msgstr "The bridge to the west of{line_break}us is all fixed now, just so{line_break}you know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09639"
msgstr "People will start traveling again,{line_break}and they'll need to buy equipment...{line_break}My equipment!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09640"
msgstr "We're still recovering from the{line_break}damage the tidal wave caused.{page_break}Once the reconstruction is{line_break}complete, Alhafra will be the{line_break}perfect town... Indestructible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09641"
msgstr "The mayor used the money{line_break}he got from Madra to pay{line_break}for all our food.{page_break}Everything was looking good,{line_break}until the boat got stolen...{line_break}That sort of killed morale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09642"
msgstr "It seems that Briggs broke{line_break}out of jail with the help{line_break}of his wife, Chaucha.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09643"
msgstr "Briggs might have had a{line_break}key, but I think he used{line_break}a different escape route...{page_break}I mean, walking out the{line_break}front door of our jail would{line_break}have been really stupid!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09644"
msgstr "A bigger boat could haul in{line_break}more fish, but right now, just{line_break}about anything will do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09645"
msgstr "I just want a house where{line_break}we can all live together{line_break}without fighting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09646"
msgstr "Someone said my son and my{line_break}grandchildren are fixing the{line_break}house. They're so considerate...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09647"
msgstr "So that Alex fellow left already,{line_break}did he? He's such a rogue... Is{line_break}he running from something?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09648"
msgstr "After the tidal wave, it was{line_break}one complaint after another,{line_break}but things have quieted down.{page_break}Everyone's been pulling together{line_break}to get this work done, and we've{line_break}set our differences aside.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09649"
msgstr "The mayor may have pulled{line_break}through the tidal wave just{line_break}fine, but his town didn't!{page_break}How could he even {text_effect:2}consider{reset_text_style}{line_break}punishing me for trying to feed{line_break}all these unfortunate souls?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09650"
msgstr "Briggs and his wife were{line_break}totally planning this jailbreak{line_break}when she saw him there...{page_break}What was the guard doing?{line_break}Wasn't he watching his{line_break}prisoner? Was he napping?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09651"
msgstr "If I had a key, I would have{line_break}used it. That's for sure...{page_break}Briggs escaped through the{line_break}caves, though... That pirate's{line_break}a wily one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09652"
msgstr "So what if trade brings people{line_break}here? Things are so bad, we{line_break}can't even offer a decent meal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09653"
msgstr "I'd really like to have a pet, but{line_break}I know better. Things are too{line_break}tough right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09654"
msgstr "Isn't anyone helping my family{line_break}with the house? I'm an old man,{line_break}and it'll take them years to finish!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09655"
msgstr "He was just my type... Aloof,{line_break}strong, blue haired...{page_break}But he was a little too aloof.{line_break}He... He never even said{line_break}good-bye...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09656"
msgstr "I heard you were there when{line_break}Briggs escaped on the sailing{line_break}ship.{page_break}A villain like Briggs should{line_break}never have been allowed to{line_break}escape. It's a terrible thing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09657"
msgstr "They were so confident when{line_break}they caught him before, but they{line_break}were careless and let him escape!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09658"
msgstr "Before I knew it, Chaucha stole{line_break}the keys to the jail, and Briggs{line_break}and his crew had them.{page_break}I never looked away! Not once!{line_break}I never let my guard down!{line_break}How did this happen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09659"
msgstr "No matter how many times I go{line_break}over it, nothing seems right.{line_break}I'm just not convinced...{page_break}Wait a sec... Did Eoleo have a{line_break}hand in this? He was standing{line_break}behind me the entire time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09660"
msgstr "The mayor of Alhafra does{line_break}not wish to meet with you.{line_break}Please step back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09661"
msgstr "You really made a mess of{line_break}things. Letting Briggs get{line_break}away? What's wrong with you!?{page_break}The mayor trusted you! You{line_break}were his favorites°but not{line_break}anymore!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09662"
msgstr "The mayor was so mad at us{line_break}for letting Briggs reach the{line_break}boat.{page_break}How were we to know he{line_break}was going to steal it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09663"
msgstr "One thing's for sure... We're not{line_break}going to be hearing about how{line_break}great {actor_name:5} is anymore!{page_break}Now it's my turn to show{line_break}the mayor what I can do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09664"
msgstr "Briggs came through here and{line_break}disappeared into the forest.{line_break}Scared the pants clean off me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09665"
msgstr "The poor guard was blindfolded{line_break}when Briggs escaped, so he{line_break}didn't see a thing.{page_break}He's smart, that Briggs,{line_break}covering his escape{line_break}route like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09666"
msgstr "Briggs came back with a{line_break}giant load of food! I've never{line_break}been so full! It feels great!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09667"
msgstr "Don't talk to me about food...{line_break}I feel like I'm gonna be sick.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09668"
msgstr "Let's see them call Champa{line_break}poor now!{page_break}Ever since Briggs came back{line_break}with a cargo of gems, we've{line_break}been filthy stinking rich!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09669"
msgstr "Hey, you just came to Champa{line_break}not too long ago, didn't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09670"
msgstr "You'll be pleased to know that{line_break}Briggs found ancient pirate{line_break}treasure and bought us all food!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09671"
msgstr "Well, you wouldn't know it to{line_break}look at us now, but Champa{line_break}was quite poor until recently.{page_break}Now, thanks to Briggs, we're{line_break}all so wealthy, it's disgusting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09672"
msgstr "Briggs took a long time{line_break}to return to us. You want{line_break}to know why?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09673"
msgstr "He was being held by an evil{line_break}man who stole his money and{line_break}made him a prisoner!{page_break}They were probably trying{line_break}to find Briggs's jewels...{line_break}The sea is a rough place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09674"
msgstr "Briggs overcame great{line_break}danger to return home to us.{line_break}I admire him. I really do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09675"
msgstr "Briggs looks so reliable,{line_break}so sure of himself. I've never{line_break}seen him like this before.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09676"
msgstr "Those bags are full of food{line_break}for the people of Champa.{line_break}Briggs gave them to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09677"
msgstr "I want to play with Eoleo,{line_break}but he never comes down{line_break}to the harbor anymore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09678"
msgstr "Briggs fought the odds to{line_break}bring us jewels and food!{line_break}He's an amazing leader!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09679"
msgstr "Obaba is the last possessor of{line_break}the ancient secrets of Ankhol,{line_break}a long-lost civilization...{page_break}There's nothing she can't fix,{line_break}no matter how broken it is.{line_break}She's quite the blacksmith!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09680"
msgstr "You'd think Obaba would be{line_break}glad that Briggs was back.{line_break}She acts like nothing's changed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09681"
msgstr "Now, nobody has to do anything{line_break}he or she doesn't want to do!{line_break}We owe Briggs a lot of thanks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09682"
msgstr "Briggs is so generous!{line_break}He told me to eat and eat{line_break}and eat, so I did!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09683"
msgstr "Errrrg... I was so full, and I{line_break}just kept eating. I think I'm{line_break}going to explode now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09684"
msgstr "Gosh... How much are all{line_break}those jewels worth? More{line_break}than I can figure, I know that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09685"
msgstr "Things are going to be different{line_break}around here. Things are going{line_break}to be better. I can't wait.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09686"
msgstr "We're lucky Briggs hadn't{line_break}found the jewels when he{line_break}was caught.{page_break}That would have been{line_break}the end of Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09687"
msgstr "Briggs was always such{line_break}a brat, but now he's saved the{line_break}village! What a turnaround!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09688"
msgstr "All of our stockhouses are{line_break}so full of food that they've{line_break}just left the extra out here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09689"
msgstr "Eoleo said he couldn't play{line_break}with us anymore, even though{line_break}he's younger than we are...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09690"
msgstr "If Champa gets enough money,{line_break}maybe we can stop with the{line_break}looting and pillaging...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09691"
msgstr "Is Obaba in a good mood now,{line_break}or what? I noticed the change{line_break}as soon as Briggs returned.{page_break}If you've got something to ask{line_break}her, now's the time to ask.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09692"
msgstr "Nobody really likes to play the{line_break}role of a pirate.{page_break}I'm sure everyone is glad they{line_break}don't have to anymore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09693"
msgstr "We don't need to live off{line_break}fish anymore, so we don't{line_break}need any fishermen, do we?{page_break}That does it. I'm not{line_break}working anymore. What{line_break}would be the point?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09694"
msgstr "It's true! It's true! Briggs did{line_break}return with the jewels!{page_break}He's really going to have more{line_break}friends than he did before!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09695"
msgstr "Father's acting like a child, and it{line_break}seems he quit his job. He plans{line_break}on lounging around at home...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09696"
msgstr "When Briggs returned with the{line_break}jewels, the adults quit working.{line_break}I hope I don't become like them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09697"
msgstr "I'd rather spend my time sleeping{line_break}than passing it chasing fish that{line_break}can't be caught.{page_break}Why go after food, when Briggs{line_break}can give it to you?{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09698"
msgstr "Briggs is a hero for saving the{line_break}village. But will Father lose his{line_break}motivation to be productive?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09699"
msgstr "If Father sits around the house, he{line_break}will lose all respectability. It's{line_break}better to fish than to do nothing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09700"
msgstr "Quitting their jobs makes the{line_break}adults just like us kids. It's{line_break}getting really weird around here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09701"
msgstr "I hear that Briggs sold the{line_break}jewels he found for cash and{line_break}then acquired a boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09702"
msgstr "While I'm grateful for the food,{line_break}it's somewhat annoying knowing{line_break}that Briggs saved the day.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09703"
msgstr "Briggs really saved our hides{line_break}this time, but I'm not about to{line_break}join his crew!{page_break}Yeah, maybe I do owe him for{line_break}this, but I'll find a way to{line_break}pay him back legitimately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09704"
msgstr "The nerve of that Briggs!{line_break}He's gone for a bit, and he{line_break}comes back in a bigger boat!{page_break}I'll bet he only did it{line_break}to show us up, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09705"
msgstr "I should just sign up with{line_break}Briggs's crew and stop all{line_break}my complaining.{page_break}Oh, but my shipmates would{line_break}never forgive me if I bailed{line_break}on them like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09706"
msgstr "I refuse to live in the cliffs, and{line_break}therefore I am against Briggs.{page_break}I have accepted his food, but that{line_break}is as far as I will let myself slip.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09707"
msgstr "I've been wondering about{line_break}finding a chief for Champa,{line_break}since we don't have one.{page_break}If so, then Briggs would be the{line_break}favorite, since he's given{line_break}so much to the village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09708"
msgstr "We village elders have guided{line_break}Champa for so many years...{page_break}Yes, times are changing. Perhaps{line_break}it's time Champa's leadership{line_break}was given to the sailors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09709"
msgstr "A new image for Champa will{line_break}reflect the time we live in...{line_break}Any new visitors will like it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09710"
msgstr "Observing Briggs recently,{line_break}the limits of Champa as a{line_break}village are very apparent.{page_break}From now on, the village will{line_break}develop through trade. I guess{line_break}that's the era we've come to.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09711"
msgstr "It seems the elders are{line_break}considering appointing Briggs{line_break}the first-ever chief of Champa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09712"
msgstr "I, for one, think a person who can{line_break}bring the people of Champa{line_break}together will do us some good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09713"
msgstr "Sure, Briggs saved the village.{line_break}But saving it from despair is not{line_break}the same as governing it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09714"
msgstr "Supporting an entire village{line_break}through fishing from the sea{line_break}is next to impossible.{page_break}We need new sources of income.{line_break}Briggs is on the right path, finding{line_break}us all those lovely jewels.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09715"
msgstr "Whoa! You... You're {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09716"
msgstr "What? Really?{line_break}It's {actor_name:5}?{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09717"
msgstr "You're awfully persistent,{line_break}aren't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09718"
msgstr "Briggs, get outta here!{line_break}{actor_name:5} is here to{line_break}finish you off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09719"
msgstr "What was that!?{line_break}{actor_name:5}? Here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09720"
msgstr "Oh no! It's really him! I've{line_break}got to get out of here!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09721"
msgstr "Why do you have to be so{line_break}stubborn? Quit following{line_break}us, you big bully!{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09722"
msgstr "All right, I surrender! I'll{line_break}go back to Alhafra...but{line_break}only if Briggs is going.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09723"
msgstr "I'd rather fight than go{line_break}back to jail.{line_break}Bring it on, sissyboy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09724"
msgstr "Leave the women and{line_break}children alone. They've{line_break}got nothing to do with this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09725"
msgstr "You're {actor_name:5}, aren't you?{line_break}You've come to bring in{line_break}Briggs, haven't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09726"
msgstr "Did you really think you could{line_break}come storming into Champa,{line_break}Briggs's home, without a fight?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09727"
msgstr "Aw, come on! I'm not doing{line_break}anything! Leave me alone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09728"
msgstr "What, you want to come in?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09729"
msgstr "As if! I'm a nice girl, and I'm{line_break}not about to let some masher{line_break}come storming into my room!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09730"
msgstr "Yeah? So what do you want?{line_break}You're wasting my time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09731"
msgstr "Why's everyone so scared of{line_break}you? You don't look so tough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09732"
msgstr "If you so much as {text_effect:2}touch{reset_text_style} me,{line_break}I'll bite your nose off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09733"
msgstr "Maybe if I pretend he's not there,{line_break}he'll go away. I don't want to fight{line_break}him... He's got creepy powers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09734"
msgstr "He's after our ship, isn't he?{line_break}That no-good thief mayor{line_break}must have sent him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09735"
msgstr "It would be so much easier just{line_break}to go back to jail. Yeah... They{line_break}can't beat me up if I surrender!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09736"
msgstr "What are they doing here?{line_break}Do they mean to capture us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09737"
msgstr "Briggs said the guy who{line_break}captured him was some amazingly{line_break}tough thug named {actor_name:5}.{page_break}But I don't know... If this really{line_break}is him, he doesn't look like the{line_break}bad guy Briggs said he was.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09738"
msgstr "Why would Briggs run away{line_break}like a little baby just because{line_break}this guy showed up?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09739"
msgstr "Briggs is pretty tough. This guy{line_break}must be a serious monster if he{line_break}beat the captain...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09740"
msgstr "Tough or not, he's not getting{line_break}past me without a beating.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09741"
msgstr "He's not so tough! Why's everyone{line_break}running away? Just thump him{line_break}good and be done with it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09742"
msgstr "What's he staring at? Sheesh!{line_break}This guy's a total lech!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09743"
msgstr "Hold it right there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09744"
msgstr "So, {actor_name:5}, you've come.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09745"
msgstr "Don't assume I'll go so{line_break}easy on you this time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09746"
msgstr "Is that boy him? The \"mighty{line_break}warrior\" you told me about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09747"
msgstr "I told you he didn't look{line_break}like much, Grandma...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09748"
msgstr "Weren't you even{line_break}listening to me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09749"
msgstr "All you told me is that his name{line_break}is {actor_name:5} and that he is{line_break}a \"mighty warrior.\" Hmph.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09750"
msgstr "He doesn't look like the sort{line_break}of person who's interested in{line_break}stealing our jewels, though.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09751"
msgstr "But that's not the{line_break}point, Grandma!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09752"
msgstr "If you don't destroy him now,{line_break}he's going to take me far away,{line_break}and you won't ever see me again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09753"
msgstr "Oh, now he doesn't look like the{line_break}kind of boy who would do that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09754"
msgstr "If he takes me away, poor{line_break}Eoleo will be so sad! What{line_break}do you say about that, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09755"
msgstr "Oh, that's just not fair.{line_break}You know I can't deny my{line_break}darling great-grandson!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09756"
msgstr "I don't see why I should be the{line_break}one to get you out of this mess,{line_break}but I can't bear to see Eoleo sad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09757"
msgstr "Grandma, please!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09758"
msgstr "Oh, all right. Listen, you have no{line_break}idea what you're getting into.{line_break}I think you'd better leave.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09759"
msgstr "Ah, you've made a good decision.{line_break}You seem like a reasonable boy.{line_break}Reasonable boys live longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09760"
msgstr "Stubborn, are you? Ah, well.{line_break}If that's the way it's going to{line_break}be, get ready for your medicine!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09761"
msgstr "Heart of the earth, fury of the{line_break}forge's flames, grant me power!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09762"
msgstr "Have you learned your{line_break}lesson, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09763"
msgstr "Ah, such a bright lad. Now then,{line_break}don't you ever try to take my{line_break}Briggs away ever again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09764"
msgstr "Back for more?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09765"
msgstr "I wouldn't be doing this if it{line_break}weren't for Eoleo, you know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09766"
msgstr "I'm sorry. You look like quite a{line_break}nice boy, but I just can't allow{line_break}you to take my Briggs away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09767"
msgstr "My salamander! You...{line_break}beat my salamander...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09768"
msgstr "I thought he was unbeatable...{line_break}How could this be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09769"
msgstr "How did you do that?{line_break}What... What are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09770"
msgstr "Grandma, what's going on!?{line_break}I thought you were going{line_break}to protect me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09771"
msgstr "What do you mean, what am I{line_break}doing? I've done everything I can!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09772"
msgstr "Grandma!!! He's going to take{line_break}me away! He's a bad guy! You{line_break}have to do {text_effect:2}something{reset_text_style}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09773"
msgstr "I'm sorry, Briggs, but you'll{line_break}have to fight him yourself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09774"
msgstr "Wha-What!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09775"
msgstr "You heard me. I'm through{line_break}pampering you. You have to{line_break}get out of this yourself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09776"
msgstr "But...Grandma... Look at him!{line_break}I mean, look what he can do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09777"
msgstr "I know, dear, but there's nothing{line_break}I can do to help. You don't want{line_break}him to take you away, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09778"
msgstr "But...what about poor Eoleo?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09779"
msgstr "*Sigh*{line_break}All right, all right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09780"
msgstr "Um. Excuse me... There seems{line_break}to be a small misunderstanding.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09781"
msgstr "Yeah! I don't like standing here{line_break}listening to a pirate call {text_effect:2}us{reset_text_style}{line_break}the bad guys!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09782"
msgstr "Pirate! My Briggs?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09783"
msgstr "He stole a ship from Alhafra{line_break}and escaped from their jail!{line_break}A ship {text_effect:2}we{reset_text_style} helped fix!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09784"
msgstr "Briggs, is this true?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09785"
msgstr "Aw... But, Grandma, they...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09786"
msgstr "We should tell you, we're{line_break}not here to take Briggs{line_break}back to Alhafra.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09787"
msgstr "So you've decided you don't{line_break}want to run errands for the{line_break}mayor of Alhafra?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09788"
msgstr "Good. That greedy bag of hot{line_break}air can do his own dirty work,{line_break}for all I care.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09789"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, I know you can't{line_break}mean that. We didn't come to{line_break}Champa for that bloated gasbag.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09790"
msgstr "Briggs... Piracy? Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09791"
msgstr "Grandma, it's not what you{line_break}think! These guys, they...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09792"
msgstr "Briggs, you just hush up!!!{line_break}{pause_20_skippable}...It all makes sense now. The{line_break}gems, the food, your absence...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09793"
msgstr "What do you mean?{line_break}What makes sense?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09794"
msgstr "They're telling the truth! And{line_break}you, Briggs! You've been{line_break}lying to me this whole time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09795"
msgstr "You're going to take their word{line_break}over your own grandson's?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09796"
msgstr "You got that right! I should{line_break}have known better than to{line_break}believe you, you scoundrel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09797"
msgstr "He only did it for Champa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09798"
msgstr "Chaucha!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09799"
msgstr "You came!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09800"
msgstr "I heard {actor_name:5} had shown{line_break}up looking for you. I was{line_break}worried...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09801"
msgstr "What did you mean, Briggs{line_break}did it for Champa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09802"
msgstr "All of that food...{line_break}Stolen goods?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09803"
msgstr "No, we paid for everthing we{line_break}brought back with us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09804"
msgstr "But you stole a boat to{line_break}do it, didn't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09805"
msgstr "Grandma, we found those jewels{line_break}ourselves, and we paid Alhafra{line_break}well for that ship, didn't we?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09806"
msgstr "Your story has the{line_break}ring of truth to it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09807"
msgstr "Thank you, {actor_name:5}. Your{line_break}honesty speaks well of you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09808"
msgstr "So he's lying again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09809"
msgstr "Dang it, {actor_name:5}, I'm{line_break}not lying!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09810"
msgstr "We...were pirates, for a short{line_break}while. Until we found the jewels.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09811"
msgstr "But if not for our efforts,{line_break}Champa would have starved{line_break}away long ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09812"
msgstr "But that doesn't excuse{line_break}resorting to piracy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09813"
msgstr "Hey, it's not like we were{line_break}doing it for the money! We{line_break}wanted to save Champa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09814"
msgstr "Those jewels we found are very{line_break}valuable. We intend to repay{line_break}each town we...borrowed from.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09815"
msgstr "Isn't that true?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09816"
msgstr "What's the matter with you!?{line_break}You said on the boat that we{line_break}would repay every last town!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09817"
msgstr "Oh yeah... You're right...{line_break}We really ought to try to make{line_break}amends for what we've done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09818"
msgstr "That's the truth, Grandmother.{line_break}Can you find it in your heart{line_break}to forgive your only grandson?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09819"
msgstr "All right, all right. I'm too old for{line_break}grudges. But what about {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09820"
msgstr "What do you say, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Can you forgive my husband?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09821"
msgstr "I agree, {actor_name:5}. If each{line_break}town is repaid what was stolen,{line_break}I see no reason for complaint.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09822"
msgstr "I don't know, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}We didn't come to capture{line_break}Briggs. Why should we care?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09823"
msgstr "Do you hear that? They forgive{line_break}you, too. That means you can{line_break}leave Eoleo with nothing to fear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09824"
msgstr "I... I don't know what to say...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09825"
msgstr "You know, you look a{line_break}little strange...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09826"
msgstr "Oh... Oh, really?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09827"
msgstr "You haven't caught a{line_break}cold, have you? Do you{line_break}have a fever?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09828"
msgstr "What are you talking about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09829"
msgstr "No, I'm positive... You look{line_break}flush, too... You'd better lie{line_break}down before it gets worse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09830"
msgstr "She...worries about me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09831"
msgstr "Hurry up and get into bed{line_break}so you can get some rest!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09832"
msgstr "Oh, for goodness' sake! You{line_break}don't want to give them your{line_break}cold, do you? Come on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09833"
msgstr "So...what brings you{line_break}to Champa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09834"
msgstr "I mean, you didn't come here{line_break}to catch Briggs, from what{line_break}I gathered...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09835"
msgstr "Ah, well... To be young and{line_break}foolish again.{page_break}If you ever need to consult with{line_break}me on any number of subjects,{line_break}you're welcome anytime.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09836"
msgstr "I mean it. If there's ever{line_break}anything you need, just{line_break}call on me. I'm always here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09837"
msgstr "Now I've done it. I said I'd help{line_break}them with anything, but I'm only{line_break}good at fixing broken things...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09838"
msgstr "This looks like a weapon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09839"
msgstr "It looks like part of a trident,{line_break}but it's only one third of the{line_break}whole thing, it seems...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09840"
msgstr "Why... Could it be? Is this{line_break}the legendary trident of{line_break}Ankohl?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09841"
msgstr "I'll hold on to this for you. It{line_break}won't do you any good like{line_break}this, and I'll keep it safe here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09842"
msgstr "You seem unsure... You don't{line_break}think I'll pull a fast one on you,{line_break}do you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09843"
msgstr "Kids today. So mistrustful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09844"
msgstr "Ah, that's nice.{line_break}Don't you worry!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09845"
msgstr "If you bring me the other{line_break}two pieces, I'll be happy{line_break}to rebuild it for you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09846"
msgstr "The legend says that anyone{line_break}who holds the whole lance has{line_break}nothing to fear from the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09847"
msgstr "All of my smithing knowledge and{line_break}training was solely so that I might{line_break}rebuild the legendary trident.{page_break}I can't wait to get all three{line_break}pieces and repair the ancient{line_break}weapon of Ankohl.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09848"
msgstr "Ah, have you found the{line_break}second piece, dear?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09849"
msgstr "It's magnificent!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09850"
msgstr "I'll hold on to this as well.{line_break}Wouldn't want it getting lost,{line_break}now would we? Only one to go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09851"
msgstr "Yes, there's no doubt about it.{line_break}Those must truly be fragments{line_break}of the legendary trident.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09852"
msgstr "Soon, I'll have the chance to{line_break}test my skills to their fullest{line_break}extent! I can hardly wait!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09853"
msgstr "Well done! You found all{line_break}three pieces of the trident!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09854"
msgstr "That means I can begin{line_break}work reforging the ancient{line_break}trident of Ankohl! At last!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09855"
msgstr "We'll just toss all three{line_break}pieces in here, shall we?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09856"
msgstr "Just leave it to me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09857"
msgstr "There's nothing to be afraid{line_break}of, dear. Just leave it to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09858"
msgstr "Heart of the earth, fury of the{line_break}forge's flames, grant me power!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09859"
msgstr "That's funny... Nothing happened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09860"
msgstr "What's going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09861"
msgstr "Something's happening!{line_break}Is that...the legendary trident?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09862"
msgstr "After all these years, the trident{line_break}is complete again. But what's{line_break}making it float like that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09863"
msgstr "Regardless, the trident has{line_break}been fixed. It belongs to you{line_break}now, {actor_name:5}. Use it well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09864"
msgstr "The trident seems to have some{line_break}amazing power... The legends{line_break}must be true...{page_break}No matter what you encounter{line_break}at sea, no monster can stand{line_break}against you with that trident.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09865"
msgstr "You guys don't look much like{line_break}warriors, but you sure are{line_break}brave to fight your way in here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09866"
msgstr "Why did you have to go and tell{line_break}Obaba that we were pirates?{line_break}I'll bet that really upset her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09867"
msgstr "Aren't you the ones who caught{line_break}Briggs in Alhafra? You don't{line_break}look it, but you're pretty tough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09868"
msgstr "When Briggs set sail, we{line_break}thought we'd never see him{line_break}again.{page_break}Now, all of a sudden, he shows{line_break}up, and with enough food to{line_break}save our town forever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09869"
msgstr "I think those guys down in{line_break}the harbor wanted to come{line_break}up here and join us...{page_break}All they have to do is ask,{line_break}but I think they're chicken...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09870"
msgstr "We have so much food{line_break}everywhere now!{page_break}I hope Briggs goes off{line_break}soon to bring us even{line_break}more jewels and treats!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09871"
msgstr "Briggs came down with a{line_break}cold. I guess that means he{line_break}won't be sailing for a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09872"
msgstr "Eoleo still won't come down{line_break}and play with us. I'm getting{line_break}really cheesed off at him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09873"
msgstr "Once I'm over my cold, I'm setting{line_break}out to get more jewels and make{line_break}amends with Madra and Daila.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09874"
msgstr "I wonder what's wrong with{line_break}Briggs. He was feeling so{line_break}healthy and happy.{page_break}He doesn't have a fever, and{line_break}he's not coughing, but he says{line_break}he's too weak to go out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09875"
msgstr "Babu ba bubabu...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09876"
msgstr "We're going to wait until{line_break}Briggs feels better before{line_break}we go out to sea again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09877"
msgstr "There were plenty of treasures{line_break}on that island in the middle of{line_break}the sea.{page_break}If we get tired of waiting{line_break}for Briggs, maybe you{line_break}could come with us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09878"
msgstr "We really want to make{line_break}amends. We just need{line_break}Briggs to get better.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09879"
msgstr "It's all my fault. If I hadn't{line_break}messed with that switch,{line_break}we'd have gotten everything.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09880"
msgstr "All of my training was for the{line_break}single purpose of reforging{line_break}the ancient trident.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09881"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} must be incredibly{line_break}strong to get Briggs all{line_break}worked up like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09882"
msgstr "I just know she's going to{line_break}yell at us. The waiting is the{line_break}worst part. Next to the yelling.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09883"
msgstr "That {actor_name:5} sure comes off{line_break}kind of high and mighty. I hate{line_break}those self-righteous types.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09884"
msgstr "I was just gazing out at sea,{line_break}and then I saw Briggs's{line_break}ship... I got all choked up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09885"
msgstr "All those sailors who didn't{line_break}join Briggs said they didn't{line_break}want to be pirates.{page_break}Now that Briggs's going{line_break}straight, they want to join him.{line_break}I think they're just cowards.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09886"
msgstr "Briggs says he's sick and{line_break}can't go to sea right now.{page_break}But how can he not go? He{line_break}has to make up for all of{line_break}his evil deeds...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09887"
msgstr "Briggs's never been sick{line_break}a day in his life. I wonder how{line_break}he caught a cold now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09888"
msgstr "Eoleo is younger than I am,{line_break}but he acts like he's a lot{line_break}older.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09889"
msgstr "I'm certain that there are{line_break}even more jewels back in{line_break}that cave!{page_break}If only I'd had the chance to{line_break}grab a few more before that{line_break}trap blocked our way!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09890"
msgstr "There is absolutely nothing{line_break}wrong with Briggs.{page_break}I just know he's hiding{line_break}something from me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09891"
msgstr "One of Papa's men touched a{line_break}trap, and that's why Papa{line_break}couldn't get all the jewels.{page_break}Papa, I think you should{line_break}tell {actor_name:5} about that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09892"
msgstr "Suppose we went to get the{line_break}jewels... How would we gather{line_break}them, with that trap in the way?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09893"
msgstr "Briggs is just pretending to{line_break}be sick because he doesn't{line_break}want to follow up on his promise.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09894"
msgstr "I was as shocked as the next{line_break}guy that we couldn't reach{line_break}those treasure chests...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09895"
msgstr "At least we got some of{line_break}the jewels before that stupid{line_break}switch blocked us off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09896"
msgstr "The jewels Briggs found{line_break}are truly remarkable.{page_break}I wonder if there are any{line_break}more like these in that cave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09897"
msgstr "Thanks to Briggs, the Champa{line_break}can eat again!{page_break}Unfortunately, all that food is{line_break}going to run out someday.{line_break}Then, what do we do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09898"
msgstr "Briggs's men said they found{line_break}amazing weapons and things{line_break}in the cave, too...{page_break}I wish I'd been there. I would{line_break}like to have seen them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09899"
msgstr "Now's the time we ought to{line_break}be working hardest. While we{line_break}can eat, Champa can flourish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09900"
msgstr "We still haven't been able{line_break}to catch any fish for dinner.{page_break}Not to worry, though. We'll{line_break}serve up the meat that{line_break}Briggs bought for us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09901"
msgstr "It's nice not having to{line_break}work, but it gets a little{line_break}boring after a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09902"
msgstr "Most people here would love{line_break}a nice fish meal, but having{line_break}red meat is a nice change.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09903"
msgstr "The only way to find your{line_break}special purpose in life{line_break}is to work hard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09904"
msgstr "Briggs's jewels have turned{line_break}this poor town into a wealthy{line_break}place, but he brought too many.{page_break}Now, the hardworking people of{line_break}Champa have learned to be{line_break}lazy louts.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09905"
msgstr "All the people in town think{line_break}they can live without ever{line_break}having to work again.{page_break}They've quit their jobs,{line_break}and they rely too heavily{line_break}on Briggs's find.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09906"
msgstr "Hold on to that tiller!{line_break}Do you want us to get{line_break}swallowed by the waves!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09907"
msgstr "I know you're worried,{line_break}{actor_name:7}, but he's doing{line_break}the best he can...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09908"
msgstr "That was an incredibly strong{line_break}whirlpool, but I doubt it could{line_break}sink us or destroy the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09909"
msgstr "See, {actor_name:7}? There's nothing to{line_break}worry about. Even if we hit a{line_break}whirlpool, we should be fine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09910"
msgstr "But still... {actor_name:8}, can't you show{line_break}{actor_name:5} how to get past the{line_break}whirlpools and into Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09911"
msgstr "Er, yes, well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09912"
msgstr "What's wrong, {actor_name:8}?{line_break}Lemuria's just beyond these{line_break}whirlpools, isn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09913"
msgstr "Yeah, I...think so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09914"
msgstr "You...\"think so\"!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09915"
msgstr "Aren't you...{text_effect:2}from{reset_text_style} Lemuria?{line_break}Shouldn't you know exactly{line_break}where it is?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09916"
msgstr "Yes, I'm from Lemuria... I've{line_break}never had to get back {text_effect:2}into{reset_text_style}{line_break}it before!{page_break}And besides, the tidal wave{line_break}carried me out of Lemuria.{line_break}I didn't come through here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09917"
msgstr "Oh, I see. So that must mean...{line_break}You don't actually know which{line_break}direction Lemuria is in, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09918"
msgstr "Don't be silly! I mean...{line_break}I just need to get my bearings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09919"
msgstr "Hm... That doesn't sound good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09920"
msgstr "If Lemuria really is beyond those{line_break}currents, then we'll need to find{line_break}a way to get through them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09921"
msgstr "And until we do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09922"
msgstr "We won't be getting into Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09923"
msgstr "Why, that was Psynergy,{line_break}wasn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09924"
msgstr "Are they Adepts?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09925"
msgstr "Who {text_effect:2}are{reset_text_style} you!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09926"
msgstr "Are you the ones who{line_break}defeated Poseidon?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09927"
msgstr "That's quite something! Who{line_break}are you, that you could{line_break}defeat that leviathan?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09928"
msgstr "But clearly, you are here,{line_break}and the beast is gone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09929"
msgstr "If you are strong enough to{line_break}defeat Poseidon, you are too{line_break}dangerous to enter Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09930"
msgstr "The king's orders are clear!{line_break}We cannot grant you entry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09931"
msgstr "King? Who is your king?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09932"
msgstr "His Highness, King Hydros,{line_break}of course...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09933"
msgstr "His Majesty has ruled over{line_break}Lemuria for centuries.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09934"
msgstr "King Hydros has decreed that{line_break}Lemuria must be kept safe{line_break}from dangerous outsiders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09935"
msgstr "You say that we are dangerous,{line_break}but do you include me as well?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09936"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09937"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09938"
msgstr "Did you join them in battle{line_break}against Poseidon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09939"
msgstr "Impossible! Everyone knows{line_break}you possess great courage, but{line_break}you still are a mere Lemurian!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09940"
msgstr "Such comments do us all a{line_break}great disservice! I battled{line_break}fiercely alongside my friends!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09941"
msgstr "Leave our landing to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09942"
msgstr "You have my word that we{line_break}shall create no problems{line_break}during our stay.{page_break}Will you not permit us to enter?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09943"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, I know you are a{line_break}man of your word, but the king's{line_break}orders must stand!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09944"
msgstr "You understand that we cannot{line_break}simply ignore the king's orders,{line_break}don't you, {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09945"
msgstr "What is King Hydros doing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09946"
msgstr "So, you people really take your{line_break}kings seriously, don't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09947"
msgstr "Insolent pup! Do not dishonor{line_break}the king of Lemuria! We are{line_break}peaceful, but quick to anger!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09948"
msgstr "Pup? I must be twice your{line_break}age! Who are you calling{line_break}\"pup\"?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09949"
msgstr "You wish to see Lemuria, and yet{line_break}you know so little of us! I am far{line_break}older than you. Show respect!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09950"
msgstr "Pah! Older than me?!{line_break}Inconceivable!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09951"
msgstr "Er... Actually, Kraden, these{line_break}two are perhaps older than{line_break}all of you combined...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09952"
msgstr "Babi must have spoken of this{line_break}to you. In Lemuria, time passes{line_break}quite slowly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09953"
msgstr "Ah... Well... I suppose I recall{line_break}something of that sort or{line_break}another... Maybe...{page_break}But to imagine for a moment{line_break}that these two gentlemen are{line_break}older than I am? It's a bit much!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09954"
msgstr "But perhaps I was rude, and{line_break}I hope you accept my apology.{line_break}My ignorance misled me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09955"
msgstr "Well, just so long as we're{line_break}clear on that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09956"
msgstr "But if your fighting is as skilled{line_break}as your wordplay, then perhaps{line_break}you aren't so dangerous to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09957"
msgstr "I agree. Perhaps His Majesty{line_break}will provide an exception in{line_break}their case.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09958"
msgstr "King Hydros might be willing{line_break}to reverse his order if we{line_break}confer with him, wouldn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09959"
msgstr "We shall speak with{line_break}him at once!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09960"
msgstr "King Hydros has been seeking{line_break}news from beyond the Sea of{line_break}Time. He will want to see you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09961"
msgstr "Wait here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09962"
msgstr "How long do you think{line_break}we'll be waiting?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09963"
msgstr "Good point. Time means little{line_break}to most Lemurians.{page_break}Mere moments to us could{line_break}seem like a lifetime to outsiders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09964"
msgstr "You seem young to me, and{line_break}yet you are probably an old{line_break}man among your people...{page_break}I would imagine that you have{line_break}probably done enough waiting{line_break}in your lifetime.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09965"
msgstr "King Hydros instructed us to be{line_break}kind to the elderly at all times.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09966"
msgstr "They seem trustworthy enough...{line_break}Shall we let them in?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09967"
msgstr "I can see no reason not to.{line_break}We won't get in trouble, will we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09968"
msgstr "I will be with them! Now,{line_break}please, let me walk the streets{line_break}of my home once more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09969"
msgstr "I beseech you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09970"
msgstr "Then we place our trust in{line_break}each of you. You may enter.{line_break}But...don't do anything rash!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09971"
msgstr "If you cause any trouble, we'll{line_break}hunt you down and exact{line_break}swift and terrible vengeance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09972"
msgstr "Do we have your word?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09973"
msgstr "Ooo! Ooo! Finally! What could{line_break}be waiting for me in Lemuria?{line_break}I can't wait another moment!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09974"
msgstr "We've come a long way{line_break}to see Lemuria. I won't have{line_break}anything ruin it for me now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09975"
msgstr "But thank you for speaking{line_break}honestly. Sometimes, you can{line_break}say the weirdest things...{page_break}I was actually a little bit{line_break}worried, to tell you truly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09976"
msgstr "What!? Are you INSANE!? Or{line_break}maybe you think you're funny?{line_break}Because you're not!{page_break}Maybe this whole quest is{line_break}just a game to you, but it's{line_break}not to me! Are you bored!?{page_break}Do you want to go home!?{line_break}FINE! That's it! Then let's{line_break}go home!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09977"
msgstr "Oh, hush. I'll keep a close{line_break}eye on them. You have{line_break}nothing to fear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09978"
msgstr "Very well, {actor_name:8}. We place{line_break}our faith in you, then.{line_break}Enter freely and peacably.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09979"
msgstr "You must already be aware of{line_break}this, but you are not permitted{line_break}to enter the palace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09980"
msgstr "If the king were to find out about{line_break}this, we'd be in big trouble.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09981"
msgstr "Don't worry! I won't let{line_break}that happen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09982"
msgstr "Is this Hydros really{line_break}so fearsome?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09983"
msgstr "Fearsome isn't the right word...{line_break}King Hydros has lived longer{line_break}than anyone. He is most wise.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09984"
msgstr "While everyone respects{line_break}him and holds him in great{line_break}reverence...{page_break}It would be a mistake to{line_break}call it fear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09985"
msgstr "I certainly do not fear him.{line_break}The king... He...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09986"
msgstr "He what?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09987"
msgstr "You will understand once you{line_break}meet the king yourself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09988"
msgstr "But that does not matter{line_break}now. Let's go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09989"
msgstr "To Lemuria... The city you've{line_break}all been longing to see...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09990"
msgstr "Lost already, {actor_name:5}? That's{line_break}the way to the boat dock! You{line_break}can't want to return already!{page_break}We've only just gotten to{line_break}Lemuria. We can't leave yet!{line_break}There's still so much to see!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09991"
msgstr "Lost already, {actor_name:5}? That's{line_break}the way to the boat dock! You{line_break}can't want to return already!{page_break}We've only just gotten to{line_break}Lemuria. We can't leave yet!{line_break}There's still so much to see!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09992"
msgstr "This place is remarkable...{line_break}Truly remarkable...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09993"
msgstr "Who goes there! I've not{line_break}seen you in Lemuria before!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09994"
msgstr "Wait a moment...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09995"
msgstr "You must be the travelers{line_break}who arrived with {actor_name:8}. Is{line_break}your name {actor_name:5}, perchance?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09996"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}?{line_break}You mean {actor_name:8},{line_break}the Lost One?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09997"
msgstr "Have I earned a title in my{line_break}absence? Well, worry not!{line_break}{actor_name:8} is lost no more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09998"
msgstr "I seek counsel with King Hydros.{line_break}Has His Highness been{line_break}told of my return?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09999"
msgstr "Word was sent, but I do not{line_break}know if it has reached the king.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10000"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10001"
msgstr "Lord Conservato is meeting{line_break}with His Highness as we speak.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10002"
msgstr "Not Conservato...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10003"
msgstr "What's wrong, {actor_name:8}? You{line_break}don't look pleased to hear{line_break}that name...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10004"
msgstr "Kraden... What do you think of{line_break}what you have seen of Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10005"
msgstr "It is a magnificent city!{line_break}Or do you mean the castle?{line_break}Both are magnificent!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10006"
msgstr "And you, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Do you agree?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10007"
msgstr "Any newcomer to our town{line_break}would doubtless feel the{line_break}same at first.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10008"
msgstr "Ah! Yes, you marvel not at its{line_break}present condition, but at the{line_break}greater splendor of its past!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10009"
msgstr "In ages past, Lemuria was a{line_break}far lovelier, more grand, and{line_break}more lively city.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10010"
msgstr "His Highness, the king, tells of{line_break}days gone by, of a more brilliant{line_break}Lemuria long before my birth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10011"
msgstr "Over the countless years,{line_break}our people have lost vigor,{line_break}enthusiasm, creativity...{page_break}Lemuria has fallen into{line_break}slow collapse, a city that{line_break}has lost its spark...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10012"
msgstr "Lemuria as you see it{line_break}is only a shadow of the{line_break}city of legend.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10013"
msgstr "If only I had the chance to see{line_break}the city in all its splendor. But{line_break}how does Conservato figure in?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10014"
msgstr "King Hydros believes that our{line_break}decay is related in some way{line_break}to Alchemy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10015"
msgstr "Alchemy!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10016"
msgstr "King Hydros wants to find a{line_break}way to stop the ruin of{line_break}Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10017"
msgstr "If there were anything we{line_break}could do to help stop it,{line_break}we would.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10018"
msgstr "But the senators are unwilling{line_break}to take action! They're stubborn,{line_break}and they fear any change...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10019"
msgstr "Senate? What is a senate?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10020"
msgstr "The senate is the group of{line_break}elders who determine policy{line_break}in Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10021"
msgstr "Lord Conservato holds the{line_break}highest office in the senate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10022"
msgstr "The senate usually opposes{line_break}any new ideas or proposals{line_break}introduced before it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10023"
msgstr "Word of our arrival will never{line_break}reach the king as long as{line_break}Conservato has his ear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10024"
msgstr "And his conversations with the{line_break}king are incredibly long.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10025"
msgstr "We have no choice but{line_break}to wait patiently here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10026"
msgstr "Why don't we spend our{line_break}time looking around Lemuria{line_break}until then...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10027"
msgstr "The king is holding counsel with{line_break}Lord Conservato right now.{page_break}It might be a while before{line_break}you can see him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10028"
msgstr "The king will be thrilled to hear{line_break}his trusted {actor_name:8} has{line_break}returned.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10029"
msgstr "How much longer will Conservato{line_break}be in there? They've been talking{line_break}for ages now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10030"
msgstr "I had heard {actor_name:8} was{line_break}back, but I didn't believe it until{line_break}now...{page_break}You seem much more confident,{line_break}{actor_name:8}. Everyone has been{line_break}noticing it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10031"
msgstr "I cannot remember the last{line_break}time we had visitors in Lemuria.{line_break}Not in a great while, certainly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10032"
msgstr "Lemuria has no disease, no{line_break}war... Anyone who saw it would{line_break}think it a paradise.{page_break}And yet...all who come to our{line_break}city seek to leave soon after{line_break}arriving. I, too, wish to leave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10033"
msgstr "In Lemuria, we do not grow old.{line_break}It must seem quite odd to{line_break}those from the outside world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10034"
msgstr "Life never changes here in{line_break}Lemuria. It can get rather{line_break}dull, you'll find.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10035"
msgstr "I ought to feel surprised to{line_break}see outsiders here, but I can't{line_break}remember how to be surprised.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10036"
msgstr "How old am I again? I quit{line_break}counting after I turned two{line_break}hundred, and that was long ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10037"
msgstr "It has been many, many years{line_break}since a new child was born{line_break}in Lemuria.{page_break}Lemurians love children, but{line_break}they only remain children for{line_break}such a short time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10038"
msgstr "We are the only children in{line_break}Lemuria. I often wish there were{line_break}other children to play with.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10039"
msgstr "Meow... Mrrrfle...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10040"
msgstr "Woof! ...rrrrrROOF!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10041"
msgstr "Moo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10042"
msgstr "Bukbukbuk...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10043"
msgstr "...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10044"
msgstr "More of the same, today and{line_break}every day. Nothing around{line_break}here ever changes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10045"
msgstr "I haven't been surprised in{line_break}ages. I don't know what I'd{line_break}do if something happened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10046"
msgstr "I've aged so slowly, I no longer{line_break}fear death, but at the same time,{line_break}I have no motivation at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10047"
msgstr "Sometimes, I think the buildings{line_break}fall apart faster than we age.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10048"
msgstr "Long ago, a man named Lunpa{line_break}drifted to our island. That was{line_break}quite a surprise.{page_break}Someone else came with him,{line_break}but he fled so quickly.{line_break}What was his name again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10049"
msgstr "King Hydros is far older{line_break}even than I am...{line_break}How old is he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10050"
msgstr "Everyone spoils me so much...{line_break}I don't ever want to grow up!{page_break}But in another 20 or 30 years,{line_break}I will be an adult. Oh well. At{line_break}least it's some kind of change.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10051"
msgstr "Are there other children in the{line_break}lands beyond the Sea of Time?{line_break}Are there other people?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10052"
msgstr "No one in Lemuria feels any{line_break}passion for anything. They're{line_break}lazier than a cat in a sunbeam.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10053"
msgstr "There's so much treasure buried{line_break}here that you could dig almost{line_break}anywhere and find something...{page_break}So why doesn't anybody{line_break}here dig?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10054"
msgstr "Lemurians are so lazy that{line_break}they make me look like a{line_break}dynamo. And they live so long!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10055"
msgstr "If it weren't for the people in{line_break}the castle, the Lemurians would{line_break}probably let themselves starve.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10056"
msgstr "Mother... Why have you{line_break}left me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10057"
msgstr "I have never been outside of{line_break}Lemuria. I don't know what the{line_break}rest of the world is like.{page_break}If there weren't laws prohibiting{line_break}us from leaving, I would be gone{line_break}in an instant.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10058"
msgstr "Now that {actor_name:8} has returned,{line_break}maybe he'll share his tales{line_break}of the outside world with me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10059"
msgstr "Who knows what wonders lie{line_break}across the Sea of Time... I'd{line_break}love to know, but...{page_break}I can't stand places with{line_break}little culture and no advanced{line_break}civilization.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10060"
msgstr "The senate passed the law that{line_break}prohibits us from leaving...{page_break}But {actor_name:8} was carried out{line_break}to sea by the tidal wave. He{line_break}can't be blamed for that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10061"
msgstr "Are you the travelers that came{line_break}here with {actor_name:8}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10062"
msgstr "No? Ah, interesting. I wonder{line_break}when {actor_name:8} will come to{line_break}see me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10063"
msgstr "I was°what is the word?°{line_break}surprised when I heard{line_break}{actor_name:8} had returned.{page_break}I hope that I get to{line_break}see him soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10064"
msgstr "I am sorry it has taken{line_break}me so long to visit, Uncle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10065"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}! You are alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10066"
msgstr "Yes, I've managed to survive{line_break}against a great many trials.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10067"
msgstr "What a fascinating coincidence!{page_break}We've stumbled across {actor_name:8}'s{line_break}uncle's house!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10068"
msgstr "I must thank you all for{line_break}looking after my nephew.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10069"
msgstr "This is {actor_name:5} and Kraden.{line_break}They are my friends, and{line_break}have aided me tremendously.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10070"
msgstr "If my sister could only hear{line_break}how timid young {actor_name:8}{line_break}has become a mighty warrior...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10071"
msgstr "Where is my mother? We've been{line_break}so busy since we arrived that I{line_break}haven't had a chance to see her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10072"
msgstr "Now that I think about it, this{line_break}place is a mess. What happened?{line_break}Mother is always so neat...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10073"
msgstr "...No! She hasn't...fallen ill{line_break}again, has she?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10074"
msgstr "There is still illness{line_break}in Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10075"
msgstr "My mother was born with{line_break}a weak heart...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10076"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}... I'm sorry... Your return{line_break}comes too late...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10077"
msgstr "After the tidal wave washed{line_break}you to sea, your mother{line_break}suddenly fell ill...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10078"
msgstr "The shock of losing you was{line_break}too great for her poor heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10079"
msgstr "She held out hope for your{line_break}safe return until the very end.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10080"
msgstr "Perhaps your mother gave{line_break}herself up to ensure your{line_break}survival...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10081"
msgstr "Does that not sound like{line_break}your mother?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10082"
msgstr "Where is she now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10083"
msgstr "She rests in the cemetery now.{line_break}Check the headstones... You{line_break}will find her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10084"
msgstr "What should we do, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Should we follow {actor_name:8}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10085"
msgstr "After all we've been through,{line_break}the least we can do is offer{line_break}{actor_name:8} our condolences.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10086"
msgstr "You're right. {actor_name:8} probably{line_break}needs some time alone right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10087"
msgstr "I am so relieved that {actor_name:8}{line_break}has returned to me alive.{page_break}He is the last of my relatives.{line_break}Without him, I would be alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10088"
msgstr "Poor {actor_name:8}...{line_break}Being born in Lemuria and{line_break}gifted with long life...{page_break}Only to lose his father in his youth{line_break}and his mother now. He faces{line_break}many long years of loneliness.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10089"
msgstr "Wait...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10090"
msgstr "I ask that you leave {actor_name:8}{line_break}to his mourning for now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10091"
msgstr "Now he is struggling with{line_break}the loss of his mother.{line_break}He needs time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10092"
msgstr "You came to Lemuria to learn{line_break}more of Alchemy, did you not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10093"
msgstr "I suspected as much. {actor_name:8}{line_break}was right to bring you here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10094"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} told me his secret...{line_break}The mission he was given{line_break}by His Highness the king.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10095"
msgstr "Even had the tidal wave not{line_break}carried {actor_name:8} off, he would{line_break}have left us... Such was his fate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10096"
msgstr "You look confused...{line_break}{actor_name:8} told you about{line_break}this, did he not?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10097"
msgstr "Of course... He must trust{line_break}you a great deal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10098"
msgstr "Curious... I can't understand{line_break}why he would do that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10099"
msgstr "If Lord Conservato had not led{line_break}the senate to oppose him,{line_break}he would have left sooner.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10100"
msgstr "I wonder what news {actor_name:8}{line_break}has brought with him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10101"
msgstr "Either way, I do know why{line_break}he has brought you here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10102"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}... Don't tell me that{line_break}he hasn't at least told you{line_break}that much!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10103"
msgstr "You say he's told you, but{line_break}you look rather confused.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10104"
msgstr "Did {actor_name:8} tell you nothing{line_break}before bringing you here{line_break}to Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10105"
msgstr "Unfortunately, I know little{line_break}more than that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10106"
msgstr "While {actor_name:8} confronts his{line_break}sorrow over the loss of his{line_break}mother, you have some time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10107"
msgstr "I shall write you a letter...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10108"
msgstr "So that you can see Lunpa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10109"
msgstr "Lunpa has locked himself in his{line_break}tower and rarely comes out, but{line_break}if I send him this, he will see you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10110"
msgstr "All I need is a bird to carry{line_break}it to him in his tower.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10111"
msgstr "There. You should be able{line_break}to see him now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10112"
msgstr "Go to Lunpa's tower. He{line_break}will see you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10113"
msgstr "Lunpa has given the king{line_break}tremendous aid on this matter.{line_break}He will have much to tell them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10114"
msgstr "House of the Senate{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10115"
msgstr "Are you the warriors from{line_break}beyond the Sea of Time who{line_break}returned with {actor_name:8}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10116"
msgstr "What can you uncivilized louts{line_break}hope to bring to Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10117"
msgstr "Only savages and barbarians are{line_break}wont to tell lies when confronted{line_break}with uncomfortable situations.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10118"
msgstr "Long ago, the power of Alchemy{line_break}was abused in ways that might{line_break}bring about the end of the world.{page_break}Because it was sealed away, the{line_break}king claims, the world has begun{line_break}to wither and decay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10119"
msgstr "And now, rumors abound of a{line_break}group of fools who are actually{line_break}attempting to restore Alchemy.{page_break}It is only because Alchemy{line_break}was sealed away that the world{line_break}has enjoyed this lasting peace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10120"
msgstr "Come what may, I cannot{line_break}approve of anyone setting{line_break}Alchemy loose on the world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10121"
msgstr "Has Lemuria fallen into decay,{line_break}I ask you!? Nay!{page_break}Only by casting aside Alchemy{line_break}has the world been saved{line_break}from itself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10122"
msgstr "Do you seek to know more{line_break}about the draughts that provide{line_break}us with such longevity?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10123"
msgstr "Once, Lemurians bottled special{line_break}draughts to leave here and{line_break}travel through Weyard...{page_break}A man named Babi stole{line_break}the remainder of our precious{line_break}draughts and fled Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10124"
msgstr "Then I shall tell you this:{line_break}So long as we drink of the{line_break}Lemurian Spring, we live long.{page_break}We no longer leave our home,{line_break}so we have no need to make{line_break}our draughts of old.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10125"
msgstr "Was that some form{line_break}of Psynergy?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10126"
msgstr "Ho ho ho! We Lemurians are{line_break}masters of Psynergy all! Your{line_break}powers are not special here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10127"
msgstr "No? Curious. But it does not{line_break}matter. Lemurians are masters{line_break}of Psynergy. It is of no import.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10128"
msgstr "What does Hydros think will{line_break}happen if he sets Alchemy{line_break}loose on the world again!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10129"
msgstr "Ever since Alchemy was sealed,{line_break}time itself has seemed frozen.{page_break}In my mind's eye, I do not{line_break}see anyone who will go along{line_break}with the king's plan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10130"
msgstr "If Alchemy were loosed upon the{line_break}world, people would fight again{line_break}to control the Stone of Sages.{page_break}Alchemy must remain sealed{line_break}away, if for no other reason{line_break}than to avoid this strife.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10131"
msgstr "All of the members of the{line_break}senate must remain opposed{line_break}to breaking the seal.{page_break}As long as we remain united,{line_break}King Hydros cannot take any{line_break}action to complete his plan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10132"
msgstr "Certainly, Lemuria has lost{line_break}some of the splendor that{line_break}once filled its streets.{page_break}But to think that Alchemy{line_break}could restore this is{line_break}madness itself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10133"
msgstr "Even though we no longer{line_break}prepare the draught, the water{line_break}of our spring sustains us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10134"
msgstr "The door doesn't want to open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10135"
msgstr "Are you kids {actor_name:8}'s{line_break}traveling companions?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10136"
msgstr "The door's broken,{line_break}I'm afraid.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10137"
msgstr "But I opened up a window{line_break}just above the door.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10138"
msgstr "Sorry about this, but you'll{line_break}have to climb through there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10139"
msgstr "Honestly, I'm amazed that{line_break}anyone can travel so far{line_break}across the world in this age.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10140"
msgstr "Say, {actor_name:8} isn't with{line_break}you! Er...why not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10141"
msgstr "His mother passed away...{line_break}He's gone to visit her grave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10142"
msgstr "Of course... His mother... He{line_break}loved her dearly. A terrible{line_break}loss... It must be hard on him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10143"
msgstr "Well, {actor_name:8} may not be here, but{line_break}we still have much to discuss.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10144"
msgstr "If {actor_name:8} brought you,{line_break}you must be working to break{line_break}the seal on Alchemy, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10145"
msgstr "Ah, {actor_name:8} has done quite{line_break}well in finding you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10146"
msgstr "That doesn't make sense... He{line_break}wouldn't have brought you to{line_break}Lemuria if you weren't helping.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10147"
msgstr "What mission could the good{line_break}King Hydros have assigned{line_break}to {actor_name:8}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10148"
msgstr "What? {actor_name:8} has told you{line_break}nothing of his mission?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10149"
msgstr "...Really?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10150"
msgstr "So you actually have nothing{line_break}at all to do with Alchemy!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10151"
msgstr "Our parents were kidnapped by{line_break}the Fire Clan, far to the north.{page_break}We are only firing the lighthouse{line_break}beacons to gain their freedom...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10152"
msgstr "King Hydros told me that Venus{line_break}and Mercury have been ignited{line_break}once again. Was that your doing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10153"
msgstr "I'm afraid I know nothing of{line_break}any northern \"Fire Clan.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10154"
msgstr "But that doesn't explain you, sir.{line_break}You're clearly not related to{line_break}these two. What are your goals?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10155"
msgstr "Kraden joined us on this quest{line_break}on behalf of Lord Babi of Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10156"
msgstr "...Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10157"
msgstr "I only know of one man named{line_break}Babi... But it couldn't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10158"
msgstr "Master Lunpa, the Babi we{line_break}speak of is the same man{line_break}you knew long ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10159"
msgstr "Ah! So...he's still out there,{line_break}living in the outside world?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10160"
msgstr "Well, that might not be the{line_break}most accurate way of putting it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10161"
msgstr "Most...accurate? My, you{line_break}certainly have an odd way{line_break}of turning a phrase...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10162"
msgstr "He was living, yes...{line_break}Until recently, that is...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10163"
msgstr "So, Babi passed away...{line_break}But only recently, you say?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10164"
msgstr "When he finally ran out of{line_break}his mystic draughts, his spirit{line_break}began to wane.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10165"
msgstr "Then...I no longer know anyone{line_break}in the world outside.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10166"
msgstr "But... Aren't you Lunpa, the{line_break}Righteous Thief?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10167"
msgstr "I was called that once, long,{line_break}long ago. Why do you ask?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10168"
msgstr "I'll bet there's at least one{line_break}person in the outside world{line_break}whom you still know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10169"
msgstr "Who would that be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10170"
msgstr "There's a town called Lunpa{line_break}in northern Angara. A man{line_break}named Donpa lives there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10171"
msgstr "I settled that village! And{line_break}Donpa... He is my son...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10172"
msgstr "Now, your grandson, Dodonpa,{line_break}rules over your village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10173"
msgstr "Rules? Rules is an ill-{line_break}sounding word.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10174"
msgstr "But it's an accurate one, Lunpa.{line_break}Dodonpa is an evil thief, who has{line_break}caused much trouble in Angara.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10175"
msgstr "What has become of my son?{line_break}How could he permit such{line_break}a thing to happen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10176"
msgstr "Master Lunpa, don't you have any{line_break}idea how old Donpa is?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10177"
msgstr "He is as I am. An old man...{line_break}He may be older even than I.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10178"
msgstr "If this news outrages you,{line_break}why don't you go and set{line_break}Dodonpa straight?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10179"
msgstr "If only I could...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10180"
msgstr "Is this the only reason we're{line_break}here? To bring news of the{line_break}outside world?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10181"
msgstr "You are kind, {actor_name:5}, but{line_break}there are much more important{line_break}matters at hand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10182"
msgstr "Yes, yes... I am sorry we were{line_break}sidetracked. We have much{line_break}more to discuss...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10183"
msgstr "But before we begin, there is{line_break}one thing I must say...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10184"
msgstr "You don't mind, do{line_break}you, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10185"
msgstr "Clearly, your judgment on this{line_break}matter is fogged, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}I must speak.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10186"
msgstr "I knew you'd agree.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10187"
msgstr "I have discussed this with{line_break}none but {actor_name:5}, but...I have{line_break}my own reasons for this quest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10188"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10189"
msgstr "Only that I have my own{line_break}reasons for wanting to see{line_break}the beacons lit again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10190"
msgstr "Why are you telling us{line_break}all of this now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10191"
msgstr "Because I feel this quest{line_break}is deeply linked to Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10192"
msgstr "I thought it odd that Lord Babi{line_break}should order me to research{line_break}Alchemy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10193"
msgstr "Hey, wait a minute... Is this{line_break}what you promised to tell us{line_break}once we reached Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10194"
msgstr "Yes, yes... May I continue?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10195"
msgstr "Long ago, before Alchemy's{line_break}power was sealed...{page_break}There were many civilizations{line_break}as advanced and cultivated{line_break}as Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10196"
msgstr "At the moment that Alchemy{line_break}was sealed away, most of those{line_break}civilizations began to wane...{page_break}Until eventually, they vanished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10197"
msgstr "I have formed certain theories{line_break}now, suggesting that this may{line_break}be related to the seal on Alchemy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10198"
msgstr "Let me get this straight...{line_break}You felt you couldn't tell us{line_break}this until we were in Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10199"
msgstr "And you only wanted to come{line_break}to Lemuria to test your theories{line_break}and see if they were true...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10200"
msgstr "But even if everything you{line_break}said {text_effect:2}is{reset_text_style} true, what does{line_break}it all mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10201"
msgstr "If your theories are correct,{line_break}the world itself will wane and{line_break}vanish... Won't it, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10202"
msgstr "{actor_name:8} never spoke of{line_break}this to you, did he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10203"
msgstr "If you came to this theory{line_break}on your own, you are indeed{line_break}a wise scholar.{page_break}We would do well to trust you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10204"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10205"
msgstr "King Hydros and I, as well as{line_break}others in Lemuria, hold the same{line_break}beliefs that you do, Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10206"
msgstr "You do!?!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10207"
msgstr "Civilizations thrive by building{line_break}upon the knowledge of the past.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10208"
msgstr "Knowledge gained in one{line_break}generation should be taken{line_break}even further by the next.{page_break}Thus, knowledge and learning{line_break}continue to grow. This is the{line_break}natural course of civilization.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10209"
msgstr "But where is the world today?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10210"
msgstr "The great civilizations of old have{line_break}all withered and vanished. We{line_break}are all isolated and alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10211"
msgstr "You have encountered many{line_break}cultures in your travels.{page_break}Are any of them capable of{line_break}building the great sanctums{line_break}and lighthouses you have seen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10212"
msgstr "No, they are not... But this{line_break}is not the only sign of the{line_break}decay you have theorized...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10213"
msgstr "I think it best that you hear{line_break}the rest directly from His{line_break}Majesty, King Hydros.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10214"
msgstr "Yes, Kraden! We shall go{line_break}to visit the king!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10215"
msgstr "Ah, but King Hydros is in{line_break}counsel with Lord Conservato.{line_break}We might not be allowed in.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10216"
msgstr "Conservato? That fool. He{line_break}refuses to acknowledge what{line_break}he can see with his own eyes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10217"
msgstr "I will meet with the king and{line_break}press our evidence upon{line_break}Conservato. Come with me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10218"
msgstr "Gah! Stupid door!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10219"
msgstr "{text_effect:2}HAHHH-AHH!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10220"
msgstr "Pah! At last, you are open!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10221"
msgstr "To the king's chambers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10222"
msgstr "Lunpa ought to be as old as{line_break}Lord Babi was, but he has so{line_break}much energy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10223"
msgstr "He's got a fire in him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10224"
msgstr "I do wish I could have heard{line_break}more about Lord Babi, though.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10225"
msgstr "But come, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}To the king's palace we go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10226"
msgstr "King Hydros awaits you.{line_break}You are free to enter.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10227"
msgstr "His Highness, the king, has{line_break}instructed that we let you{line_break}pass. You are welcome here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10228"
msgstr "They are clearly using Psynergy,{line_break}which makes them Adepts...{page_break}But are they so important that{line_break}His Highness must make time{line_break}for them right away?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10229"
msgstr "What does His Highness have{line_break}in mind? {actor_name:8}, his{line_break}friends, and Lunpa are all here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10230"
msgstr "He is still in chambers with{line_break}Lord Conservato. Why is he{line_break}granting them entrance?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10231"
msgstr "If you seek the counsel of His{line_break}Highness, the king, follow this{line_break}passage to the doors at the end.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10232"
msgstr "His Highness never leaves a{line_break}meeting with Conservato in a{line_break}good mood. Good luck.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10233"
msgstr "Conservato and the king were{line_break}yelling so loudly that I could{line_break}hear them from out here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10234"
msgstr "King Hydros is the wisest of{line_break}all the Lemurian kings...{page_break}But I understand why{line_break}Conservato and his senate{line_break}oppose the king's plans.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10235"
msgstr "The senate holds King Hydros in{line_break}poor regard because he favors{line_break}Lunpa's wisdom over their own.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10236"
msgstr "Lord Conservato holds the{line_break}most power in Lemuria after{line_break}the king.{page_break}I don't think he'll take{line_break}kindly to the advice of{line_break}outworlders like these.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10237"
msgstr "Oh, dear! Using Psynergy in the{line_break}palace of the good King Hydros!?{line_break}What ill-mannered buffoons!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10238"
msgstr "His Highness, the king, is most{line_break}temperamental, which is a rare{line_break}trait in Lemurians.{page_break}Lord Conservato is calm and{line_break}collected, like a true Lemurian.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10239"
msgstr "Lord Conservato only raises his{line_break}voice when he speaks with the{line_break}king.{page_break}Their debates frighten me.{line_break}I can't stand the yelling.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10240"
msgstr "His Highness is worried that{line_break}Lemuria will wither away.{line_break}What a ridiculous notion!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10241"
msgstr "I trust the king. If His Majesty{line_break}is wrong, the fault lies with{line_break}Lunpa, not with him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10242"
msgstr "I cannot let the secret of our{line_break}mystical draught ever reach{line_break}the outside world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10243"
msgstr "If the world knew our mystic{line_break}draughts were nothing but{line_break}spring water, we'd be overrun!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10244"
msgstr "You are Lord {actor_name:5}, correct?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10245"
msgstr "Then you have no business here!{line_break}His Majesty is involved in a most{line_break}important meeting right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10246"
msgstr "It would seem the warriors of{line_break}which you spoke have arrived.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10247"
msgstr "So it would, Your Highness.{line_break}I shall call them to us{line_break}immediately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10248"
msgstr "There is no need, Lunpa.{line_break}Let us go to them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10249"
msgstr "Hydros! Would you see me{line_break}dishonored thus? They ought{line_break}to present themselves to us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10250"
msgstr "I do not go to present myself{line_break}to them, Conservato. I am{line_break}merely going to where they are.{page_break}I have something that I{line_break}wish to show everyone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10251"
msgstr "Regardless of your reasons,{line_break}sire, I will not go to them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10252"
msgstr "Do as you will, Conservato.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10253"
msgstr "However, {text_effect:2}we{reset_text_style} shall go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10254"
msgstr "I heard of your arrival. It is{line_break}quite remarkable that you were{line_break}able to reach Lemuria. Welcome.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10255"
msgstr "Allow me to introduce my{line_break}companions. This is {actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10256"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10257"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10258"
msgstr "...And Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10259"
msgstr "Kraden is the one who told{line_break}me of the outside world's{line_break}civilizations, of their condition...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10260"
msgstr "Ah, Kraden! Lunpa describes{line_break}you as a remarkable scholar.{line_break}Your research impressed us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10261"
msgstr "Thank you, Your Highness.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10262"
msgstr "Your theories are correct.{line_break}Our world is now on a path{line_break}to destruction.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10263"
msgstr "And who has decided this?{line_break}You, Hydros?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10264"
msgstr "Some civilizations have{line_break}vanished, surely, but that is{line_break}the way of the outside world.{page_break}Look around you: Lemuria{line_break}remains unchanged!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10265"
msgstr "Don't delude yourself. Lemuria{line_break}has been in slow decline for{line_break}ages now, but that can wait.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10266"
msgstr "My most trusted scholars have{line_break}reached this conclusion after{line_break}extensive research.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10267"
msgstr "I sent {actor_name:8} to confirm{line_break}this for me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10268"
msgstr "So you admit it, Hydros!{line_break}You violated the directive{line_break}of the senate!{page_break}You used the tidal wave as{line_break}your chance to send {actor_name:8}{line_break}away, despite our commands!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10269"
msgstr "You are incorrect. The tidal{line_break}wave carried me away{line_break}by chance alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10270"
msgstr "Conservato, you must know{line_break}that the tidal wave was caused{line_break}by Poseidon's return!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10271"
msgstr "Only a fool would have chosen{line_break}to send a man to sea if he knew{line_break}that this would have happened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10272"
msgstr "What was it that you intended{line_break}to have {actor_name:8} confirm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10273"
msgstr "This map shows the ancient world,{line_break}when Lemuria still traded with{line_break}people on the many continents.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10274"
msgstr "It was a great age...{line_break}A time when the world{line_break}shined brightly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10275"
msgstr "And this...is the map Lunpa had{line_break}with him when he arrived in{line_break}Lemuria 150 years ago...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10276"
msgstr "I used this map to sail around{line_break}the world. It is quite accurate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10277"
msgstr "In-Incredible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10278"
msgstr "You understand, Kraden...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10279"
msgstr "What do you understand?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10280"
msgstr "Well, unless my eyes deceive{line_break}me, the continents have shrunk{line_break}since the golden age...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10281"
msgstr "That's insane!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10282"
msgstr "It is not insane! It is true!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10283"
msgstr "Perhaps this will make the{line_break}point more clearly. Look at{line_break}these two maps side by side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10284"
msgstr "There's no mistaking it.{line_break}The continents on Lunpa's{line_break}map are clearly smaller...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10285"
msgstr "Lies! Nothing but lies!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10286"
msgstr "What do you hope to gain{line_break}from foisting these lies{line_break}upon our people?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10287"
msgstr "You know well that I hope{line_break}to gain nothing more than{line_break}the truth, Conservato.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10288"
msgstr "And who do you expect will{line_break}believe such nonsense?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10289"
msgstr "If you do not believe the{line_break}evidence before your eyes,{line_break}what do you believe?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10290"
msgstr "Do you believe the Lemurian{line_break}map to be accurate to this day?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10291"
msgstr "Tell me, {actor_name:8}... You were{line_break}able to investigate this{line_break}matter, were you not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10292"
msgstr "Thanks to {actor_name:5} and my{line_break}companions, I was able to travel{line_break}much of the Eastern Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10293"
msgstr "And what did you find?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10294"
msgstr "I found, in truth, that Lunpa's map{line_break}is the more accurate of the two.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10295"
msgstr "However, the world seems even{line_break}smaller now than it appears on{line_break}Lunpa's map...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10296"
msgstr "What are you saying?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10297"
msgstr "Time itself has stopped...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10298"
msgstr "Think of Weyard as a living,{line_break}breathing being, possessing{line_break}its own life force...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10299"
msgstr "The four elements are the{line_break}nourishment needed to sustain{line_break}this being.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10300"
msgstr "Kraden... This is exactly what{line_break}King Hydros himself has said{line_break}to me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10301"
msgstr "Ever since Alchemy was sealed{line_break}away, the world has been cut off{line_break}from its nourishment.{page_break}It has gone into a state{line_break}akin to hibernation.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10302"
msgstr "By using less energy, Weyard{line_break}prolongs its life...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10303"
msgstr "Yet when hibernating, the being{line_break}has only stopped its own clock...{line_break}not the flow of time around it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10304"
msgstr "When a bear sleeps through{line_break}the winter, it needs only wait{line_break}for spring to come...{page_break}When it awakens, it can nourish{line_break}its weakened body again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10305"
msgstr "But if spring never comes,{line_break}the bear will eventually die...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10306"
msgstr "Weyard is wasting away, its{line_break}continents shrinking, because{line_break}its spring has never come.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10307"
msgstr "Hydros, how can you make such{line_break}outrageous claims? The world{line_break}is not alive...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10308"
msgstr "Tell me, Conservato, why do you{line_break}think Poseidon has returned?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10309"
msgstr "Do you have the answer, Hydros?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10310"
msgstr "The elemental lighthouses...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10311"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} and his companions{line_break}have lit the beacons on both{line_break}Mercury and Venus Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10312"
msgstr "What!? Have you any idea what{line_break}will happen if you set that evil{line_break}loose upon the world again?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10313"
msgstr "You know that it could bring{line_break}about the destruction of the{line_break}world, and yet you did it anyway?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10314"
msgstr "When the four beacons are fired,{line_break}Alchemy will be released, and{line_break}our world, destroyed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10315"
msgstr "My lord, you cannot possibly{line_break}intend for these people to light{line_break}the remaining beacons!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10316"
msgstr "I do indeed, Conservato, and I{line_break}also fear the possibility that{line_break}Alchemy will destroy the world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10317"
msgstr "But I cannot stand by, knowing{line_break}as I do that the world will wither{line_break}and die if we do not act!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10318"
msgstr "This is madness, Hydros! Does{line_break}the threat of Alchemy mean{line_break}so little to you?{page_break}Would you put the world{line_break}in even greater danger to{line_break}satisfy your theories!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10319"
msgstr "With only two of the beacons{line_break}lit, I assume you intend to send{line_break}{actor_name:8} out again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10320"
msgstr "And I will go, Lord Conservato.{line_break}{actor_name:5} has need of{line_break}my power!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10321"
msgstr "Then go, {actor_name:8}...{line_break}But if you do, say farewell...for{line_break}you will never be able to return.{page_break}You will be banished from{line_break}Lemuria forever.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10322"
msgstr "You know our laws. Are you{line_break}prepared for the outcome?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10323"
msgstr "I myself am disgusted by{line_break}the whole matter. I take{line_break}my leave of you, Hydros.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10324"
msgstr "But I warn you... I will {text_effect:2}not{reset_text_style}{line_break}permit you to go through{line_break}with this madness!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10325"
msgstr "What will you do, Your Highness?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10326"
msgstr "I knew this outcome was{line_break}inevitable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10327"
msgstr "But I could not sit silent while{line_break}our world drifted down the{line_break}path of its destruction.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10328"
msgstr "I want you to light the{line_break}remaining beacons before{line_break}you return.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10329"
msgstr "That's what we intend to do,{line_break}but we cannot leave the{line_break}Eastern Sea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10330"
msgstr "I have already heard of{line_break}this problem from {actor_name:8}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10331"
msgstr "This is something I found{line_break}by accident in some ruins{line_break}back in my days as a thief.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10332"
msgstr "I'm not sure what it is,{line_break}but it seems to contain{line_break}some powerful Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10333"
msgstr "Seems to? You are{line_break}not certain?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10334"
msgstr "It is a Psynergy that we{line_break}Lemurians are unable to use.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10335"
msgstr "I understand you travel with{line_break}many different kinds of Adepts,{line_break}do you not, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10336"
msgstr "If we include {actor_name:8} in our{line_break}numbers, we have one Adept{line_break}for each of the four elements.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10337"
msgstr "Then at least one of you should{line_break}be able to use the Psynergy{line_break}that this contains.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10338"
msgstr "King Hydros believes the item{line_break}can only be used by one who{line_break}wields Psynergy of the earth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10339"
msgstr "If I am not mistaken, it{line_break}is a powerful Psynergy{line_break}we call Grind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10340"
msgstr "If you master this Psynergy,{line_break}the reefs that block your way{line_break}shall pose no trouble anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10341"
msgstr "With Grind, you should be able{line_break}to create a path by which you{line_break}can sail into the Western Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10342"
msgstr "Go, brave Adepts! By your hands,{line_break}may the remaining lighthouses{line_break}burn bright once more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10343"
msgstr "That Psynergy is quite{line_break}powerful. It can only be{line_break}trusted to a very few people.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10344"
msgstr "That His Highness has given{line_break}it to you should illustrate how{line_break}great his expectations are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10345"
msgstr "I have no doubt that your journey{line_break}will be fraught with ever-{line_break}increasing danger...{page_break}But we are counting on{line_break}you, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10346"
msgstr "I've never seen Lord Conservato{line_break}so angry before...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10347"
msgstr "Lord Conservato has ordered{line_break}us to prevent you from leaving{line_break}the island...{page_break}But I cannot see why he would{line_break}do something like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10348"
msgstr "I'm sure the senate has{line_break}something to say about this.{line_break}What's going on around here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10349"
msgstr "How could Lord Conservato{line_break}expect someone like me to{line_break}believe that King Hydros...{page_break}Would order {actor_name:8} to{line_break}destroy the world?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10350"
msgstr "Lord Conservato seemed very{line_break}angry. Maybe that's why he{line_break}called for a senate meeting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10351"
msgstr "Both Lord Conservato and the{line_break}king want peace for us, so why{line_break}must they fight all the time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10352"
msgstr "Maybe once you have left,{line_break}the king and Conservato{line_break}will come to an accord.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10353"
msgstr "Today, His Highness and Lord{line_break}Conservato were arguing more{line_break}loudly than ever before!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10354"
msgstr "If Hydros plans to unleash{line_break}Alchemy upon the world{line_break}again, then I am against it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10355"
msgstr "If you and Lunpa were all to{line_break}leave Lemuria, I think we'd have{line_break}peace and quiet here again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10356"
msgstr "The senate's reports usually{line_break}tend to influence the popular{line_break}opinion in Lemuria.{page_break}I'll bet that is a constant{line_break}annoyance to the king...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10357"
msgstr "The king's leadership is too{line_break}progressive... It's as though he{line_break}invites opposition.{page_break}Of course he doesn't get along{line_break}with the senate. It's their duty{line_break}to protect the laws of old!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10358"
msgstr "Whenever outsiders arrive{line_break}in Lemuria, it means trouble.{page_break}{actor_name:8} has done{line_break}nothing but stir up trouble{line_break}by bringing them here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10359"
msgstr "What will happen to us? Will{line_break}Lord Conservato be able to{line_break}stop the king's plans?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10360"
msgstr "As long as I can live in peace,{line_break}I am happy. I suppose that is a{line_break}sign of growing old...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10361"
msgstr "I know why Lemuria ended{line_break}all its dealings with the{line_break}outside world...{page_break}Lemurians want peace.{line_break}We desire no change.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10362"
msgstr "Do not listen to Conservato.{line_break}We cannot let the world{line_break}wither and die.{page_break}Go, brave Adepts! By your hands,{line_break}may the remaining lighthouses{line_break}burn bright once more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10363"
msgstr "You must sail to the Western Sea.{line_break}Do not worry about Lemuria.{line_break}Ignite the elemental beacons.{page_break}Conservato lacks the conviction{line_break}to discuss these matters with{line_break}the people of Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10364"
msgstr "I think I overheard something{line_break}I shouldn't have... I'll forget{line_break}everything.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10365"
msgstr "My people may not desire{line_break}change, but I cannot let that{line_break}stop me.{page_break}I do this not for myself, but{line_break}for all those yet to be born{line_break}throughout Weyard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10366"
msgstr "His Majesty has come to this{line_break}decision on his own, without{line_break}the counsel of his advisors.{page_break}This is why I must remain{line_break}by his side and support his{line_break}decision.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10367"
msgstr "The actions of King Hydros{line_break}are treasonous. They betray{line_break}the will of his people.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10368"
msgstr "The door is locked... It sounds{line_break}as if there's a raucous caucus{line_break}going on inside...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10369"
msgstr "Umm... {actor_name:8}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10370"
msgstr "Yes, {actor_name:7}? What is it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10371"
msgstr "There's something I've{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}been meaning to ask you...{line_break}Something I{pause_20_skippable} have to ask you...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10372"
msgstr "Ask me, {actor_name:7}.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10373"
msgstr "You and I look roughly{line_break}the same age, but {pause_20_skippable}how{line_break}old are you, really?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10374"
msgstr "Is that your question,{line_break}{actor_name:7}? It's not important!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10375"
msgstr "It is to me. If you are much older{line_break}than us, then I'm afraid we've not{line_break}shown you the proper respect.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10376"
msgstr "She's got a point.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10377"
msgstr "Don't worry about such things.{line_break}Please, treat me as you have{line_break}all along.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10378"
msgstr "No, that won't do.{line_break}You have to tell us.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10379"
msgstr "What!? Come now!{line_break}This is silly!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10380"
msgstr "No, {actor_name:8}! Tell me!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10381"
msgstr "You're afraid you haven't shown{line_break}me the proper respect, and yet{line_break}you make demands of me?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10382"
msgstr "Come on, {actor_name:8}...{line_break}You can tell us.{line_break}How old are you really?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10383"
msgstr "This has nothing to do with{line_break}respect! You just want to know{line_break}how old I am, don't you!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10384"
msgstr "Hee hee!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10385"
msgstr "Heh heh!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10386"
msgstr "Oh ho ho ho!!!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10387"
msgstr "I knew it! Come on,{line_break}{actor_name:5}! Can't you get{line_break}them off my back?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10388"
msgstr "... ...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10389"
msgstr "You're in this too, aren't you,{line_break}{actor_name:5}? I've had it with your{line_break}conspiracies! I will not tell you!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10390"
msgstr "Oh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10391"
msgstr "Goodness!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10392"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! Look over here!{line_break}This palace is magnificient!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10393"
msgstr "Where are you going, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Let's take a longer look around!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10394"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, are we setting{line_break}off now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10395"
msgstr "Then, to sea we go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10396"
msgstr "Please don't rush on my{line_break}account. Let's enjoy our stay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10397"
msgstr "What's the matter?{line_break}Can't you climb up?{line_break}...Fine. Just a moment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10398"
msgstr "You came all this way and{line_break}then got stuck here? You{line_break}can't be very bright.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10399"
msgstr "There! Is that better?{line_break}Now climb up here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10400"
msgstr "Drinking from this spring{line_break}restores vigor and vitality!{line_break}Want a sip?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10401"
msgstr "These turtles have lived in{line_break}the spring forever... It must be{line_break}the water that does it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10402"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} and the others{line_break}drank of the spring.{page_break}Their HP and PP were{line_break}fully replenished!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10403"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} read the sign:{page_break}The Spring of Lemuria{line_break}Face away and toss in a{line_break}coin to test your luck.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10404"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} read the sign:{page_break}The Spring of Lemuria{line_break}Toss in a Lucky Medal{line_break}to improve your luck.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10405"
msgstr "If you face away from the spring,{line_break}toss in a coin, and land it in the{line_break}target, good fortune will come.{page_break}You've traveled a long way{line_break}to be here. You should give{line_break}it a try.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10406"
msgstr "I'd love to test my luck, but{line_break}I've used up all my coins. Maybe{line_break}I'll take one out of the spring!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10407"
msgstr "I remember an outsider who came{line_break}to Lemuria and then spent {text_effect:2}days{reset_text_style}{line_break}testing his luck at the spring!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10408"
msgstr "He had such a good time, he{line_break}said he was going to build a{line_break}spring like this in his hometown.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10409"
msgstr "Do you wish to test your luck{line_break}at the Spring of Lemuria?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10410"
msgstr "Well, then, I'll just take{line_break}a turn...{page_break}If you change your mind,{line_break}let me know, and I will give{line_break}you a chance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10411"
msgstr "Go ahead.{line_break}Test your luck!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10412"
msgstr "You look like you're in for{line_break}a spell of good luck.{page_break}After all, your aura glows{line_break}brightly about you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10413"
msgstr "No one is luckier than him{line_break}who believes in his luck and{line_break}has friends who believe in him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10414"
msgstr "Don't tell me, you're here to{line_break}solve the riddle of the rock!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10415"
msgstr "I don't want to scare you but,{line_break}I think you should reconsider.{page_break}Even the warriors who survive{line_break}to make it back do so by the{line_break}skin of their teeth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10416"
msgstr "Just passing through? Here's{line_break}some advice for you:{line_break}Steer clear of the mountain.{page_break}I don't know what kind of{line_break}treasure's up there, but it's{line_break}not worth your life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10417"
msgstr "I hear Kibombo has finally{line_break}chosen a new witch doctor.{page_break}Maybe now, they'll calm down{line_break}and not be so aggressive...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10418"
msgstr "There was a giant explosion{line_break}on the rock the other night...{line_break}I couldn't get back to sleep at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10419"
msgstr "The mountain is called Magma{line_break}Rock, and it's cursed... No one's{line_break}supposed to go up there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10420"
msgstr "We're lucky the river floods{line_break}over every season. That's what{line_break}keeps the Kibombo away.{page_break}We were fine this year, though.{line_break}They still hadn't chosen a new{line_break}witch doctor, so they stayed put.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10421"
msgstr "The explosions within Magma{line_break}Rock are called magma balls.{page_break}They're formed naturally{line_break}near the mouth of the{line_break}volcano. Scary, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10422"
msgstr "You must be very brave to{line_break}come all the way here by boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10423"
msgstr "There's a place called Shaman{line_break}Village in the middle of{line_break}the continent.{page_break}Supposedly, one of the rivers{line_break}leads to it. I have no idea{line_break}which one, though.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10424"
msgstr "The people of Shaman Village{line_break}are very wary of strangers. Be{line_break}careful if you ever meet them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10425"
msgstr "For a continent as desolate{line_break}as this one, there sure have{line_break}been a lot of boats here lately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10426"
msgstr "I think there's a cave down{line_break}at the end of the river. That's{line_break}the way into Shaman Village.{page_break}I wonder if I should tell them{line_break}what the legends say... Nah,{line_break}they look like a smart group.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10427"
msgstr "Long ago, Shaman was{line_break}ravaged by outsiders.{line_break}It was terrible.{page_break}From that day on, they simply{line_break}have not trusted strangers{line_break}in their village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10428"
msgstr "If you want to cross the glaciers{line_break}of the Northern Sea, you'll need{line_break}magma balls...{page_break}They come from volcanoes, but{line_break}the best place to get them is{line_break}Magma Rock, to the south.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10429"
msgstr "A long time ago, we used to{line_break}trade with a village named Prox{line_break}to the north of us.{page_break}But the sea freezes in winter,{line_break}and over time, it just became{line_break}impossible to get there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10430"
msgstr "The people of Loho have a{line_break}legendary weapon called a{line_break}cannon that fires magma balls.{page_break}That's supposed to be how{line_break}they crossed the frozen wastes,{line_break}but it sounds like a tall tale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10431"
msgstr "The Northern Sea is thick with{line_break}icebergs in the winter. They{line_break}can sink a boat in an instant!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10432"
msgstr "There's nothing to the west of{line_break}here. AND it's really dangerous.{line_break}You shouldn't go that way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10433"
msgstr "The sea west of here spills{line_break}over a massive waterfall.{page_break}You'll really start to appreciate{line_break}the grandeur of nature if you{line_break}see that, I can tell you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10434"
msgstr "The currents are so strong{line_break}near the falls that any boat{line_break}caught in it is doomed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10435"
msgstr "My buddy thinks I'm nuts{line_break}to risk my life for a look{line_break}at the falls.{page_break}Actually, I just want to get{line_break}my hands on some treasure{line_break}I saw on the way there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10436"
msgstr "We've made these wings and{line_break}carried them here just to{line_break}fulfill a great prophecy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10437"
msgstr "We must be prepared to{line_break}attach these wings to{line_break}the sacred vessel.{page_break}It is said that we will know{line_break}the time has come when{line_break}Mt. Jupiter is in flames.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10438"
msgstr "We brought these wings from{line_break}Contigo, and now we're guarding{line_break}them.{page_break}If they were damaged or{line_break}broken, the prophecy might{line_break}never be fulfilled.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10439"
msgstr "I wonder if these giant wings{line_break}will really make it fly... I'd{line_break}like to see that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10440"
msgstr "We first heard the prophecy{line_break}three years ago... The wings{line_break}have come a long way since then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10441"
msgstr "These wings are so heavy{line_break}that they would sink an{line_break}ordinary ship.{page_break}I wonder what kind of ship{line_break}the sacred vessel is.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10442"
msgstr "I doubt anyone could hurt{line_break}these sturdy wings, but we{line_break}must guard them just the same.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10443"
msgstr "It's kind of hard to imagine{line_break}what these wings would look{line_break}like actually flapping.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10444"
msgstr "There's something burning{line_break}like an ember within the stone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10445"
msgstr "Do you want to retrieve it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10446"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} got{line_break}a Magma Ball.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10447"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} checked the tablet...{line_break}There's something etched on it.{page_break}Wielder of Flame's strength,{line_break}Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}If th'art worthy, I will grant thee{line_break}the power to Blaze with fire.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10448"
msgstr "Flame's strength? Hey, that must{line_break}mean it's finally my turn!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10449"
msgstr "{actor_name:6} touched the tablet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10450"
msgstr "{actor_name:6} received the{line_break}fire Psynergy Blaze.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10451"
msgstr "Do you know anything about a{line_break}legend about these people who{line_break}could control the wind and air?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10452"
msgstr "Well, the legend says that these{line_break}giants from Anemos built{line_break}Contigo with their wind powers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10453"
msgstr "That was the Anemos tribe.{line_break}They even had the power to{line_break}fly through the air!{page_break}The people of Contigo inherited{line_break}some of their power, and now,{line_break}we rule over Atteka.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10454"
msgstr "The beacon within Jupiter{line_break}Lighthouse will soon be lit.{page_break}I know this because of a{line_break}strange premonition I had{line_break}three years ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10455"
msgstr "I guess the people of Contigo{line_break}lost the power they inherited{line_break}from the Anemos tribe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10456"
msgstr "The people of Anemos possessed{line_break}power over the wind. They could{line_break}also see into the future.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10457"
msgstr "When the power of Anemos is{line_break}lost, a group will come to light{line_break}the beacon against darkness.{page_break}We had thought it was{line_break}nothing but legend, but{line_break}it is all coming true.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10458"
msgstr "The Anemos geoglyphs show a{line_break}boat with wings sprouting from{line_break}its hull...{page_break}The story goes that these{line_break}wings could make the boat{line_break}float in the air...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10459"
msgstr "If you want to get a look at{line_break}the Anemos geoglyphs, you{line_break}ought to go to the ruins...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10460"
msgstr "Our people have labored{line_break}for some time to build{line_break}the Wings of the Anemos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10461"
msgstr "The Anemos blood in our{line_break}veins often brings about{line_break}strange miracles.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10462"
msgstr "Surely, someone will come{line_break}soon to light the beacon{line_break}atop the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10463"
msgstr "The power of the wind is{line_break}not all that we've lost.{page_break}We have lost much of{line_break}our culture, as well as the{line_break}technology to rebuild the ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10464"
msgstr "There were two siblings born in{line_break}Contigo. The older held great{line_break}power. Both are gone now...{page_break}The younger was only a baby{line_break}when he left the village. I don't{line_break}know how strong he became.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10465"
msgstr "I think Jupiter Lighthouse will{line_break}be lit soon. I don't know when,{line_break}but it will happen soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10466"
msgstr "It's hard to believe, but the{line_break}Anemos really did have the{line_break}power to make ships fly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10467"
msgstr "The Anemos geoglyphs are{line_break}the most amazing carvings{line_break}I've ever seen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10468"
msgstr "We built the Wings of Anemos{line_break}out of materials we found in{line_break}the ruins of Anemos Sanctum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10469"
msgstr "The siblings who inherited the{line_break}powers of the Anemos aren't{line_break}in Contigo anymore.{page_break}The younger brother was just{line_break}a baby when the merchant{line_break}known as Hammet took him away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10470"
msgstr "I'm sure the younger brother,{line_break}{actor_name:3}, must be grown up{line_break}by now... Is he still with Hammet?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10471"
msgstr "My father doesn't approve of{line_break}the way I look up to Yegelos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10472"
msgstr "The families of children who{line_break}inherited those powers lived{line_break}lives of constant suffering.{page_break}Eventually, they left Contigo to{line_break}make their fortunes elsewhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10473"
msgstr "{actor_name:3}'s mother left him in{line_break}the care of a kindly merchant.{line_break}She died shortly afterward.{page_break}I think she died of sorrow at{line_break}sending {actor_name:3} away. She{line_break}wanted a better life for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10474"
msgstr "I wish I could have inherited{line_break}the power of the Anemos.{line_break}Then I could be a hero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10475"
msgstr "Long ago, the people of{line_break}Hesperia attacked Atteka. Our{line_break}forefathers were not afraid.{page_break}With the help of the great hero{line_break}Yegelos, we drove them off, and{line_break}they haven't invaded since.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10476"
msgstr "A long time ago, the tribes{line_break}of Shaman and Contigo were{line_break}at constant war.{page_break}Throughout their many battles,{line_break}the warriors Yegelos and{line_break}Hoabna formed a friendship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10477"
msgstr "For a long time now, Contigo{line_break}has been without a hero. This{line_break}depresses our youth, I think.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10478"
msgstr "Everybody thinks the people{line_break}of Contigo are strong, but{line_break}we just hate to fight.{page_break}It's strange, because Yegelos{line_break}loved to fight, and Hoabna{line_break}was the stronger of the two.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10479"
msgstr "Soon, the siblings with the{line_break}power of the Anemos will{line_break}return and fulfill the legend.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10480"
msgstr "The power of the Anemos is{line_break}all but gone in Contigo.{page_break}However, it sometimes happens{line_break}that a newborn suddenly{line_break}shows power over the wind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10481"
msgstr "I don't have any powers like{line_break}the Anemos did, but my sister,{line_break}Ahri, is different.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10482"
msgstr "The baby's forehead is{line_break}furrowed, like it's thinking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10483"
msgstr "Babu bawaba bibaw.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10484"
msgstr "It sure is drafty in this{line_break}shabby old house.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10485"
msgstr "When the Wings of Anemos are{line_break}complete, let's fix the house!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10486"
msgstr "I just know {actor_name:3} became{line_break}big and manly, just like{line_break}Yegelos. I know he'll return...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10487"
msgstr "A terrible misfortune fell on{line_break}the family of the siblings...{line_break}It's a terrible story.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10488"
msgstr "Whenever my sister furrows{line_break}her brow like that, strange{line_break}things happen around here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10489"
msgstr "Bawaba... It's hot...{line_break}I want cool wind, babu baba.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10490"
msgstr "It was a longstanding tradition{line_break}that people in Atteka would take{line_break}a pilgrimage to Anemos Sanctum.{page_break}Since we began construction{line_break}on the wings, everyone is{line_break}coming to Contigo to help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10491"
msgstr "Of course, they're here to work,{line_break}not to fight, so business is{line_break}still in the pits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10492"
msgstr "Mining materials in the ruins{line_break}is dangerous work, so my{line_break}armor is selling well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10493"
msgstr "Nothing else around here is{line_break}selling well, but at least I'm{line_break}pulling through all right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10494"
msgstr "The villagers are working their{line_break}hardest to complete the wings{line_break}and fulfill the prophecy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10495"
msgstr "Oh, how I want to see the{line_break}sunlight shining off these{line_break}wings up in the sky!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10496"
msgstr "We've had so many people{line_break}coming to Contigo lately{line_break}that we're full, and I'm beat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10497"
msgstr "All the work on the wings{line_break}means that our inn is always{line_break}full! It's a good time for us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10498"
msgstr "Gotta make all the beds{line_break}before everyone returns{line_break}from Anemos Sanctum...{page_break}Then, I've gotta get started{line_break}setting things up for dinner{line_break}before they come down to eat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10499"
msgstr "If I don't make dinner now,{line_break}it won't be ready in time for{line_break}all our guests to eat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10500"
msgstr "Did you just arrive in Contigo?{page_break}Are you connected to the{line_break}prophecy, or are you here to{line_break}help build the wings?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10501"
msgstr "The prophecies of the Anemos{line_break}tell that someday soon, a true{line_break}miracle will occur...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10502"
msgstr "I worked myself half to death{line_break}yesterday. I feel miserable, but{line_break}I'll do it again tomorrow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10503"
msgstr "The Wings of Anemos are{line_break}nearly complete... I think I'll{line_break}take tomorrow off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10504"
msgstr "I'm afraid I'm too old to help in{line_break}the construction of the wings,{line_break}but I so want to see them fly...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10505"
msgstr "When is that miracle of the{line_break}Anemos gonna hurry up and{line_break}happen? I can't wait forever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10506"
msgstr "I threw my back out helping with{line_break}the wings. I can't touch my toes.{line_break}I can barely touch my knees.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10507"
msgstr "I want to see the boat{line_break}when it sails through the{line_break}air on our wings.{page_break}But even more, I want to see{line_break}the hero of prophecy... Will he{line_break}be a real looker, like Yegelos?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10508"
msgstr "The real miracle will be if{line_break}these wings actually make{line_break}a boat fly.{page_break}However, I remain open-minded.{line_break}I hope we can see this miracle{line_break}of Anemos soon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10509"
msgstr "If I see the Wings of Anemos{line_break}make a boat fly through the{line_break}air, I too shall be a believer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10510"
msgstr "I've come a long way to{line_break}see the flying boat. I hope{line_break}the prophecies are right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10511"
msgstr "The wings are almost done.{line_break}We just need to get them to{line_break}the bay and await the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10512"
msgstr "The wings will be finished{line_break}shortly. Where is the ship{line_break}they're going to be attached to?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10513"
msgstr "Which part goes where? Does{line_break}this metal feather connect{line_break}to that wooden post?{page_break}It's like a puzzle, and it's{line_break}getting rather complicated.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10514"
msgstr "You've gotta watch out, 'cause{line_break}you don't want to break{line_break}anything... It's delicate work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10515"
msgstr "Just a few more touches, and{line_break}the wings are done. All we have{line_break}left is to assemble them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10516"
msgstr "The guys carrying the other wing{line_break}haven't come back, and we're{line_break}almost ready to send this one!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10517"
msgstr "I've been really busy lately,{line_break}but now that the second wing{line_break}is almost done, I can rest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10518"
msgstr "What do we do if we made{line_break}these wings, and then no boat{line_break}shows up for us to put them on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10519"
msgstr "There are too many parts!{line_break}I think I'm going insane from{line_break}all these stupid parts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10520"
msgstr "When I start getting irritated,{line_break}I just go nuts. I think I should{line_break}avoid getting irritated.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10521"
msgstr "How long have we been{line_break}working on these stupid{line_break}wings?{page_break}When I see that boat{line_break}soaring through the{line_break}skies, I think I'll cry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10522"
msgstr "Have you taken a good look{line_break}at the Anemos geoglyph?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10523"
msgstr "You can't see all of it right{line_break}now, because the wings are{line_break}covering up the picture...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10524"
msgstr "Oh, that's really too bad.{line_break}The picture of the flying{line_break}boat looks so cool.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10525"
msgstr "That sign has a translation of{line_break}the characters on the wall.{page_break}If you're interested in studying{line_break}the sanctum, you should give it{line_break}a read.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10526"
msgstr "I want to get a good look at{line_break}the inside of the sanctum, but{line_break}I can't get this door open.{page_break}I'm hoping that deciphering{line_break}these characters on the wall{line_break}might give me the clue I need.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10527"
msgstr "The merchant Hammet took{line_break}the gold in this room with{line_break}him when he left Contigo.{page_break}He vowed to use the money{line_break}to raise {actor_name:3} properly{line_break}and give him a good life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10528"
msgstr "I can't even imagine how cool{line_break}it would be to see a boat like{line_break}the one in the geoglyph.{page_break}But it's so big! I doubt{line_break}there's a boat that big{line_break}anywhere!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10529"
msgstr "I don't know if anyone{line_break}in Contigo cares about{line_break}what I'm doing here.{page_break}But I know that devoted{line_break}pilgrims will appreciate{line_break}having this translation.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10530"
msgstr "Wouldn't that be terrible if{line_break}I got the door open and there{line_break}was nothing on the other side?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10531"
msgstr "Someone told me that Hammet{line_break}went to a town called Kalay{line_break}and did quite well for himself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10532"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} examined the wall.{line_break}There are characters carved{line_break}into it.{page_break}Hmmm... I keep staring at it,{line_break}but it's not making any{line_break}more sense.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10533"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} examined the sign.{line_break}The characters from the wall{line_break}are translated there.{page_break}Some them are gates, and{line_break}some them are roads.{page_break}Search with your heart to{line_break}find the truest path.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10534"
msgstr "Turn the slot and get a prize!{line_break}The lottery slots are over here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10535"
msgstr "Drop some cash and double up!{line_break}The hi-lo dice are over here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10536"
msgstr "You never know what the{line_break}dice will do next! Come and{line_break}give our dice a toss!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10537"
msgstr "It's good to have this much{line_break}business, but what happens to{line_break}us when the wings are done?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10538"
msgstr "Once the wings are finished,{line_break}all these guests will leave.{line_break}Until then, I'll work my hardest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10539"
msgstr "I've got so much to do that{line_break}I don't even have time to{line_break}eat! I'm starving!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10540"
msgstr "I must be the greatest chef in{line_break}the world! Look at all this food{line_break}I've been making! I'm amazing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10541"
msgstr "... ...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10542"
msgstr "Hm. Outsiders... I don't like{line_break}the looks of them. I'm just{line_break}going to wait until they leave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10543"
msgstr "Until the chief says otherwise,{line_break}nobody will talk to these{line_break}outsiders. It's the law.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10544"
msgstr "Who invited these foreigners{line_break}into our town?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10545"
msgstr "Ugh... Foreigners. I'm not{line_break}going to waste my time{line_break}even {text_effect:2}talking{reset_text_style} to them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10546"
msgstr "Our ancestors learned a harsh{line_break}lesson... Shamans never lie, but{line_break}outsiders are never honest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10547"
msgstr "Our ancestors learned that we{line_break}can trust no one but the people{line_break}of Contigo, our longtime friends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10548"
msgstr "These foreigners look{line_break}trustworthy, but I know{line_break}better...{page_break}They may seem nice, but all{line_break}outsiders are wicked!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10549"
msgstr "Shut your doors tight{line_break}when outsiders are in sight.{page_break}If we want to protect ourselves,{line_break}our culture, we have to keep{line_break}outsiders {text_effect:2}out{reset_text_style}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10550"
msgstr "It seems to be locked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10551"
msgstr "Trial Road{line_break}None may enter without{line_break}permission from Moapa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10552"
msgstr "The entrance is closed.{line_break}You probably shouldn't go in.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10553"
msgstr "This is my house. If you're{line_break}looking for Moapa, here I am.{line_break}Back up. Give me some room.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10554"
msgstr "Who have we here? Strangers{line_break}in Shaman Village? What is your{line_break}purpose in coming here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10555"
msgstr "Shaman Village does not{line_break}appreciate intruders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10556"
msgstr "You're not welcome here,{line_break}outlander. Leave now, and{line_break}never come back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10557"
msgstr "If there's something you want{line_break}to say, hurry up and say it.{line_break}I'll listen, but not for long!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10558"
msgstr "What's wrong? Nothing to say?{line_break}Then what are you standing{line_break}around for? Get out of town!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10559"
msgstr "If there's something you want{line_break}to say, say it to Moapa, not{line_break}to us. We don't want to hear it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10560"
msgstr "If you anger Moapa, you'll be{line_break}in for a little taste of his{line_break}awesome and terrible power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10561"
msgstr "They don't look like they've{line_break}come from Contigo... There's{line_break}no reason for us to be nice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10562"
msgstr "If it hadn't been for Moapa,{line_break}I'd have been glad to fling{line_break}these outlanders into the cold.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10563"
msgstr "Maybe they're looking for{line_break}treasure. They ought to be{line_break}looking in Contigo, not here.{page_break}The temple near Contigo is{line_break}filled with treasures beyond{line_break}belief.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10564"
msgstr "If you're here offering charity,{line_break}I won't have it... Or did you{line_break}want to show me something?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10565"
msgstr "What makes you think I would{line_break}be interested in this?{page_break}Show it to Moapa if you{line_break}must, but I don't need it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10566"
msgstr "Yes, yes. That's very nice.{line_break}Did you want to sell it? Because{line_break}I don't have any money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10567"
msgstr "That's the Shaman's Rod!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10568"
msgstr "We thought it was lost{line_break}forever... It once belonged{line_break}to the great Hoabna.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10569"
msgstr "Hoabna's staff was a gift from{line_break}his great friend in Contigo,{line_break}Yegelos.{page_break}When Yegelos gave it to him,{line_break}Hoabna accepted a great{line_break}responsibility...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10570"
msgstr "He vowed to care for the sacred{line_break}treasure of Contigo, the Hover{line_break}Jade...{page_break}When the Shaman's Rod returns{line_break}to us, we are charged to give{line_break}the bearer the Hover Jade.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10571"
msgstr "Have you outlanders come{line_break}to claim the Hover Jade?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10572"
msgstr "I suppose we have, yes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10573"
msgstr "That's a shame. We'll never{line_break}give the Hover Jade to you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10574"
msgstr "But...we brought you the{line_break}Shaman's Rod... What's stopping{line_break}you from giving us the jade?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10575"
msgstr "Hoabna handed the Hover{line_break}Jade down from generation to{line_break}generation for our care.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10576"
msgstr "We are to return it to the{line_break}descendants of Yegelos. And{line_break}you are clearly not from Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10577"
msgstr "That's preposterous! We{line_break}returned your rod! We've come{line_break}so far already!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10578"
msgstr "What difference does it make{line_break}if we're from Contigo or not!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10579"
msgstr "Make no mistake about it. We{line_break}are the intended recipients of{line_break}the stone of Yegelos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10580"
msgstr "Is there some way we can get{line_break}our hands on the Hover Jade?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10581"
msgstr "No. You ask the impossible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10582"
msgstr "What about...the test? Would{line_break}that be a bad idea, Moapa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10583"
msgstr "You know, Trial Road? Only{line_break}Yegelos could walk that path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10584"
msgstr "The way of the vanishing sand!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10585"
msgstr "Yes, if you outlanders intend{line_break}to claim the Hover Jade, you{line_break}must fetch it and bring it here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10586"
msgstr "If you people have the{line_break}courage, follow me! {end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10587"
msgstr "If you'd told us there was a{line_break}test to begin with, we'd have{line_break}been out of your hair by now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10588"
msgstr "What kind of test is this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10589"
msgstr "I understand that you're a{line_break}little concerned, but unless{line_break}you try it, you'll never know!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10590"
msgstr "Give it your best, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10591"
msgstr "Moapa left the door open, and{line_break}strangers got in... Ah, but they're{line_break}gone already...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10592"
msgstr "The outlanders look like{line_break}warriors, but they're nothing{line_break}next to my father.{page_break}He's the leader of Shaman{line_break}Village, but he's also just so{line_break}strong! He never loses!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10593"
msgstr "Those are the first foreigners{line_break}I've ever seen... They don't look{line_break}so different from us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10594"
msgstr "The card reads \"Put {argument_signed_number} coins{line_break}on the counter, and you can stay.\"{page_break}Will you pay {argument_signed_number} coins?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10595"
msgstr "I don't much like strangers,{line_break}but if they're willing to pay,{line_break}I'm willing to let them stay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10596"
msgstr "Moapa ordered us to let them{line_break}stay. I don't know why, though.{line_break}It's not like we lock the doors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10597"
msgstr "There's something written on{line_break}the card: \"If you don't have any{line_break}money, feel free to leave. Now.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10598"
msgstr "Nothing personal, but nobody in{line_break}town will talk to you.{page_break}It may seem weird, but it's{line_break}a law among the Shaman{line_break}tribe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10599"
msgstr "They'll need to find Moapa{line_break}if they want to talk to one{line_break}of the locals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10600"
msgstr "To inherit the stone of Yegelos,{line_break}you must cause this sand{line_break}to disappear.{page_break}If you can manage that feat,{line_break}then the blood of Contigo{line_break}runs through your veins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10601"
msgstr "Just ahead lies Trial Road,{line_break}where Hoabna and Yegelos{line_break}fought their greatest battles.{page_break}Only superior ones such as{line_break}they could have followed{line_break}the road to its end.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10602"
msgstr "When Yegelos and Hoabna{line_break}waged their mighty battles here,{line_break}the sand suddenly vanished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10603"
msgstr "I know the truth. These{line_break}outlanders stole the rod{line_break}from Contigo.{page_break}No matter. Their misdeeds{line_break}will be revealed to all when{line_break}they fail the Trial Road.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10604"
msgstr "If they lack the power of Contigo{line_break}or the power of Shaman Village,{line_break}they will fail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10605"
msgstr "They stand no chance of{line_break}making the sand vanish. They{line_break}will give up and go home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10606"
msgstr "You can do it, {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10607"
msgstr "Leave it to me, {actor_name:6}.{line_break}This will be a breeze.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10608"
msgstr "I don't believe it. They did{line_break}it! The sand vanished!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10609"
msgstr "The legends... They were{line_break}all true!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10610"
msgstr "She's the one! She must{line_break}have come from Contigo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10611"
msgstr "Her?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10612"
msgstr "She's the one that did it?{line_break}But she's...just a girl!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10613"
msgstr "Well, you wanted the sand{line_break}to vanish, so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10614"
msgstr "Can we have the Hover{line_break}Jade now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10615"
msgstr "Nope, you still can't have it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10616"
msgstr "What? Why not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10617"
msgstr "This was just a test to see{line_break}if you earned the right to{line_break}take the test to earn the stone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10618"
msgstr "So, there's more that they{line_break}have to do before you'll give{line_break}them the stone?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10619"
msgstr "You will have to reach{line_break}the end of Trial Road.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10620"
msgstr "The girls, too? Surely you{line_break}can't make them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10621"
msgstr "I thought that only the chosen{line_break}hero could travel the road...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10622"
msgstr "What, are you saying I can't{line_break}be the chosen hero?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10623"
msgstr "The heroes have always been{line_break}men, ever since the time of{line_break}Hoabna. It is the way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10624"
msgstr "I don't like your attitude,{line_break}mister! I can be every bit{line_break}as heroic as some guy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10625"
msgstr "That may be true, but you{line_break}must respect our customs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10626"
msgstr "It's the same in Contigo,{line_break}you know. If you don't like{line_break}it, take it up with Yegelos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10627"
msgstr "Hold it, hold it... Moapa,{line_break}what were you just saying{line_break}about Trial Road?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10628"
msgstr "If we reach the end of Trial{line_break}Road, won't our names join{line_break}the ranks of your heroes?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10629"
msgstr "Kraden's right... It shouldn't{line_break}matter if a girl does it... All{line_break}that matters is that we finish!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10630"
msgstr "If you give us the chance,{line_break}we will prove it to you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10631"
msgstr "Unless you're afraid that a{line_break}girl like me might become{line_break}your town's newest hero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10632"
msgstr "Have they earned the right?{line_break}Shall we let them onto Trial Road?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10633"
msgstr "I don't like the way these{line_break}outsiders were talking to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10634"
msgstr "I think they need to learn{line_break}exactly what it takes to be{line_break}a hero around here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10635"
msgstr "Yeah, if these guys are so{line_break}stubborn, let's give them a{line_break}shot! They'll probably give up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10636"
msgstr "You said it yourselves. We're{line_break}too stubborn to quit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10637"
msgstr "Yeah. If you want us \"outlanders\"{line_break}to leave, you'd better give us{line_break}a chance to walk Trial Road!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10638"
msgstr "Trial Road is a difficult one...{line_break}When you reach the top, a{line_break}terrible battle awaits you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10639"
msgstr "It's difficult enough for me. I{line_break}expect you will find it quite{line_break}impossible. Still interested?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10640"
msgstr "You seem confident, but it{line_break}is your ignorance speaking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10641"
msgstr "So... You are not as sure of{line_break}yourselves as you first seemed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10642"
msgstr "But I will permit this. Follow{line_break}me, and I shall explain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10643"
msgstr "Listen carefully to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10644"
msgstr "This cave provides you with{line_break}an opportunity to practice{line_break}your skills.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10645"
msgstr "Legends say that Yegelos and{line_break}Hoabna once fought here. These{line_break}columns commemorate this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10646"
msgstr "They raced one another{line_break}to the summit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10647"
msgstr "And there, they fought with{line_break}all their might on the peak{line_break}of the mountain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10648"
msgstr "In honor of their great{line_break}battle, the leaders of{line_break}Shaman created this trial.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10649"
msgstr "The rules are simple.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10650"
msgstr "The room is filled with traps{line_break}and snares. Use the power of{line_break}Contigo to avoid them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10651"
msgstr "This road has four doors. To{line_break}open them, you will need to{line_break}place items in these chests. {end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10652"
msgstr "Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10653"
msgstr "The door is triggered only when{line_break}the treasure chests are filled{line_break}to the correct weight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10654"
msgstr "Try putting heavier items, like{line_break}weapons and tools, into the{line_break}chests, or the doors won't open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10655"
msgstr "If you reach the door after{line_break}your opponents do, you will{line_break}be at a serious disadvantage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10656"
msgstr "You see, it will take twice the{line_break}weight to open the doors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10657"
msgstr "Stand on the switch, and the{line_break}number of chests you need{line_break}to fill will open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10658"
msgstr "If you are last to each of{line_break}the four doors, you will lose{line_break}eight items to the chests!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10659"
msgstr "If Trial Road proves too much{line_break}for you, press this button.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10660"
msgstr "This ends the battle, though.{line_break}A true hero would not{line_break}surrender so easily.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10661"
msgstr "In order to reach the battle{line_break}at the summit, you cannot{line_break}fail on Trial Road.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10662"
msgstr "Do you understand?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10663"
msgstr "Would you like me to{line_break}explain it to you again?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10664"
msgstr "Do all outlanders share{line_break}your thickwittedness?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10665"
msgstr "Then you understand the{line_break}treacherous path of Trial{line_break}Road. Will you continue?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10666"
msgstr "You have chosen wisely,{line_break}and for your wisdom, you{line_break}must leave Shaman Village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10667"
msgstr "You have heard the rules,{line_break}and you wish to continue.{line_break}You have been warned.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10668"
msgstr "But what's this? You no{line_break}longer have the Shaman's Rod?{page_break}We cannot accept your{line_break}challenge if you do not have{line_break}the Shaman's Rod. Leave me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10669"
msgstr "It looks as though you are{line_break}missing the item you need{line_break}if you are to challenge us.{page_break}Without it, we won't even{line_break}entertain the idea of competing{line_break}with you. Leave us at once.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10670"
msgstr "Choose the road of your{line_break}liking. It matters not to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10671"
msgstr "Choose the road of your{line_break}liking. It matters not to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10672"
msgstr "Do you need to hear Moapa's{line_break}explanation again?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10673"
msgstr "Thick-witted outsiders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10674"
msgstr "Then you must leave{line_break}Shaman Village and forget{line_break}about the Hover Jade.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10675"
msgstr "Do you need to hear Moapa's{line_break}explanation again?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10676"
msgstr "Thick-witted outsiders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10677"
msgstr "As long as you remain in{line_break}our village, my people are{line_break}not free to do as they will.{page_break}If you are not going to take{line_break}the challenge of Trial Road,{line_break}you must leave Shaman Village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10678"
msgstr "I cannot lose. I will not{line_break}lose.{page_break}It is my responsibility as{line_break}head of the Shaman tribe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10679"
msgstr "You're doomed. Moapa is{line_break}the greatest warrior in all{line_break}of Hesperia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10680"
msgstr "You don't seem like bad{line_break}people, for outlanders, but{line_break}we cannot give you the jade.{page_break}Only the hero with the blood{line_break}of Yegelos, the hero of Contigo,{line_break}can claim the gem.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10681"
msgstr "Have you decided to give up{line_break}this foolishness once and for all?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10682"
msgstr "You have chosen wisely,{line_break}and for your wisdom, you{line_break}must leave Shaman Village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10683"
msgstr "Choose the road of your{line_break}liking. It matters not to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10684"
msgstr "If you have chosen, then we{line_break}shall take the other path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10685"
msgstr "On the count of three,{line_break}the challenge begins!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10686"
msgstr "Do you want to challenge{line_break}me on Trial Road?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10687"
msgstr "You have chosen wisely,{line_break}and for your wisdom, you{line_break}must leave Shaman Village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10688"
msgstr "Do you need to hear Moapa's{line_break}explanation again?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10689"
msgstr "Thick-witted outsiders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10690"
msgstr "Let's get on with it, then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10691"
msgstr "Place this item in the chest?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10692"
msgstr "The chest won't open. There's{line_break}something keeping it shut tight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10693"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} put {argument_actor_name:1}'s{line_break}{argument_item_name:1} in the chest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10694"
msgstr "Do you want to give up?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10695"
msgstr "Yes"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10696"
msgstr "No"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10697"
msgstr "It would be wise of you to{line_break}quit. Even if you reach the{line_break}top, you cannot beat me.{page_break}You would do well to leave{line_break}Shaman Village at once.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10698"
msgstr "You may have been slow, but{line_break}you made it through Trial{line_break}Road to the mountain's peak!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10699"
msgstr "Well, then... The time is nigh for{line_break}us to decide who is stronger!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10700"
msgstr "Let the battle begin!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10701"
msgstr "You were quite swift! You{line_break}may prove a challenge yet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10702"
msgstr "However, just because you're{line_break}fast doesn't mean you're strong.{line_break}Challenge or no, I will win.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10703"
msgstr "Let the battle begin!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10704"
msgstr "You've lost. Now leave{line_break}Shaman village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10705"
msgstr "All right, all right. You've{line_break}proven your strength, and{line_break}you are heroes indeed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10706"
msgstr "As we promised, you will{line_break}receive the Hover Jade, and{line_break}we will take the Shaman's Rod.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10707"
msgstr "After many years, the vow that{line_break}Hoabna made to Yegelos has{line_break}at last been fulfilled!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10708"
msgstr "I'm tired now. I'll be back in{line_break}the Shaman Village resting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10709"
msgstr "I'm sure you must be exhausted{line_break}as well. Let's go back to the{line_break}village and rest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10710"
msgstr "So, you rose to the challenge{line_break}of Trial Road? Moapa was{line_break}quite impressed with you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10711"
msgstr "The people of Shaman Village{line_break}are normally quiet, valiant, and{line_break}noble.{page_break}You defeated Moapa, and we{line_break}must respect the bravery you{line_break}demonstrated in fighting him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10712"
msgstr "You defeated Moapa, and{line_break}that is ample proof of your{line_break}skill as warriors.{page_break}I think you will find that the{line_break}people of Shaman Village{line_break}treat you quite differently now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10713"
msgstr "Heroes cannot be evil. And{line_break}now, we have learned that{line_break}heroes can be foreigners, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10714"
msgstr "Your battle with Moapa was{line_break}just like the legendary battle{line_break}between Hoabna and Yegelos!{page_break}I would love to have watched,{line_break}to see a new legend in the{line_break}making...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10715"
msgstr "Everyone in town is talking{line_break}about how you have fulfilled{line_break}Hoabna's promise.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10716"
msgstr "After your battle, did you{line_break}check on the other side{line_break}of the mountain?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10717"
msgstr "Did you see the spring? There's{line_break}supposed to be a spring that{line_break}only Hoabna could find.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10718"
msgstr "If you have the same powers{line_break}Hoabna had, you might be able{line_break}to get there...{page_break}Nobody with the powers of{line_break}the Shaman tribe alone can{line_break}reach the hidden spring.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10719"
msgstr "Some people among the{line_break}Shaman tribe possess{line_break}a special power...{page_break}The story goes that those{line_break}with this power are the{line_break}chosen few.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10720"
msgstr "Moapa is quite honorable to{line_break}sing their praises. This is{line_break}what makes him a leader.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10721"
msgstr "It's tough to imagine this{line_break}bunch beating Moapa, but{line_break}I'm not thinking about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10722"
msgstr "Someday, a child in Shaman{line_break}will grow to be stronger{line_break}even than Moapa.{page_break}Then, the Shaman tribe will{line_break}rise up again and reclaim{line_break}what it once lost to Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10723"
msgstr "We are too cautious around{line_break}strangers. The world should{line_break}not be such an unfriendly place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10724"
msgstr "I never thought I'd live{line_break}to see the day Hoabna's{line_break}promise was fulfilled.{page_break}Of course, I never thought{line_break}anyone with Contigo blood{line_break}could defeat a Shaman hero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10725"
msgstr "I hope that we remain{line_break}close friends with the{line_break}Contigo after this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10726"
msgstr "If I had the power to break{line_break}down walls of sand, I'd climb to{line_break}the other side of the mountain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10727"
msgstr "People living on the outskirts{line_break}of Shaman Village have different{line_break}powers from us.{page_break}Why would that be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10728"
msgstr "I can finally open the door{line_break}and air the place out.{page_break}I can't believe Moapa was{line_break}on the mountain fighting while{line_break}I was stuck in here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10729"
msgstr "If I'd known that there was{line_break}going to be a challenge{line_break}on Trial Road...{page_break}I wouldn't have locked up.{line_break}I'd have been right up there,{line_break}watching the fight!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10730"
msgstr "I thought it was quiet out here.{line_break}I've been locked inside all{line_break}day, so I couldn't check...{page_break}It was all because they{line_break}were fighting Moapa up{line_break}on Trial Road...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10731"
msgstr "Nobody got to watch the{line_break}challenge at Trial Road. It{line_break}was just too far from town.{page_break}What a stupid law, that makes{line_break}us hide away and miss all{line_break}the battles!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10732"
msgstr "For years, the people of Hesperia{line_break}fought against the people of{line_break}Atteka...{page_break}Our own Shaman Village was{line_break}caught up in this war, as{line_break}were the people of Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10733"
msgstr "In those dark times, Contigo{line_break}and Shaman fought repeatedly{line_break}to protect our lands.{page_break}We fought to no avail, until{line_break}we decided to let Hoabna and{line_break}Yegelos fight for the outcome.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10734"
msgstr "The battles between Shaman{line_break}and Contigo were terrible, and{line_break}few warriors ever survived.{page_break}Eventually, our towns chose{line_break}Hoabna and Yegelos to fight{line_break}as our champions.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10735"
msgstr "I've always wondered why the{line_break}final battle between Hoabna{line_break}and Yegelos took place here.{page_break}I think Yegelos was really{line_break}brave for traveling here all{line_break}the way from Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10736"
msgstr "I had thought that, after{line_break}Yegelos, Contigo remained{line_break}without a new hero.{page_break}Now, suddenly, a hero shows{line_break}up who is mightier even than{line_break}Moapa. It's beyond belief!{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10737"
msgstr "The stories always said that{line_break}the heroes of Contigo were{line_break}inferior to our own.{page_break}Now, I'm not so sure... It{line_break}sounded like a fair match,{line_break}and yet Shaman's hero lost.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10738"
msgstr "Grandma and Grandpa have{line_break}been in a terrible mood since{line_break}they heard Moapa lost...{page_break}They're probably tired of being{line_break}asked about the ancient war{line_break}between Atteka and Hesperia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10739"
msgstr "Everyone always comes to ask{line_break}Grandma and Grandpa about the{line_break}old battles of legend.{page_break}It's all anyone ever talks to{line_break}them about anymore. I'll bet{line_break}they're tired of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10740"
msgstr "Hoolabaloo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10741"
msgstr "So, you'd like to hear{line_break}your fortune, would you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10742"
msgstr "That's probably good. The{line_break}things I see are not for{line_break}everyone to hear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10743"
msgstr "Well, you caught me in a{line_break}good mood... I'll do it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10744"
msgstr "Hoolabaloo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10745"
msgstr "Ballabahoo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10746"
msgstr "Hoolabaloola!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10747"
msgstr "I can see it clearly... Your{line_break}life is thick with danger...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10748"
msgstr "Ooo... Wow, that was a strong{line_break}one... Listen, don't go south.{line_break}Bad stuff down there. Wow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10749"
msgstr "Oh, it's terrible! Awful beyond{line_break}words! No more, no more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10750"
msgstr "You should absolutely not go{line_break}south. Do you hear me? I'm{line_break}serious about this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10751"
msgstr "That's weird... Everything is{line_break}cloudy... The ether is gray{line_break}and full of mists...{page_break}The world is undergoing some{line_break}sort of change, it seems.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10752"
msgstr "So, you'd like to hear{line_break}your fortune, would you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10753"
msgstr "That's probably good. The{line_break}things I see are not for{line_break}everyone to hear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10754"
msgstr "Well, you caught me in a{line_break}good mood... I'll do it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10755"
msgstr "Wallamafoo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10756"
msgstr "Ballabahoo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10757"
msgstr "Whazupwichoo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10758"
msgstr "I can see it clearly... Your{line_break}life is thick with danger...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10759"
msgstr "Ooo... Wow, that was a strong{line_break}one... North by northeast is...{line_break}bad. Bad stuff up there. Wow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10760"
msgstr "Oh, it's terrible! Awful beyond{line_break}words! No more, no more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10761"
msgstr "Listen, I want you to promise{line_break}me you'll NEVER go north by{line_break}northeast. You got that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10762"
msgstr "That's weird... Everything is{line_break}cloudy... The ether is gray{line_break}and full of mists...{page_break}The world is undergoing some{line_break}sort of change, it seems.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10763"
msgstr "Your attacks showed skill{line_break}and speed, but if we meet{line_break}in battle again, I won't lose.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10764"
msgstr "I don't think the other villagers{line_break}will ever forgive us for losing{line_break}to you on Trial Road.{page_break}If they had any idea how{line_break}strong you are, they wouldn't{line_break}be complaining.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10765"
msgstr "Just climbing to the top of{line_break}Trial Road is excruciating.{page_break}It must have been hard for{line_break}Yegelos and Hoabna, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10766"
msgstr "That wasn't a fair fight...{line_break}I was all worn out from the{line_break}climb... How could I fight?{page_break}How did Hoabna manage{line_break}to fight after climbing a{line_break}mountain like that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10767"
msgstr "You have defeated me, and{line_break}yet I still don't know your{line_break}names... Would you tell me?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10768"
msgstr "A warrior who does not{line_break}share his name is a{line_break}humble warrior indeed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10769"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, {actor_name:6}, {actor_name:7},{line_break}and {actor_name:8}. I shall remember{line_break}those names.{page_break}We do not forget the names{line_break}of heroes who can defeat{line_break}me in fair combat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10770"
msgstr "Moapa said that he doesn't{line_break}even know the names of the{line_break}heroes who beat him...{page_break}He feels bad for not having{line_break}asked. Maybe you should{line_break}go tell him your names.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10771"
msgstr "In a formal battle, it is both{line_break}customary and honorable to{line_break}give your name.{page_break}It's not too late for you...{line_break}Please go tell my father{line_break}your names.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10772"
msgstr "Why does it matter if you{line_break}know the name of someone{line_break}who beat you or not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10773"
msgstr "If a warrior beats you, you{line_break}must learn his name...{page_break}Not many people have beaten{line_break}me, and they deserve my{line_break}respect.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10774"
msgstr "I would feel bad not knowing{line_break}the name of a warrior who{line_break}defeated me, I guess...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10775"
msgstr "What a shame... My own father,{line_break}losing to some ignorant{line_break}foreigner with bad manners.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10776"
msgstr "It's so old-fashioned to have{line_break}to give your name to an{line_break}opponent before a battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10777"
msgstr "I'll never forget the name{line_break}of anyone I fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10778"
msgstr "I was stunned to hear that{line_break}Moapa lost his battle...{page_break}His weapons all came from{line_break}my own warehouse, so I feel{line_break}a little responsible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10779"
msgstr "Everyone is depressed that{line_break}Moapa lost his big fight. They{line_break}should be glad the hero came!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10780"
msgstr "Although it's not right to{line_break}blame his loss on the{line_break}weapons he used.{page_break}I couldn't afford it if that{line_break}rumor started going around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10781"
msgstr "My husband is getting neurotic,{line_break}worrying about whether his{line_break}weapons caused the loss.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10782"
msgstr "You've traveled to lots of{line_break}different lands, haven't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10783"
msgstr "That explains it... The only{line_break}reason you won is because{line_break}of your travels...{page_break}Your strange, exotic{line_break}weapons are what won{line_break}the day, not your skill.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10784"
msgstr "I could have sworn that{line_break}fancy boat was yours...{page_break}If you can afford such a{line_break}nice boat, you can probably{line_break}afford nice weapons, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10785"
msgstr "We're very fond of Moapa{line_break}here. He's a great leader.{page_break}If anyone in town says{line_break}something mean to you,{line_break}please forgive them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10786"
msgstr "I've been locked up inside{line_break}all day! I'm so glad to get{line_break}outside and stretch!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10787"
msgstr "Ah... I've been inside for so{line_break}long... I think I'll have a little{line_break}picnic! But what should I eat...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10788"
msgstr "Around here, people like a{line_break}nice hot steak and some{line_break}potatoes and beans...{page_break}You foreigners might be used{line_break}to strange, exotic food, but{line_break}we like our meals simple.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10789"
msgstr "Moapa has been miserable{line_break}since his defeat. If only I could{line_break}have taken his place up there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10790"
msgstr "It drives me nuts how{line_break}worked up everyone gets{line_break}about Moapa around here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10791"
msgstr "All of the older people in town{line_break}are really upset that Moapa{line_break}lost...{page_break}It doesn't matter to us kids.{line_break}I think they're too hung up{line_break}on tradition.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10792"
msgstr "I'm starving! I can't wait until{line_break}dinner! I love my meat and{line_break}potatoes! And BEANS!!!{page_break}It must be the spices the{line_break}chef uses... Lots of salt,{line_break}and lots of pepper!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10793"
msgstr "Those fancy foreign chefs{line_break}use all sorts of spices to{line_break}hide the flavor of their food.{page_break}As far as I'm concerned,{line_break}there are only two spices:{line_break}salt and pepper.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10794"
msgstr "You beat Moapa? Incredible!{line_break}...Not that I ever doubted you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10795"
msgstr "Don't be too pleased with{line_break}yourself for beating Moapa.{page_break}One of these days, we'll{line_break}come storming into Contigo,{line_break}and we'll show you what's what!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10796"
msgstr "Oh, please... Let a true{line_break}warrior be born in Shaman.{line_break}Let us forget this disgrace!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10797"
msgstr "The older folks of Shaman{line_break}are quite upset that Moapa{line_break}was beaten.{page_break}I'm afraid this might lead{line_break}to renewed fighting between{line_break}Shaman and Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10798"
msgstr "Moapa must have been{line_break}hungry after climbing the{line_break}mountain...{page_break}That's the only way those{line_break}lousy Contigo nobodies{line_break}could have beaten him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10799"
msgstr "I can't forgive the fact{line_break}that Contigo's heroes beat{line_break}our leader, Moapa...{page_break}I hope a new hero is born in{line_break}Shaman, one who can crush{line_break}those Contigo barbarians...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10800"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, the hero of Contigo!{line_break}I shall never forget you, the{line_break}only one that defeated me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10801"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, {actor_name:6}, {actor_name:7},{line_break}and {actor_name:8}... I won't forget{line_break}those names...{page_break}Someday, their names will be{line_break}engraved on the columns{line_break}leading to Trial Road.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10802"
msgstr "Ahhhh!!!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10803"
msgstr "{actor_name:4}!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10804"
msgstr "Noooo!!!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10805"
msgstr "Oof!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10806"
msgstr "{actor_name:4}!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10807"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10808"
msgstr "Is that...{pause_20_skippable} It's {actor_name:1}{line_break}and the others!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10809"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}? Isn't he a friend{line_break}of yours, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10810"
msgstr "They both come from Vale, and{line_break}regardless of what {actor_name:1}{line_break}believes, they must be allies now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10811"
msgstr "Don't be that way! You two have{line_break}much in common, even if you are{line_break}at odds right now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10812"
msgstr "But {actor_name:1} and the others{line_break}came all this way just to try{line_break}and stop us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10813"
msgstr "But didn't you hear that? It{line_break}sounded like a cry for help...{line_break}What if they're in trouble?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10814"
msgstr "Hang on, {actor_name:4}!{line_break}Don't worry, {actor_name:2}!{line_break}Everything will be fine!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10815"
msgstr "Don't worry about me... I'm{line_break}fine, but {actor_name:2}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10816"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}, you're only using{line_break}one arm to hang on...{line_break}What's the matter?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10817"
msgstr "I don't know... I think I hurt my{line_break}arm when I fell... It's totally{line_break}numb! I can't move it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10818"
msgstr "You shouldn't have tried{line_break}to save me when I fell{line_break}into that hole...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10819"
msgstr "Oh, {actor_name:4}, don't blame{line_break}yourself... I wasn't going to{line_break}leave you down there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10820"
msgstr "It's no use! I can't pull{line_break}you up, {actor_name:2}! I'm{line_break}not strong enough!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10821"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}, please! You've{line_break}got to save {actor_name:2}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10822"
msgstr "This doesn't look good...{line_break}We have to save {actor_name:2},{line_break}and fast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10823"
msgstr "No, I'm afraid you won't{line_break}be doing that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10824"
msgstr "Who are you!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10825"
msgstr "Me? Why, I'm Karst.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10826"
msgstr "And I'm Agatio.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10827"
msgstr "If you're not here to help my{line_break}friend, then get out of my{line_break}way, so I can do it myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10828"
msgstr "Your friends will have to take{line_break}care of themselves. You have{line_break}a little debt to repay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10829"
msgstr "Debt? What are you talking{line_break}about? We've never even{line_break}seen you before!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10830"
msgstr "Regardless, you have done Karst{line_break}here a great wrong, and you're{line_break}beginning to be a hindrance to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10831"
msgstr "Wait a second... You two look{line_break}familiar somehow... Do you{line_break}know Saturos and Menardi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10832"
msgstr "So, you're not such a fool{line_break}after all, {actor_name:1}! You are{line_break}right. We are of the same clan.{page_break}The Fire Clan, from the frozen{line_break}land of Prox, far to the north!{end_wait}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10833"
msgstr "Prox? Never heard of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10834"
msgstr "That doesn't surprise me.{line_break}Our town hangs on the{line_break}brink of extinction.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10835"
msgstr "And the seal placed on{line_break}Alchemy is responsible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10836"
msgstr "What are you saying? That{line_break}doesn't make any sense.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10837"
msgstr "It matters not! For soon, Prox{line_break}will recover its lost power...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10838"
msgstr "We shall bring Prox back from{line_break}the edge, and then all the people{line_break}of Weyard will kneel before us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10839"
msgstr "You think we'd let you, after{line_break}hearing all that nonsense?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10840"
msgstr "See! You're a hindrance!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10841"
msgstr "And {actor_name:5} was trying{line_break}to help you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10842"
msgstr "Actually...we don't know what{line_break}{actor_name:5}'s objectives are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10843"
msgstr "And we don't care, as long{line_break}as he lights the beacon on{line_break}Jupiter Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10844"
msgstr "Then get out of our way!{line_break}We're here to stop {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10845"
msgstr "Move, or we'll have to{line_break}move you ourselves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10846"
msgstr "Did you hear that, Karst?{line_break}They actually want to fight?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10847"
msgstr "You mean to tell us that{line_break}you would leave your{line_break}friend...hanging?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10848"
msgstr "So this was all part{line_break}of your plan?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10849"
msgstr "Cowards! Stop playing{line_break}dirty and fight fair!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10850"
msgstr "If you really are the brats who{line_break}killed Saturos and Menardi, then{line_break}you've earned some new foes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10851"
msgstr "But answer me this: would{line_break}you still cry foul if you were{line_break}fighting us four on two?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10852"
msgstr "That's why you were waiting{line_break}up here? To set a trap and{line_break}make {actor_name:4} and {actor_name:2} fall?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10853"
msgstr "We didn't plan on snaring{line_break}both of them, though... That{line_break}{text_effect:2}was{reset_text_style} a pleasant surprise!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10854"
msgstr "So that's the deal, is it?{line_break}You came up here to fight us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10855"
msgstr "Oh, did you figure that out all{line_break}on your own? Impressive! I'm{line_break}quite fond of intelligent boys...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10856"
msgstr "I hope you don't think{line_break}we're afraid of a fair{line_break}fight, two on two...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10857"
msgstr "A fair fight?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10858"
msgstr "I'm sorry if I misled you, but we{line_break}have a third... A Water Adept...{line_break}Alex!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10859"
msgstr "Alex?{pause_20_skippable} ...Where is he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10860"
msgstr "What's wrong, Karst?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10861"
msgstr "It's Alex! He's gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10862"
msgstr "What!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10863"
msgstr "Alex!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10864"
msgstr "Alex?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10865"
msgstr "Did anyone see where{line_break}he went?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10866"
msgstr "Forget about him! Honestly, I{line_break}was planning to do the same to{line_break}him that I'm about to do to them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10867"
msgstr "My only regret is that I{line_break}won't be able to wipe that{line_break}sneering smile off his face.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10868"
msgstr "Well, take out all of your{line_break}aggressions on these brats...{line_break}You'll feel better!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10869"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! Agatio and Karst{line_break}are attacking {actor_name:1}{line_break}and the others!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10870"
msgstr "Do you think {actor_name:1} and{line_break}{actor_name:3} can handle them{line_break}without {actor_name:4} and {actor_name:2}'s help?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10871"
msgstr "I'm disgusted that Karst{line_break}would set a trap for them.{line_break}It's dishonorable!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10872"
msgstr "What if {actor_name:2} loses his{line_break}grip while they're still fighting?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10873"
msgstr "There's still time! We have to{line_break}help {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10874"
msgstr "Ah, {actor_name:5}... I've been{line_break}waiting for you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10875"
msgstr "Have you come here to{line_break}light the beacon?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10876"
msgstr "And you're sure that's{line_break}{text_effect:2}all{reset_text_style} you're going to do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10877"
msgstr "Hmph. They consider you their{line_break}enemy, and yet you pity them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10878"
msgstr "I saw you watching when{line_break}{actor_name:1}'s friends fell{line_break}into Karst's trap.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10879"
msgstr "I know you, {actor_name:5}.{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}I know that if you leave{line_break}{actor_name:1} behind, you'll regret it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10880"
msgstr "You're not like me. You can't{line_break}simply discard someone who{line_break}is no longer of use to you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10881"
msgstr "Well, you'd better hurry if you{line_break}still hope to save them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10882"
msgstr "Everyone recovered fully.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10883"
msgstr "There you go! Consider it a{line_break}gift. You can still make it.{line_break}Go on...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10884"
msgstr "It is time you followed your{line_break}true feelings. Go on.{line_break}Save your friends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10885"
msgstr "Even now, I want to run to{line_break}{actor_name:4}, to give her my aid...{line_break}It seems I am weak as well...{page_break}I suppose I have no choice{line_break}but to part ways with Agatio{line_break}and Karst.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10886"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}... I'm sorry...{line_break}I can't take any more...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10887"
msgstr "Keep it together, {actor_name:3}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10888"
msgstr "Ha! You're a fool! Never let{line_break}concern distract you in battle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10889"
msgstr "AHHHHHHHH!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10890"
msgstr "We did it, Agatio!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10891"
msgstr "It was close, but we did it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10892"
msgstr "Heh... He's no warrior. His{line_break}concern for his friend gave{line_break}us the opportunity to strike!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10893"
msgstr "What's this? He's still alive!?{line_break}Even after that blow?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10894"
msgstr "It would be a shame if you{line_break}and I ever had to regret letting{line_break}him live...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10895"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}! Watch out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10896"
msgstr "He's still alive! If we're going to{line_break}act, {actor_name:5}, we have to act now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10897"
msgstr "They're going to kill {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10898"
msgstr "No, they aren't! I'm not about{line_break}to let that happen!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10899"
msgstr "None of us are, {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10900"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}? What's going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10901"
msgstr "Be grateful! We just{line_break}did you a favor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10902"
msgstr "I understand that when Venus{line_break}was lit, the ground shook so{line_break}fiercely that the very earth split.{page_break}Curious that it hasn't here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10903"
msgstr "You haven't lit the beacon{line_break}yet, have you? And after all{line_break}we've done to help you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10904"
msgstr "We're going to light the{line_break}beacon right now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10905"
msgstr "If that's true, then you'd{line_break}better go do it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10906"
msgstr "But we're not leaving{line_break}{actor_name:1} behind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10907"
msgstr "Oh, great... Are you going{line_break}to betray us now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10908"
msgstr "Typical. And you're going to{line_break}try to stop us from finishing{line_break}them off, aren't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10909"
msgstr "Don't lie... We can see it in{line_break}your eyes. We can see what{line_break}you truly mean to do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10910"
msgstr "If you're only here to clear{line_break}the way for us to light the{line_break}beacon, then your work is done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10911"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} has proven to{line_break}be a greater foe than we'd{line_break}imagined. We can't let him live.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10912"
msgstr "Consider how powerful these two{line_break}were without the aid of a Water{line_break}Adept. We have to finish them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10913"
msgstr "If you want them, you're going{line_break}to have to face us first!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10914"
msgstr "You're both quite badly{line_break}injured... You're in no shape{line_break}to fight all four of them.{page_break}I think it would be best{line_break}if you left now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10915"
msgstr "We haven't much choice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10916"
msgstr "Karst, no!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10917"
msgstr "Agatio, if we fight {actor_name:5}{line_break}now...we'll be destroyed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10918"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} killed your sister!{line_break}Where is your anger!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10919"
msgstr "I am filled with rage, but not so{line_break}much as to be blinded by it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10920"
msgstr "What, then? Do we give up?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10921"
msgstr "Fine! But this is not the end.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10922"
msgstr "Do with {actor_name:1}{line_break}as you will.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10923"
msgstr "But swear this oath to us:{line_break}if we leave now, you will{line_break}light the beacon's fire.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10924"
msgstr "I don't care if you want to{line_break}help {actor_name:2} or not!{line_break}The lighthouse comes first!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10925"
msgstr "We do not have time to wait{line_break}for you to save {actor_name:2}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10926"
msgstr "Go, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}I will tend to {actor_name:2}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10927"
msgstr "And be sure to bring with{line_break}you the Mars Star that{line_break}{actor_name:1} carries on him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10928"
msgstr "How did you know{line_break}about the Mars Star?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10929"
msgstr "Did you think this was about{line_break}nothing more than revenge?{line_break}Alex told us about it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10930"
msgstr "Take the Mars Star, or we'll{line_break}be forced to make you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10931"
msgstr "Do not force our{line_break}hand on this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10932"
msgstr "Go on, {actor_name:5}. Take it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10933"
msgstr "I don't know why you're doing{line_break}this, but I trust you...{line_break}Take the Mars Star.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10934"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} took the Mars Star.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10935"
msgstr "That's better, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}We'll be waiting for you{line_break}on the aerie.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10936"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, wait...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10937"
msgstr "We cannot trust them.{line_break}Take me with you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10938"
msgstr "Good thinking. If something{line_break}happens up there, you'll be{line_break}safer with {actor_name:8}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10939"
msgstr "We'll be fine. Take{line_break}{actor_name:8} with you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10940"
msgstr "Listen to the others...{line_break}Safety in numbers, as{line_break}they say...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10941"
msgstr "{control_28:5}{page_break}, {actor_name:5}... No!{line_break}Why are you helping them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10942"
msgstr "Don't worry about us... Help{line_break}{actor_name:2} and {actor_name:4} first.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10943"
msgstr "We have to help {actor_name:2}.{line_break}He can't hold on for much{line_break}longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10944"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}! I don't know how{line_break}you survived that attack,{line_break}but I'm so glad you did...{page_break}We're going to help you...{line_break}We're going to heal you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10945"
msgstr "{actor_name:3}... You've been injured.{line_break}Don't worry about the others.{line_break}Let's take care of those wounds.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10946"
msgstr "Why did you help us, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Whatever it was, I'm glad you{line_break}stopped to help us...{page_break}But why do you have to{line_break}still light the beacon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10947"
msgstr "I thought you were our{line_break}enemy, {actor_name:5}... Why did{line_break}you stop to help us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10948"
msgstr "{actor_name:2} and {actor_name:4} are{line_break}back. They fell through that{line_break}hole, and then this panel...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10949"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}! Look at you!{line_break}You're a mess! I thought I'd{line_break}never see you again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10950"
msgstr "You're pretty tough for your{line_break}age... I'm impressed, {actor_name:3}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10951"
msgstr "You're late, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10952"
msgstr "Now light the beacon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10953"
msgstr "Once you've lit the beacon,{line_break}we might even forgive you{line_break}for saving {actor_name:1} back there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10954"
msgstr "Once Jupiter is lit, only{line_break}Mars remains! Now, light{line_break}the beacon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10955"
msgstr "Once Jupiter is lit, we'll have no{line_break}need for you. Just watch...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10956"
msgstr "Do even think about{line_break}resisting us... We have{line_break}our own ideas about that.{page_break}Once the beacon is lit,{line_break}your usefulness will have{line_break}run out for good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10957"
msgstr "There seems to be a wide{line_break}hole for the Elemental Star.{page_break}Cast the Jupiter Star in?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10958"
msgstr "We have ignited the beacon...{line_break}The third lighthouse is lit...{line_break}Now let us go...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10959"
msgstr "I don't think so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10960"
msgstr "You see, you've betrayed{line_break}us once already...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10961"
msgstr "We simply can't trust{line_break}you anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10962"
msgstr "And now that Jupiter{line_break}Lighthouse is lit, I'm afraid we{line_break}have little use for traitors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10963"
msgstr "Poor dear... You look puzzled.{line_break}Would you like to know{line_break}why we don't need you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10964"
msgstr "I'd be happy to tell you. Mars{line_break}Lighthouse{pause_20_skippable} is in Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10965"
msgstr "Figured it out, have you?{line_break}Yes, Mars Lighthouse is in{line_break}Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10966"
msgstr "What are you doing!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10967"
msgstr "They stole the Mars Star!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10968"
msgstr "Your job is done now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10969"
msgstr "We're not done yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10970"
msgstr "We've got the Mars Star!{line_break}We don't need you anymore!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10971"
msgstr "You know what that means,{line_break}of course, don't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10972"
msgstr "Exactly! That means it's{line_break}time to die, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10973"
msgstr "No? Well, how can I put this?{line_break}It's time to die!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10974"
msgstr "But what will happen to{line_break}{actor_name:5}'s parents?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10975"
msgstr "We keep our promises! Once all{line_break}four lighthouses have been{line_break}lit, we shall release them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10976"
msgstr "We would never do anything as{line_break}terrible as breaking our word...{line_break}as you have done so casually.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10977"
msgstr "But if you're dead...{line_break}Who will come to take{line_break}them home from Prox?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10978"
msgstr "I guess they'll just have to spend{line_break}their remaining years in the{line_break}frozen wastelands of the north!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10979"
msgstr "Don't worry! They'll be fine!{line_break}Now prepare for the end!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10980"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10981"
msgstr "I thought you were taking too{line_break}long, so I came to check on{line_break}you. What's going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10982"
msgstr "They say they don't{line_break}need us anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10983"
msgstr "Agatio! {actor_name:5}'s sister isn't{line_break}supposed to be here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10984"
msgstr "What do you want me to{line_break}do? We can't just leave{line_break}now! We have to finish them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10985"
msgstr "Don't worry, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}I'm here to help!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10986"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10987"
msgstr "I got the feeling something was{line_break}wrong, so I rushed up here. Just{line_break}in the nick of time, it looks like!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10988"
msgstr "Thank you, {actor_name:7}! I'm{line_break}not looking forward to fighting,{line_break}but I'm glad you're here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10989"
msgstr "Another one? Agatio, we're{line_break}rapidly being outnumbered!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10990"
msgstr "It's too late to flee now! We{line_break}have to keep fighting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10991"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} and the others{line_break}are safe! Now let's take care{line_break}of these two rats!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10992"
msgstr "We did it...{line_break}We beat them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10993"
msgstr "Barely...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10994"
msgstr "What should we do with them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10995"
msgstr "Finish us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10996"
msgstr "But think: what happens to{line_break}your parents if neither we nor{line_break}Saturos and Menardi return?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10997"
msgstr "Are you saying your people{line_break}will kill our parents if you don't{line_break}return to Prox? I doubt that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10998"
msgstr "Well then, I suppose you'd{line_break}better finish us off, like I said.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10999"
msgstr "What's the matter? Are you{line_break}going to do it or not?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11000"
msgstr "No, {actor_name:5}! Don't!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11001"
msgstr "You've made the better{line_break}choice, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11002"
msgstr "When did you get here, Alex?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11003"
msgstr "If Karst is not bluffing... If you{line_break}kill them, all of your efforts{line_break}will have been for naught.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11004"
msgstr "Do you understand, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}If that happens, {actor_name:1} will{line_break}suffer the same fate you do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11005"
msgstr "Alex! What are you doing!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11006"
msgstr "I have revived them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11007"
msgstr "Why!? Are you going to make{line_break}us fight them again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11008"
msgstr "Don't worry, {actor_name:6}.{line_break}Look at them... They can barely{line_break}walk right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11009"
msgstr "Still, that doesn't give you{line_break}the right to...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11010"
msgstr "If you're not going to finish{line_break}them off, you'll just be leaving{line_break}them here, won't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11011"
msgstr "You're not going to help{line_break}us defeat these brats?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11012"
msgstr "You'd better not be expecting{line_break}a big thank-you for this, Alex!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11013"
msgstr "Of course not, Karst.{line_break}I would never ask for{line_break}your gratitude.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11014"
msgstr "What's keeping {actor_name:5}{line_break}and the others?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11015"
msgstr "We should be going before{line_break}{actor_name:1} and the others arrive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11016"
msgstr "If they're coming up, how do{line_break}you plan on avoiding them{line_break}on your way down?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11017"
msgstr "Do not worry about us...{line_break}We'll just take the elevator.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11018"
msgstr "Now that the lighthouse has{line_break}been lit, it should be fully{line_break}operational again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11019"
msgstr "Oh! You're looking better!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11020"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, {actor_name:6}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11021"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}... {actor_name:2}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11022"
msgstr "Man! They got away!{line_break}What a bunch of jerks!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11023"
msgstr "All right, {actor_name:5}! We want{line_break}to know what's going on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11024"
msgstr "It's all quite complicated,{line_break}{actor_name:1}. There are a number{line_break}of{pause_20_skippable} extenuating circumstances.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11025"
msgstr "What are you talking{line_break}about, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11026"
msgstr "Look, I don't think any of{line_break}us are in any shape for{line_break}another fight right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11027"
msgstr "What do you mean, {actor_name:3}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11028"
msgstr "I'm just saying we should{line_break}get ourselves back to Contigo{line_break}and sort things out there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11029"
msgstr "That's a sound plan, {actor_name:3}...{line_break}I fully agree.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11030"
msgstr "You're right. We can't fight{line_break}right now. Let's head back{line_break}to Contigo.{page_break}What do you say, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Can we talk there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11031"
msgstr "We'll be waiting for you...{line_break}So don't think you can{line_break}sneak off again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11032"
msgstr "He's right, {actor_name:5}. It's time{line_break}we explained ourselves to them.{line_break}We should go to Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11033"
msgstr "We'll be there, {actor_name:1}.{line_break}I promise. I hope you can{line_break}still trust me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11034"
msgstr "I've never stopped trusting{line_break}you, {actor_name:6}. I'll be waiting{line_break}for you in Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11035"
msgstr "We'll be expecting you. Don't{line_break}think you can sneak out of this!{line_break}You owe us an explanation!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11036"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} wasn't the only{line_break}surprise. They were all far more{line_break}powerful than I'd expected.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11037"
msgstr "Don't worry, Karst! We'll win{line_break}in the end...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11038"
msgstr "This one moved... I can't{line_break}believe they're still alive!{line_break}The pests!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11039"
msgstr "If we stay here much longer,{line_break}{actor_name:1} and the others{line_break}will come! We should leave!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11040"
msgstr "I know... But treason deserves{line_break}death! We must finish them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11041"
msgstr "There's no time for{line_break}petty grudges!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11042"
msgstr "Alex! You...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11043"
msgstr "You no longer consider me{line_break}a friend? I do not care.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11044"
msgstr "It goes beyond that, Alex!{line_break}You've betrayed us, and{line_break}treason deserves death!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11045"
msgstr "Yes, I heard you the first time.{page_break}But shouldn't you heal{line_break}yourselves before making{line_break}foolish threats?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11046"
msgstr "After fighting both {actor_name:1}{line_break}and {actor_name:5}, you're in no{line_break}condition to fight me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11047"
msgstr "And if {actor_name:1} and the others{line_break}come, what chance will you have?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11048"
msgstr "What's keeping {actor_name:5}{line_break}and the others?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11049"
msgstr "There's no time to talk!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11050"
msgstr "Then what should we do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11051"
msgstr "We take the elevator! With{line_break}the beacon lit, it should be{line_break}fully operational once more.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11052"
msgstr "We have no choice. Let's go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11053"
msgstr "Good! You're listening to{line_break}reason! Now follow me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11054"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11055"
msgstr "What's happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11056"
msgstr "It seems they fought with{line_break}Agatio and Karst...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11057"
msgstr "I had a really bad feeling{line_break}after {actor_name:7} left.{line_break}I hate it when I'm right...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11058"
msgstr "Your power of prediction must{line_break}be even stronger than you'd{line_break}thought, {actor_name:3}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11059"
msgstr "Blast! They must have taken{line_break}the elevator to escape!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11060"
msgstr "How could they have done{line_break}that to {actor_name:6}? Those monsters!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11061"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} tried to help us...{line_break}They must have attacked him{line_break}because he betrayed them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11062"
msgstr "So, does that mean {actor_name:5}{line_break}isn't really our enemy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11063"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! You're alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11064"
msgstr "{actor_name:4}, he needs healing,{line_break}quickly! There's still time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11065"
msgstr "Don't let 'em die! {actor_name:5}{line_break}still has a lot of questions to{line_break}answer before he's in the clear!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11066"
msgstr "If you save {actor_name:5}, we'll{line_break}tell you everything...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11067"
msgstr "All right, {actor_name:5}! We want{line_break}to know what's going on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11068"
msgstr "It's all quite complicated,{line_break}{actor_name:1}. There are a number{line_break}of{pause_20_skippable} extenuating circumstances.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11069"
msgstr "What are you talking{line_break}about, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11070"
msgstr "Look, I don't think any of{line_break}us are in any shape for{line_break}another fight right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11071"
msgstr "What do you mean, {actor_name:3}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11072"
msgstr "I'm just saying we should{line_break}get ourselves back to Contigo{line_break}and sort things out there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11073"
msgstr "That's a sound plan, {actor_name:3}...{line_break}I fully agree.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11074"
msgstr "You're right. We can't fight{line_break}right now. Let's head back{line_break}to Contigo.{page_break}What do you say, {actor_name:5}?{line_break}Can we talk there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11075"
msgstr "We'll be waiting for you...{line_break}So don't think you can{line_break}sneak off again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11076"
msgstr "He's right, {actor_name:5}. It's time{line_break}we explained ourselves to them.{line_break}We should go to Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11077"
msgstr "We'll be there, {actor_name:1}.{line_break}I promise. I hope you can{line_break}still trust me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11078"
msgstr "I've never stopped trusting{line_break}you, {actor_name:6}. I'll be waiting{line_break}for you in Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11079"
msgstr "We'll be expecting you. Don't{line_break}think you can sneak out of this!{line_break}You owe us an explanation!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11080"
msgstr "The door's locked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11081"
msgstr "Holder of the star...{line_break}Show the power of Anemos!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11082"
msgstr "You didn't warn me that there{line_break}would be an earthquake when{line_break}the beacon was lit!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11083"
msgstr "The core is shining so{line_break}brightly already...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11084"
msgstr "I've heard tales of this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11085"
msgstr "But I had no idea it would{line_break}be so spectacular.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11086"
msgstr "I've heard tales of this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11087"
msgstr "But I had no idea it would{line_break}be so spectacular.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11088"
msgstr "You're not planning on running{line_break}away from {actor_name:1} again, are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11089"
msgstr "We can't run anymore, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}I promised him that we wouldn't.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11090"
msgstr "Besides, they want to talk,{line_break}not fight...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11091"
msgstr "They're waiting for us.{line_break}Let's go to Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11092"
msgstr "We shouldn't run from {actor_name:1}{line_break}anymore, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11093"
msgstr "Are you looking for {actor_name:1}?{line_break}He and his colleagues are in the{line_break}house at the top of the hill.{page_break}Are you the people they've{line_break}been waiting for?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11094"
msgstr "Everyone's left town for the{line_break}time being. They're transporting{line_break}the wings...{page_break}Actually, they might even have{line_break}finished putting them onto the{line_break}ship by now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11095"
msgstr "Is that your boat? It looks{line_break}exactly like the one in the{line_break}geoglyphs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11096"
msgstr "Jupiter Lighthouse has been lit,{line_break}for the first time in years...{line_break}Did you feel that earthquake?{page_break}If that's what happens when{line_break}the lighthouses shine, I wish{line_break}that it had stayed dark!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11097"
msgstr "They look like they're in{line_break}for some trouble. Oh well...{line_break}I ain't a'gonna help 'em.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11098"
msgstr "The prophecies are all coming{line_break}true... We're living in some{line_break}strange times, it seems.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11099"
msgstr "It's just like the legends said...{line_break}The ship in the geoglyphs has{line_break}finally come to Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11100"
msgstr "What does it mean, when{line_break}ancient legends are turning{line_break}out to be true?{page_break}I just want the world to go{line_break}back to the way it was before.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11101"
msgstr "I'm glad you kept your{line_break}promise, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11102"
msgstr "All right, let's hear what he{line_break}has to say for himself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11103"
msgstr "What can we say, {actor_name:1}?{line_break}Has {actor_name:5} ever harmed you?{line_break}Have we ever fought against you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11104"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}'s been avoiding you,{line_break}but he never had any intention{line_break}of fighting you or anything...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11105"
msgstr "And he definitely helped us out{line_break}back at Jupiter Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11106"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}'s been worrying about{line_break}{actor_name:6} nonstop since this{line_break}nightmare began!{page_break}How could she run away{line_break}from him like that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11107"
msgstr "She was afraid that if we{line_break}met, we would be forced to{line_break}fight... She didn't want that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11108"
msgstr "I know that, now... But it doesn't{line_break}explain why you're doing this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11109"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} betrayed his hometown,{line_break}Vale... That's why he hasn't been{line_break}able to face {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11110"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} had hoped to play{line_break}the villain alone, without getting{line_break}{actor_name:6} or me involved...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11111"
msgstr "He betrayed Vale? Kraden,{line_break}what are you talking about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11112"
msgstr "He conspired to steal the{line_break}Elemental Stars and fire the{line_break}beacons of the four lighthouses.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11113"
msgstr "That's what Saturos and Menardi{line_break}were trying to do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11114"
msgstr "Why were you helping them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11115"
msgstr "Our parents' lives were at{line_break}stake! We had to help!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11116"
msgstr "Parents? But...your parents died{line_break}three years ago, in that storm...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11117"
msgstr "That night, Saturos and his men{line_break}had raided Sol Sanctum... The{line_break}storm was their doing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11118"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}, you saw two{line_break}strangers that night°Saturos{line_break}and Menardi.{page_break}They were the only survivors{line_break}of Saturos's raiding party.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11119"
msgstr "They had failed to solve the{line_break}mystery of Sol Sanctum. In doing{line_break}so, they triggered the storm.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11120"
msgstr "Everyone thought that you{line_break}were killed by that boulder,{line_break}{actor_name:5}.{page_break}I can't tell you how glad I was{line_break}to find you were alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11121"
msgstr "In fact, nobody was killed{line_break}by the boulder that day!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11122"
msgstr "So that means...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11123"
msgstr "Wait a minute, Kraden...{line_break}Did you just say that {text_effect:2}nobody{reset_text_style}{line_break}was killed by that boulder?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11124"
msgstr "But what about {actor_name:1}'s dad?{line_break}And {actor_name:6} and {actor_name:5}'s parents?{line_break}I thought they'd died that day!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11125"
msgstr "I'm not so sure now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11126"
msgstr "Yes! If {actor_name:5} survived,{line_break}Kyle and the others may have{line_break}as well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11127"
msgstr "Why didn't you tell us? We{line_break}could have worked together to{line_break}save your parents, couldn't we?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11128"
msgstr "Except that we had only just{line_break}begun our journey, and we{line_break}simply weren't strong enough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11129"
msgstr "He's right. They were too{line_break}powerful then... It would have{line_break}been impossible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11130"
msgstr "There's more to it than that.{line_break}He had another reason to{line_break}light the lighthouse beacons.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11131"
msgstr "Unless the lighthouse beacons{line_break}are all lit, Weyard will eventually{line_break}be destroyed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11132"
msgstr "Destroyed?{line_break}But...how? Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11133"
msgstr "King Hydros, ruler of Lemuria,{line_break}says that our world is steadily{line_break}shrinking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11134"
msgstr "Elemental energy drives the{line_break}growth of civilization. Without{line_break}it, we and our world will wither.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11135"
msgstr "All that because the lighthouses{line_break}aren't illuminated?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11136"
msgstr "According to my research,{line_break}that seems to be the case.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11137"
msgstr "But...once the lighthouses{line_break}are all lit, you said the world{line_break}would end anyway!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11138"
msgstr "That...might be true, too... But{line_break}if we do nothing, the world{line_break}will definitely end.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11139"
msgstr "Wait for the end of the world{line_break}to come or wind up accidentally{line_break}triggering it ourselves...{page_break}What a choice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11140"
msgstr "Nothing is certain. There is{line_break}no way to prevent the world{line_break}from reaching its natural end.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11141"
msgstr "However, we can fight to save{line_break}the world from withering away{line_break}due to the actions of men.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11142"
msgstr "And, {actor_name:5}, you knew this?{line_break}You were helping them because{line_break}you knew what was happening?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11143"
msgstr "You're a lot smarter than{line_break}I remember you being...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11144"
msgstr "You just figured it out along{line_break}the way, huh? That's still{line_break}pretty darned smart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11145"
msgstr "Why did you wait so long{line_break}to tell me? I would have{line_break}helped you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11146"
msgstr "You wouldn't have done it{line_break}before, {actor_name:1}...{page_break}It would have meant violating{line_break}the sacred teachings of Vale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11147"
msgstr "Now that we know all of{line_break}this, shouldn't we be going?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11148"
msgstr "Hamma!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11149"
msgstr "Hello again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11150"
msgstr "Hamma! You...know {actor_name:1}?{line_break}And his companions, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11151"
msgstr "We met at the temple on the{line_break}edge of the Lamakan Desert..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11152"
msgstr "I'm Hamma, descendant{line_break}of the Anemos."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11153"
msgstr "I was born in Contigo, and{line_break}I inherited the power of{line_break}the Anemos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11154"
msgstr "Hey... We just got into Contigo,{line_break}and we found out this is where{line_break}{actor_name:3} was born!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11155"
msgstr "Yeah... We also learned{line_break}that he's got a sister!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11156"
msgstr "Sister... You don't mean...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11157"
msgstr "That would be me, yes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11158"
msgstr "Not now, {actor_name:3}...{line_break}This isn't the time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11159"
msgstr "Three lighthouses have been{line_break}lit... The elements have been{line_break}thrown out of balance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11160"
msgstr "Jupiter is growing stronger,{line_break}and the north grows colder{line_break}with every passing moment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11161"
msgstr "You must hurry to Mars{line_break}Lighthouse. Ignite its beacon,{line_break}before all of Weyard freezes...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11162"
msgstr "Mars Lighthouse? Agatio{line_break}has the Mars Star. He's{line_break}on his way to light it now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11163"
msgstr "I doubt they will be able to{line_break}light the Mars beacon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11164"
msgstr "Why's that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11165"
msgstr "There is a powerful force{line_break}that does not want to see{line_break}Mars rekindled.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11166"
msgstr "You will fail as well...unless{line_break}you pool your strengths{line_break}together and fight as one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11167"
msgstr "This is bad.{line_break}We have to go...now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11168"
msgstr "I had hoped that you{line_break}would feel that way...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11169"
msgstr "I've prepared a gift for you,{line_break}to aid you on your way to{line_break}Mars Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11170"
msgstr "I must leave you now, but{line_break}we will meet at the inlet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11171"
msgstr "I'm sorry we left Venus{line_break}Lighthouse without seeing you...{line_break}I'm sorry for making you worry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11172"
msgstr "Maybe when this is all over, we{line_break}can all go on a trip together.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11173"
msgstr "Hey, {actor_name:6}, you sure seem{line_break}calm, considering that we're{line_break}racing to meet our enemies...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11174"
msgstr "I'm just relieved that we've{line_break}sorted our differences...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11175"
msgstr "Me too, {actor_name:4}... We could{line_break}not have stood divided{line_break}against a common foe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11176"
msgstr "Yeah, I guess I'm a little{line_break}happy that we're not going{line_break}to have to beat {actor_name:5} up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11177"
msgstr "Listen, this is {actor_name:5}'s quest{line_break}now... We're just doing what{line_break}we can to help out...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11178"
msgstr "Aren't you happy?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11179"
msgstr "Everything's finally come{line_break}together... This is how it was{line_break}meant to be, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11180"
msgstr "Don't worry about the future,{line_break}{actor_name:5}... Enjoy this brief{line_break}moment's happiness.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11181"
msgstr "But Hamma's waiting for us.{line_break}Let's go to our ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11182"
msgstr "You have to hurry! I think{line_break}the ship from the geoglyphs{line_break}is going to take off soon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11183"
msgstr "First, the lighthouse is lit, and{line_break}now, we're going to see a{line_break}flying boat! It's like a festival!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11184"
msgstr "The boss said it was all right{line_break}for us to go to the inlet once{line_break}all the customers leave.{page_break}So hurry up and leave,{line_break}so we can go watch{line_break}the boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11185"
msgstr "They've finished putting the{line_break}wings on the boat, but I don't{line_break}see what the big deal is.{page_break}It's just a flying boat, for{line_break}crying out loud!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11186"
msgstr "Once all our customers{line_break}leave, I'm free to go. So{line_break}hurry up already!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11187"
msgstr "I can't believe it... All of the{line_break}hopes of the people of Atteka{line_break}have come true here, in Contigo!{page_break}It's like a miracle, a dream{line_break}come true! This calls for{line_break}a festival!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11188"
msgstr "All these years, I thought it was{line_break}just a children's story, but now{line_break}it's all coming true...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11189"
msgstr "It was kind of impressive{line_break}watching the procession{line_break}carrying those wings, though...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11190"
msgstr "A flying ship... Surely, it must{line_break}be a miracle. I'll have to{line_break}study this closely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11191"
msgstr "Perhaps if I see a miracle{line_break}with my own eyes, my faith{line_break}will be restored once more...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11192"
msgstr "Hamma returned to Contigo{line_break}after all these years... Right{line_break}when we finished the wings!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11193"
msgstr "Was your boat really the same{line_break}one in the geoglyph? What's{line_break}that all about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11194"
msgstr "Everyone's waiting down by{line_break}the beach.{page_break}They all want to see the boat{line_break}fly with their own eyes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11195"
msgstr "A massive rock blocked the{line_break}entrance to the inlet after the{line_break}lighthouse beacon was lit...{page_break}If that ship's ever going to{line_break}leave the inlet, it's gonna{line_break}have to fly to do it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11196"
msgstr "Where do you think you're going?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11197"
msgstr "We worked really hard{line_break}on that ship of yours!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11198"
msgstr "I want to see our handiwork{line_break}take flight. Don't you, buddy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11199"
msgstr "I want to!  Boy, do I want to!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11200"
msgstr "So hurry up!{line_break}We want to see the boat fly!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11201"
msgstr "Thanks, buddy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11202"
msgstr "The villagers are all waiting to{line_break}see the ship fly. So how's about{line_break}getting on with the flying!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11203"
msgstr "Hamma wouldn't let us get{line_break}any closer, so we're waiting{line_break}here to watch the ship leave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11204"
msgstr "When people work together,{line_break}even a little spiritual power{line_break}can work great wonders.{page_break}We sent everyone back to{line_break}the village so that their hopes{line_break}would not impair your flight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11205"
msgstr "We've been working forever{line_break}on getting these wings{line_break}onto the boat!{page_break}We're not used to working like{line_break}this... It's making me dizzy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11206"
msgstr "Who built the boat from the{line_break}geoglyph, anyway?{page_break}Is there another tribe that's{line_break}descended from the Anemos{line_break}besides our tribe in Contigo?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11207"
msgstr "Hamma is the new leader of{line_break}Contigo. She bears the powers{line_break}of the Anemos, after all.{page_break}But I still think she shouldn't{line_break}be ordering us to help fix{line_break}up your boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11208"
msgstr "If that boat's gonna get out{line_break}of the inlet, it's gonna have{line_break}to fly. I want to see that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11209"
msgstr "It's amazing to think that my{line_break}hard work is going to help{line_break}make that boat fly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11210"
msgstr "Hamma says that our own{line_break}hopes and dreams might{line_break}prevent the boat from flying.{page_break}It's as though, by wanting it{line_break}too much, we'll actually{line_break}prevent it from happening.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11211"
msgstr "We can't get too close to{line_break}the boat, or it might not fly...{page_break}We've just got to have{line_break}everyone watch from afar.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11212"
msgstr "It's almost time... Time to{line_break}watch a legend become reality!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11213"
msgstr "If everyone will just obey{line_break}Hamma's request, the ship{line_break}will surely fly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11214"
msgstr "When the winged ship of Anemos{line_break}flies once again, the whole land{line_break}shall be made free...{page_break}That's what the legend says,{line_break}anyway... But what land needs{line_break}freeing? We seem free enough...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11215"
msgstr "Once you remove the stone{line_break}anchors weighing the ship{line_break}down, it should fly...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11216"
msgstr "The day has finally come that{line_break}the ship will fly on the Wings{line_break}of Anemos...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11217"
msgstr "The Anemos were powerful,{line_break}sure, but can their power really{line_break}make a great ship fly?{page_break}No... No, I must not doubt...{line_break}I must have faith that it will{line_break}fly. It is meant to be.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11218"
msgstr "These warriors will know what{line_break}to do... They'll know how to{line_break}save the land...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11219"
msgstr "I hear that the warriors brought{line_break}the Hover Jade back with them...{page_break}Now, that's something that I'd{line_break}really like to see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11220"
msgstr "I've been waiting for you,{line_break}{actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11221"
msgstr "Take a look at your ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11222"
msgstr "Now that you have been given{line_break}wings, all obstacles in your{line_break}path will vanish forever...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11223"
msgstr "However, it is not the wings{line_break}alone that grant your ship{line_break}the power of flight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11224"
msgstr "Psynergy is the force that{line_break}powers the Wings of Anemos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11225"
msgstr "If the ship is to fly, you{line_break}will need to focus the{line_break}power of your minds...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11226"
msgstr "You have visited Shaman{line_break}Village recently, have you not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11227"
msgstr "Now is the time to make{line_break}use of the powers you{line_break}acquired there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11228"
msgstr "Now... Use the power of{line_break}Hover to raise your ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11229"
msgstr "At first, you may not want to{line_break}move your ship too high or{line_break}too far...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11230"
msgstr "It will be difficult at first, but{line_break}that is to be expected... After{line_break}all, this is your first flight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11231"
msgstr "But your quest should not{line_break}demand much more of you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11232"
msgstr "Now, be confident{line_break}and set sail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11233"
msgstr "All of Contigo is watching...{line_break}Show them your power, and{line_break}make your vessel fly!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11234"
msgstr "Use your Psynergy to raise{line_break}your ship and fly over reefs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11235"
msgstr "Travel safely, {actor_name:3}...{line_break}The world depends on you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11236"
msgstr "I got stuck doing chores at{line_break}home, and I had to miss{line_break}watching the ship take off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11237"
msgstr "Everyone's been going on{line_break}about how amazing it was{line_break}to watch the ship fly...{page_break}I wish I could have been{line_break}there to see it. I guess it{line_break}was pretty moving.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11238"
msgstr "It must be so exciting to{line_break}travel around the world{line_break}in a flying ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11239"
msgstr "Hamma was telling us that the{line_break}world is a dangerous place.{line_break}I wonder what she meant.{page_break}I think she's concerned about{line_break}the elemental balance...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11240"
msgstr "I saw the ship fly!{line_break}Now I want to see what it{line_break}looks like from on board!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11241"
msgstr "It wasn't what I expected,{line_break}but seeing the ship take{line_break}off was still amazing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11242"
msgstr "I didn't get to see the ship{line_break}take off, but I'm not really{line_break}all that disappointed.{page_break}I heard that it wasn't{line_break}that impressive anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11243"
msgstr "Some people were talking{line_break}about how the ship wasn't{line_break}really that impressive.{page_break}Why would they say that?{line_break}A ship actually flew{line_break}through the air!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11244"
msgstr "I couldn't fly in the air,{line_break}that's for sure. I get motion{line_break}sickness just walking around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11245"
msgstr "I heard that the world could{line_break}freeze over soon... I hope{line_break}{actor_name:3} does what he needs to.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11246"
msgstr "The ship looked like it{line_break}had a few problems trying{line_break}to get off the ground.{page_break}I guess it was because{line_break}the crew had never made{line_break}a ship fly before.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11247"
msgstr "All of those legends did{line_break}nothing but build up people's{line_break}expectations.{page_break}I'm just glad to know that{line_break}the ship flew at all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11248"
msgstr "I guess the lighthouse was{line_break}lit because {actor_name:3} and Hamma{line_break}finally returned to Contigo.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11249"
msgstr "{actor_name:3} doesn't remember{line_break}his mother, because he was{line_break}taken away at such an early age.{page_break}But I saw her eyes the day he{line_break}went away. Tears welled up,{line_break}and she couldn't stop crying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11250"
msgstr "From the look on {actor_name:3}'s{line_break}face, whatever happened at the{line_break}lighthouse must have been bad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11251"
msgstr "Hamma will stay with us, but{line_break}{actor_name:3} is leaving again.{page_break}The power of Anemos must{line_break}be a terrible responsibility{line_break}for such a young boy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11252"
msgstr "I wonder how {actor_name:3} feels{line_break}now that he knows what{line_break}happened to his mother.{page_break}Hamma seems so closed up...{line_break}I wonder if she'll talk to him{line_break}about it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11253"
msgstr "Someday, I'm gonna fight {actor_name:3},{line_break}and then I'll be the legendary{line_break}hero of Contigo!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11254"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Brrr...Brrr... It's been really{line_break}cold since the lighthouse{line_break}beacon was lit!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11255"
msgstr "Winter just ended, but{line_break}it keeps getting colder.{line_break}What's going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11256"
msgstr "Jupiter Lighthouse has been{line_break}called the beacon of wind... Is{line_break}that why it's so windy and cold?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11257"
msgstr "Hamma says that if {actor_name:3}{line_break}fails, it will continue to get{line_break}colder and colder.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11258"
msgstr "The lighthouse has been lit,{line_break}and we've made a ship fly...{line_break}Our legends are coming to life!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11259"
msgstr "It's up to the people of{line_break}Contigo to live up to{line_break}our own legends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11260"
msgstr "Mom and Dad have been{line_break}walking around in a daze{line_break}since the ship took off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11261"
msgstr "The baby's forehead is{line_break}furrowed, like it's thinking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11262"
msgstr "Goo goo. Gaa gaa... Waaa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11263"
msgstr "Drafts! I hate drafts! This{line_break}stupid house is always cold!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11264"
msgstr "Now that we've finished the{line_break}wings, we should fix the house.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11265"
msgstr "{actor_name:3} has the power of{line_break}prophecy, but I'll bet he didn't{line_break}see this coming!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11266"
msgstr "Now that I think about it,{line_break}this very day will probably{line_break}become a legend, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11267"
msgstr "It's time to fix those drafts{line_break}now that the wings are done!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11268"
msgstr "Goo... It's getting colder...{line_break}Gagoo... I want a blanket...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11269"
msgstr "Ah, you've returned! What{line_break}brings you to my new home?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11270"
msgstr "Hamma...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11271"
msgstr "You're my sister... Why didn't{line_break}you tell me sooner? Why didn't{line_break}you tell me when we first met?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11272"
msgstr "You play an important role in{line_break}all this. If I'd told you, you{line_break}would have come here too soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11273"
msgstr "This place is so familiar...{line_break}I feel like I've lived here{line_break}my whole life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11274"
msgstr "Look at me, {actor_name:3}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11275"
msgstr "You're too sentimental.{page_break}You would have given up your{line_break}quest to find your true home,{line_break}and we would all now be lost.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11276"
msgstr "What are you saying, sister?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11277"
msgstr "No, not sister... Do not think of{line_break}me as your sister until you{line_break}have fulfilled your destiny.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11278"
msgstr "W-Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11279"
msgstr "Our world is falling{line_break}into ruin...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11280"
msgstr "What? Hamma, what do you{line_break}mean? What's happening?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11281"
msgstr "Look, I don't want to interrupt{line_break}your reunion or anything, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11282"
msgstr "I couldn't help overhearing{line_break}you say something about the{line_break}world falling apart. What's up?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11283"
msgstr "Our world requires a delicate{line_break}balance of elemental forces.{line_break}That balance has been disturbed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11284"
msgstr "Without that balance, one{line_break}element might be lost beneath{line_break}the others, straining Weyard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11285"
msgstr "You're talking about{line_break}Mars Lighthouse, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11286"
msgstr "Isn't Agatio taking care of{line_break}Mars Lighthouse? Everything{line_break}should be fine soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11287"
msgstr "Agatio will not light{line_break}Mars Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11288"
msgstr "You don't think he can do it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11289"
msgstr "No. A great power stands{line_break}ready to oppose them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11290"
msgstr "They lack the power to{line_break}resist that force, and they{line_break}will fall before it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11291"
msgstr "But what will happen if{line_break}Mars Lighthouse isn't lit{line_break}quickly enough?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11292"
msgstr "Our world will be plunged{line_break}into ice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11293"
msgstr "But what would make{line_break}that happen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11294"
msgstr "Even I do not know the{line_break}answer to that question.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11295"
msgstr "Ah... Yes, given the way that{line_break}the elements interact, I see...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11296"
msgstr "Kraden, you understand?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11297"
msgstr "Well, I'm only guessing...{line_break}But I think it's a good guess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11298"
msgstr "Quit fooling around and{line_break}tell me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11299"
msgstr "The earth is nurturing and{line_break}warm. Many creatures are{line_break}reared in this warmth, you see?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11300"
msgstr "I follow you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11301"
msgstr "It's OK, {actor_name:5}... I don't{line_break}really get it either, but let's{line_break}see where he's taking this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11302"
msgstr "Now, think about the ocean.{line_break}It is a cold place, is it not?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11303"
msgstr "Yeah, it is awfully cold...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11304"
msgstr "I don't know what point he's{line_break}trying to make, but I have to{line_break}agree that the ocean's cold...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11305"
msgstr "Both lighthouses were lit,{line_break}and a balance was reached.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11306"
msgstr "But with only the lighthouse{line_break}of wind lit, the balance has{line_break}been disturbed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11307"
msgstr "I get it... Wind cools things down,{line_break}but it can't heat them up...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11308"
msgstr "When you burn your hand on{line_break}something hot, you blow on{line_break}it to cool it off, don't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11309"
msgstr "Right, yeah... I've always done{line_break}that without thinking about{line_break}it, but it makes sense, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11310"
msgstr "When Mercury Lighthouse was{line_break}lit, this didn't happen, though.{line_break}I wonder why...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11311"
msgstr "Water cannot cool things{line_break}as swiftly as wind, perhaps.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11312"
msgstr "Or maybe the combined power{line_break}of water and wind is cooling{line_break}things down even faster...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11313"
msgstr "If what Hamma's saying is{line_break}true, we'd better get moving{line_break}again, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11314"
msgstr "I got too worked up about{line_break}seeing my sister... Sorry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11315"
msgstr "It's all right. I'm happy that{line_break}you cared so much...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11316"
msgstr "All right, {actor_name:5}! Let's head{line_break}to Mars Lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11317"
msgstr "No matter what happens, you{line_break}must light the beacon on{line_break}Mars Lighthouse!{page_break}I hope for your safe return.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11318"
msgstr "My heart is with you always,{line_break}{actor_name:3}. Never forget that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11319"
msgstr "A cannon? Yeah, I think I heard{line_break}something about a town up in{line_break}western Angara having one...{page_break}A shot fired from that cannon{line_break}can apparently break even the{line_break}biggest blocks of ice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11320"
msgstr "I'd sure like to see the cannon{line_break}someday. It sounds like a{line_break}powerful weapon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11321"
msgstr "Now that the wings are finished,{line_break}I doubt anyone will be buying{line_break}any more armor from me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11322"
msgstr "Well, if there aren't going to be{line_break}any customers for a while, maybe{line_break}I'll finally take that vacation.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11323"
msgstr "It's always such a letdown when{line_break}you finish off a major task like{line_break}fulfilling an ancient prophecy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11324"
msgstr "Now that the wings are done,{line_break}everyone who came to help out{line_break}has left the village... {end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11325"
msgstr "All of our work and all of our{line_break}celebration are finally at an end.{page_break}I think Contigo is going to go{line_break}back to being a very quiet place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11326"
msgstr "The inn has become so lonely{line_break}now that everyone's gone{line_break}home.{page_break}We should have an annual{line_break}festival in Contigo to{line_break}commemorate this day!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11327"
msgstr "Gosh... We were so busy,{line_break}and now we're totally empty.{line_break}I don't know what to do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11328"
msgstr "Now's my chance to experiment{line_break}with some exciting new dishes!{line_break}What should I make first...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11329"
msgstr "It's going to be a little slow{line_break}for a while, but I can't really{line_break}complain, now, can I?{page_break}After all, I saw the lighthouse{line_break}shining again, and I actually{line_break}saw a flying ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11330"
msgstr "The inn is bound to be slow{line_break}for a little while, but business{line_break}will pick up again.{page_break}Everyone who witnessed the{line_break}events of the past few days{line_break}will want to come back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11331"
msgstr "What are we going to do?{line_break}All the excitement is over,{line_break}and I'm going to be bored!{page_break}I was starting to like all the{line_break}attention I was getting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11332"
msgstr "Seeing that ship take flight{line_break}was the most moving thing{line_break}I've ever seen...{page_break}I think I'll have to preserve{line_break}it for future generations...{line_break}in cake form!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11333"
msgstr "It was a miracle that made{line_break}all of the legends of the{line_break}Anemos come true...{page_break}I'm not entirely sure,{line_break}but I think my faith{line_break}has been restored!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11334"
msgstr "It was a shock to see{line_break}such a huge ship float.{page_break}It made me realize how{line_break}small we all truly are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11335"
msgstr "I can't believe that a ship{line_break}just like the one in the{line_break}geoglyph actually exists.{page_break}And I think everyone's proud{line_break}to have helped to make the{line_break}legends come true!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11336"
msgstr "That flying ship looked so{line_break}fake... It didn't look anything{line_break}like I'd imagined it would.{page_break}Nobody else was complaining,{line_break}but they don't pay attention{line_break}to the details, like I do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11337"
msgstr "Look closely at the{line_break}geoglyph. Study it,{line_break}examine its details...{page_break}The more you stare at it,{line_break}the more you recognize the{line_break}greatness of the Anemos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11338"
msgstr "I'm convinced there's something{line_break}hidden in the Sanctum.{page_break}I just know it says something{line_break}about it on the wall.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11339"
msgstr "All the amazing things we've{line_break}seen and done, all the legends{line_break}that have come true...{page_break}And I still can't get into{line_break}the secret chambers of{line_break}the Anemos Sanctum!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11340"
msgstr "He's an odd boy, but I'm glad{line_break}that {actor_name:3} has returned{line_break}to Contigo at last...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11341"
msgstr "We all came together and{line_break}worked to make the legends{line_break}come true...{page_break}It's really inspiring... Actually,{line_break}it gives me goosebumps...{line_break}{text_effect:4}Brrrr...{reset_text_style}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11342"
msgstr "All right, so we've followed{line_break}the instructions on the wall,{line_break}and we {text_effect:2}still{reset_text_style} can't get in!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11343"
msgstr "If you tap on the floor or{line_break}walls, you can hear a hollow{line_break}sort of sound.{page_break}I'm convinced that there's{line_break}nothing on the other side!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11344"
msgstr "{actor_name:3} was supposed to be{line_break}a great, manly hero... I guess not{line_break}all the legends came true...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11345"
msgstr "I've been watching the skies,{line_break}hoping I could catch another{line_break}glimpse of the flying ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11346"
msgstr "I wonder what's on the other{line_break}side of the ocean... I should be{line_break}happy where I am, but...{page_break}Whenever I think about that{line_break}flying ship, I want to leave{line_break}home, to explore the world!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11347"
msgstr "All of our myths and legends{line_break}have taught us that the sea{line_break}is a dangerous, fearsome power.{page_break}But on the day the ship{line_break}left, the sea was so calm{line_break}and romantic looking...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11348"
msgstr "You're going north? I hear it's{line_break}always winter in the lands{line_break}to the north, so bundle up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11349"
msgstr "Whenever I look at the sky,{line_break}I think about that flying ship,{line_break}and I want to travel the world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11350"
msgstr "I wish I could travel to the{line_break}end of the sea on that{line_break}beautiful flying ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11351"
msgstr "Everyone in Contigo used{line_break}to be afraid of the ocean.{page_break}But now, everyone who saw the{line_break}ship take off sees the sea{line_break}filled with wonder and romance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11352"
msgstr "I've decided to become...{line_break}an adventurer!{page_break}One day, when {actor_name:3} and his{line_break}companions return, I will join{line_break}them on their amazing ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11353"
msgstr "The legends tell us that a{line_break}great calamity brought an{line_break}end to the Anemos...{page_break}It had something to do with{line_break}the light from the lighthouses{line_break}being extinguished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11354"
msgstr "That crater behind the village{line_break}is supposed to be where the{line_break}city of the Anemos was.{page_break}The legend says that, one day,{line_break}it just lifted off the ground and{line_break}flew away!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11355"
msgstr "The ancient city of the Anemos{line_break}was located right near the ruins.{page_break}That crater nearby is where{line_break}the city once was.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11356"
msgstr "Cities flying up into the{line_break}sky? I don't buy that for{line_break}a second!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11357"
msgstr "If a ship can rise up from{line_break}the sea, why can't a city{line_break}rise up from the ground?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11358"
msgstr "I've seen a lot of weird{line_break}things lately... Maybe I ought{line_break}to listen to those legends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11359"
msgstr "The city of the Anemos rose up{line_break}into the sky and became what{line_break}we now call the Moon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11360"
msgstr "Wait... The city of Anemos{line_break}flew up into the sky?{page_break}All right, that's just stupid!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11361"
msgstr "We did it! The ship took{line_break}off without a hitch!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11362"
msgstr "Yeah, but...shouldn't it be{line_break}flying a little higher than this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11363"
msgstr "Hamma told us that we wouldn't{line_break}be able to fly very high until we{line_break}were more familiar with Hover.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11364"
msgstr "Let's see how far we{line_break}can take this thing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11365"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}, what's wrong? You{line_break}don't look happy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11366"
msgstr "Do you remember on Idejima,{line_break}when I told you I had my own{line_break}reasons for joining your quest?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11367"
msgstr "You were so secretive!{line_break}Are you going to tell us now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11368"
msgstr "... ...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11369"
msgstr "You've gone quiet again...{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}It's OK... You don't have to{line_break}tell us if you're not ready yet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11370"
msgstr "I thought that if I went to{line_break}Jupiter Lighthouse, I would{line_break}learn who I was...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11371"
msgstr "I remember the people of{line_break}Lalivero talking about how{line_break}{actor_name:7} fell from the sky...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11372"
msgstr "All my life, I've been looking{line_break}for the answer... Where was I{line_break}born, and why was I abandoned?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11373"
msgstr "You knew {actor_name:5} was going to{line_break}Jupiter Lighthouse eventually,{line_break}and so you went along with him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11374"
msgstr "But you didn't find any answers,{line_break}did you, {actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11375"
msgstr "I'm sorry, {actor_name:7}... I was so{line_break}excited to find Contigo that I{line_break}didn't consider your feelings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11376"
msgstr "What? Why is everyone so{line_break}down all of a sudden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11377"
msgstr "... ...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11378"
msgstr "Faran raised {actor_name:7} like his own{line_break}daughter. He's cared for her{line_break}ever since he first found her!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11379"
msgstr "Yes, that's true, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11380"
msgstr "But you can never be his{line_break}real daughter, is that it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11381"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}! You don't have to{line_break}be so blunt about it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11382"
msgstr "No, he's right... I'd want to know{line_break}my real parents, no matter how{line_break}caring Faran might have been.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11383"
msgstr "You think so? If it were me, I{line_break}doubt it'd bother me at all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11384"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}, you may not know this,{line_break}but you and I are very similar...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11385"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11386"
msgstr "Well, it's not exactly the{line_break}same situation, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11387"
msgstr "I was born in a poor village. My{line_break}memories are hazy, but I still{line_break}remember it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11388"
msgstr "I was only four when Babi{line_break}took me under his wing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11389"
msgstr "You see, even though I was{line_break}young, I was quite intelligent.{line_break}Babi had heard about me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11390"
msgstr "And Babi took you to Tolbi{line_break}to further your education, to{line_break}raise you as a scholar...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11391"
msgstr "I was separated from my parents{line_break}so early in life... I've never known{line_break}the comforts of a true home.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11392"
msgstr "Faran has always been like{line_break}a father to me... I must have{line_break}been very lucky.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11393"
msgstr "I should say so.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11394"
msgstr "Thank you, Kraden...{line_break}I feel better now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11395"
msgstr "I'm glad I could help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11396"
msgstr "Well, we should be going...{line_break}Let's hurry on, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11397"
msgstr "Hey, wait!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11398"
msgstr "Master Hammet requested that{line_break}I deliver this to {actor_name:1}, and{line_break}I totally forgot about it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11399"
msgstr "Well, you'd better hurry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11400"
msgstr "I'm supposed to deliver this{line_break}to {actor_name:1}... It's not too late, is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11401"
msgstr "On my way here, I stopped in{line_break}Kalay briefly to speak with{line_break}Master Hammet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11402"
msgstr "He was quite upset that you{line_break}hadn't returned to visit him{line_break}so that he could thank you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11403"
msgstr "So he requested that I take{line_break}this with me to Atteka.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11404"
msgstr "It is a gift of thanks from{line_break}Master Hammet. Take it, please.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11405"
msgstr "Welcome to Loho! We've been{line_break}excavating all sorts of ores{line_break}to get the metals inside!{page_break}The metal used to make the{line_break}ancient ruins might have come{line_break}from these very rocks!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11406"
msgstr "We have a lot of important{line_break}excavations going on, but{line_break}we're also doing some mining.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11407"
msgstr "Some of the miners found an{line_break}ancient cannon when they{line_break}were digging a while back.{page_break}If you want to see it, it's{line_break}over by the wall near the{line_break}ruins.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11408"
msgstr "That wall seems indestructible!{line_break}We've been trying to dig{line_break}through it for a while now.{page_break}We're pretty sure there are{line_break}some valuable metals and{line_break}minerals on the other side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11409"
msgstr "We only settled here a short{line_break}while ago, and we found all{line_break}those ruins here...{page_break}We named our settlement{line_break}Loho, but I've been wondering{line_break}what it used to be called...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11410"
msgstr "Everyone in Loho sure loves{line_break}digging. It's not all mining...{line_break}We're interested in history, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11411"
msgstr "All we need is a way to use{line_break}the cannon to knock down the{line_break}wall... That would be great.{page_break}Then, we could get rid of the{line_break}cannon altogether. We don't{line_break}have any use for weapons here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11412"
msgstr "If we can't get through that{line_break}wall, we'll never know what's{line_break}on the other side...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11413"
msgstr "Once we can get through the{line_break}wall, there will be enough{line_break}work for everyone in town!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11414"
msgstr "If you want to be a miner,{line_break}you have to know the earth...{line_break}You have to know where to dig.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11415"
msgstr "This is the spot. A good hole{line_break}here, and you'll dig up some{line_break}fantastic ore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11416"
msgstr "I haven't found anything worth{line_break}the trouble of digging up. It's{line_break}time to find another spot.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11417"
msgstr "If you live in Loho and you{line_break}don't dig, you're not one of{line_break}us... You don't belong.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11418"
msgstr "Real experts can find the best{line_break}spots to dig in a single glance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11419"
msgstr "Once you've been mining for{line_break}a while, it's like the ground says{line_break}to you, \"Hey! Hey, you! Dig here!\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11420"
msgstr "I think I'm starting to lose{line_break}my touch... None of my digs{line_break}has produced anything at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11421"
msgstr "Commerce really took off{line_break}when we started this mining{line_break}colony in Loho.{page_break}You just have to know how{line_break}to make the most out of{line_break}what's around you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11422"
msgstr "Whenever someone strikes{line_break}gold, we get a rush of visitors,{line_break}and business just takes off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11423"
msgstr "If you're only here for{line_break}the cannon, you can{line_break}forget about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11424"
msgstr "If the cannon is truly as{line_break}powerful as the people say,{line_break}we can't just give it away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11425"
msgstr "We brought the cannon up here{line_break}to break down the old wall, but{line_break}we don't have any ammunition...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11426"
msgstr "You can put metal balls in{line_break}the barrel, but what makes{line_break}them come out again?{page_break}It looks a little like an old{line_break}ballista, but the way it works{line_break}is totally different.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11427"
msgstr "Did you want this cannon?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11428"
msgstr "Well, if you can figure out{line_break}a way to break down this{line_break}wall, it's all yours.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11429"
msgstr "All we really want to do is{line_break}break down that wall right{line_break}there...{page_break}If we can find someone to do{line_break}that, we'll give 'im the cannon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11430"
msgstr "Cannons are so heavy! Why did{line_break}we bring it up here if we're not{line_break}going to use it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11431"
msgstr "What idiot said that we'd be{line_break}able to destroy that wall if{line_break}we dragged the cannon up here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11432"
msgstr "All right, we figured out that{line_break}you need to put a steel ball in{line_break}there, but what do you do then?{page_break}You can stick a ball in there{line_break}just fine, but I don't think it'll{line_break}be coming out on its own...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11433"
msgstr "It looks like it's empty.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11434"
msgstr "This can't be used as{line_break}a cannonball.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11435"
msgstr "Is everyone all right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11436"
msgstr "Did you hear that? That{line_break}sound was incredible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11437"
msgstr "What do you think you're{line_break}doing, making all that noise?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11438"
msgstr "Hey, look at that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11439"
msgstr "What are you looking at?{line_break}It wasn't me! It was the wall!{line_break}Look at the wall!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11440"
msgstr "The wall... It's gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11441"
msgstr "Well, it's mostly gone, yeah...{line_break}You can get through to the{line_break}other side now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11442"
msgstr "How did you manage to{line_break}break down the wall?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11443"
msgstr "Ah, never mind... What's important{line_break}here is that we can dig on{line_break}the other side of the wall now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11444"
msgstr "Yeah, who cares how it{line_break}happened? We can dig again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11445"
msgstr "Well, you did what we asked,{line_break}so the cannon's all yours!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11446"
msgstr "Hmmm... It's gonna be tough{line_break}carrying that thing around...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11447"
msgstr "Those guys are new in town, aren't{line_break}they? Do you think they came{line_break}from Atteka or Hesperia?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11448"
msgstr "I don't know, but I can tell{line_break}you they came by boat...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11449"
msgstr "Yeah, I saw one anchored{line_break}off the beach!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11450"
msgstr "That boat's yours, isn't it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11451"
msgstr "Well, why don't you let us{line_break}get that cannon onto your{line_break}boat for you, hm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11452"
msgstr "Look, the only way to get{line_break}here is by boat, and I see{line_break}a boat right there!{page_break}Don't tell me it's not yours!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11453"
msgstr "I don't know why I'm offering,{line_break}but why don't you let us put{line_break}it aboard your boat for you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11454"
msgstr "Was that you that fired{line_break}the cannon earlier?{page_break}If you know how to use{line_break}the cannon, you'll be able{line_break}to sail in the Northern Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11455"
msgstr "That cannon sure gives off{line_break}a serious bang! Everyone in{line_break}Loho was totally shocked!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11456"
msgstr "When we found that cannon{line_break}at the dig, I thought it was{line_break}just useless junk.{page_break}If you know how to use{line_break}it, it can be a pretty{line_break}potent tool!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11457"
msgstr "Now that the wall's been{line_break}breached, we can get on{line_break}with the mining! Good work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11458"
msgstr "That cannon can shatter any{line_break}of the ice floes that keep the{line_break}ships from trying to sail north.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11459"
msgstr "That cannon was really{line_break}loud... Imagine if you were{line_break}standing right next to it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11460"
msgstr "I don't think we should have{line_break}given the cannon away. We{line_break}should have sold it to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11461"
msgstr "We don't have anything to worry{line_break}about, now that we can start{line_break}mining in the ruins...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11462"
msgstr "I've gotta go stake myself{line_break}a claim on the other side{line_break}of the wall!{page_break}We've found some valuable{line_break}metals out here; think what{line_break}we'll find inside!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11463"
msgstr "You probably only want the{line_break}cannon so that you can force{line_break}other people to obey your will.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11464"
msgstr "Ah, so you have a quest to{line_break}fulfill, do you? I guess that{line_break}means you're leaving soon.{page_break}When I was your age,{line_break}I used to love the life{line_break}of danger and adventure.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11465"
msgstr "I think we've dug up all{line_break}that there is out here.{page_break}I'm going to find myself{line_break}a new spot inside the wall.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11466"
msgstr "Thanks for opening up{line_break}the wall... There are some{line_break}great places to dig out here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11467"
msgstr "I keep digging up little, tiny{line_break}gems and metals... But when I{line_break}get enough, I'll be rich!{page_break}After all, when you pile up{line_break}enough dirt, you eventually{line_break}make a mighty mountain!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11468"
msgstr "Ha ha ha! I've got this giddy{line_break}feeling, like I'm going to dig{line_break}up a mountain of money!{page_break}Whenever I get this feeling,{line_break}I always dig out a fortune!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11469"
msgstr "I just need to stick to this{line_break}one spot. Eventually, I'll{line_break}dig up something valuable!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11470"
msgstr "These guys must be really{line_break}busy, sailing around all over{line_break}the world like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11471"
msgstr "When they get wherever they're{line_break}going, they'll tell the world{line_break}that Loho's got the best metal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11472"
msgstr "Even at my age, I just{line_break}love the feel of digging{line_break}into the earth.{page_break}Still, when you're not digging{line_break}up anything good, you start{line_break}to feel a little frustrated.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11473"
msgstr "I only just started digging,{line_break}and I'm already wealthy{line_break}beyond my wildest dreams!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11474"
msgstr "I've hit the mother lode!{line_break}I keep on digging, and I{line_break}keep getting more and more!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11475"
msgstr "It doesn't matter how old{line_break}you get... Nothing beats the{line_break}feeling of digging a new mine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11476"
msgstr "I hear you took our cannon{line_break}in exchange for knocking{line_break}down that ancient wall.{page_break}I'll be sorry to see it go...{line_break}That cannon was going{line_break}to make Loho famous.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11477"
msgstr "Now, we don't have a symbol{line_break}anymore... We just have a{line_break}town full of holes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11478"
msgstr "You've acquired a splendid{line_break}cannon. Just be sure that{line_break}you use it wisely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11479"
msgstr "It worries me to no end,{line_break}thinking of the evils one{line_break}could do with that cannon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11480"
msgstr "You don't have anything to{line_break}worry about. We got the cannon{line_break}onto your ship with no problems.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11481"
msgstr "Now, we're going to start{line_break}excavating the ground north of{line_break}the wall you knocked a hole in.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11482"
msgstr "I saw some of the village{line_break}men carrying the cannon{line_break}out of town...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11483"
msgstr "I don't know where they were{line_break}taking it, but I'm glad the{line_break}cannon's gone...{page_break}I think they just wanted to{line_break}make some room for us to{line_break}begin mining again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11484"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} checked the sign{page_break}It reads \"People staying at{line_break}the inn can check in at the{line_break}counter.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11485"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! Welcome back to{line_break}Prox! It looks like only Mars{line_break}Lighthouse still needs lighting...{page_break}Agatio didn't think you'd be{line_break}coming back here, so I'm a{line_break}little surprised to see you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11486"
msgstr "Agatio and Karst left for{line_break}Mars Lighthouse a little{line_break}while ago...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11487"
msgstr "I'm glad you made it back{line_break}safely... The ice is making it very{line_break}difficult for anyone to sail here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11488"
msgstr "We're used to the cold up{line_break}here in Prox, but lately, it{line_break}seems to be getting worse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11489"
msgstr "I've been keeping a close{line_break}eye on the northern skies...{page_break}Once I see a bright flash in{line_break}the distance, I'll know the{line_break}last beacon has been lit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11490"
msgstr "Have you seen Saturos or{line_break}Menardi? People have been{line_break}saying that they were killed...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11491"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, you're back? And you{line_break}learned how to use Psynergy?{page_break}I can sense the power{line_break}inside of you... It's strong!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11492"
msgstr "Once the final lighthouse is lit,{line_break}the winds should weaken. They{line_break}keep getting stronger, though!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11493"
msgstr "Agatio and Karst told me that{line_break}{actor_name:5} ran away because{line_break}their quest was too dangerous.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11494"
msgstr "Agatio and Karst are the{line_break}strongest fighters in Prox...{line_break}That's why we sent them.{page_break}But I'm worried... They've been{line_break}gone for a while now, and the{line_break}lighthouse still remains dark.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11495"
msgstr "Ever since Agatio returned from{line_break}Jupiter Lighthouse, the winds{line_break}have been stronger than ever...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11496"
msgstr "It gets cold around here, but{line_break}this is the first time I've ever{line_break}seen snow pile up on the river.{page_break}What if Agatio doesn't reach{line_break}Mars Lighthouse in time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11497"
msgstr "Everything is supposed to{line_break}return to normal once Mars{line_break}Lighthouse is lit again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11498"
msgstr "I can't believe anyone could{line_break}have beaten Saturos and{line_break}Menardi...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11499"
msgstr "If {actor_name:5} could become an{line_break}Adept so quickly, so can I!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11500"
msgstr "If this weather continues much{line_break}longer, we'll all be buried under{line_break}snow in no time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11501"
msgstr "The rift at Mars Lighthouse{line_break}gets wider every day.{page_break}If we don't find a way to{line_break}stop it, I think it's going to{line_break}devour Prox entirely!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11502"
msgstr "Our chieftain told me that the{line_break}rift is growing larger by the day,{line_break}just like Gaia Falls is.{page_break}We'd better light the Mars{line_break}beacon soon, or Prox is{line_break}finished...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11503"
msgstr "Not too long ago, I climbed{line_break}the mountains to the north to{line_break}look at the rift. It was huge!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11504"
msgstr "I thought Prox would be here{line_break}forever, but now, it looks like{line_break}it might be destroyed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11505"
msgstr "Nobody believed that the rift{line_break}would go as far south as{line_break}Prox...{page_break}They all thought Puelle was{line_break}being melodramatic... But no{line_break}one thinks that anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11506"
msgstr "The northern rift has gotten{line_break}so big that I couldn't see the{line_break}other side...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11507"
msgstr "Prox originally flourished{line_break}because concerned Adepts lit{line_break}the fires of the Mars Lighthouse.{page_break}Now, we, the people of the{line_break}northern flame, have been{line_break}forgotten by the outside world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11508"
msgstr "No one thought about our{line_break}needs when they extinguished{line_break}the great lighthouses...{page_break}Now, because of them, our{line_break}great land is dying, crumbling{line_break}away at the edges...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11509"
msgstr "If Mars Lighthouse's fires are{line_break}not rekindled, Prox will be{line_break}destroyed, but that's not all...{page_break}Eventually, Gaia Falls will{line_break}continue to erode, finally{line_break}devouring all of Weyard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11510"
msgstr "When the lighthouses were{line_break}all extinguished, every great{line_break}civilization faded away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11511"
msgstr "To think that we all once{line_break}had the power to control{line_break}nature... What fools we were.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11512"
msgstr "I think it's too late for us{line_break}already... But if they light the{line_break}fires, we'll be ready for them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11513"
msgstr "We sent emissaries to Vale{line_break}to tell them that Weyard{line_break}was dying.{page_break}But they wouldn't listen to us...{line_break}If only they had listened to us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11514"
msgstr "Vale's elders were stubborn...{line_break}They refused to listen to us,{line_break}and they drove us out by force.{page_break}We had gone in peace, hoping{line_break}to convince them of the plight{line_break}our world faces...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11515"
msgstr "At least the journey wasn't{line_break}for nothing. We learned that Sol{line_break}Sanctum held a hidden secret.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11516"
msgstr "Three years ago, we sent our{line_break}finest to Sol Sanctum. All but{line_break}two were killed in a trap.{page_break}The people of Vale couldn't{line_break}possibly understand how dire{line_break}our need was...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11517"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, you like igloos, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11518"
msgstr "You {text_effect:2}would{reset_text_style} say that...{line_break}You come from somewhere{line_break}warm and sunny!{page_break}We didn't have anything to{line_break}play with, so we just decided{line_break}to make this thing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11519"
msgstr "Well, if you don't like cold{line_break}things, you're in the wrong{line_break}place!{page_break}We just built this so that{line_break}we'd have something to{line_break}do to keep us warm...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11520"
msgstr "The wind is so cold and{line_break}bitter that we decided to{line_break}hide out inside our igloo...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11521"
msgstr "My parents told me that it{line_break}would do me good to get some{line_break}fresh air, but I'm freezing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11522"
msgstr "Those poor children. They{line_break}don't understand what's about{line_break}to happen to us...{page_break}I just want them to be happy{line_break}in the short time left to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11523"
msgstr "I hate igloos, but at least{line_break}it's protecting us from the{line_break}wind...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11524"
msgstr "Mama and Papa have been{line_break}acting really strange lately...{line_break}They seem so sad.{page_break}Whenever I ask them what's{line_break}wrong, they tell me to go{line_break}outside and play some more.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11525"
msgstr "I always catch a cold when I'm{line_break}outside in weather like this...{line_break}Does Mom want me to get sick?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11526"
msgstr "I can't bring myself to tell{line_break}them what's going to happen{line_break}to us...{pause_20_skippable} Oh, please, save us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11527"
msgstr "Puelle, our chieftain, grew{line_break}worried about Agatio and{line_break}Karst.{page_break}He's gone to the northern{line_break}edge of town to wait for them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11528"
msgstr "The people Saturos rescued{line_break}from the storm in Vale should{line_break}be waiting in their room.{page_break}Once Mars Lighthouse has{line_break}been lit, they'll be free to{line_break}return home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11529"
msgstr "Don't forget, {actor_name:5}, your{line_break}mother and father are staying{line_break}in the north end of Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11530"
msgstr "Now that Saturos and his{line_break}team are gone, Agatio is the{line_break}last of our warriors.{page_break}If something happens to{line_break}them, our final hope is lost.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11531"
msgstr "Mars is the last lighthouse{line_break}that needs to be rekindled.{page_break}Once that's been taken care{line_break}of, the people of Vale will be{line_break}set free.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11532"
msgstr "Saturos used {actor_name:5}'s parents{line_break}to force {actor_name:5} to follow him{line_break}on his mission.{page_break}We've fallen on hard times{line_break}when we need to coerce{line_break}people to join our cause.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11533"
msgstr "They're not here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11534"
msgstr "Strange... We looked all over{line_break}the village, and we can't find{line_break}any trace of them at all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11535"
msgstr "Everyone says they've{line_break}practically vanished without{line_break}a trace... It's so strange.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11536"
msgstr "You don't think they...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11537"
msgstr "They wouldn't have gone to{line_break}the lighthouse...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11538"
msgstr "Yeah, you're probably right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11539"
msgstr "Puelle's going to be upset{line_break}that we didn't follow his{line_break}order to free them, though.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11540"
msgstr "He was clear about it, too...{line_break}\"When {actor_name:5} returns to Prox,{line_break}set his parents free.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11541"
msgstr "Puelle ordered me to set{line_break}your parents free. That's{line_break}why I'm here now...{page_break}The only thing is, no one{line_break}else is here... I don't know{line_break}where your parents went!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11542"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} took the trouble of{line_break}coming back for his parents,{line_break}and now they're just gone?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11543"
msgstr "Puelle wanted to set {actor_name:5}'s{line_break}parents free before Prox{line_break}was destroyed...{page_break}But if we can't find them,{line_break}how can we set them free?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11544"
msgstr "I can't think of anywhere{line_break}else {actor_name:5}'s parents{line_break}might have gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11545"
msgstr "When you left Prox, you were{line_break}so young that you could barely{line_break}lift a sword!{page_break}Now, look at you! You could{line_break}handle any weapon with ease!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11546"
msgstr "You go away for a little{line_break}while, and you come back{line_break}a strong and mighty warrior!{page_break}I'm so proud of you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11547"
msgstr "What has he gone through{line_break}that he's become so strong{line_break}in such a short time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11548"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} looks so confident,{line_break}so bold... You can see it in{line_break}his eyes...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11549"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, your parents have{line_break}gone away... They were very{line_break}worried about you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11550"
msgstr "Your mother knows that you're{line_break}strong and healthy, so I'm sure{line_break}she's very relieved...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11551"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}'s parents{line_break}were worried about him when{line_break}they heard Saturos was dead.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11552"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}'s parents were{line_break}so worried about him that{line_break}they were wasting away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11553"
msgstr "I hear Agatio and Karst have{line_break}gone to Mars Lighthouse...{page_break}What if their actions only{line_break}cause more turmoil? How can{line_break}we be sure they're right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11554"
msgstr "These catastrophes are{line_break}the result of the lighthouse{line_break}beacons being rekindled.{page_break}This snow, this wind, it all{line_break}started after Jupiter{line_break}Lighthouse was lit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11555"
msgstr "We can't wait for Agatio{line_break}and his men any longer...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11556"
msgstr "If we wait much longer, this wind{line_break}and snow will make it impossible{line_break}to reach the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11557"
msgstr "I'm going to the lighthouse...{line_break}Will any of you come{line_break}with me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11558"
msgstr "Puelle, I can't let you{line_break}go on your own...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11559"
msgstr "If something were to{line_break}happen to you, who{line_break}would lead our village?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11560"
msgstr "Please, you must let us{line_break}go in your stead.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11561"
msgstr "How can you expect to{line_break}accomplish what Agatio{line_break}and Karst could not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11562"
msgstr "They may have been more{line_break}powerful than any of us, but{line_break}we can't just stand by!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11563"
msgstr "They're not coming back,{line_break}just like Saturos... You have{line_break}to let us try.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11564"
msgstr "I can't. I can't allow it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11565"
msgstr "Listen to your elder...{line_break}He speaks wisely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11566"
msgstr "I'm speaking to you too, Puelle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11567"
msgstr "If Agatio and Karst cannot{line_break}do the task, how can you, a{line_break}single man, hope to do it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11568"
msgstr "What are you saying?{line_break}If we stand around debating,{line_break}our town is doomed for certain!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11569"
msgstr "We can't risk sacrificing{line_break}any more lives.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11570"
msgstr "So, we must sit here and{line_break}wait for a miracle to come.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11571"
msgstr "Is that you, {actor_name:5}? When{line_break}did you return to Prox?{page_break}You should take your parents{line_break}back to Vale, so they can at{line_break}least die in their hometown.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11572"
msgstr "If we were better Adepts,{line_break}we could try to enter the{line_break}lighthouse ourselves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11573"
msgstr "I feel so helpless... Agatio has{line_break}not returned, and the lighthouse{line_break}beacon remains unlit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11574"
msgstr "All we can do now is wait{line_break}for Agatio and his men to{line_break}return...{page_break}But no honest soldier can{line_break}sit idly by while others do{line_break}all of the work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11575"
msgstr "Our Psynergy feels weak...{line_break}I can sense it inside me.{page_break}The water, earth, and wind{line_break}lighthouses have been lit,{line_break}and fire alone remains dark.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11576"
msgstr "Puelle promised that he{line_break}would return our hostages{line_break}to Vale.{page_break}If you don't believe me,{line_break}ask him yourself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11577"
msgstr "If the lighthouse isn't lit{line_break}soon, Prox is doomed...{line_break}I need to get out of here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11578"
msgstr "Neither our elder nor Puelle{line_break}will tell us what's going on{line_break}at the lighthouse...{page_break}Why are we training so{line_break}much? A lighthouse shouldn't{line_break}pose that much danger...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11579"
msgstr "Puelle is stronger than any{line_break}of us, and there is nothing{line_break}he can do to save us...{page_break}But if we don't take some{line_break}kind of action, Prox will be{line_break}destroyed for sure...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11580"
msgstr "If they didn't light the beacon{line_break}and they didn't return home,{line_break}Agatio's team must have failed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11581"
msgstr "If only my fire Psynergy{line_break}weren't so weak now, I{line_break}might be able to help...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11582"
msgstr "Puelle never intended to take{line_break}hostages. He wanted the people{line_break}of Vale to be returned safely.{page_break}Saturos insisted that we{line_break}hold on to them for our{line_break}safety, but Puelle disagreed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11583"
msgstr "You... {actor_name:5}, it's you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11584"
msgstr "I'd heard that you had returned{line_break}to us... You look so much{line_break}stronger than when you left.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11585"
msgstr "It seems he has brought{line_break}some allies with him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11586"
msgstr "Yes... I am Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11587"
msgstr "My name is {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11588"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}... Isn't that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11589"
msgstr "That is the name of the one{line_break}Agatio said had killed Saturos{line_break}and Menardi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11590"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}, stop that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11591"
msgstr "You are correct, but{line_break}{actor_name:1} had reasons{line_break}for fighting them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11592"
msgstr "Saturos and Menardi had{line_break}invaded Vale, stolen its sacred{line_break}treasure, triggered a volcano...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11593"
msgstr "You cannot blame {actor_name:1} for{line_break}pursuing them and fighting{line_break}to regain what they had stolen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11594"
msgstr "We only wanted to stop them...{line_break}We didn't think they'd fight{line_break}us to the death.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11595"
msgstr "They flung themselves into the{line_break}opening of Venus Lighthouse's{line_break}beacon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11596"
msgstr "Did...Saturos and Menardi{line_break}put up a good fight?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11597"
msgstr "I'll bet you thought you{line_break}didn't stand a chance{line_break}against them, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11598"
msgstr "You were probably really{line_break}tense the whole time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11599"
msgstr "Saturos and Menardi had a{line_break}job to do... That was all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11600"
msgstr "If I'd been in your shoes, I'd{line_break}have done the same thing...{line_break}I can't blame you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11601"
msgstr "And in the end, you were stronger{line_break}than they were... You should be{line_break}proud of that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11602"
msgstr "I am sad that they lost their{line_break}lives in their quest, but there{line_break}was no avoiding it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11603"
msgstr "What has happened cannot{line_break}be undone. We should cooperate{line_break}to find a way to save Weyard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11604"
msgstr "We understand that Agatio{line_break}and Karst have made for Mars{line_break}Lighthouse and not returned.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11605"
msgstr "Then all that remains for us{line_break}is to wait until Gaia Falls{line_break}carries us all to our doom.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11606"
msgstr "It seems that Mars Lighthouse{line_break}is as dangerous as all the rest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11607"
msgstr "We have only a few soldiers{line_break}remaining, and none who can{line_break}make the climb to the aerie.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11608"
msgstr "Only Saturos and perhaps{line_break}Agatio were strong enough{line_break}to reach the top...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11609"
msgstr "And none of them can{line_break}help us now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11610"
msgstr "You think we can do it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11611"
msgstr "I agree, {actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11612"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, what are you{line_break}thinking?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11613"
msgstr "We've climbed three lighthouses{line_break}already... What's one more? Let's{line_break}go to Mars Lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11614"
msgstr "They've proven themselves{line_break}strong enough! I say we trust{line_break}in {actor_name:5} to do this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11615"
msgstr "This is an unexpected turn of{line_break}events, but yes, I think you{line_break}can light the lighthouse...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11616"
msgstr "Off to the Mars Lighthouse!{line_break}Let's go, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}Come on, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11617"
msgstr "There is one thing that I{line_break}don't want you to forget.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11618"
msgstr "In order to light the beacon{line_break}at Mars Lighthouse, you will{line_break}need to have the Mars Star.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11619"
msgstr "Ah! And Agatio and Karst{line_break}have the Mars Star now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11620"
msgstr "You must find Agatio and{line_break}Karst, and you must take{line_break}the Mars Star from them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11621"
msgstr "Thanks for your help.{line_break}The future of Weyard{line_break}rests in your hands.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11622"
msgstr "You must find Karst,{line_break}get the Mars Star, and{line_break}light the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11623"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, you are the only{line_break}hope left to us now.{line_break}Good luck.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11624"
msgstr "If this doesn't work, we're all{line_break}finished... Prox, Weyard, even{line_break}Vale... All will be lost...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11625"
msgstr "If they were strong enough to{line_break}defeat Saturos and Menardi,{line_break}perhaps they can do the job...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11626"
msgstr "Why... Why am I lying here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11627"
msgstr "Wait, I think I remember... We{line_break}were going to light the beacon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11628"
msgstr "But the lighthouse was frozen.{line_break}We wandered lost inside,{line_break}trying to find the aerie...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11629"
msgstr "We must hurry... If we{line_break}delay, Prox is destroyed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11630"
msgstr "It's no use... I'm absolutely{line_break}drained... I can't even stand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11631"
msgstr "And the cold... Why am I so cold?{line_break}We of the Fire Clan are meant{line_break}to be immune to the cold...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11632"
msgstr "I feel the cold too, Karst...{line_break}I... I'm afraid we're going{line_break}to die up here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11633"
msgstr "I can feel it now... The long,{line_break}dark sleep creeping into{line_break}my soul...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11634"
msgstr "Wait... I think{line_break}I remember...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11635"
msgstr "The eye... It told us that we{line_break}lack the will to go any farther.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11636"
msgstr "The eye... I remember now...{line_break}I felt its gaze pierce me to{line_break}the core, then all went black...{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11637"
msgstr "That's right... And I remember{line_break}fighting against {actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11638"
msgstr "I do, too... Was it a dream?{line_break}An illusion?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11639"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}? Is that you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11640"
msgstr "Amazing... Then our luck hasn't{line_break}entirely run out yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11641"
msgstr "How can you play games{line_break}with us like this?{page_break}Regardless, it's amazing that{line_break}you're here... It means our luck{line_break}hasn't entirely run out yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11642"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, you must complete{line_break}our quest... Please... You have{line_break}to light the beacon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11643"
msgstr "We can't even stand... We're in{line_break}no condition to go on. Light{line_break}the beacon for us... Please.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11644"
msgstr "You'll need the Mars Star.{line_break}Go on... Take it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11645"
msgstr "Please hurry... If I can just see{line_break}the light of the beacon, I'll know{line_break}that I haven't died in vain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11646"
msgstr "We're counting on you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11647"
msgstr "It's too late for us now...{line_break}Hurry, light the beacon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11648"
msgstr "Your hand...so warm...{line_break}People have such warm{line_break}hands... I had forgotten...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11649"
msgstr "I'm so tired... A fog is rising{line_break}before my eyes... No! Can't{line_break}die until the beacon...is lit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11650"
msgstr "I'm so cold, colder than I ever{line_break}thought possible... All because{line_break}Mars Lighthouse remains unlit...{page_break}I have to stay alive...long{line_break}enough to see its light...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11651"
msgstr "You who hold the star,{line_break}open your heart and listen...{page_break}If you wish to reach the heavens,{line_break}give your star to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11652"
msgstr "If you do not hold the star,{line_break}you shall not ascend to the{line_break}heavens... Begone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11653"
msgstr "You who hold the star,{line_break}open your heart and listen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11654"
msgstr "If you wish to scale the{line_break}heavens, set the four{line_break}spirits aflame!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11655"
msgstr "Mankind... With the power of{line_break}wisdom, they ruled the earth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11656"
msgstr "Fish... With cold courage,{line_break}they ruled the water.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11657"
msgstr "Dragons... Burning with might,{line_break}they ruled the fires.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11658"
msgstr "Bird... On the wings of truth,{line_break}they ruled the winds.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11659"
msgstr "You have proven your worth!{line_break}The heavens await you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11660"
msgstr "Betrayers, you have arrived!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11661"
msgstr "Who said that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11662"
msgstr "The wind's too strong!{line_break}I can't see anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11663"
msgstr "I heard it too, but I don't{line_break}see anyone else up here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11664"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! Quick! Cast the Mars{line_break}Star in before anything{line_break}has a chance to stop us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11665"
msgstr "So, you are still intent on lighting{line_break}the beacon of Mars Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11666"
msgstr "Who said that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11667"
msgstr "Have you forgotten me so soon,{line_break}{actor_name:1}? And you, {actor_name:2}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11668"
msgstr "It seems to know you,{line_break}{actor_name:1}... Do you have any{line_break}idea what it is?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11669"
msgstr "Then search your heart, boy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11670"
msgstr "That voice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11671"
msgstr "It's...the Wise One!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11672"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}, since when are{line_break}you on a first-name basis{line_break}with the Wise One?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11673"
msgstr "It must have been{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}. {actor_name:1},{line_break}what happened in Sol Sanctum{line_break}after we were kidnapped?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11674"
msgstr "When Saturos and Menardi stole{line_break}the Elemental Stars, they also{line_break}triggered a volcanic eruption.{page_break}The Wise One prevented Mt. Aleph{line_break}from erupting so that {actor_name:2}{line_break}and I could escape.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11675"
msgstr "But...wait, Mt. Aleph {text_effect:2}did{reset_text_style} erupt!{line_break}There was a huge explosion! We{line_break}saw it all the way in Vault!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11676"
msgstr "But it would have erupted with{line_break}us still inside... There was no way{line_break}we could have escaped in time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11677"
msgstr "The Wise One held off the{line_break}eruption until we could escape...{line_break}He even halted the lava flow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11678"
msgstr "I can't believe it... Nobody has{line_break}enough power to do that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11679"
msgstr "I know it sounds weird, but I{line_break}was there, and it happened, so{line_break}you'll just have to believe us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11680"
msgstr "If it can do all that, this{line_break}Wise One seems more like{line_break}a god than an Adept!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11681"
msgstr "I did not just save you. I also{line_break}tasked you with recovering the{line_break}four Elemental Stars.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11682"
msgstr "Why have you disobeyed my{line_break}command? Why have you come{line_break}to light the beacon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11683"
msgstr "Because Prox will be{line_break}destroyed if we don't! We{line_break}can't let that happen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11684"
msgstr "Prox? They have brought this{line_break}disaster upon themselves.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11685"
msgstr "Are you saying we should just{line_break}abandon them to die? What{line_break}did they do to deserve that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11686"
msgstr "The people of Prox have{line_break}committed an unforgivable{line_break}sin. They must pay the price.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11687"
msgstr "For lighting the lighthouses?{line_break}Is that their sin? Does that{line_break}warrant total destruction?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11688"
msgstr "If we don't light the beacon,{line_break}Gaia Falls will eventually{line_break}erode away all of Weyard!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11689"
msgstr "We have fought for so long to{line_break}save all the people of our world,{line_break}and now you would stop us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11690"
msgstr "Gaia Falls is growing.{line_break}It's consuming more and{line_break}more with each passing day!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11691"
msgstr "How can you just allow{line_break}the world to crumble into{line_break}nothingness?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11692"
msgstr "The seal needs to be{line_break}broken! The world will be{line_break}destroyed if it's not!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11693"
msgstr "You have learned{line_break}far too much.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11694"
msgstr "Wise One! You can't continue{line_break}to protect the lighthouses! You{line_break}know what's happening!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11695"
msgstr "It is your duty to protect all of{line_break}Weyard! If Weyard is destroyed,{line_break}you will have failed us all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11696"
msgstr "Why won't you answer{line_break}us, Wise One?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11697"
msgstr "If Alchemy is unleashed,{line_break}mankind may well destroy{line_break}all of Weyard itself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11698"
msgstr "But we can combine our{line_break}strengths, ensure that Alchemy{line_break}not be used for evil...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11699"
msgstr "It is inevitable. In time, one man{line_break}will seek to rule over all. It is{line_break}human nature, inescapable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11700"
msgstr "And it shall come sooner{line_break}than any of you think.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11701"
msgstr "Why do you say that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11702"
msgstr "The Water Adept who climbs{line_break}toward the peak of Mt. Aleph{line_break}even as we speak...{page_break}Is he not a friend of yours?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11703"
msgstr "Alex is his name. Surely,{line_break}you have not forgotten him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11704"
msgstr "Alex!? What would he be{line_break}doing on Mt. Aleph?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11705"
msgstr "He understands far more than{line_break}you do. He knows that when{line_break}the four beacons have been lit...{page_break}Their light will gather{line_break}at Sol Sanctum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11706"
msgstr "But what would he gain{line_break}from being there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11707"
msgstr "When the final beam of light{line_break}reaches the peak of Mt. Aleph,{line_break}the Golden Sun shall rise.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11708"
msgstr "The Golden Sun!?{line_break}What is that? And what{line_break}would Alex want with it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11709"
msgstr "When the four beams merge{line_break}into one, they form a golden{line_break}light, bathing Mt. Aleph's peak.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11710"
msgstr "Is... Is that Alchemy? I mean,{line_break}pure Alchemy made real, at{line_break}the heart of its power?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11711"
msgstr "And it's that light that gives{line_break}shape to the Stone of Sages?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11712"
msgstr "This has been Alex's one true{line_break}desire from the very start.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11713"
msgstr "Alex planned all of this?{line_break}Then he must have been{line_break}after this power all along!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11714"
msgstr "We've been duped! He used us all!{line_break}Oh, you'd better believe he's{line_break}not getting away with this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11715"
msgstr "Alex... How could he do this?{line_break}He's... He's one of my own{line_break}people! I feel sick...disgusted...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11716"
msgstr "None of that matters right now.{line_break}We still have to light the beacon.{line_break}We don't have any choice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11717"
msgstr "If we don't do it now, Prox{line_break}will be destroyed!{line_break}{actor_name:5}... We have to, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11718"
msgstr "You bet we do! The Wise One{line_break}will have to deal with Alex{line_break}on his own.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11719"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! We don't have any{line_break}choice! The Wise One will have{line_break}to deal with Alex himself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11720"
msgstr "I cannot interfere in the{line_break}actions of mankind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11721"
msgstr "If you can't interfere, then how{line_break}about getting out of our way so{line_break}we can light the beacon, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11722"
msgstr "Ooo... Good one, {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11723"
msgstr "I don't like doing exactly what{line_break}Alex wants, but it's looking like{line_break}we've got no choice...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11724"
msgstr "Don't worry, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}Just throw the Mars Star into{line_break}the beacon's well! Now!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11725"
msgstr "The Wise One himself said{line_break}he's not allowed to interfere!{line_break}You're all clear!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11726"
msgstr "Wise One! Didn't you just say{line_break}that you aren't allowed to{line_break}interfere with our actions?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11727"
msgstr "That is correct.{line_break}I cannot stop you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11728"
msgstr "But...what if some miracle were{line_break}to occur, one that prevented you{line_break}from igniting the beacon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11729"
msgstr "Miracle? What are you talking{line_break}about? What kind of miracle?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11730"
msgstr "If you can defeat a miracle,{line_break}only then can you ignite the{line_break}beacon's flame.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11731"
msgstr "The Wise One is up to something!{line_break}Be wary, everyone! We don't{line_break}know what he's capable of!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11732"
msgstr "A three-headed dragon?{line_break}{text_effect:2}That's{reset_text_style} your miracle?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11733"
msgstr "So you would have us fight{line_break}for our future? Fine, then{line_break}fight we shall!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11734"
msgstr "What's he thinking? We already{line_break}beat a two-headed dragon. How{line_break}much tougher can this one be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11735"
msgstr "I don't care how many heads{line_break}it has. Nothing's going to{line_break}stop us now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11736"
msgstr "Let's do it! For Prox!{line_break}For the future of Weyard!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11737"
msgstr "Wait a second... Wasn't that{line_break}two-headed dragon actually{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{page_break}So that means this three-{line_break}headed dragon must be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11738"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! NO! You mustn't{line_break}fight that dragon! It's°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11739"
msgstr "Too late, Kraden! We can't{line_break}get away from it now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11740"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, don't! Stop!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11741"
msgstr "...Who are they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11742"
msgstr "That's what I was trying{line_break}to warn you about!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11743"
msgstr "It wasn't just the dragon{line_break}you killed...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11744"
msgstr "I remember you warning us,{line_break}but it was too late for us to{line_break}stop...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11745"
msgstr "Kraden, what do you know?{line_break}Why were you trying to stop{line_break}us from fighting the dragon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11746"
msgstr "It was the Wise One's{line_break}final trap...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11747"
msgstr "Trap? What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11748"
msgstr "The Wise One knew he couldn't{line_break}stop you, so he played a cruel,{line_break}wretched trick on you instead.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11749"
msgstr "Kraden, I don't understand...{line_break}What are you trying to tell us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11750"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}, let's see who{line_break}those people are while they{line_break}try to sort this out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11751"
msgstr "No, {actor_name:6}! Don't look!{line_break}You mustn't look! It will only{line_break}bring you pain...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11752"
msgstr "What are you talking about,{line_break}Kraden? They can't hurt us{line_break}anymore... We'll just°{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11753"
msgstr "What's the matter, {actor_name:6}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11754"
msgstr "It...can't be... How? How...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11755"
msgstr "Nnn... Uhnnn...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11756"
msgstr "What is it, {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11757"
msgstr "Uhhh...unnnn...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11758"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}! I... I know{line_break}that guy! That's your dad!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11759"
msgstr "Then...does that mean...{line_break}the other two are...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11760"
msgstr "Hhnnnng...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11761"
msgstr "Hhhnnn...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11762"
msgstr "Mom... Dad...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11763"
msgstr "I'll heal {actor_name:6}'s parents!{line_break}Quickly, {actor_name:4}! Tend to{line_break}{actor_name:1}'s father!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11764"
msgstr "If only... If only I'd realized{line_break}it sooner...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11765"
msgstr "What's the matter, {actor_name:8}?{line_break}Why did you stop? {actor_name:6}'s{line_break}parents need you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11766"
msgstr "Don't give up, {actor_name:4}. You{line_break}can't! You have to save them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11767"
msgstr "It's no use, {actor_name:3}...{line_break}I'm tapped...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11768"
msgstr "I am, too... And even if I weren't,{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}it's just too late...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11769"
msgstr "What are you saying!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11770"
msgstr "They're not...{line_break}They can't be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11771"
msgstr "That's not what I'm saying,{line_break}{actor_name:6}... I...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11772"
msgstr "I finally found them... I was{line_break}going to be with them again...{line_break}For the first time in years...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11773"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11774"
msgstr "Please... It can't be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11775"
msgstr "Mom... Wake up!{line_break}It's me... It's {actor_name:6}!{line_break}...Don't leave me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11776"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, you must prepare{line_break}yourself for what comes next...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11777"
msgstr "Being transformed into a dragon,{line_break}fighting in that form... This{line_break}requires tremendous power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11778"
msgstr "What are you saying, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11779"
msgstr "In fighting you, your parents{line_break}were forced to use every{line_break}last ounce of their energy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11780"
msgstr "They don't have the strength to...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11781"
msgstr "Even if they had won the battle,{line_break}they would not have survived.{line_break}You cannot blame yourself...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11782"
msgstr "You monster!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11783"
msgstr "Why did you do this? Why{line_break}did you make us fight{line_break}{actor_name:6}'s parents?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11784"
msgstr "You're no god! You're no{line_break}protector! You're evil!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11785"
msgstr "You don't understand the pain{line_break}you have caused, Wise One.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11786"
msgstr "You have no idea the damage{line_break}done to a child who learns she{line_break}has destroyed her own parents.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11787"
msgstr "That's enough...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11788"
msgstr "I knew what I was doing the{line_break}moment I raised my sword.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11789"
msgstr "We defied the Wise One in{line_break}order to save the world.{line_break}Our parents would understand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11790"
msgstr "Don't you think so, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11791"
msgstr "You're right. It hurts, but it's true.{line_break}We didn't do this for ourselves.{line_break}We did it for all of Weyard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11792"
msgstr "I agree with my brother...{line_break}But it does no one any good{line_break}if we don't complete our task.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11793"
msgstr "We still have a chance to{line_break}save Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11794"
msgstr "Perhaps we can't save your{line_break}parents, but we can save{line_break}countless others.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11795"
msgstr "Kyle and the others saved{line_break}them, too... They sacrificed their{line_break}lives so that we could go on.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11796"
msgstr "I never imagined that{line_break}my actions would help{line_break}to save the world...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11797"
msgstr "Even though lighting the beacon{line_break}may create wars and strife,{line_break}I regret none of this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11798"
msgstr "There's little time left, {actor_name:5}...{line_break}Use the Mars Star and{line_break}light the beacon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11799"
msgstr "Our quest is almost over.{line_break}I...don't know how I'm going{line_break}to tell Mom about this...{page_break}But sorrow can wait. We've{line_break}got to light the beacon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11800"
msgstr "I wish I could console you{line_break}somehow... It must be tough...{page_break}I just wish I'd had one last{line_break}chance to have some of{line_break}{actor_name:5}'s mother's cookies.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11801"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, I understand your{line_break}loss...{page_break}But remember, you and {actor_name:6}{line_break}still have each other.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11802"
msgstr "If Alex set this all in motion,{line_break}then he's responsible for this,{line_break}and I'll never forgive him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11803"
msgstr "I thought I'd get to see my{line_break}parents again... I thought I'd{line_break}get to hold them again...{page_break}But instead, we were{line_break}forced to destroy them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11804"
msgstr "I don't know my parents...{line_break}They might be alive, somewhere{line_break}out there... But I share your pain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11805"
msgstr "I'm sorry things had to end{line_break}up like this, {actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11806"
msgstr "Both Kyle and your parents{line_break}were very dear to me. My{line_break}sorrow joins yours, friends.{page_break}We must light the beacon, if for{line_break}no other reason than to provide{line_break}them with a proper funeral.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11807"
msgstr "Unnnn... {actor_name:5}?{line_break}...{actor_name:6}?{page_break}I am so happy...to have one{line_break}last chance to see you again...{line_break}in the end...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11808"
msgstr "Uhhhhnnn... {actor_name:5}...{line_break}I...can't see you, but I sense that{line_break}you're nearby...{page_break}Please... Take care of{line_break}{actor_name:6} for us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11809"
msgstr "*Koff! Koff!* {actor_name:5}...{line_break}You made it back...alive...{line_break}Please, I must ask one last thing...{page_break}Tell Dora...to live her life{line_break}to the fullest...for me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11810"
msgstr "Do not let your sadness{line_break}overwhelm you, {actor_name:5}!{page_break}Go! Once the beacon has been{line_break}ignited, you can mourn as much{line_break}as you need. I will protect you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11811"
msgstr "Will you cast in the Mars Star?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11812"
msgstr "The beacon is lit!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11813"
msgstr "And to think, I joined this quest{line_break}hoping to prevent exactly this{line_break}from happening...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11814"
msgstr "And I began this quest as a{line_break}prisoner, taken against my will.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11815"
msgstr "And if that tidal wave hadn't{line_break}sent me far off course, I{line_break}wouldn't even be here now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11816"
msgstr "How many lives have been{line_break}taken and changed forever{line_break}just to light this beacon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11817"
msgstr "Mom... Dad...{line_break}Weyard is safe now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11818"
msgstr "You're right!{line_break}I hear voices, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11819"
msgstr "I told you...{line_break}I told you I could hear them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11820"
msgstr "Who said that?{line_break}Where are you?!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11821"
msgstr "We're in Imil! We're at the{line_break}base of Mercury Lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11822"
msgstr "You... You can't be!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11823"
msgstr "You... You can't be!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11824"
msgstr "Hey! I know that voice!{line_break}It's {actor_name:4}, I just{line_break}know it!{pause_20_skippable} {actor_name:4}!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11825"
msgstr "It's you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11826"
msgstr "Of course it's us! We can hear{line_break}you, {actor_name:4}! You're all{line_break}right! I'm so happy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11827"
msgstr "Who are those two{line_break}kids talking to?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11828"
msgstr "I don't know. They've been{line_break}standing here telling everyone{line_break}to leave the lighthouse.{page_break}...Weird couple of kids{line_break}if you ask me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11829"
msgstr "How is it that we{line_break}can hear you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11830"
msgstr "I don't know, but he told us{line_break}we'd be able to talk to you{line_break}if we came here now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11831"
msgstr "He? Who's \"he\"?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11832"
msgstr "I don't know... We were sleeping,{line_break}and he came to us in a dream...{page_break}He said, \"Go to the lighthouse!\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11833"
msgstr "The lighthouse? Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11834"
msgstr "He said that we have to{line_break}deliver a message... He was{line_break}too busy to do it himself...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11835"
msgstr "What message?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11836"
msgstr "We have to warn everyone to{line_break}stay clear of the lighthouses!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11837"
msgstr "What's going to happen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11838"
msgstr "I don't know, but he told us{line_break}to warn people away from{line_break}Mt. Aleph as well!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11839"
msgstr "But who is \"he\"!? You{line_break}still haven't told us!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11840"
msgstr "You're a meanie! I don't{line_break}tell meanies anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11841"
msgstr "Don't pay any attention to{line_break}him... It's me, {actor_name:4}... Can you{line_break}tell me who spoke to you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11842"
msgstr "I told you, I don't know, but{line_break}he looked like a big rock...{line_break}with a big, rocky eye!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11843"
msgstr "The... The Wise One!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11844"
msgstr "What could he be doing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11845"
msgstr "Of course! I understand...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11846"
msgstr "The Wise One said that when{line_break}all four lighthouses have been{line_break}lit, the Golden Sun will shine...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11847"
msgstr "When that happens, Mt. Aleph{line_break}and the lighthouses will probably{line_break}become quite dangerous...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11848"
msgstr "So, the Wise One is warning{line_break}people in dreams, telling{line_break}them to seek refuge?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11849"
msgstr "Why would he do that!? You{line_break}saw what he did to us... He{line_break}can't be up to anything good...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11850"
msgstr "Have you not learned?{line_break}One's actions do not always{line_break}reveal one's true intentions.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11851"
msgstr "Hamma...{pause_20_skippable} Sister...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11852"
msgstr "Master Hamma! Did you receive{line_break}a message, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11853"
msgstr "Yes. I was called to Jupiter{line_break}Lighthouse in a dream.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11854"
msgstr "You have completed your{line_break}quest, but I see it comes{line_break}with great loss...{page_break}Your suffering has been{line_break}almost unbearable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11855"
msgstr "Master Hamma... My parents...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11856"
msgstr "I know, {actor_name:6}, and I am sorry.{line_break}But do not give up hope{line_break}for them just yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11857"
msgstr "What do you mean,{line_break}Master Hamma?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11858"
msgstr "Appearances can be an{line_break}illusion... The Wise One{line_break}has a caring heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11859"
msgstr "He forced us to fight{line_break}{actor_name:1}'s and {actor_name:6}'s parents!{line_break}What's so \"caring\" about that!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11860"
msgstr "If the Wise One were truly evil,{line_break}he would not be warning me{line_break}of danger in my dreams.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11861"
msgstr "Well, I... I guess not... But{line_break}then, what's he up to?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11862"
msgstr "We do not have time to{line_break}discuss it right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11863"
msgstr "She's right.{page_break}If the Wise One said it's not{line_break}safe to be near the lighthouses,{line_break}then I think we should listen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11864"
msgstr "I am heading for safety, too.{line_break}All of you must get away{line_break}from the lighthouse now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11865"
msgstr "Hurry, everyone! Let's go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11866"
msgstr "What about our parents?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11867"
msgstr "We can't leave them behind...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11868"
msgstr "I understand how you feel, but{line_break}we won't make it if we have{line_break}to take them with us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11869"
msgstr "Make the decision, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}Should we take them with us?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11870"
msgstr "It's too dangerous...{line_break}The Golden Sun is forming!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11871"
msgstr "A ray of light is emanating{line_break}from the beacon... From the{line_break}Mars Star.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11872"
msgstr "What will happen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11873"
msgstr "The power of Alchemy will{line_break}be unleashed upon the world!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11874"
msgstr "We must take {actor_name:1}'s{line_break}father and {actor_name:6}'s{line_break}parents and flee!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11875"
msgstr "Stop it! Let go of my wrist!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11876"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}, get a grip!{line_break}No one's touching you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11877"
msgstr "I'm serious! I...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11878"
msgstr "The beacon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11879"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}... We have to{line_break}move your parents!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11880"
msgstr "Mom! Dad!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11881"
msgstr "What's happening?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11882"
msgstr "There's no time for questions!{line_break}Just carry them!{line_break}Carry them and go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11883"
msgstr "There's a space for you{line_break}to place something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11884"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} got the Mars Star!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11885"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} used the Mars Star!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11886"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} checked the ice.{page_break}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11887"
msgstr "A shaft of ice is poking{line_break}up through the floor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11888"
msgstr "Thank you, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}And you, too, {actor_name:1}{line_break}and Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11889"
msgstr "By igniting Mars Lighthouse,{line_break}you stopped Gaia Falls{line_break}from devouring our town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11890"
msgstr "We're just glad to have helped{line_break}save Weyard...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11891"
msgstr "You've been through many{line_break}trials, more than any of us{line_break}can ever know...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11892"
msgstr "We had no idea what to{line_break}expect when we lit the{line_break}final beacon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11893"
msgstr "When we saw the flash of{line_break}the beacon, we had no idea{line_break}what you suffered to light it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11894"
msgstr "I thought we were done for...{line_break}There was no way we could{line_break}escape with our parents' bodies.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11895"
msgstr "Well, at least, not if we hadn't{line_break}pulled together and overcome{line_break}our sorrows...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11896"
msgstr "That light was brilliant!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11897"
msgstr "You know, I shall always regret{line_break}that I didn't get to look upon{line_break}the beacon's light from afar...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11898"
msgstr "I understand your regret... As{line_break}a scholar of Alchemy, you would{line_break}have been most impressed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11899"
msgstr "I saw the beams of blue, red,{line_break}and purple streaming out{line_break}toward the southeast...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11900"
msgstr "That's the direction in which{line_break}Vale lies, is it not? Was the{line_break}light headed to your hometown?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11901"
msgstr "Indeed it was. The Wise One{line_break}said the beams were going to{line_break}merge into one above Mt. Aleph.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11902"
msgstr "The orb of golden light{line_break}we saw... That was shining{line_break}directly over Vale?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11903"
msgstr "Yes. That was the Golden{line_break}Sun forming over Mt. Aleph.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11904"
msgstr "If I remember the{line_break}tales correctly...{page_break}The Golden Sun is the blast of{line_break}light emitted at the very moment{line_break}the Stone of Sages forms...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11905"
msgstr "Such legends exist even{line_break}here? I wish that I'd known{line_break}that sooner!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11906"
msgstr "I fear for Vale, to think that all{line_break}this energy is being released{line_break}right over your hometown.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11907"
msgstr "We're all worried about that.{line_break}We're hoping we can return to{line_break}Vale as quickly as possible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11908"
msgstr "Oh... Is there nothing we can{line_break}do to convince you to stay?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11909"
msgstr "We had hoped you might stay{line_break}in Prox a while, but that sounds{line_break}unlikely...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11910"
msgstr "Don't worry... We plan on{line_break}returning as soon as things{line_break}quiet down, don't we?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11911"
msgstr "Our village will not soon forget{line_break}that you saved us from the edge{line_break}of destruction. Do visit us again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11912"
msgstr "You have just completed a{line_break}long and difficult journey.{page_break}Perhaps when you are older,{line_break}and you look back on your youth,{line_break}you will remember us fondly...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11913"
msgstr "When that time comes, I may{line_break}no longer be in this world.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11914"
msgstr "Don't say such things... I'm{line_break}sure a long life awaits you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11915"
msgstr "Well, I suppose we should{line_break}be departing for Vale soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11916"
msgstr "You're right, Kraden...{line_break}If we don't, you-know-who{line_break}might start causing trouble...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11917"
msgstr "At least some of your cares{line_break}have been remedied...{page_break}You must be glad to know{line_break}we've brought all three{line_break}back from the brink of death.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11918"
msgstr "I would not have thought it{line_break}possible had I not seen it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11919"
msgstr "Even I do not fully{line_break}understand it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11920"
msgstr "But their can be no doubt. The{line_break}fire Psynergy released by the{line_break}beacon rekindled their spirits.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11921"
msgstr "I hadn't expected so much{line_break}Psynergy to be released by{line_break}the lighthouse's beam...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11922"
msgstr "I have no real explanation,{line_break}other than that their life force{line_break}had not been fully extinguished.{page_break}It was a miracle, but the{line_break}fire Psynergy seems to have{line_break}recharged them somehow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11923"
msgstr "And had your parents not been{line_break}Adepts, the wave of Psynergy{line_break}would have passed them by.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11924"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}! What's taking you{line_break}two so long? Don't keep me{line_break}waiting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11925"
msgstr "Uh-oh! It's {actor_name:6}...{line_break}We're late, and she looks{line_break}rather displeased with us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11926"
msgstr "Should I let her know{line_break}we're leaving now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11927"
msgstr "I'm sorry! We're almost done.{line_break}Can you wait for us at the{line_break}village gates with the others?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11928"
msgstr "I'm serious! If I have to wait{line_break}much longer, you're not{line_break}going to be happy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11929"
msgstr "I'm sorry, {actor_name:6}! It sounds{line_break}like things are going to take{line_break}just a little bit longer...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11930"
msgstr "Well, I'm not going to wait much{line_break}longer! If you don't come soon,{line_break}we're all leaving without you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11931"
msgstr "I'll wait outside with them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11932"
msgstr "I don't think they want to{line_break}wait anymore, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}We're all set to head home...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11933"
msgstr "They have no patience{line_break}whatsoever. Ah, well...{line_break}I suppose it is time to leave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11934"
msgstr "May your journey home{line_break}be safe and uneventful...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11935"
msgstr "We shall never forget what{line_break}you have done for Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11936"
msgstr "Thank you for lighting the{line_break}fires of the lighthouse beacon,{line_break}{actor_name:5}. You saved us all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11937"
msgstr "It's too bad about Agatio{line_break}and Karst...{page_break}They weren't bad people... A{line_break}little obsessed, yeah, but it's{line_break}still sad that they're gone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11938"
msgstr "I don't remember the last{line_break}time I saw the sky this bright{line_break}and clear. It feels wonderful!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11939"
msgstr "Winter in Prox can be bitter{line_break}cold, but I think things will{line_break}feel more mild after this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11940"
msgstr "I was so moved when I saw{line_break}that light shining from the{line_break}north. We all owe you our lives.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11941"
msgstr "The lighthouses have all been{line_break}lit... Does that mean we're going{line_break}to fall back into war and chaos?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11942"
msgstr "You did an amazing job... You{line_break}accomplished what Agatio and{line_break}Karst could not...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11943"
msgstr "Will you be going back to Vale{line_break}now that your quest is over,{line_break}{actor_name:5}? Don't forget us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11944"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} has proven{line_break}himself as the strongest{line_break}warrior Prox has ever known!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11945"
msgstr "I heard the Karst and Agatio{line_break}were defeated by a monstrous{line_break}dragon...{page_break}{actor_name:5} beat the dragon,{line_break}though... I don't know whether{line_break}I'm impressed or scared of him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11946"
msgstr "The blizzard's finally over...{line_break}That was the worst patch of{line_break}weather we've ever had!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11947"
msgstr "Now that our weather is{line_break}returning to normal, maybe{line_break}everyone will move back here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11948"
msgstr "I was the first person in town{line_break}to see the lighthouse! I was{line_break}so happy, I had to tell everyone!{page_break}I felt like a little boy again,{line_break}running giddily through{line_break}town, shouting and waving!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11949"
msgstr "They had no choice... They{line_break}had to light the four{line_break}elemental lighthouses...{page_break}Even though it might mean{line_break}a rise in war and violence,{line_break}it had to be done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11950"
msgstr "When {actor_name:5} left town, he{line_break}of a fighter... He wasn't much{line_break}of anything, really...{page_break}When did he become{line_break}mightier than the mightiest{line_break}of Prox's warriors?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11951"
msgstr "I bet {actor_name:5} and his friends{line_break}live in a nice, warm place... I{line_break}wish I could go with them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11952"
msgstr "I think the rift to the north{line_break}started receding when the{line_break}lighthouse was lit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11953"
msgstr "I wonder if that hole up{line_break}north has stopped growing...{line_break}What if it starts again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11954"
msgstr "The lighthouse was so beautiful{line_break}when the beacon was lit... It{line_break}made a beautiful band of light!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11955"
msgstr "I was afraid the falls were{line_break}going to gobble me up!{line_break}I'm glad that's over now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11956"
msgstr "What do we do if the falls{line_break}start expanding again and{line_break}{actor_name:5} isn't here?{page_break}Oh, great... That's going to{line_break}keep me up all night worrying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11957"
msgstr "All the lights joined up{line_break}together and shot off to{line_break}the southeast.{page_break}It looked like they all{line_break}formed into a big, golden{line_break}ball or something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11958"
msgstr "I've been told that lighting{line_break}the four beacons has set{line_break}Alchemy free on the world.{page_break}Now that we all can use{line_break}Alchemy again, civilization is{line_break}going to make great strides!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11959"
msgstr "I guess the four lighthouses{line_break}were the seal that blocked{line_break}the power of Alchemy.{page_break}So not only did {actor_name:5} save{line_break}Prox, he's also brought{line_break}about a new golden age!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11960"
msgstr "The people of Prox won't{line_break}forget what you've done{line_break}for them...{page_break}You can return home to{line_break}Vale with great pride, but you'll{line_break}always be welcome here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11961"
msgstr "Alchemy has been freed. We{line_break}must begin researching it{line_break}in earnest here in Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11962"
msgstr "Now that Alchemy is free,{line_break}it's like Weyard is waking up!{line_break}How will the world change?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11963"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} and his allies{line_break}saved us from certain{line_break}destruction.{page_break}It's a shame the rest of the{line_break}world doesn't know how much{line_break}they've done for us all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11964"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, take some advice{line_break}from an old man...{page_break}You would do well not to tell{line_break}anyone that you were the ones{line_break}to light the beacons...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11965"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} and his friends left{line_break}Vale having sworn to return{line_break}with the Elemental Stars.{page_break}When they return, they'll have{line_break}to tell everyone what happened.{line_break}I hope they won't be punished...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11966"
msgstr "If they found out {actor_name:5} used{line_break}the treasures of Sol Sanctum{line_break}to light the beacons...{page_break}That fool of a mayor would{line_break}no doubt punish them for{line_break}what they did to save us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11967"
msgstr "The mayor and the elders in{line_break}Vale are so out of touch.{page_break}When they see {actor_name:5} and{line_break}his friends return without the{line_break}stones, they'll punish them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11968"
msgstr "Weeee! What fun! Now that{line_break}it's stopped snowing, we{line_break}can go outside and play.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11969"
msgstr "I miss running around outside.{line_break}It's been so cold, I can't even{line_break}work up a good sweat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11970"
msgstr "If I'm going to be a great{line_break}warrior, like {actor_name:5}, I'm gonna{line_break}have to train hard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11971"
msgstr "I can hear the sound of{line_break}children playing far off{line_break}in the distance...{page_break}That sound means that{line_break}everything's back to normal{line_break}and our worries are past.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11972"
msgstr "Now that the lighthouse is lit,{line_break}we don't have to play in{line_break}that stupid igloo anymore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11973"
msgstr "That blizzard was unreal,{line_break}but it's gone now, and the{line_break}weather's beautiful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11974"
msgstr "You get more exercise running{line_break}in the snow, because it's a lot{line_break}harder to do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11975"
msgstr "It's been so long since{line_break}children's voices rang{line_break}through our streets.{page_break}I hope these children{line_break}remain ignorant of how much{line_break}danger we were all in...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11976"
msgstr "I have much to do, so I{line_break}won't be able to see you{line_break}off, but I wish you safe journey.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11977"
msgstr "Your body has absorbed a{line_break}great deal of raw elemental{line_break}energy. Please be careful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11978"
msgstr "There's no telling what could{line_break}happen now... If you absorbed{line_break}energy, maybe {actor_name:6} did, too...{page_break}Which means you'd better{line_break}not make her angry, or you'll{line_break}really get it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11979"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, I always thought{line_break}of you as my very own grandson{line_break}when you were here...{page_break}Now that you're leaving, I can't{line_break}describe the sorrow that fills{line_break}this old man's heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11980"
msgstr "Think of your old grandma's{line_break}cooking every now and then{line_break}when you're back home in Vale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11981"
msgstr "We may have underestimated{line_break}the power of the Psynergy he{line_break}unleashed...{page_break}We'll have to study it more{line_break}closely once we've seen{line_break}{actor_name:5} on his way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11982"
msgstr "The power to revive the dead...{line_break}It's an awesome and terrifying{line_break}power indeed...{page_break}Eternal life could soon be in{line_break}the hands of Alchemists{line_break}everywhere... What a thought!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11983"
msgstr "We've lost so many soldiers,{line_break}and now {actor_name:5} is leaving...{line_break}It's going to be quiet in Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11984"
msgstr "Who knew that the poor, injured{line_break}boy they brought back from Vale{line_break}would be the one to save Prox?{page_break}I'm happy that he'll finally{line_break}be able to return home, but{line_break}I'll miss him so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11985"
msgstr "I'm so sad... {actor_name:5} doesn't{line_break}even have time to enjoy{line_break}this last meal I made him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11986"
msgstr "Thank you so much, {actor_name:5}!{line_break}If you hadn't returned to us,{line_break}we wouldn't be here now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11987"
msgstr "Your foster grandmother knew{line_break}that you would return. She{line_break}always said you were reliable.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11988"
msgstr "I never imagined that little{line_break}{actor_name:5} would become stronger{line_break}even than Agatio and Karst.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11989"
msgstr "It's too bad {actor_name:5} can't{line_break}stick around... He'd make the{line_break}perfect son-in-law.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11990"
msgstr "We had no idea there would{line_break}be such a terrible earthquake{line_break}when the beacon was lit.{page_break}My wife tumbled right into my{line_break}arms... It was like we were{line_break}teenagers all over again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11991"
msgstr "After that earthquake, I feel{line_break}like I aged a couple of years{line_break}in just a few minutes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11992"
msgstr "We'll never be able to thank{line_break}{actor_name:5} and the warriors{line_break}of Vale enough.{page_break}I hope they're all happy to{line_break}be home with their families{line_break}in Vale again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11993"
msgstr "When the earthquake hit,{line_break}{actor_name:5} and his friends{line_break}were high up on the lighthouse.{page_break}If that had been me up there,{line_break}I think my heart would have{line_break}stopped from fear!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11994"
msgstr "Now that the lighthouse has{line_break}been lit, I fear for what will{line_break}happen to Weyard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11995"
msgstr "The lighthouses are going{line_break}to restore the power of{line_break}Alchemy to the land...{page_break}But Alchemy is too terrible{line_break}a power to set free...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11996"
msgstr "Sorry, {actor_name:5}, but this road{line_break}is blocked off right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11997"
msgstr "If you're worried about the{line_break}lighthouse beacon, don't...{line_break}It's still lit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11998"
msgstr "I just don't think I'm cut out{line_break}to be a soldier. I should have{line_break}taken up knitting instead.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "11999"
msgstr "{actor_name:5} taught me a lot{line_break}about how to be a serious{line_break}soldier...{page_break}I've been going easy on myself,{line_break}but no more! I'm going to train{line_break}harder every day!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12000"
msgstr "Even just standing outside the{line_break}lighthouse, I can feel the energy{line_break}coming from within...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12001"
msgstr "Well, you look like you're all{line_break}set for the return trip to Vale.{line_break}Travel well, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12002"
msgstr "The road to the lighthouse{line_break}is in terrible shape after{line_break}the earthquake...{page_break}I've got no clue how {actor_name:5}{line_break}and the others made it back{line_break}to town on that road.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12003"
msgstr "The elders were saying that{line_break}the lighthouse beacon is tough{line_break}to put out once it's lit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12004"
msgstr "On the other hand, now that{line_break}Alchemy is free, maybe I{line_break}should study Alchemy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12005"
msgstr "Maybe if I train hard enough,{line_break}I'll be as strong as Menardi{line_break}and Karst were...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12006"
msgstr "If the light of the beacon{line_break}keeps shining, the power{line_break}of Alchemy will never end...{page_break}Even if Prox is attacked,{line_break}the bright flames of our{line_break}strength will burn on.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12007"
msgstr "When {actor_name:5} left Prox, I didn't{line_break}think much of him, but now,{line_break}he's totally hot!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12008"
msgstr "What took you so long?{line_break}Mom and Dad are tired{line_break}of waiting for you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12009"
msgstr "That's not true, {actor_name:5}. You take{line_break}as long as you need to say{line_break}farewell to the people of Prox.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12010"
msgstr "Don't worry about us, {actor_name:5}...{line_break}Puelle and the others took{line_break}good care of us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12011"
msgstr "Don't tell him that! We'll be{line_break}stuck here forever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12012"
msgstr "You look like you're feeling back{line_break}to your old self, {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12013"
msgstr "You were weeping such{line_break}mournful tears after the battle...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12014"
msgstr "What!? As if!{line_break}You can't prove anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12015"
msgstr "Go easy on her. You have to{line_break}remember, she thought that{line_break}both of her parents had died.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12016"
msgstr "Oh, were you crying, {actor_name:6}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12017"
msgstr "No! I said...{line_break}I said I wasn't!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12018"
msgstr "Now you've got me thinking{line_break}about my family... I didn't think{line_break}I'd miss them this much...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12019"
msgstr "I only hope that they're all{line_break}safe back in Vale...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12020"
msgstr "I just want to be home again...{line_break}I want to see how my mother{line_break}is doing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12021"
msgstr "Don't worry, Son. I'm sure{line_break}Dora's doing fine. She's a{line_break}strong woman.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12022"
msgstr "But last time I saw her, she{line_break}looked so sick, so weak...{page_break}Even if nothing happened{line_break}to Vale, I'm still worried...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12023"
msgstr "Don't worry, {actor_name:1}. I'm sure{line_break}she's in wonderful shape.{page_break}I think she'll be surprised{line_break}to see me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12024"
msgstr "And she wouldn't let anything{line_break}happen until you came home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12025"
msgstr "Sorry to keep you all waiting.{line_break}At last, the time has come for{line_break}us to return to Vale...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12026"
msgstr "As soon as we leave Prox,{line_break}we'll head toward Angara, and{line_break}from there, to Vale...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12027"
msgstr "I can't wait to see this{line_break}winged ship of yours! It{line_break}sounds so incredible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12028"
msgstr "I remember so little of our{line_break}trip to Prox... This is really{line_break}my first voyage on a ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12029"
msgstr "I've heard that the wind and{line_break}waves make the boat rock...{line_break}I hope I don't get sick...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12030"
msgstr "This ancient ship of ours{line_break}actually flies above the{line_break}ocean... It's quite a cozy ride.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12031"
msgstr "It looks like we've got{line_break}an exciting last trip{line_break}ahead of us, doesn't it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12032"
msgstr "Wow... Setting out like this{line_break}takes me back to our own{line_break}quest's start... It was so long ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12033"
msgstr "I'm still worried about my{line_break}mother, but I'll try to put it{line_break}aside and enjoy the trip.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12034"
msgstr "If you keep talking like this,{line_break}we'll never go anywhere!{line_break}Let's go, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12035"
msgstr "What's the matter, boys?{line_break}Are you reluctant to depart?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12036"
msgstr "It's hard to believe that our{line_break}quest is almost at its end.{line_break}I know how you feel.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12037"
msgstr "After all that we've been{line_break}through, you can't possibly be{line_break}nervous about this small trip!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12038"
msgstr "I just hope that Vale came out{line_break}of this in as good a condition{line_break}as Prox did...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12039"
msgstr "We won't know until we get there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12040"
msgstr "I can't stop thinking about{line_break}how my parents are doing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12041"
msgstr "Were the both of them in Vale?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12042"
msgstr "Can't you make a guess, Kraden?{line_break}Will Vale still be standing{line_break}when we arrive?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12043"
msgstr "Not even I can know that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12044"
msgstr "I can see it in your eyes,{line_break}Kraden! You think something's{line_break}happened, don't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12045"
msgstr "It's a possibility... One that{line_break}cannot be ignored...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12046"
msgstr "If it's not there, then what's{line_break}the point in even going back?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12047"
msgstr "Is that really how you{line_break}feel, {actor_name:1}? What about{line_break}you, {actor_name:5}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12048"
msgstr "Have you already forgotten all{line_break}that we discussed? You ought{line_break}to refresh your memory!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12049"
msgstr "You remember, don't you,{line_break}{actor_name:5}? Think about it{line_break}for a moment, {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12050"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12051"
msgstr "Our conversation with Hamma{line_break}after we ignited the beacon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12052"
msgstr "Don't you remember us talking{line_break}to the children from Imil at the{line_break}base of Mercury Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12053"
msgstr "When they were warning people{line_break}away from the lighthouses?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12054"
msgstr "Yes. The Wise One instructed{line_break}everyone to seek refuge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12055"
msgstr "Yeah, so what about it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12056"
msgstr "You still don't see, {actor_name:2}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12057"
msgstr "Even if Vale were destroyed,{line_break}I'd expect that the villagers{line_break}have all escaped to safety.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12058"
msgstr "I guess that's true... They{line_break}might still be all right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12059"
msgstr "That's true... So whatever{line_break}happens, my family's alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12060"
msgstr "I'd forgotten about that...{line_break}Thanks, Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12061"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}, can you make sure{line_break}everyone else knows that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12062"
msgstr "OK, let's go. The both of you!{line_break}We have to catch up to{line_break}everyone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12063"
msgstr "Kraden...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12064"
msgstr "Why did the Wise One change{line_break}our parents into a dragon? Why{line_break}did he make us fight them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12065"
msgstr "I mean, we almost killed them...{line_break}He tried to make us kill our{line_break}own parents. Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12066"
msgstr "Do you think that he intended{line_break}for them to die from the start?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12067"
msgstr "I cannot speak for him, but I{line_break}think he knew that they would{line_break}be revived by the beacon's light.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12068"
msgstr "Ah... You don't understand why{line_break}he put you through all this if{line_break}he knew they'd survive...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12069"
msgstr "We cannot hope to fathom the{line_break}motives of a being as all-{line_break}powerful as the Wise One...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12070"
msgstr "You don't know either, Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12071"
msgstr "I can only hazard a guess...{line_break}The Wise One...{line_break}wanted to test you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12072"
msgstr "What do you mean, test us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12073"
msgstr "I cannot tell you more... It is{line_break}up to you to find the answer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12074"
msgstr "Will we use Alchemy to wage{line_break}war, to raise armies?{page_break}Or will we use it to grow wise,{line_break}to rise above our petty feuds{line_break}and perform great deeds?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12075"
msgstr "You were willing to sacrifice{line_break}everything for your quest. I'd say{line_break}you've risen to this challenge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12076"
msgstr "Oops! Is everyone else that{line_break}far ahead of us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12077"
msgstr "We'd better hurry and catch{line_break}up to the others before they{line_break}leave us behind!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12078"
msgstr "After all, I'm not terribly{line_break}interested in trying to walk{line_break}all the way back to Vale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12079"
msgstr "If you feel the same, then{line_break}we'd better be hurrying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12080"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}! {actor_name:5}!{line_break}We're off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12081"
msgstr "Kraden, come look at this...{line_break}There's a huge ice wall{line_break}blocking our path...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12082"
msgstr "Hm... If we can't do something{line_break}about that wall, we're not going{line_break}any farther, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12083"
msgstr "Kraden, come look at this...{line_break}There's a huge ice wall{line_break}blocking our path...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12084"
msgstr "Nothing to worry about,{line_break}{actor_name:6}. We'll just have to{line_break}use that cannon we got in Loho!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12085"
msgstr "That's right! If the cannon can{line_break}blast away a stone wall, think{line_break}what it'll do to ice!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12086"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, take us between those{line_break}two blocks of ice for shelter{line_break}when you fire the cannon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12087"
msgstr "We should be safe if we{line_break}fire from this distance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12088"
msgstr "OK, here we go! {actor_name:5}, aim{line_break}right at the ice wall and fire{line_break}when ready!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12089"
msgstr "What? You're not ready yet?{line_break}Take your time and get{line_break}into position then...{page_break}But as soon as you're{line_break}ready, fire!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12090"
msgstr "Fire the Magma Ball!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12091"
msgstr "Great! We did it! We{line_break}can keep going now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12092"
msgstr "All right, let's head for{line_break}the Northern Seas.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12093"
msgstr "Let's go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12094"
msgstr "The Golden Sun... The very{line_break}quintessence of Alchemy's{line_break}power! It's beginning!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12095"
msgstr "Wait for me! Please, wait!{line_break}Wait until I reach the{line_break}summit of Mt. Aleph!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12096"
msgstr "At last! I have it!{line_break}Eternal life...and{line_break}limitless power!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12097"
msgstr "At last, the power of nature{line_break}is mine to control as I will!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12098"
msgstr "Rise, storms! Rise up and{line_break}unleash your might upon Vale{line_break}and the foothills of Mt. Aleph!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12099"
msgstr "That's odd... I should have{line_break}limitless power... So why can't{line_break}I call up a simple storm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12100"
msgstr "Wh-Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12101"
msgstr "I am called the Wise One...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12102"
msgstr "The Wise One? Vale's protector?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12103"
msgstr "You wish to have limitless power?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12104"
msgstr "Wish to?{line_break}I just got it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12105"
msgstr "No. Your power is nearly{line_break}limitless, but it has boundaries.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12106"
msgstr "Nearly limitless? You speak{line_break}in riddles. Can't you see?{line_break}The power is mine!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12107"
msgstr "Yes. You also have nearly endless{line_break}life. And your Psynergy is...{line_break}somewhat stronger.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12108"
msgstr "If you are trying to anger me,{line_break}have a little taste of exactly how{line_break}much power I have attained!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12109"
msgstr "Look at me! My body is{line_break}brimming with power!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12110"
msgstr "How!? What's going on?{line_break}I should be all-powerful!{line_break}How can you defeat me?!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12111"
msgstr "You are not all-powerful, Alex.{line_break}Your power has its limits, as{line_break}does your life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12112"
msgstr "That cannot be! Who is{line_break}responsible for this treachery?{line_break}Who has robbed me of my dream?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12113"
msgstr "I, the Wise One, imbued the Mars{line_break}Star with some of the power{line_break}of the forming Golden Sun.{page_break}It rests even now in the hands{line_break}of young {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12114"
msgstr "Why?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12115"
msgstr "The heavens and earth are{line_break}changing, Alex! You must{line_break}flee{pause_20_skippable} now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12116"
msgstr "Wha-What!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12117"
msgstr "Mt. Aleph will soon be drawn{line_break}into the heart of the earth! You{line_break}must flee or join it forever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12118"
msgstr "Flee?! I can't flee!{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}I can't even move!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12119"
msgstr "Ah, yes. You now see the limits of{line_break}your power. If you are swallowed{line_break}by the earth, you may not survive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12120"
msgstr "If you survive, perhaps we{line_break}shall meet again someday...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12121"
msgstr "We're heading to Tolbi. We hear{line_break}there's a tournament there{line_break}called Colosso.{page_break}I'm Morgan, and this here's{line_break}Dekka. We're gonna compete,{line_break}and we're gonna win!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12122"
msgstr "Hey, if you see a gladiator{line_break}named {actor_name:1}, give him{line_break}a message for me...{page_break}If he's thinking about going{line_break}to Colosso this year, he doesn't{line_break}stand a chance of winning!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12123"
msgstr "The gladiator who takes the{line_break}prize in Colosso earns quite{line_break}a reputation as a warrior...{page_break}Mercenaries get a lot more{line_break}jobs when they've got a{line_break}good reputation.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12124"
msgstr "We fought in Colosso last{line_break}year, but we lost to a weaselly{line_break}little kid named {actor_name:1}.{page_break}We're after revenge, so we've{line_break}been out on a risky journey to{line_break}increase our fighting strength.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12125"
msgstr "I found {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12126"
msgstr "We've been looking for{line_break}you, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12127"
msgstr "Who are you guys?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12128"
msgstr "The name's Satrage. You{line_break}took me out in the last{line_break}round at Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12129"
msgstr "And I'm Azart!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12130"
msgstr "And don't forget Navampa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12131"
msgstr "Oh. It's you guys.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12132"
msgstr "Is that any way to say{line_break}hello to some old friends?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12133"
msgstr "What's your problem?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12134"
msgstr "We want to talk to you{line_break}about your fighting style{line_break}at Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12135"
msgstr "Yeah. And we think you shouldn't{line_break}have won, {actor_name:1}. We think{line_break}you didn't fight fair.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12136"
msgstr "It sounds like you resent the{line_break}fact that {actor_name:1} beat you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12137"
msgstr "We've just been thinking about{line_break}it, and there's no way that{line_break}{actor_name:1} should have won!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12138"
msgstr "Right. So you think I cheated{line_break}just because I used my{line_break}Pynergy abilities in Colosso?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12139"
msgstr "I don't know how you did{line_break}it. I'm just sayin' I think{line_break}you cheated is all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12140"
msgstr "Ah, but Psynergy is a warrior's{line_break}skill, every bit as much as your{line_break}sword arts. It isn't cheating.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12141"
msgstr "You're not listening, are you,{line_break}old man? That fight was fixed,{line_break}and we're here to pay you back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12142"
msgstr "Hey, these guys aren't{line_break}very strong at all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12143"
msgstr "Ha! We were right! They{line_break}{text_effect:2}were{reset_text_style} cheating at Colosso!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12144"
msgstr "I knew it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12145"
msgstr "It takes a lot to reach the{line_break}finals at Colosso... A lot more{line_break}than you guys can take.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12146"
msgstr "You look like you've got{line_break}business in here, but there's{line_break}no way you're getting past us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12147"
msgstr "Give it up! We're staying here.{line_break}We've got our eyes peeled, and{line_break}there's no way you're getting in!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12148"
msgstr "These guys were phenomenal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12149"
msgstr "Which one of you didn't think{line_break}they won Colosso fair and{line_break}square?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12150"
msgstr "It wasn't me! I think both you{line_break}and Navampa were saying{line_break}something like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12151"
msgstr "So. You don't still think our{line_break}victory at Colosso was fixed,{line_break}do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12152"
msgstr "No way, {actor_name:1}! We've seen{line_break}the error of our ways!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12153"
msgstr "We promise we won't badmouth{line_break}you or call you a fraud ever{line_break}again. Will you forgive us?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12154"
msgstr "Don't be that way! We've{line_break}learned our lesson! Forgive us!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12155"
msgstr "You're not such a bad{line_break}kid after all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12156"
msgstr "You came out here looking{line_break}for treasure, didn't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12157"
msgstr "Here, this was in the chest{line_break}we found.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12158"
msgstr "You were nice enough to{line_break}forgive us, so we think you{line_break}should have it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12159"
msgstr "Right, well... I guess we'll{line_break}be leaving now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12160"
msgstr "By the time the next Colosso{line_break}rolls around, we ought to be{line_break}strong enough to win for sure!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12161"
msgstr "Maybe we'll see you there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12162"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12163"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}, is it you? Do my{line_break}eyes deceive me?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12164"
msgstr "Oh. I must have been mistaken.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12165"
msgstr "No, you are not{line_break}{actor_name:1}, are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12166"
msgstr "Young lady, are you looking{line_break}for someone by the name{line_break}of {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12167"
msgstr "Yes, old man! I am looking{line_break}for one called {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12168"
msgstr "Where is {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12169"
msgstr "I'm sorry... {actor_name:1} isn't{line_break}with us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12170"
msgstr "Well then, where can I{line_break}find {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12171"
msgstr "Why do you want to find{line_break}him so badly?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12172"
msgstr "Me? I am Feizhi... {actor_name:1}{line_break}helped me once.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12173"
msgstr "He helped Ulmuch. Ulmuch was{line_break}trapped, but {actor_name:1} saved him.{line_break}He is a brave man, isn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12174"
msgstr "I suppose... But why are you{line_break}looking for him? Do you{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}like him? Is that it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12175"
msgstr "You're a mean old man. It is{line_break}not polite to tease me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12176"
msgstr "That's what it is! You{line_break}like {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12177"
msgstr "No! I am so embarrassed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12178"
msgstr "Don't worry, Feizhi... We'll tell{line_break}{actor_name:1} how you feel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12179"
msgstr "I...{pause_20_skippable} Really?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12180"
msgstr "Then...will you give him{line_break}this when you tell him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12181"
msgstr "What is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12182"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} is on a dangerous{line_break}journey. I am worried about him,{line_break}so I made him a good luck charm.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12183"
msgstr "Ah, a good luck charm... I see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12184"
msgstr "I am going home now, old man.{line_break}Thank you for doing this favor{line_break}for me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12185"
msgstr "Legends said that Crossbone{line_break}Isle could be found in the{line_break}middle of the Karagol Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12186"
msgstr "Ah... Crossbone Isle... Wait,{line_break}did you say \"could\"? Is it not{line_break}there anymore or something?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12187"
msgstr "Well, it's still there, but there's{line_break}no point in going. Someone{line_break}named {actor_name:1} picked it clean.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12188"
msgstr "What, he took all the treasure?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12189"
msgstr "Yeah. And apparently, he{line_break}even defeated the ancient{line_break}ghost pirate protecting it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12190"
msgstr "What about the stories that if you{line_break}beat the ghost pirate, you would{line_break}become the leader of all pirates?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12191"
msgstr "Well, you see, that means that{line_break}{actor_name:1} is our leader now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12192"
msgstr "Wow... just like that?{pause_20_skippable} I'll bet{line_break}he's pretty tough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12193"
msgstr "No doubt. But you know, he{line_break}must be a reliable guy, too...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12194"
msgstr "You think?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12195"
msgstr "You'd have to be to beat that{line_break}ghost. That's why we're looking{line_break}for him now, remember?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12196"
msgstr "If he's looking for a pirate{line_break}crew, he can count me in!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12197"
msgstr "Hey! Wait a minute!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12198"
msgstr "Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12199"
msgstr "You were talking about{line_break}{actor_name:1}, weren't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12200"
msgstr "Don't play dumb...{line_break}We all heard you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12201"
msgstr "Yes, we know {actor_name:1}.{line_break}What about him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12202"
msgstr "Well, why don't you tell us{line_break}where we can find him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12203"
msgstr "Why should we tell{line_break}you anything?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12204"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} took good care of{line_break}us when we were in Vault, and{line_break}we'd like to thank him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12205"
msgstr "Ah, yes... Well... I'm afraid{line_break}we don't know where you can{line_break}find {actor_name:1} right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12206"
msgstr "Oh, is that so? Well, I guess{line_break}we'll just have to give you the{line_break}reward we'd planned for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12207"
msgstr "You've got a grudge against{line_break}{actor_name:1}, and you're going{line_break}to take it out on us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12208"
msgstr "Oh yeah, you could call it{line_break}a grudge... A serious grudge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12209"
msgstr "But don't worry... We're just{line_break}going to give you a little sample{line_break}of what we've planned for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12210"
msgstr "It looks like {actor_name:1} runs{line_break}with a pretty feeble crowd...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12211"
msgstr "Well, we have been working out.{line_break}Maybe {actor_name:1} won't be so{line_break}tough this time around...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12212"
msgstr "So you think we just{line_break}got a lot stronger?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12213"
msgstr "You let {actor_name:1} know{line_break}we're looking for him!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12214"
msgstr "The band of thieves he busted{line_break}in Vault are coming to repay{line_break}the favor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12215"
msgstr "And we're not messing around!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12216"
msgstr "Be sure you tell him!{line_break}And send him this way!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12217"
msgstr "We lost again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12218"
msgstr "So, boss... You, uh... You think{line_break}maybe it was a mistake going{line_break}after these guys?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12219"
msgstr "This means we're going to{line_break}jail again, doesn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12220"
msgstr "Aw... Why do we have to go{line_break}back to jail. I hate it there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12221"
msgstr "It's not like we really hurt{line_break}anyone... After all, we lost!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12222"
msgstr "Yeah... And it's not like we{line_break}stole anything...this time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12223"
msgstr "We're not gonna have to{line_break}go to jail, are we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12224"
msgstr "You're thieves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12225"
msgstr "If we asked around, we could{line_break}probably find a dozen reasons{line_break}to have you locked up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12226"
msgstr "Are you guys, like, wandering{line_break}sheriffs or something?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12227"
msgstr "Because we could be really{line_break}useful to you if you are. We know{line_break}all sorts of criminal elements...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12228"
msgstr "And even if you're not, we{line_break}could be really useful to you...{line_break}Anything's better than jail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12229"
msgstr "You can't honestly believe{line_break}we would let you join us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12230"
msgstr "Hey, come on! We haven't done{line_break}anything wrong, really! Not yet,{line_break}anyway...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12231"
msgstr "Yeah! We didn't have enough{line_break}time to do anything bad before{line_break}we ran into you guys!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12232"
msgstr "Yeah, so give us a break!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12233"
msgstr "So, uh... Bye! See you later!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12234"
msgstr "Will you promise to stop{line_break}following {actor_name:1} and trying{line_break}to get revenge on him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12235"
msgstr "The four elements are{line_break}the basic building{line_break}blocks of all matter.{page_break}The elemental spirits{line_break}are called Djinn.{page_break}The four elements are{line_break}Venus for Earth,{line_break}Mercury for Water,{page_break}Mars for Fire, and{line_break}Jupiter for Wind.{page_break}Each element has many{line_break}different Djinn."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12236"
msgstr "When you set a Djinni, its{line_break}elemental power may{line_break}change your class{page_break}or Psynergy. In battle,{line_break}you can unleash the{line_break}powers of set Djinn."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12237"
msgstr "When a Djinni is standing{line_break}by, you can use it{line_break}to summon in battle.{page_break}To use a summon{line_break}immediately, put your{line_break}Djinn on standby before{page_break}battle. But be careful,{line_break}because changing set{line_break}Djinn to standby changes{page_break}your class and Psynergy."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12238"
msgstr "If you have a standby{line_break}Djinni in battle, you{line_break}can use it to summon.{page_break}After summoning, the{line_break}Djinni will be in{line_break}recovery until it has{page_break}recovered all its{line_break}power. Recovering Djinni{line_break}cannot be unleashed{page_break}or used to summon."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12239"
msgstr "If a Djinni's power is{line_break}used to summon, the{line_break}Djinni enters recovery.{page_break}After it has recovered{line_break}its power, it will set{line_break}itself once again."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12240"
msgstr "When a Djinni is set to{line_break}an Adept, its power{line_break}may change the Adept's{page_break}class. Find your own{line_break}unique combinations of{line_break}Djinni to improve your{page_break}characters' classes."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12241"
msgstr "Psynergy is a mental{line_break}power. People who wield{line_break}it are called Adepts.{page_break}Psynergy can change{line_break}with class changes or{line_break}when you go up a level.{page_break}Try changing your{line_break}class to earn new{line_break}Psynergy."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12242"
msgstr "To give your Djinni to{line_break}someone else, move it{line_break}like this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12243"
msgstr "After choosing who gets the{line_break}Djinni, you can \"set\" it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12244"
msgstr "When your class changes,{line_break}the Psynergy you can use{line_break}may also change.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12245"
msgstr "Setting a Djinni changes your{line_break}attributes and sometimes{line_break}even your class.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12246"
msgstr "Each Djinni has different,{line_break}unique powers.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12247"
msgstr "Once we have been set, you{line_break}can unleash us in battle to{line_break}use our powers.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12248"
msgstr "So, {protagonist_name}, let me demonstrate{line_break}the power of my attack now.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12249"
msgstr "See! What did I tell you? When{line_break}you unleashed me, I used my{line_break}special attack ability!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12250"
msgstr "After being unleashed, we{line_break}Djinn will then stand by, ready{line_break}to be summoned back again...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12251"
msgstr "If you have multiple standby{line_break}Djinn, you can summon even{line_break}greater powers into battle!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12252"
msgstr "Choose this command when{line_break}you want to unleash me in{line_break}battle, all right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12253"
msgstr "Then you can summon{line_break}even greater powers!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12254"
msgstr "After a Djinni has been{line_break}used to summon, it must{line_break}spend time in recovery.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12255"
msgstr "And once we've recovered,{line_break}we automatically set ourselves{line_break}again, so we're ready to attack!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12256"
msgstr "That's all you have to do{line_break}to unleash a set Djinni!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12257"
msgstr "Hey!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12258"
msgstr "You look like you already{line_break}know a little about us, huh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12259"
msgstr "Well, you weren't very surprised{line_break}when you saw me. Am I right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12260"
msgstr "No way! You? Surprised?{line_break}Nah, I can't believe that!{page_break}I mean, look at you! You're{line_break}an Adept!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12261"
msgstr "I thought so. I could tell{line_break}you were an Adept from{line_break}a mile away!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12262"
msgstr "See, you know all about us,{line_break}so you must be an Adept.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12263"
msgstr "Even I know that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12264"
msgstr "You look like you're new around{line_break}here. Embarking on a dangerous{line_break}journey in a strange land?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12265"
msgstr "I thought so... Well, I'm looking{line_break}for my companions... We were{line_break}parted when Mt. Aleph erupted.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12266"
msgstr "Would you mind helping{line_break}me find my companions?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12267"
msgstr "Come on, take me with{line_break}you. I'll even lend you and{line_break}your allies my powers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12268"
msgstr "You see, the more Djinn you{line_break}have with you, the more powerful{line_break}your Psynergy becomes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12269"
msgstr "All you have to do is set us{line_break}and then unleash us in battle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12270"
msgstr "If you gather a bunch of us,{line_break}you'll have all that power{line_break}at your disposal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12271"
msgstr "So what do you say? Will{line_break}you be a pal and take me{line_break}with you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12272"
msgstr "Oh, come on! I promise I won't{line_break}be a burden and eat all your{line_break}chips or anything!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12273"
msgstr "But if I'm with you, you'll{line_break}be all kinds of strong!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12274"
msgstr "Wait, that's not it... There's{line_break}more! Your allies will develop{line_break}{text_effect:4}exciting new abilities{reset_text_style}!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12275"
msgstr "And I'll be your best friend ever{line_break}in combat! I'll be all over the{line_break}bad guys, I promise!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12276"
msgstr "What, you want to see me{line_break}beg? Fine! I'm begging! PLEASE!{line_break}Let me join your group!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12277"
msgstr "You just don't get it, do you?{line_break}I'm not used to being ignored,{line_break}you know. Take me with you!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12278"
msgstr "Don't be a meanie, OK? Nobody{line_break}likes a meanie. I'm serious{line_break}here.{page_break}You don't really want to{line_break}leave me behind, do you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12279"
msgstr "Oh, all right. If that's the way{line_break}you're gonna be, fine.{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}I'm coming with you anyway!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12280"
msgstr "I'm so happy! Oh, you won't{line_break}regret this, I promise!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12281"
msgstr "The Venus Djinni {text_color:5}{argument_ability_name}{text_color:16}{line_break}has become {protagonist_name}'s pal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12282"
msgstr "While I'm here, would you like{line_break}me to give you a quick{line_break}explanation about Djinn?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12283"
msgstr "After bringing a Djinni{line_break}into your party, you must{line_break}set it to somebody.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12284"
msgstr "Next, I'll show you how you{line_break}can use us in battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12285"
msgstr "See! We Djinn can be{line_break}pretty useful, can't we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12286"
msgstr "But...there's one more thing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12287"
msgstr "So, we go from set{line_break}to standby to recovery,{line_break}then back to set.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12288"
msgstr "That's just a simple little{line_break}explanation of how to use us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12289"
msgstr "Did you get all that?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12290"
msgstr "Hmmmm...{pause_20_skippable} Do you want me to{line_break}explain it all to you again?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12291"
msgstr "Well, then, I guess I'll go back{line_break}to the beginning, OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12292"
msgstr "Well, that's it. Now, we're{line_break}pals forever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12293"
msgstr "Oh, yeah! If you want to{line_break}learn more about Djinn,{line_break}refer to the help, OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12294"
msgstr "You and your friends should{line_break}make sure you get the most{line_break}out of us Djinn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12295"
msgstr "To give your Djinni to{line_break}someone else, move it{line_break}like this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12296"
msgstr "After choosing who gets the{line_break}Djinni, you can \"set\" it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12297"
msgstr "When your class changes,{line_break}the Psynergy you can use{line_break}may also change.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12298"
msgstr "Setting a Djinni changes your{line_break}attributes and sometimes{line_break}even your class.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12299"
msgstr "Each Djinni has different,{line_break}unique powers.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12300"
msgstr "Once we have been set, you{line_break}can unleash us in battle to{line_break}use our powers.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12301"
msgstr "So, {protagonist_name}, let me demonstrate{line_break}the power of my attack now.{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12302"
msgstr "See! What did I tell you? When{line_break}you unleashed me, I used my{line_break}special attack ability!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12303"
msgstr "After being unleashed, we{line_break}Djinn will then stand by, ready{line_break}to be summoned back again...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12304"
msgstr "If you have multiple standby{line_break}Djinn, you can summon even{line_break}greater powers into battle!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12305"
msgstr "Choose this command when{line_break}you want to unleash me in{line_break}battle, all right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12306"
msgstr "Then you can summon{line_break}even greater powers!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12307"
msgstr "After a Djinni has been{line_break}used to summon, it must{line_break}spend time in recovery.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12308"
msgstr "And once we've recovered,{line_break}we automatically set ourselves{line_break}again, so we're ready to attack!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12309"
msgstr "That's all you have to do{line_break}to unleash a set Djinni!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12310"
msgstr "Hey!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12311"
msgstr "You look like you already{line_break}know a little about us, huh?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12312"
msgstr "Well, you didn't look surprised{line_break}when you saw me. Were you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12313"
msgstr "No way! You? Surprised?{line_break}Nah, I can't believe that!{page_break}I mean, look at you! You're{line_break}an Adept!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12314"
msgstr "I thought so. I could tell{line_break}you were an Adept from{line_break}a mile away!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12315"
msgstr "See, you know all about us,{line_break}so you must be an Adept.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12316"
msgstr "Even I know that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12317"
msgstr "You look like you're new around{line_break}here. Embarking on a dangerous{line_break}journey in a strange land?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12318"
msgstr "I thought so... Well, I'm looking{line_break}for my companions... We were{line_break}parted when Mt. Aleph erupted.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12319"
msgstr "Would you mind helping{line_break}me find my companions?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12320"
msgstr "Come on, take me with{line_break}you. I'll even lend you and{line_break}your allies my powers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12321"
msgstr "You see, the more Djinn you{line_break}have with you, the more powerful{line_break}your Psynergy becomes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12322"
msgstr "All you have to do is set us{line_break}and then unleash us in battle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12323"
msgstr "If you gather a bunch of us,{line_break}you'll have all that power{line_break}at your disposal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12324"
msgstr "So what do you say? Will{line_break}you be a pal and take me{line_break}with you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12325"
msgstr "Oh, come on! I promise I won't{line_break}be a burden and eat all your{line_break}chips or anything!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12326"
msgstr "But if I'm with you, you'll{line_break}be all kinds of strong!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12327"
msgstr "Wait, that's not it... There's{line_break}more! Your allies will develop{line_break}{text_effect:4}exciting new abilities{reset_text_style}!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12328"
msgstr "And I'll be your best friend ever{line_break}in combat! I'll be all over the{line_break}bad guys, I promise!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12329"
msgstr "What, you want to see me{line_break}beg? Fine! I'm begging! PLEASE!{line_break}Let me join your group!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12330"
msgstr "You just don't get it, do you?{line_break}I'm not used to being ignored,{line_break}you know. Take me with you!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12331"
msgstr "Don't be a meanie, OK? Nobody{line_break}likes a meanie. I'm serious{line_break}here. Can I go with you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12332"
msgstr "Oh, all right. If that's the way{line_break}you're gonna be, fine.{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}{line_break}I'm coming with you anyway!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12333"
msgstr "I'm so happy! Oh, you won't{line_break}regret this, I promise!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12334"
msgstr "The Venus Djinni {text_color:5}{argument_ability_name}{text_color:16}{line_break}has become {protagonist_name}'s pal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12335"
msgstr "While I'm here, would you like{line_break}me to give you a quick{line_break}explanation about Djinn?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12336"
msgstr "After bringing a Djinni{line_break}into your party, you must{line_break}set it to somebody.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12337"
msgstr "Next, I'll show you how you{line_break}can use us in battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12338"
msgstr "See! We Djinn can be{line_break}pretty useful, can't we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12339"
msgstr "But...there's one more thing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12340"
msgstr "So, we go from set{line_break}to standby to recovery,{line_break}then back to set.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12341"
msgstr "That's just a simple little{line_break}explanation of how to use us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12342"
msgstr "Did you get all that?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12343"
msgstr "Hmmmm...{pause_20_skippable} Do you want me to{line_break}explain it all to you again?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12344"
msgstr "Well, then, I guess I'll go back{line_break}to the beginning, OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12345"
msgstr "Well, that's it. Now, we're{line_break}pals forever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12346"
msgstr "Oh, yeah! If you want to{line_break}learn more about Djinn,{line_break}refer to the help, OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12347"
msgstr "You and your friends should{line_break}make sure you get the most{line_break}out of us Djinn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12348"
msgstr "It looks like seawater has{line_break}seeped into the well.{page_break}I doubt anyone will be using{line_break}it for quite a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12349"
msgstr "There's a passageway at{line_break}the bottom of the well!{page_break}I wonder if anyone else{line_break}knows about this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12350"
msgstr "It's completely full of water.{line_break}The bottom is really deep.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12351"
msgstr "Meh? I saw the silhouette{line_break}of a man in the well!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12352"
msgstr "It looks like this well doesn't{line_break}get a lot of use.{page_break}I guess it's because it's so far{line_break}from the main part of town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12353"
msgstr "There's only a little bit of water{line_break}down at the bottom of the well.{page_break}As hot as it gets around here,{line_break}I bet the water evaporates fast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12354"
msgstr "This well looks really old.{page_break}I'll bet this is exactly how it{line_break}looked back in ancient times.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12355"
msgstr "There are some potatoes{line_break}boiling in the pot.{page_break}Maybe they're making{line_break}potato salad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12356"
msgstr "They're making nan.{page_break}It looks weird, though...{line_break}I guess in Madra, they add{line_break}nuts and raisins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12357"
msgstr "All the spices are neatly{line_break}arranged.{page_break}No dining table in Madra would{line_break}be complete without them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12358"
msgstr "There's a chicken curry slowly{line_break}simmering on the stove.{page_break}Judging from the smell and{line_break}the deep red color, it must{line_break}have a lot of tomatoes in it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12359"
msgstr "A pot of Masala tea is{line_break}boiling on the stove.{page_break}It's full of milk, and it{line_break}has a nice, sweet smell.{line_break}It's driving me crazy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12360"
msgstr "They're making tandoori chicken.{page_break}In Madra, it's cooked on the{line_break}bone. It's one of the dishes{line_break}they're famous for.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12361"
msgstr "It's a roast chicken so big{line_break}that it's practically bursting{line_break}out of the oven!{page_break}Hmm... I wonder if it was{line_break}related to the chicken I saw{line_break}outside... I thought it was a pet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12362"
msgstr "Fresh eggs, over easy...{line_break}Some people call 'em{line_break}\"sunny side up\"!{page_break}When it comes to breakfast,{line_break}these are the best!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12363"
msgstr "That cheese looks fabulous.{page_break}I could really use a snack...{line_break}Maybe with some bread and°{line_break}Gah! I'm getting hungry!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12364"
msgstr "Eeeeew!{line_break}They're frying up bug larvae!!{page_break}It looks awful!{line_break}But it smells GREAT!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12365"
msgstr "It's lamb on the bone, broiled{line_break}over an open flame. The lamb is{line_break}golden brown and juicy.{page_break}They'd probably notice if{line_break}I took some... Too bad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12366"
msgstr "Huh, what is that!?{line_break}Lobster grilled in the shell!{page_break}I'd like to experience this{line_break}luxurious culinary treat{line_break}at least once in my life!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12367"
msgstr "Newts skewered over an{line_break}open flame.{page_break}Are they making food or some{line_break}strange kind of medicine?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12368"
msgstr "There are lots of strange-{line_break}looking plants boiling in that{line_break}large pot.{page_break}It's got a familiar smell I just{line_break}can't quite put my finger on.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12369"
msgstr "Seasonal veggies boiling{line_break}with some lamb meat.{page_break}The oyster seasoning is{line_break}really tempting my tummy.{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12370"
msgstr "There is a seafood pie baking{line_break}in the oven.{page_break}Its reputation for having a, er,{line_break}fragrant smell precedes it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12371"
msgstr "It looks like some kind{line_break}of seafood soup.{page_break}It smells like the ocean!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12372"
msgstr "It's Alhafra's famous{line_break}broiled lobster!{page_break}It's bigger than I could ever{line_break}possibly have imagined!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12373"
msgstr "That seafood stew has an{line_break}abundant variety of fish.{page_break}One bite of that, and I'd{line_break}be hooked!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12374"
msgstr "The steel resting in the flames{line_break}is glowing bright red.{page_break}This must be where they{line_break}forge sharp items.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12375"
msgstr "There's fish I've never seen{line_break}before gently simmering there.{page_break}I wonder what this foul soup{line_break}could possibly taste like...{line_break}I'm not sure I want to find out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12376"
msgstr "There's a bright-red soup{line_break}full of beans and tomatoes{line_break}simmering.{page_break}That spicy smell is really{line_break}something else, but it might{line_break}burn my mouth a bit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12377"
msgstr "Ah, the smell of fresh corn{line_break}bread cooking in the oven!{page_break}One whiff, and I'm drooling{line_break}like a bulldog!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12378"
msgstr "Contigo's famous for these{line_break}cookies they make...{page_break}I've heard that, even if you{line_break}have the recipe, it still takes{line_break}years to learn to bake them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12379"
msgstr "It's roasted fish from{line_break}the nearby river.{page_break}The smoke is getting in my eyes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12380"
msgstr "That simmering soup is{line_break}made with broth of cow bones.{page_break}It seems it's a traditional{line_break}Shaman meal, passed down{line_break}from generation to generation.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12381"
msgstr "I've never seen vegetables{line_break}like the ones boiling there.{page_break}Whoa! They really stink!{line_break}Do people actually eat those!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12382"
msgstr "There's Kaltic stew made with{line_break}lamb meat and potatoes.{page_break}Looks pretty tasty, if you{line_break}like boiled meat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12383"
msgstr "Those boiling vegetables{line_break}look like weeds.{page_break}I'm pretty sure I won't{line_break}be eating any of those{line_break}anytime soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12384"
msgstr "There's cheese in this stew.{page_break}Hey! There's mold growing on it!{line_break}Is it supposed to be like that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12385"
msgstr "There is some strange{line_break}dish made using fish eggs.{page_break}There are strings coming from{line_break}them. I wonder if that's normal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12386"
msgstr "They've got some strange{line_break}meat I've never seen before.{page_break}Instead of using firewood,{line_break}they're cooking it with burning{line_break}antlers.{page_break}I wonder if the meat{line_break}and the antlers came{line_break}from the same animal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12387"
msgstr "It looks like there's a captain's{line_break}logbook in here.{page_break}There's something about an{line_break}unreported trip to Lemuria in{line_break}here... I guess they were rushed.{end_wait}  "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12388"
msgstr "There's a book called \"The{line_break}Great Adventures of Lunpa.\"{line_break}...Written by Lunpa, no less.{page_break}\"When the great flood came,{line_break}we fled our homes by boat.{line_break}Waves engulfed our ships.{page_break}\"We came to in a strange{line_break}land called Lemuria.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12389"
msgstr "I found a letter from Babi.{line_break}On the outside, it reads,{line_break}\"To my dear friend Lunpa.\"{page_break}Babi wrote, \"Forgive me,{line_break}Lunpa, but I must leave the{line_break}island without you.\"{end_wait} "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12390"
msgstr "Here's a book called{line_break}\"The History of Lemuria.\"{page_break}An excerpt: \"Only traces of{line_break}the once-brilliant land of{line_break}Lemuria remain today.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12391"
msgstr "Here's a book called{line_break}\"Elemental Lighthouses.\"{page_break}It reads, \"The beacons of the{line_break}four elemental lighthouses{line_break}brighten the fringes of Weyard.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12392"
msgstr "Here's a book called \"The{line_break}Great Lemurian People.\"{page_break}\"The chosen master of{line_break}water will be a native{line_break}son of Lemuria.\" {end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12393"
msgstr "Here's a book called{line_break}\"Alchemy and Ancient{line_break}Civilization: Part I.\"{page_break}\"Through the use of Alchemy,{line_break}civilization undergoes great{line_break}growth and improvement.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12394"
msgstr "Here's a book called{line_break}\"Alchemy and Ancient{line_break}Civilization: Part II.\"{page_break}\"Those who master Alchemy{line_break}shall master the world.\" {end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12395"
msgstr "Here's a book called{line_break}\"The Diary of Hydros.\"{page_break}\"{actor_name:8} is most{line_break}definitely still alive. I pray{line_break}for his safe return.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12396"
msgstr "It's pleasantly cool.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12397"
msgstr "What in°!!! {control_15:4}{control_15:4}{page_break}{control_12:11}What's with all these bathrobes?!?{line_break}Where are the baths?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12398"
msgstr "Finally! We've reached Vale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12399"
msgstr "... ...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12400"
msgstr "What's the matter, {actor_name:2}?{line_break}You're finally home again.{line_break}Aren't you happy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12401"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}'s just worried{line_break}about what's happened{line_break}to everyone in Vale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12402"
msgstr "So it's just over{line_break}that last hill?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12403"
msgstr "I can't wait to see what{line_break}your hometown looks like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12404"
msgstr "It's beautiful... I'm sure you{line_break}will like it, {actor_name:8}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12405"
msgstr "I'm...just going to close my{line_break}eyes. Someone tell me if{line_break}it's all right to open them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12406"
msgstr "Me too... Would someone{line_break}else see how things are?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12407"
msgstr "I'll go. Come with{line_break}me, {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12408"
msgstr "How's it look, {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12409"
msgstr "I'm almost there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12410"
msgstr "It... It can't be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12411"
msgstr "What is it, {actor_name:1}?{line_break}...{actor_name:5}? Say something!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12412"
msgstr "I'm sorry, {actor_name:6}, but...{line_break}Vale...Mt. Aleph...{line_break}They're gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12413"
msgstr "What!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12414"
msgstr "This... This is terrible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12415"
msgstr "Is that Mt. Aleph?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12416"
msgstr "Mom...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12417"
msgstr "Dora...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12418"
msgstr "Mom... Dad...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12419"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}... {actor_name:2}...{line_break}What can I do? What can{line_break}I say to comfort you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12420"
msgstr "They're here somewhere...{line_break}They have to be here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12421"
msgstr "What can we do? How{line_break}can we help them now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12422"
msgstr "I don't know... Call out to{line_break}them... Such a tragedy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12423"
msgstr "I'll call them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12424"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{line_break}{actor_name:2}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12425"
msgstr "I understand what you're{line_break}feeling. I've felt it, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12426"
msgstr "But standing here won't{line_break}bring them back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12427"
msgstr "Let's go back to Vault. We{line_break}can rest there and think...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12428"
msgstr "... ...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12429"
msgstr "... ...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12430"
msgstr "Your family's safe, {actor_name:5}.{line_break}You don't have anything to{line_break}worry about anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12431"
msgstr "But what am I supposed{line_break}to do? ...I'm all alone now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12432"
msgstr "Aw... Poor baby...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12433"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}, what's gotten into{line_break}you? How could you say{line_break}that to {actor_name:2}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12434"
msgstr "Tee hee! I wonder...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12435"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}, {actor_name:4}!? You think{line_break}this is funny!? I've lost{line_break}everyone! My whole family!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12436"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}!{line_break}Don't be so sad!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12437"
msgstr "???{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12438"
msgstr "I'd thought you might be a{line_break}little more confident after{line_break}all your adventures!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12439"
msgstr "!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12440"
msgstr "Ha ha! I got to see my{line_break}brother crying!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12441"
msgstr "!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12442"
msgstr "So, you made it back, {actor_name:2}...{line_break}I knew it would take more{line_break}than this to beat you, Son.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12443"
msgstr "Welcome home, {actor_name:2}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12444"
msgstr "You look surprised to see{line_break}us, {actor_name:2}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12445"
msgstr "How did you survive?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12446"
msgstr "The Wise One warned us of{line_break}danger. He guided us here{line_break}to safety.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12447"
msgstr "Everything was destroyed...{line_break}Our homes, our town...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12448"
msgstr "But the Wise One saved{line_break}you all?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12449"
msgstr "I'm... I'm not alone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12450"
msgstr "If you all made it out,{line_break}did Dora as well?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12451"
msgstr "Dora...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12452"
msgstr "...Mom...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12453"
msgstr "Welcome home,{line_break}Kyle... {actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12454"
msgstr "You survived!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12455"
msgstr "So did you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12456"
msgstr "I am the guardian of water.{line_break}If you would claim my power,{line_break}you must prove your worth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12457"
msgstr "I am the guardian of fire.{line_break}If you want my power, prove{line_break}yourself in my crucible of flame.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "12458"
msgstr "I am the guardian of wind.{line_break}If you would claim my power,{line_break}you must prove your worth.{end_wait}"

